t\nwas printed).\n- Tightened a few catalog fixes (`artifact/expose-missing`,\n`shared/eager-without-singleton`, `federation/name-conflict`,\nmissing-config `doctor/partial-analysis`).\n- Agent playbook (`AGENTS.md` / `skills/mfdoctor/SKILL.md`) tells agents\nto read those remediations instead of scraping engine stderr.\n\nJSON `status.incompleteReasons` stays the stable code list (no report\nschema change). Fingerprints are unchanged.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Unit tests for SARIF remediations, quieter failure stderr, plugin\nincomplete remediations, default finding suggestions, and catalog fix\nquality.\n- Regenerated rule docs, inventory fixture, and analysis-cost golden\nsuggestion strings.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-85800909-bb1f-53d6-b478-8feb5da71d07?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-85800909-bb1f-53d6-b478-8feb5da71d07&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwAgzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACiAQAH2Kv0/2ALY6+LdWbotU8EsF\nFmfcrPI25NLMwBwIX8OAfFUntCw8kPEUzNlek9Ju