one (intentionally)\n\n- No package version bump, changeset, or npm publish.\n- `adm-zip` override stays (still needed until MF 2.9.2 is pinned).\n- `@module-federation/vite` 1.23.0 and enhanced/rsbuild 2.9.1/2.9.2\n(still age-gated).\n- React catalog / Dependabot #490/#492.\n- Vite 5/6 compatibility cells and vite alerts #45–#47 (intentional\ncontract / policy-skip).\n- `minimumReleaseAgeExclude` / `trustPolicyExclude` not broadened.\n\nOverride keys stay narrow (`fast-uri@3`, `undici@7`), same pattern as\n`nanoid@3` / `vitest@4`. Drop the undici override when dts-plugin pins\n`>=7.29.1`.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm install --lockfile-only` succeeds with the ten-day age\npolicy (no new excludes)\n- [x] Lockfile resolves `fast-uri@3.1.8` and `undici@7.29.1` only for\nthose lines\n- [x] `vp run fmt:check`, `lint`, `knip`, `changeset:check`\n- [x] `vp run inventory:check`, `typecheck`, `docs:build`\n- [x] `vp run test:unit` — 94 files / 1228 tests passed\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-017ffc50-49d4-54a5-9334-4b79c466c8f9?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-017ffc50-49d4-54a5-9334-4b79c466c8f9&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-