eration/vite 1.22.0 (#496)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nThe 10-day `minimumReleaseAge` gate (14400 minutes, strict) has cleared\nfor `@module-federation/vite` **1.22.0** (published 2026-09-15).\nContinues the example/fixture pin cluster from #458.\n\n**Pins**\n- `@module-federation/vite`: 1.21.3 → **1.22.0**\n\nThis jump includes 1.21.4, 1.21.5, 1.21.6, and 1.22.0, all now outside\nthe age window. 1.22.0 adds first-class `ssrEntryLoader` plus\nshared-runtime, SSR, and preload fixes (1.21.6…1.22.0).\n\nDeliberately **not** 1.22.1 — that release is still inside the 10-day\nage gate (published 2026-09-18, clears ~15:59 Europe/Berlin on\n2026-09-28). Vite 5.4.21 compatibility cells (`vite-cjs`,\n`vite-multi-instance`) stay on Vite 5. `@module-federation/enhanced` and\n`rsbuild-plugin` stay at 2.9.0. Vite 5.4.21 `trustPolicyExclude` and\nsecurity overrides are unchanged.\n\n**Age-gate excludes** in `pnpm-workspace.yaml`: dropped entries that\nhave left the window and no longer need an exception:\n\n- `@module-federation/vite@1.21.3` (pin moved to age-cleared 1.22.0; no\nnew exclude)\n- `obug@2.2.1`, `tinyexec@1.3.1`, `adm-zip@0.6.1`\n- `@module-federation/*@2.9.0` (dts-plugin, enhanced, rsbuild-plugin,\nbridge-react-webpack-plugin, cli, error-codes,\ninject-external-runtime-core-plugin, managers, manifest, rspack,\nruntime-core, runtime-tools, runtime, sdk, third-party-dts-extractor,\nwebpack-bundler-runtime)\n\nKept intentional exceptions: Vite+ `0.2.9` and\n`@voidzero-dev/vite-plus-*@0.2.9`, `js-yaml@3.15.1 || 4.3.1`,\n`trustPolicyExclude` for `vite@5.4.21`, and the existing\nreact-router/nanoid/fast-uri/adm-zip/vitest overrides.\n\nNo `@tonoizer/mfdoctor` version bump, changeset, or publish.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-7dcc37a3-3e31-5d67-ac87-955a0f6940f8?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/op