wed these paths and recorded the size of a\nfile outside the project root in project facts. Reproduced with an\noutside test file; ordinary in-root assets served as a control.\n\n## Fix\n\nCheck both lexical and canonical filesystem containment before statting\nan asset. Preserve in-root output aliases. Add traversal, symlink, and\nbenign alias regression tests.\n\n## Checks\n\n- Focused asset size tests: 6 passed\n- TypeScript, formatting, and lint passed\n- Direct Node checks covered a symlinked project root, traversal, and an\nescaping symlink","tree":{"sha":"4fdca3bb2d796203d65ed7c2be17f9d31a3435c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/4fdca3bb2d796203d65ed7c2be17f9d31a3435c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/d2079fb5b62901283793a30ad50c1e6ce7bf6eae","verification":{"payload":"tree 4fdca3bb2d796203d65ed7c2be17f9d31a3435c0\nparent 36c4fa56d1ac15e99f4981b4ad4026d051d6bdc1\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1790444607 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790444607 +0200\n\nfix: contain asset size reads within project root (#494)\n\n## Issue and verification\n\nManifest and emitted asset names can contain traversal segments. The\nprior size collector followed these paths and recorded the size of a\nfile outside the project root in project facts. Reproduced with an\noutside test file; ordinary in-root assets served as a control.\n\n## Fix\n\nCheck both lexical and canonical filesystem containment before statting\nan asset. Preserve in-root output aliases. Add traversal, symlink, and\nbenign alias regression tests.\n\n## Checks\n\n- Focused asset size tests: 6 passed\n- TypeScript, formatting, and lint passed\n- Direct Node checks covered a symlinked project root, traversal, and an\nescaping symlink","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquAQ/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/MoQAAVU+QtamcCBrYFyFEiJTRcT\nFAjKZS6HkzTsw4DbPj87oo687H+1nqFCfBS