irectory and\na control in-root directory.\n\n## Fix\n\nResolve existing path components physically, including junctions and\nsymlinks, and require the result to remain under the physical project\nroot. Return the resolved path so subsequent writes use it. Add\nregression tests for an outside link and an in-root link.\n\n## Checks\n\n- Focused diagnostics tests: 12 passed\n- TypeScript, formatting, and lint passed","tree":{"sha":"2d0120c601de530ac64393cc074740a77c5457c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/2d0120c601de530ac64393cc074740a77c5457c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/36c4fa56d1ac15e99f4981b4ad4026d051d6bdc1","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d0120c601de530ac64393cc074740a77c5457c2\nparent 3c1df4f6a0b9ec5f9feb8625f8bfcec3afe6f6f2\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1790444577 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790444577 +0200\n\nfix: contain diagnostics path through symlinks (#495)\n\n## Issue and verification\n\nThe diagnostics directory resolver checked only the lexical path. A\njunction or directory symlink under the project could point outside;\nwriting diagnostics then removed the outside prompts directory.\nReproduced against the prior resolver with an outside test directory and\na control in-root directory.\n\n## Fix\n\nResolve existing path components physically, including junctions and\nsymlinks, and require the result to remain under the physical project\nroot. Return the resolved path so subsequent writes use it. Add\nregression tests for an outside link and an in-root link.\n\n## Checks\n\n- Focused diagnostics tests: 12 passed\n- TypeScript, formatting, and lint passed","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquAQhCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtAMQAEDwv7oxVoDSMNI1LyFf/J4Z\n7DPiPd/JONnC352vNdNPGhgf0+qzhGS+1oFJ3EzXeOdDqv5eqYbYI8vc818goffe\nXGbpLFxeU5kLQaBLEEndE7WAbf9bRPo9TMJkH5vmHUu4fgv4WrkcJhAj6PKpXx0k\nktZYeo4B