ontract.mjs` still invokes `runSchemaContractChecks`,\nwhich still validates the same fixtures.\n- No production or published package files change.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Baseline and post-change: `pnpm run test:unit` (94 files, 1,221\ntests), `pnpm run schema:check`, and `pnpm run typecheck` passed.\n- Formatting and pre-commit lint passed.","tree":{"sha":"8c360225b510bc8625226e6dc945debce2ceeb08","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/8c360225b510bc8625226e6dc945debce2ceeb08"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/0645179b98af81ed2a5221d300adfd1cd158b9f1","verification":{"payload":"tree 8c360225b510bc8625226e6dc945debce2ceeb08\nparent 67161d3da9b73aea1249ff9f88e5f822588e8805\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1790187218 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790187218 +0200\n\nrefactor(test): narrow schema helper exports (#487)\n\n## Why\n\nKeep the schema test helper module''s internal surface limited to the\nfunctions and types used by its callers.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Make `SchemaKind` private to `test/helpers/schema-contract.ts`.\n- Make `validateFixturePayloads` private while retaining its call from\n`runSchemaContractChecks`.\n- Remove the comment that described the now-private helper.\n\n## Blast Radius\n\n- Repository-wide search found no external or dynamic consumer of either\nexport.\n- `scripts/schema-contract.mjs` still invokes `runSchemaContractChecks`,\nwhich still validates the same fixtures.\n- No production or published package files change.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Baseline and post-change: `pnpm run test:unit` (94 files, 1,221\ntests), `pnpm run schema:check`, and `pnpm run typecheck` passed.\n- Formatting and pre-commit lint passed.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtBbSCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAX90QAIjaDP4eh0PaYDZTOeQYT1q4\ntsaA/A+bYDiUG/TLDosI9r/WbVBbiofK4vvsN2rLxcNp+5xOA/KOLN1I41NqDoPh\npFbvyafkgotR+bznJGPDBxafaif