n\n- Repository-wide exact-symbol search found only the alias declaration.\n- `src/identity.ts` is not exposed through a package subpath, and\npackage files exclude `src`.\n- The current-main build did not include this alias in any published\ndeclaration entrypoint.\n- No runtime code or public package API changes.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Baseline on `origin/main`: unit suite (94 files, 1,221 tests), build,\nand typecheck passed.\n- After change: unit suite (94 files, 1,221 tests), build, typecheck,\nintegration suite (4 files, 80 tests), and formatting passed.\n- Compared all ten ESM/CJS package entrypoints and their\n`.d.ts`/`.d.cts` declarations against the baseline build; runtime export\nnames and declaration files are unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"94ecf158a80ad70b09eef2e3bde7a02c9ce50806","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/94ecf158a80ad70b09eef2e3bde7a02c9ce50806"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/67161d3da9b73aea1249ff9f88e5f822588e8805","verification":{"payload":"tree 94ecf158a80ad70b09eef2e3bde7a02c9ce50806\nparent 85686a7c169c63426b41d1ec3282dffc55acc407\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1790187181 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790187181 +0200\n\nrefactor(identity): remove unused dimensions alias (#486)\n\n## Why\n\nRemove a dead internal type alias identified by the expanded Knip audit.\nThe alias had no repository consumers and was not part of the published\npackage surface.\n\n## Scope\n\n- Remove `IdentityDimensions` from `src/identity.ts`.\n- Keep `IdentityDimensionsByKind` and all dimension-specific interfaces\nunchanged.\n\n## Blast Radius\n\n- Repository-wide exact-symbol search found only the alias declaration.\n- `src/identity.ts` is not exposed through a package subpath, and\npackage files exclude `src`.\n- The current-main build did not include this alias in any published\ndeclaration entrypoint.\n- No runtime code or public package API changes.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Baseline on `origin/main`: unit suite (94 files, 1,221 tests), build,\nand typecheck passed.\n- After change: unit suite (94 files, 1,221 tests), build, typecheck,\nintegration suite (4 files, 80 tests), and formatting passed.\n- Compared all ten ESM/CJS package entrypoints and their\n`.d.ts`/`.d.cts` declarations against the baseline build; runtime export\nnames and declaration files are unchanged.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtBatCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADEsQAAkaU0DcPK2T/am24pSQIcJU\ny0H+vqz9T27s1OrYumAUHpTzbyWkdev4AVW9zhZjCm2UV2+ZLkX2BoZWx/epx5GI\nWYJbbnr0GkIty2Pxtc7OgwzO9ZcaL0CqC0QTxqzJ/n3DkMmjoAMW1KD0UMTaPOAc\nr0t8d02XQwY3ObWswEgoM82I79JLimGgZKQBQTuTDHcQvSUS72LYcPFuBUkChGF1\nfXSWCPEGAQDpezldrlwKdXONvMkxWK7PpiYbj2jyf7RnCQCIDzCTRWgXT3INXcfD\nF9sezWf9DSw2xSYB8dbjwzlMNIaW737BhMatcpZnQrGhaGHHfMYtYMOa0BUsj7jm\nSD2zY49w9hM36+zHodqhYY0x1OCtRBVMUrU6JqO/l/vX+8DxfaTBacbeci6cxZgM\nTWmISBFcfInGuuxyociIvLlVzGStyniE0Of91Fo2lCiW7A2KiZnH1VoQAC+ajLvl\nl6+f4iz1qtgMmjj1P4BA7t3thQ5OnpKdSnQyxv3zamLbRC2Zvy6DQgmBhVwlS/jV\nKaNGD0oXFjlPxPcmrhVTdZjqkYBVK96xNPVcfp7CIr7pJfQBa8p7mcMFCfP+v6hl\nwNBGxpv3DA1YzZacKWf13nVWI/MEwLKHmlOKQbnSz7AQwyppMtHDkW1kr8DYNFW7\nyQqQRycftwjXHvqyeVS5\n=mqHj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T18:13:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commit/67161d3da9b73aea1249ff9f88e5f822588e8805","node_id":"C_kwDOTjIi_9oAKDY3MTYxZDNkYTliNzNhZWExMjQ5ZmY5Zjg4ZTVmODIyNTg4ZTg4MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commit/85686a7c169c63426b41d1ec3282dffc55acc407","sha":"85686a7c169c63426b41d1ec3282dffc55acc407","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/85686a7c169c63426b41d1ec3282dffc55acc407"}],"sha":"67161d3da9b73aea1249ff9f88e5f822588e8805","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/67161d3da9b73aea1249ff9f88e5f822588e8805"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70775490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/85686a7c169c63426b41d1ec3282dffc55acc407/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T18:12:14Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T18:12:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(core): remove unused internal exports (#485)\n\n## Why\nThe source scan found names with no caller outside their defining\nmodules. The package does not expose these module paths. Keep the live\nhelpers in place, remove their module exports, and delete the two unused\nfinding-family aliases.\n\n## Scope\n- Delete `ruleFamilyForFinding` and `ruleFamily`.\n- Keep prompt ranking and verification-plan declarations private in\n`src/agent-prompt.ts`.\n- Keep Bridge constants, the docs origin, repair evidence bounds, and\nexpose-key sets private to their modules.\n- Keep the federation rule list, graph mapper, and React server asset\nmatcher private to their modules.\n\n## Blast Radius\nThe package exports ten entry points and does not publish `src`. Public\nruntime exports and declaration files match the main artifact. Rollup\nemitted new hashes for private chunks after their module exports\nchanged, so the unit and integration suites ran against the rebuilt\noutput.\n\n## Verification\n- `pnpm run test:unit` passed with 94 files and 1,221 tests.\n- `pnpm run test:integration` passed with 4 files and 80 tests against\nthe built package.\n- `pnpm run build`, `pnpm run typecheck`, and `pnpm run knip` passed.\n- ESM and CJS runtime exports and declaration entry files match main\nacross all ten package entries.\n- Formatting and `git diff --check` passed.","tree":{"sha":"90fe0727c7eaa4981a9c4b9052d3f8dc0560af7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/90fe0727c7eaa4981a9c4b9052d3f8dc0560af7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/85686a7c169c63426b41d1ec3282dffc55acc407","verification":{"payload":"tree 90fe0727c7eaa4981a9c4b9052d3f8dc0560af7c\nparent ca9b4c297d9b743483b7f3039cccc0a491cc9891\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1790187134 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790187134 +0200\n\nrefactor(core): remove unused internal exports (#485)\n\n## Why\nThe source scan found names with no caller outside their defining\nmodules. The package does not expose these module paths. Keep the live\nhelpers in place, remove their module exports, and delete the two unused\nfinding-family aliases.\n\n## Scope\n- Delete `ruleFamilyForFinding` and `ruleFamily`.\n- Keep prompt ranking and verification-plan declarations private in\n`src/agent-prompt.ts`.\n- Keep Bridge constants, the docs origin, repair evidence bounds, and\nexpose-key sets private to their modules.\n- Keep the federation rule list, graph mapper, and React server asset\nmatcher private to their modules.\n\n## Blast Radius\nThe package exports ten entry points and does not publish `src`. Public\nruntime exports and declaration files match the main artifact. Rollup\nemitted new hashes for private chunks after their module exports\nchanged, so the unit and integration suites ran against the rebuilt\noutput.\n\n## Verification\n- `pnpm run test:unit` passed with 94 files and 1,221 tests.\n- `pnpm run test:integration` passed with 4 files and 80 tests against\nthe built package.\n- `pnpm run build`, `pnpm run typecheck`, and `pnpm run knip` passed.\n- ESM and CJS runtime exports and declaration entry files match main\nacross all ten package entries.\n- Formatting and `git diff --check` passed.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtBZ+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAT8gQAG/S33wlJXzQtUexR5MU3+a3\nPvlPK01fMq3YI011EFNkdAVkoqY/Tb6vBKTolJiaNV/k8eWlMEdzmSu1w/QCv7F+\nlWqjGYyhq6go/ZcnFRD0ESyp377Y6yDXNohobEbrKhpNHp6sWgEwK3BESKWUC7MT\nKVww03/7izH5enDrI2zgbOLMSXN6AJDIbjqTEKOm8qXNiVcY4dOu2z87rGxyw0Fv\ng9J8OetHulpAwBThCw5My4CBei75mR4kjmzjWDqezC91GbazBYSMlI4XjWrOko4D\n8xHaJp4kox79micWrjH6J9ywIF+Ok41XRfJd3tMErBDq2r3t6MqQD