26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: normalize mfdoctor branding (#482)\n\n## Summary\n- Normalize the product-facing brand from `MFDoctor` to `mfdoctor`\nacross current source text, CLI/report output, documentation, localized\nand versioned docs, examples, fixtures, schemas, GitHub metadata,\nskills, and SVG labels.\n- Preserve the package name `@tonoizer/mfdoctor`, CLI command\n`mfdoctor`, public API identifiers, stable environment/config\nidentifiers, the `build-report/MFDoctor` discriminator, and historical\nchangelog/ADR wording.\n- Add a patch Changeset for the published package content and\nuser-facing diagnostics.\n\n## Testing\n- [x] `vp pack`\n- [x] `vp run --filter . typecheck`\n- [x] `vp run --filter . test:unit` (94 files, 1221 tests)\n- [x] `vp run --filter . docs:build`\n- [x] `vp run --filter . pack:check`\n- [x] `vp run --filter . fmt:check`\n- [x] `vp run --filter . lint`\n\n## Risks\n- User-facing terminal, JSON/SARIF metadata, capability descriptions,\nprompts, and diagnostics now use lowercase `mfdoctor`; package/API\ncompatibility is unchanged.\n- Historical changelog and ADR references intentionally retain the\noriginal capitalization for historical accuracy.\n\nNo linked issue.","tree":{"sha":"c68722e9d0787e06263ae0b1895a4a875044f0a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/c68722e9d0787e06263ae0b1895a4a875044f0a3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/b7aa69ef95dbf2b702daad12bf3be116305e7e7c","verification":{"payload":"tree c68722e9d0787e06263ae0b1895a4a875044f0a3\nparent 8883e7f850db9029a7ed8c79c24a1d9e11b02763\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1789829606 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789829606 -0700\n\nchore: normalize mfdoctor branding (#482)\n\n## Summary\n- Normalize the product-facing brand from `MFDoctor` to `mfdoctor`\nacross current source text, CLI/report output, documentation, localized\nand v