izer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/0531a3c67076b7e5af49619e5a991c77e0621737/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T22:09:52Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T22:09:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(engine): inline execution state shaping (#476)\n\n## Why\nThe two execution-state helpers each have one caller and only forward a\nsingle mapping. Keeping the transformation at its use site reduces\nindirection without changing the state data shape.\n\n## Scope\nInline the engine-error mapping into `structureEvidenceRun`. Non-error\nstates retain identity and engine-error states receive the same phase,\nerror code, and run ID fields.\n\n## Blast Radius\nThe evidence rollout and run-status tests cover disabled and\nengine-error output. Typecheck, Knip, and the built package confirm the\npublic artifact remains valid.\n\n## Verification\n- Baseline: 75 focused tests passed before editing\n- `pnpm exec vitest run test/integration/evidence-rollout-bridge.test.ts\ntest/unit/run-status.test.ts`\n- `pnpm typecheck`\n- `pnpm knip`\n- `pnpm build`\n- `git diff --check`\n- Comment-quality review: pass\n\nThe repository-wide docs build and final package CLI assertion remain\nexisting trunk blockers documented in the cleanup a