 behavior and no supported reporters entry\nexists.\n\n## Verification\n- Baseline: 25 focused tests passed before editing\n- `pnpm exec vitest run test/unit/reporters.test.ts`\n- `pnpm typecheck`\n- `pnpm knip`\n- `pnpm build`\n- `git diff --check`\n- Comment-quality review: pass\n\nThe repository-wide docs build and final package CLI assertion remain\nexisting trunk blockers documented in the cleanup audit.","tree":{"sha":"87b01470c91b7421c4f70f453e8a62b0a0f9c3eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/87b01470c91b7421c4f70f453e8a62b0a0f9c3eb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/efe944658f16a7758d15193b2e5f965a7a16dacc","verification":{"payload":"tree 87b01470c91b7421c4f70f453e8a62b0a0f9c3eb\nparent 5ac1c4f92162eb6c66f5b9e06f585a90f35de852\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1789769382 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789769382 -0700\n\nrefactor(reporting): remove unused docs origin export (#478)\n\n## Why\n`DOCTOR_DOCS_ORIGIN` is re-exported from the internal reporters module,\nbut no supported package entry or repository consumer imports it from\nthere. The reporters module still uses the internal docs URL helper.\n\n## Scope\nRemove only the unused re-export. Report writing, formatting, and\ndocumentation links remain unchanged.\n\n## Blast Radius\nRepository search covered source, tests, scripts, docs, fixtures,\ngenerated declarations, and package exports. The built artifact retains\ninternal `doctorRuleDocUrl` behavior and no supported reporters entry\nexists.\n\n## Verification\n- Baseline: 25 focused tests passed before editing\n- `pnpm exec vitest run test/unit/reporters.test.ts`\n- `pnpm typecheck`\n- `pnpm knip`\n- `pnpm build`\n- `git diff --check`\n- Comment-quality review: pass\n\nThe repository-wide docs build and final package CLI assertion remain\nexisting trunk blockers documented in the cleanup audit.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGI