s, not the internal `federation-model` module.\n\n## Scope\nRemove only four internal type exports and retain every runtime model\nfield, builder, and cycle-group consumer.\n\n## Blast Radius\nRepository search covered source, tests, scripts, docs, fixtures,\ngenerated declarations, and package exports. Federation,\nevidence-reader, semantic graph, and UI graph tests continue to consume\nthe model internally.\n\n## Verification\n- Baseline: 48 focused tests passed before editing\n- `pnpm exec vitest run test/unit/federation-instances.test.ts\ntest/unit/evidence-reader.test.ts test/unit/semantic-graph.test.ts\ntest/unit/ui-graph.test.ts`\n- `pnpm typecheck`\n- `pnpm knip`\n- `pnpm build`\n- `git diff --check`\n- Comment-quality review: pass\n\nThe repository-wide docs build and final package CLI assertion remain\nexisting trunk blockers documented in the cleanup audit.","tree":{"sha":"aab5f3743e698bccf5769ee2901ee35b15bc67ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/aab5f3743e698bccf5769ee2901ee35b15bc67ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/5ac1c4f92162eb6c66f5b9e06f585a90f35de852","verification":{"payload":"tree aab5f3743e698bccf5769ee2901ee35b15bc67ca\nparent beee06c0908f73dd4f5e7743ed604a1b8f191e6b\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1789769368 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789769368 -0700\n\nrefactor(federation): narrow internal model types (#475)\n\n## Why\nThe federation model helper interfaces are internal implementation\nshapes. The package exports the model behavior through supported adapter\nand root entries, not the internal `federation-model` module.\n\n## Scope\nRemove only four internal type exports and retain every runtime model\nfield, builder, and cycle-group consumer.\n\n## Blast Radius\nRepository search covered source, tests, scripts, docs, fixtures,\ngenerated declarations, and package exports. Federation,\nevidence-reader, semantic graph, and UI graph tests continue to consume\nthe model internally.\n\n## Verification\n- Baseline: 48 focused tests passed before editing\n- `pnpm exec vitest run test/unit/federation-instances.test.ts\ntest/unit/evidence-reader.test.ts test/unit/semantic-graph.test.ts\ntest/unit/ui-graph.test.ts`\n- `pnpm typecheck`\n- `pnpm knip`\n- `pnpm build`\n- `git diff --check`\n- Comment-quality review: pass\n\nThe repository-wide docs build and final package CLI assertion remain\nexisting trunk blockers documented in the cleanup audit.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrbaYCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMI0QAAcif+JcMGMuQ+7MJcib2eu7\neBiDy5J+YgmeJSwxaPANDHJShpZoguQIlTEwU/KWtZWLgeTGz9G2exkTXmTdcG2C\nR7B0b4rels8+NcEnhtE0URnWCKiATUELkQGv9z3Z04RnhKRIjgR24x2QVb9bSk4/\nMoW4DbjN3LiDBnTjKvYHnvigYabKwq7OLM1m3o/8G3kpzXnzDQ/8/+XYknnCgy6g\nZALqXc1StSun+MBlIgxkN/jYYBV/GQ35wcMRvfz2WWa/jy1rWldf+7usCsuiDTXg\nhiSedDDYYqj34XtG3nw293N4T9pyA40oa0cHKRXSNNrwazxYd5Ak7xIhd9vOd4cZ\nPvbCGEsetyDEJIeMb3NvyTgV9xLvrqYgGkITujkY8OuvkWwxIZ4puTRpbdTphP4e\nqn0lUBx6kmc2wigMSojPLClalNxTxuaw4j/KzmUkq9hMiZf1E2GWPZ4ooD99XE+r\n63SFdk6SSY5g0UOpmk8yKlqrKHDK/VJ+MEOH0ZYwCHY0pNC8ERUk3hZqWt997NVU\nyVkkjAGuDaHvJFT5QLKbf8+GnuyTEX6qGn0oF/S4RQXRraDud8OgOA1SzW5mgNHC\nUp1xWSvv86D093Vg7cgZTNrlZoSpueXMlrznxdGPPDcEUFzXaZ6NKCaEhAU4Q0C3\njfXMt4p9SiciBL2NLSRs\n=oFbN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T22:09:29Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_e