 to define the internal\n`RuleExecutionState` union. The supported root entry exports the union\nand its engine-error member, not this constituent type.\n\n## Scope\nRemove only the internal type export. Disabled-rule behavior and the\npublic execution-state contract remain unchanged.\n\n## Blast Radius\nRepository search covered source, tests, scripts, docs, fixtures,\ngenerated declarations, and package exports. The evidence rollout tests\nstill exercise disabled states through the public union.\n\n## Verification\n- Baseline: 73 focused tests passed before editing\n- `pnpm exec vitest run test/unit/rule-contract.test.ts\ntest/integration/evidence-rollout-bridge.test.ts`\n- `pnpm typecheck`\n- `pnpm knip`\n- `pnpm build`\n- `git diff --check`\n- Comment-quality review: pass\n\nThe repository-wide docs build and final package CLI assertion remain\nexisting trunk blockers documented in the cleanup audit.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrbaFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA53oQACnpsLCWcF/HaCkG9OQhAgbl\nN37mG/FerPu2rcuDFi9VKB3KEYxmTnsENCO+2y5Gulz2WeBgoDTO1Vft7X9QVvE7\nxO/trLcrW4Rv9+T2/zJcbN6Cv3bvk2982M7B4rgOQDfb2On1shKzrHgybl+T3vry\nlLxnL2S6KlDyHSLcgg3/Vv/IbP66Fs9Z5CtXAZi7crm2gTagIVVfSUyhl4cUNAF9\ncA+4six2F826VRlD5a9qj8l5TnhqpQBrhZgPfU7pslxC1iyiwLQhjHhZ1jYSCAO6\nmJOUGzWyVkBOR35BnJeN7ReYZ1dCC0m67/Hcn00UggLf3+nQY6kC700vti9whw8l\nBDp8rpdB8CFN4olsqBP6lQ0JzthoAZRCa6W3FXZljYUSBuro5AModFGXx4Ktnw5m\nCRX7YD4h3Gc8iBRACDUAAYw9XnnHuN7npMcAJmN09pRpi3ljNkKTXF9sb+jc96Y7\nYBumRjvpOZLHDrkDLxotZovUj3Junws0I7xNtFCF1cLfDPxfK6guPIQA+pxN8XGy\n8HAcJwUEKlrn67ORyWQdQL1BidI+hJrzCV5fttLvvVWqwjo0EG+xpx4dhujSlQJf\n7cCz7rXApgoPNnroYB7wp6d0NGq1lkCI4RINWReZJwnP4sFFgDADQaXHA6iqGo7n\n0yBwttA6Au16tkX8Id8E\n=oHJb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T22:09:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://a