tps://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/dd2cd92bb838284f72bec534b5793d0a5e35116a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:12:01Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-15T07:12:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: keep verify-mfdoctor map honest after require-complete and freshness (#464)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nMaintain pass on `.cursor/skills/verify-mfdoctor/` (index hygiene +\nsource wave + live drive of all nine mapped features).\n\n**Outcome: changed.** All mapped CLI/plugin recipes still work. Proven\nmap/evidence corrections from post-#456 churn:\n\n- **#453** — `mfdoctor check` / `workspace` / `federation` gained opt-in\n`--require-complete`. Incomplete evidence (`missing-emit`, unmatched\nglobs, stale facts) becomes policy-fail exit `1` instead of legacy\nincomplete exit `2` / quiet `0`. Capabilities\n`operations.commands.{check,workspace,federation}` and\n`nonInteractive.flags` advertise the flag. Package version on this\ncheckout is `2.0.1`.\n- **#452** — workspace discovery reports stale project facts when a\nlisted source file is newer than `project.json`. CLI surface:\n`doctor/partial-analysis` with `details.workspaceDiagnostics[].kind` =\n`stale` and `status.incompleteReasons` including `evidence-unknown`\n(exit `2`, or `1` with `--require-complete`). `--glob` is a\nroot-relative discovery override (must name `.mf`; `**/project.json`\nskips hidden dirs).\n- **#449** — CLI/release contract harden; no extra mapped command. Live\n`capabilities` still lists the same command set.\n- **#457 / #458** — deps only. Plugin-emit Vite 8 cell still writes\n`.mf/doctor/project.json` with `lifecycle.flavor=rolldown-vite`.\n- **#460 / #462 / #463 / #455** — release workflow / version bump; no\nextra user-facing CLI recipe beyond the 2.0.1 capabilities payload.\n\nPrompt, baseline, runtime, and rules maps still match source. Catalog\nstill 127 rules; Vite-only `supportedBundlers` still `[\"vite\"]`.\n\n## Scope\n\nOnly `.cursor/skills/verify-mfdoctor/` (SKILL.md, features, evidence).\nNo product code, no version bump, no npm publish.\n\n## Coverage\n\n| Feature | Source | Live |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| capabilities | `--require-complete` in operations +\nnonInteractive.flags (#453); version 2.0.1 | `node dist/cli.js\ncapabilities` exit 0 |\n| check | `--require-complete` → exit 1 on `missing-emit` | helper\n`--no-write` + require-complete on showcase |\n| workspace | stale diagnostics + `--require-complete` + `--glob` |\nconflict 1 / clean 0 / require-complete 1 / stale 2 |\n| federation | unmatched + `--require-complete` → exit 1 |\nversion-conflict 1 / unmatched 2 / unmatched+flag 1 |\n| prompt | match | finding / fingerprint / top / unknown |\n| baseline | match | generate / update / prune-missing |\n| runtime | match | mismatch 1 / green 0 / missing trace 2 |\n| plugin-emit | match | `@mfdoctor-standalone/vite` build; core emit\nruleIds present |\n| rules | match | catalog / one / vite-only / unknown |\n\nOffline default. `probe` / `compare` not driven. Index: nine feature\nfiles, no missing/extra/dead entries.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm install && pnpm build`\n- [x] Doctor `node dist/cli.js capabilities`\n- [x] Live drive of every mapped feature (temps under\n`/tmp/mfdoctor-verify-*` or `--no-write`)\n- [x] Evidence under\n`.cursor/skills/verify-mfdoctor/evidence/<feature-id>/` after cleanup\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-1da85a8a-4353-55ed-912a-bd8d024eb7e9?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-l