replace-objects ls-remote ssh://git@github.com/release-package/package.tgz.git\nnpm error git@github.com: Permission denied (publickey).\n```\n\nnpm 11 treats `owner/repo` as GitHub shorthand.\n`release-package/package.tgz` matches that shape, so it never opened the\nlocal tarball.\n\nDraft 2.0.1 is still a draft; npm still has 2.0.0 only.\n\n## Change\n\nExact publish command is now:\n\n```bash\n\"$HOME/.local/bin/npm\" stage publish \"$PWD/release-package/package.tgz\" --access public --tag \"$NPM_TAG\"\n```\n\n(via `NPM=\"$HOME/.local/bin/npm\"`)\n\nThe stage step also:\n\n- prepends `$HOME/.local/bin` to `PATH` (in addition to `GITHUB_PATH`\nfrom the install step)\n- checks that binary is executable and reports `11.17.0`\n- runs `\"$NPM\" help stage` so `npm stage` is present before publish\n- requires `$PWD/release-package/package.tgz` to exist\n\nUnchanged: OIDC / `environment: npm` / draft-until-stage / promote flow\n/ no checkout in stage. No version bump, no npm publish from this PR.\n\n## Tests\n\n`test/unit/release-workflows.test.ts` asserts the absolute tarball path,\nthe user-prefix npm binary, and `help stage`.\n\nAfter merge, re-dispatch Stage with tag `2.0.1`.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-e96130bc-15a1-5938-a4c6-efe03b2c38f3?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-e96130bc-15a1-5938-a4c6-efe03b2c38f3&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"3fd8ed06bf75362d69cff0b47bfd181f37d9ee24","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/3fd8ed06bf75362d69cff0b47bfd181f37d9ee24"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/7b3ace32a38c4d2b2b10440bde7022120cb8aa44","verification":{"payload":"tree 3fd8ed06bf75362d69cff0b47bfd181f37d9ee24\nparent 53c44f82edbd106388fa6f53e7d9665f092b4085\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1789454032 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789454032 -0700\n\nfix: pass an absolute tarball path to npm stage publish (#463)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Why\n\nStage for tag **2.0.1** failed again after the `npm` GitHub environment\nwas approved:\n\n\nhttps://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/actions/runs/34902873107\n\n#460 and #462 worked: user-prefix install + `hash -r` +\n`\"$HOME/.local/bin/npm\" --version` = `11.17.0`.\n\nThen **Stage with trusted publishing** failed:\n\n```\nnpm stage publish release-package/package.tgz --access public --tag \"$NPM_TAG\"\nnpm error code 128\nnpm error command git --no-replace-objects ls-remote ssh://git@github.com/release-package/package.tgz.git\nnpm error git@github.com: Permission denied (publickey).\n```\n\nnpm 11 treats `owner/repo` as GitHub shorthand.\n`release-package/package.tgz` matches that shape, so it never opened the\nlocal tarball.\n\nDraft 2.0.1 is still a draft; npm still has 2.0.0 only.\n\n## Change\n\nExact publish command is now:\n\n```bash\n\"$HOME/.local/bin/npm\" stage publish \"$PWD/release-package/package.tgz\" --access public --tag \"$NPM_TAG\"\n```\n\n(via `NPM=\"$HOME/.local/bin/npm\"`)\n\nThe stage step also:\n\n- prepends `$HOME/.local/bin` to `PATH` (in addition to `GITHUB_PATH`\nfrom the install step)\n- checks that binary is executable and reports `11.17.0`\n- runs `\"$NPM\" help stage` so `npm stage` is present before publish\n- requires `$PWD/release-package/package.tgz` to exist\n\nUnchanged: OIDC / `environment: npm` / draft-until-stage / promote flow\n/ no checkout in stage. No version bump, no npm publish from this PR.\n\n## Tests\n\n`test/unit/release-workflows.test.ts` asserts the absolute tarball path,\nthe user-prefix npm binary, and `help stage`.\n\nAfter merge, re-dispatch Stage with tag `2.0.1`.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-e96130bc-15a1-5938-a4c6-efe03b2c38f3?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-e96130bc-15a1-5938-a4c6-efe03b2c38f3&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqObQCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzgkQAF6Bo0qzTVoMMb3NZY2Cfn0S\nIa16GAOzRdJlmUafVOxT/RENDBTONGXNSTvsZQeBKeKG6z6uRfz/mFOX