 ID while preserving prior findings.\n- Atomically replace stale reports on outer failures and expose\nworkspace/federation gate completeness outputs.\n- Add focused regressions for strict/default behavior, incomplete\nevidence, thrown rules, stale reports, and action output safety.\n\n## Testing\n- [x] pnpm exec vitest run test/unit/run-status.test.ts\ntest/unit/failures.test.ts\ntest/unit/workspace-federation-gate-action.test.ts\n- [x] pnpm exec vitest run test/integration/failures.test.ts\ntest/integration/evidence-rollout-bridge.test.ts\n- [x] pnpm test:unit\n- [x] pnpm fmt:check\n- [x] pnpm lint\n- [x] pnpm build\n- [x] pnpm typecheck\n\n## Risks\n- CLI parsing and public option/type wiring remain intentionally outside\nthis lane and require the parent integration lane; the action forwards\nthe strict flag/env contract for that integration.\n- Build reports the repository''s existing mixed ESM/CommonJS export\nwarnings.\n- No network/probe or evidence rollout default changes were made.","tree":{"sha":"660f8cc25451df3214b6f2ce4ca21c0e866e0d5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/660f8cc25451df3214b6f2ce4ca21c0e866e0d5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/e535bce9aeb506e97213450a8ff5bf74f164b769","verification":{"payload":"tree 660f8cc25451df3214b6f2ce4ca21c0e866e0d5b\nparent 90e208bac60f5618be490727fe42e642a8f93ae1\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1789420351 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789420351 -0700\n\nfeat: add opt-in strict completeness gate (#453)\n\n## Summary\n- Add an explicitly opt-in strict completeness contract while preserving\nlegacy default exit semantics.\n- Structure thrown rule/evidence/analysis failures with phase, stable\nerror code, and run ID while preserving prior findings.\n- Atomically replace stale reports on outer failures and expose\nworkspace/federation gate completeness outputs.\n- Add focused regressions for strict/d