re pin cluster from #443.\n\n**Pins**\n- `@module-federation/vite`: 1.21.1 → **1.21.3**\n\n1.21.2 + 1.21.3 include runtime crash/correctness fixes we want in CI\ncells:\n\n1.21.2:\n- honor `vite-ignore` during dev transforms (#1159)\n- expand `react/` prefix in SSR `loadShare` and eager seed (#1156)\n- hashed SSR `remoteEntry` filename matches browser entry (#1157)\n- keep React DOM sharing client-safe (#1158)\n- keep lazy remotes on demand (#1162)\n\n1.21.3:\n- manage shared exports and providers (#1165)\n- make dev virtual IDs deterministic (#1167)\n- clean up settled pending shared loads (#1168)\n- fall back to root `index.html` for dev entry injection (#1171)\n- defer default-scope singleton fallback imports (#1173)\n- prevent shared package self-import rewrites (#1177)\n- respect eager shared fallback initialization (#1180)\n- keep runtime-registered shared providers (#1178)\n- skip satisfy-checking `import:false` stubs (#1184)\n- skip shared dependency cycle rewrites (#1182)\n\nDeliberately **not** 1.21.4 / 1.21.5 / 1.21.6 — those remain inside the\n10-day age gate (published 2026-09-07 / 2026-09-07 / 2026-09-10). Latest\nnpm is 1.21.6; ignore until the gate clears. Vite 5.4.21 compatibility\ncells (`vite-cjs`, `vite-multi-instance`) stay on Vite 5.\n`@module-federation/enhanced` and `rsbuild-plugin` stay at 2.9.0. Vite\n5.4.21 `trustPolicyExclude` / policy-skip Dependabot alerts are\nunchanged.\n\n**Age-gate excludes** in `pnpm-workspace.yaml`:\n`@module-federation/vite@1.21.1` → `@1.21.3` (exact). Dropped stale\n`@module-federation/node@2.7.49` because the lock already resolves\n`2.7.50` (published 2026-08-24, outside the window). Existing\n`@module-federation/*@2.9.0` / Vite+ excludes are unchanged.\n\nNo `@tonoizer/mfdoctor` version bump, changeset, or publish.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-f88ab37f-42d3-59a3-badf-04933c87b936?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefe