flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commit/4629105af2af9726b39bc664114dbae8ccff442b","node_id":"C_kwDOTjIi_9oAKDQ2MjkxMDVhZjJhZjk3MjZiMzliYzY2NDExNGRiYWU4Y2NmZjQ0MmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commit/6b8c858b506bf628f57fd9b7845d7642b6fb86e3","sha":"6b8c858b506bf628f57fd9b7845d7642b6fb86e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/6b8c858b506bf628f57fd9b7845d7642b6fb86e3"}],"sha":"4629105af2af9726b39bc664114dbae8ccff442b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/4629105af2af9726b39bc664114dbae8ccff442b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70775490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/6b8c858b506bf628f57fd9b7845d7642b6fb86e3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-14T07:24:46Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-14T07:24:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): override adm-zip to 0.6.1 (Dependabot #56) (#457)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nForce patched `adm-zip@0.6.1` via a pnpm override to clear Dependabot\nalert #56\n([GHSA-vwc7-r8mq-g2x9](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-vwc7-r8mq-g2x9)\n/ [CVE-2026-76845](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-76845)).\n\nVulnerable range is `>= 0.5.9, <= 0.6.0`. Extraction (`extractAllTo` /\n`extractAllToAsync` / `extractEntryTo`) can follow pre-existing\ndestination symlinks and overwrite files outside the extraction root\nwhen `overwrite` is enabled.\n\nThe lockfile had `adm-zip@0.6.0` as a **transitive** of\n`@module-federation/dts-plugin@2.9.0`. We do not consume `adm-zip`\ndirectly, so an override is the same pattern as nanoid (#367), fast-uri\n(#441), and vitest (#446).\n\nUpstream released `adm-zip@0.6.1` on 2026-09-11 with an explicit fix:\n*\"Blocked extraction from writing through symlinks inside the target\"*\n(`assertPathSafe` before `writeFileTo`). GitHub Advisory still shows\n`first_patched_version=null`, but 0.6.1 is outside the vulnerable range\nand contains the fix.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `pnpm-workspace.yaml`: add exact override `adm-zip: 0.6.1`\n- `pnpm-workspace.yaml`: add exact `minimumReleaseAgeExclude` entry\n`adm-zip@0.6.1`\n- `pnpm-lock.yaml`: refresh so every resolution is `adm-zip@0.6.1` (no\nremaining `adm-zip@0.6.0`)\n\n`minimumReleaseAge: 14400` (10 days) + `minimumReleaseAgeExclude` is\nrequired because 0.6.1 was published ~2026-09-11 and is still inside the\nwindow on 2026-09-14. Keep the exclude exact; drop it when the age gate\nclears / `@module-federation/dts-plugin` pins `adm-zip >= 0.6.1`. Drop\nthe override when dts-plugin pins that patched line.\n\nNo `@tonoizer/mfdoctor` version bump, changeset, npm publish, or GitHub\nRelease.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Vite 5 Dependabot #19–#21 / #34–#37 / #45–#47 (policy skip; Vite 5→6\nis not hygiene)\n- Opportunistic `@module-federation/vite` bumps\n- Assessment/feature PRs #449/#452/#453, changeset-release #455\n- Issues #29/#314/#356\n- Architecture / HTML UI / general `--fix`\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm install` succeeds with the exact age-exclude\n- [x] Lockfile has `adm-zip@0.6.1` only; dts-plugin tree no longer\nresolves `0.6.0`\n- [x] Pre-commit fmt + lint passed\n- [x] `pnpm run test:unit` — 92 files / 1194 tests passed\n- [x] `pnpm run test:integration` — 4 files / 80 tests passed\n- [ ] GitHub Quality + remaining PR checks\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-aa66ed65-54b1-5e52-aaa3-b9855834e8cd?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-aa66ed65-54b1-5e52-aaa3-b9855834e8cd&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"087383eeab4ec9f23a068483065e0da6e62cc678","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/087383eeab4ec9f23a068483065e0da6e62cc678"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/6b8c858b506bf628f57fd9b7845d7642b6fb86e3","verification":{"payload":"tree 087383eeab4ec9f23a068483065e0da6e62cc678\nparent 11a6aba85ff69ef3292fb8189feab494627340ed\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1789370686 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789370686 -0700\n\nchore(deps): override adm-zip to 0.6.1 (Dependabot #56) (#457)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nForce patched `adm-zip@0.6.1` via a pnpm override to clear Dependabot\nalert #56\n([GHSA-vwc7-r8mq-g2x9](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-vwc7-r8mq-g2x9)\n/ [CVE-2026-76845](https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-76845)).\n\nVulnerable range is `>= 0.5.9, <= 0.6.0`. Extraction (`extractAllTo` /\n`extractAllToAsync` / `extractEntryTo`) can follow pre-existing\ndestination symlinks and overwrite files outside the extraction root\nwhen `overwrite` is enabled.\n\nThe lockfile had `adm-zip@0.6.0` as a **transitive** of\n`@module-federation/dts-plugin@2.9.0`. We do not consume `adm-zip`\ndirectly, so an override is the same pattern as nanoid (#367), fast-uri\n(#441), and vitest (#446).\n\nUpstream released `adm-zip@0.6.1` on 2026-09-11 with an explicit fix:\n*\"Blocked extraction from writing through symlinks inside the target\"*\n(`assertPathSafe` before `writeFileTo`). GitHub Advisory still shows\n`first_patched_version=null`, but 0.6.1 is outside the vulnerable range\nand contains the fix.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `pnpm-workspace.yaml`: add exact override `adm-zip: 0.6.1`\n- `pnpm-workspace.yaml`: add exact `minimumReleaseAgeExclude` entry\n`adm-zip@0.6.1`\n- `pnpm-lock.yaml`: refresh so every resolution is `adm-zip@0.