-09-14T07:08:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: keep verify-mfdoctor map honest after verification contracts (#456)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nMaintain pass on `.cursor/skills/verify-mfdoctor/` (index hygiene +\nsource wave + live drive of all nine mapped features).\n\n**Outcome: changed.** All mapped CLI/plugin recipes still work. Proven\nmap/evidence corrections from post-#445 churn:\n\n- **#454** — `mfdoctor capabilities` now ships a per-command\n`operations` contract (`operations.schemaVersion`,\narguments/options/network/writtenArtifacts/errorCodes, including\n`<diagnostics-dir>/verification-plan.json`). `mfdoctor prompt` prints\n`## Verification plan` and `## Repair context` before `## Finding`.\nStandalone `prompt` fills project directory / report path / completeness\nwith `unknown` rather than inventing analysis context.\n- **#450** — conflict report JSON keeps a high numeric `summary.score`\n(99) but `summary.scoreLabel` is `Needs work` when a blocking error\nexists. Stale evidence said `Great`.\n- **#447** — no user-facing `rules` / plugin-emit change (internal\n`emitCatalogRuleIds` scanner only). Live catalog still 127 rules;\nVite-only `supportedBundlers` still `[\"vite\"]`.\n- **#446 / #448** — deps only. **#451** — collect/runtime-binding\ninternals; mapped check/emit rule IDs unchanged.\n\n## Scope\n\nOnly `.cursor/skills/verify-mfdoctor/` (SKILL.md, features, evidence).\nNo product code, no version bump, no npm publish.\n\n## Coverage\n\n| Feature | Source | Live |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| capabilities | operations contract added in #454 | `node dist/cli.js\ncapabilities` exit 0; `operations.schemaVersion` 1 |\n| check | score/scoreLabel in report JSON | disposable showcase\n`--no-write`; `config/remote-http-insecure` + `missing-emit` |\n| workspace | match + scoreLabel | conflict exit 1 / clean exit 0 |\n| federation | match + scoreLabel | version-conflict exit 1 / unmatched\nexit 2 |\n| prompt | plan/repair headings from #454 | finding / fingerprint / top\n/ unknown |\n| baseline | match | generate / update / prune-missing |\n| runtime | match | mismatch exit 1 / green exit 0 / missing trace exit\n2 |\n| plugin-emit | match | `@mfdoctor-standalone/vite` build; core emit\nruleIds present |\n| rules | #447 not user-facing | catalog / one / vite-only / unknown |\n\nOffline default. `probe` / `compare` not driven. Index: nine feature\nfiles, no missing/extra/dead entries.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm install && pnpm build`\n- [x] Doctor `node dist/cli.js capabilities`\n- [x] Live drive of every mapped feature (temps under\n`/tmp/mfdoctor-verify-*` or `--no-write`)\n- [x] Evidence under\n`.cursor/skills/verify-mfdoctor/evidence/<feature-id>/` after cleanup\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-ba1db1dc-3fd3-5546-9eaf-fad5f5945c9c?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-ba1db1dc-3fd3-5546-9eaf-fad5f5945c9c&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"d78b539376f2d2f5cf02cc14ade84d9f8e339771","url":"https://api.github