ns contract added in #454 | `node dist/cli.js\ncapabilities` exit 0; `operations.schemaVersion` 1 |\n| check | score/scoreLabel in report JSON | disposable showcase\n`--no-write`; `config/remote-http-insecure` + `missing-emit` |\n| workspace | match + scoreLabel | conflict exit 1 / clean exit 0 |\n| federation | match + scoreLabel | version-conflict exit 1 / unmatched\nexit 2 |\n| prompt | plan/repair headings from #454 | finding / fingerprint / top\n/ unknown |\n| baseline | match | generate / update / prune-missing |\n| runtime | match | mismatch exit 1 / green exit 0 / missing trace exit\n2 |\n| plugin-emit | match | `@mfdoctor-standalone/vite` build; core emit\nruleIds present |\n| rules | #447 not user-facing | catalog / one / vite-only / unknown |\n\nOffline default. `probe` / `compare` not driven. Index: nine feature\nfiles, no missing/extra/dead entries.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm install && pnpm build`\n- [x] Doctor `node dist/cli.js capabilities`\n- [x] Live drive of every mapped feature (temps under\n`/tmp/mfdoctor-verify-*` or `--no-write`)\n- [x] Evidence under\n`.cursor/skills/verify-mfdoctor/evidence/<feature-id>/` after cleanup\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-ba1db1dc-3fd3-5546-9eaf-fad5f5945c9c?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-ba1db1dc-3fd3-5546-9eaf-fad5f5945c9c&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefe