ce, and leave JSON/SARIF writers and legacy evidence defaults\nunchanged.\n- Add focused regressions and update the CLI/report schema guidance.\n\n## Verification\n\n- pnpm exec vitest run test/unit/reporters.test.ts\ntest/unit/health-score.test.ts\n- pnpm test:unit\n- pnpm exec vitest run test/unit/schema-contract.test.ts\ntest/unit/cli.test.ts\n- pnpm schema:check\n- pnpm fmt:check\n- pnpm lint\n- pnpm typecheck\n- pnpm build\n- Commit hook: vp fmt --check and vp lint --deny-warnings\n\nAll listed checks pass. pnpm docs:build remains blocked by the existing\nRspress SSG runtime error: createContext is not a function in\n@rspress/core 2.0.19. Docs generators, German validation, parity,\nprepare, snippets, and link checks pass before that failure.","tree":{"sha":"a4ca8d4dfd7cb484def410d53b6a2d9c7b8ef942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/a4ca8d4dfd7cb484def410d53b6a2d9c7b8ef942"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/8469777f221fedc4828ad3d07fc02a18f0814023","verification":{"payload":"tree a4ca8d4dfd7cb484def410d53b6a2d9c7b8ef942\nparent deac9524679d5dac4c4edc62e37e8433ccd90424\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1789333461 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789333461 -0700\n\nfeat: improve terminal result ordering and score semantics (#450)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Lead human-facing terminal output with policy result, analysis\ncompleteness and reason codes, and next action before the health score.\n- Keep incomplete analysis at a truthful n/a terminal score and force\nnon-suppressed blocking errors to the Needs work label even when the\nnumeric score is high.\n- Render path:line:column locations, deduplicate identical finding\nguidance, and leave JSON/SARIF writers and legacy evidence defaults\nunchanged.\n- Add focused regressions and update the CLI/report schema guidance.\n\n## Verification\n\n- pnpm exec vitest run test/unit/reporters.test.ts\ntest/unit/health-score.test.ts\n- pnpm test:unit\n- pnpm exec vitest run test/unit/schema-contract.test.ts\ntest/unit/cli.test.ts\n- pnpm schema:check\n- pnpm fmt:check\n- pnpm lint\n- pnpm typecheck\n- pnpm build\n- Commit hook: vp fmt --check and vp lint --deny-warnings\n\nAll listed checks pass. pnpm docs:build remains blocked by the existing\nRspress SSG runtime error: createContext is not a function in\n@rspress/core 2.0.19. Docs generators, German validation, parity,\nprepare, snippets, and link checks pass before that failure.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqpw/VCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAq40QAJa6KyceZtKUWm3wbicr2XC3\n9+F3Q7RXGXwQAL6q4cbdhSGm3ranjAOxzRujm5LEjvrI+mmha+Ceq7DB78Vt+zjF\nhSp3ssZNOiNti0B3nBT/oxYmyFegu/EYvC7fyA1fviGUHS1bQ13Z2D/8vv4iHVOr\nUMOkq36sCekCrjfqID/UuJGhwLRKK8pa6myaRAShuRQ6QF5VOFmTJ8IyHwd4uI5J\nSQngAOBeacY+LyWYXOzLzDUgp35TTDhcM+66VaD0YTh46y5Ph4wI8g1cJZue+Nyw\nnHxGICJ3xEhopmTkJjPWK/lwGGr19chz8Dm9HktL4BUIxfKg6+d2p7KaBKFAlUB5\ntDk+BYER7hkrAIIqJbzLXqtVLVqwpAYNANCrBFUu0Dn0oAz7OSBWdH9cbFirlfdj\nupYCLUYLZ3fySAea1b13Kc3+bd3H6fWKc79Qcc07Jb8WqMaFOZPLJTdY/fBHFV1S\nXIVdgwNge1586O87GXD78+Tmd7UbIqu+QZ8g/x2pQ+01OSVipWjCEk3Zf1t7njAT\n6sO1uUyAI95DWv6/QuTYVpiDZriPcwH4NPYsux4ATpzGbmIpquK+MNngM5CNU4jZ\nPchAOPuofH1gTVSH0wiD25BrWW1SFuUed9VPA1tKmVtrNw90lcHNVq/WksnvrgNd\nZPkbiExX8tZ8EtG7y7gO\n=vo3O\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-13T21:04:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url"