html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/3a72cbb1a7ab8f2b2a775ddbe2fcf4db09017126/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-13T19:38:32Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-13T19:38:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): bump @rspress/core from 2.0.19 to 2.0.21 (#448)\n\nBumps\n[@rspress/core](https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/tree/HEAD/packages/core)\nfrom 2.0.19 to 2.0.21.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/releases\">@​rspress/core''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v2.0.21</h2>\n<h2>What''s Changed</h2>\n<h3>Bug Fixes 🐞</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>fix(theme/Link): stabilize anchor scrolling after navigation by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SoonIter\"><code>@​SoonIter</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/pull/3627\">web-infra-dev/rspress#3627</a></li>\n<li>fix(theme): keep all surfaces in sync when switching appearance by\n<a href=\"https://github.com/fi3ework\"><code>@​fi3ework</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/pull/3628\">web-infra-dev/rspress#3628</a></li>\n<li>fix(theme/Nav): fix left-positioned menu alignment and spacing by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ruibaby\"><code>@​ruibaby</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/pull/3629\">web-infra-dev/rspress#3629</a></li>\n<li>fix(theme): replace <code>border-bottom</code> link underlines with\n<code>text-decoration</code> by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SoonIter\"><code>@​SoonIter</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/pull/3631\">web-infra-dev/rspress#3631</a></li>\n<li>fix(theme/Banner): support SSR and prevent flash before hydration by\n<a href=\"https://github.com/SoonIter\"><code>@​SoonIter</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/pull/3630\">web-infra-dev/rspress#3630</a></li>\n<li>fix(theme): limit link hover opacity to callouts by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SoonIter\"><code>@​SoonIter</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/pull/3632\">web-infra-dev/rspress#3632</a></li>\n<li>fix(theme/Nav): expand navbar item click areas by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SoonIter\"><code>@​SoonIter</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/pull/3633\">web-infra-dev/rspress#3633</a></li>\n<li>fix(theme/CodeBlock): preserve background when scrolling\nhorizontally by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ruibaby\"><code>@​ruibaby</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/pull/3634\">web-infra-dev/rspress#3634</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Other Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Release v2.0.21 by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/SoonIter\"><code>@​SoonIter</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/pull/3635\">web-infra-dev/rspress#3635</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/compare/v2.0.20...v2.0.21\">https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/compare/v2.0.20...v2.0.21</a></p>\n<h2>v2.0.20</h2>\n<h2>Highlights</h2>\n<h3>🧭 New Blog: <a\nhref=\"https://rspress.rs/blog/agent-friendly-website\">How to build an\nAgent-friendly website</a></h3>\n<p>Can an AI agent find, read, and understand your documentation as\neasily as a human? This new guide shows how Rspress combines\n<code>llms.txt</code>, SSG-MD, <code>Accept: text/markdown</code>, and\n<code>injectLlmsHint</code> to build documentation for both humans and\nAgents—and how AFDocs makes the result measurable.</p>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n<p><strong>Read the blog:</strong> <a\nhref=\"https://rspress.rs/blog/agent-friendly-website\">How to build an\nAgent-friendly website</a></p>\n<h3>🔗 Normalize clean URLs before rendering</h3>\n<p>Static hosts can serve the same page through URLs such as\n<code>/guide</code>, <code>/guide.html</code>, <code>/guide/</code>, and\n<code>/guide/index.html</code>. Rspress can now match the actual route\nfirst and normalize the browser address bar to the format selected by\n<code>route.cleanUrls</code> before the page renders:</p>\n<pre lang=\"ts\"><code>import { defineConfig } from ''@rspress/core'';\n<p>export default defineConfig({<br />\nroute: {<br />\ncleanUrls: true,<br />\ncleanUrlsRedirect: true,<br />\n},<br />\n});<br />\n</code></pre></p>\n<p>With this configuration, <code>/guide.html</code> becomes\n<code>/guide</code>, while <code>/reference/index.html</code> becomes\n<code>/reference/</code>. Normalization uses\n<code>history.replaceState</code>, does not reload the page, and\npreserves <code>base</code>, query parameters, hashes, and existing\nhistory state.</p>\n<p>This is a browser-side fallback rather than an HTTP 301/308 redirect.\nKeep server or CDN redirects for canonical SEO behavior.</p>\n<p><strong>Documentation:</strong> <a\nhref=\"https://rspress.rs/api/config/config-basic#routecleanurlsredirect\"><code>route.cleanUrlsRedirect</code></a></p>\n<p><strong>Blog:</strong> <a\nhref=\"https://rspress.rs/blog/trailing-slash\">The trailing slash problem\nin static sites</a></p>\n<p><strong>Related PR:</strong> <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/pull/3571\">#3571</a></p>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/commit/7bd6c16cc019201497183617483777b5e327316c\"><code>7bd6c16</code></a>\nRelease v2.0.21 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/tree/HEAD/packages/core/issues/3635\">#3635</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/commit/8764f373db9149d33094bc4cad0e586bf3e8d06f\"><code>8764f37</code></a>\nfix(theme/CodeBlock): preserve background when scrolling horizontally\n(<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/tree/HEAD/packages/core/issues/3634\">#3634</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/commit/fe879af91b47a18a129b068d48f032a8b8a7ec84\"><code>fe879af</code></a>\nfix(theme/Nav): expand navbar item click areas (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/tree/HEAD/packages/core/issues/3633\">#3633</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/commit/fcdc78f0fc59395802750ae0b13de1466b41ec17\"><code>fcdc78f</code></a>\nfix(theme): limit link hover opacity to callouts (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/tree/HEAD/packages/core/issues/3632\">#3632</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/commit/22860763de7ba28de1a86fd39a5e9d543512fac0\"><code>2286076</code></a>\nfix(theme/Banner): support SSR and prevent flash before hydration (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/tree/HEAD/packages/core/issues/3630\">#3630</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/commit/ce245033e8404df79ffa805f35e3b24defbe81e5\"><code>ce24503</code></a>\nfix(theme): replace <code>border-bottom</code> link underlines with\n<code>text-decoration</code> (#...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/commit/ea8f00b2abefdcd8e7b44d24a