ting\nhistory state.</p>\n<p>This is a browser-side fallback rather than an HTTP 301/308 redirect.\nKeep server or CDN redirects for canonical SEO behavior.</p>\n<p><strong>Documentation:</strong> <a\nhref=\"https://rspress.rs/api/config/config-basic#routecleanurlsredirect\"><code>route.cleanUrlsRedirect</code></a></p>\n<p><strong>Blog:</strong> <a\nhref=\"https://rspress.rs/blog/trailing-slash\">The trailing slash problem\nin static sites</a></p>\n<p><strong>Related PR:</strong> <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/pull/3571\">#3571</a></p>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/commit/7bd6c16cc019201497183617483777b5e327316c\"><code>7bd6c16</code></a>\nRelease v2.0.21 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/tree/HEAD/packages/core/issues/3635\">#3635</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/commit/8764f373db9149d33094bc4cad0e586bf3e8d06f\"><code>8764f37</code></a>\nfix(theme/CodeBlock): preserve background when scrolling horizontally\n(<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/tree/HEAD/packages/core/issues/3634\">#3634</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/commit/fe879af91b47a18a129b068d48f032a8b8a7ec84\"><code>fe879af</code></a>\nfix(theme/Nav): expand navbar item click areas (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/tree/HEAD/packages/core/issues/3633\">#3633</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/commit/fcdc78f0fc59395802750ae0b13de1466b41ec17\"><code>fcdc78f</code></a>\nfix(theme): limit link hover opacity to callouts (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/tree/HEAD/packages/core/issues/3632\">#3632</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/web-infra-dev/rspress/commit/22860763de7ba28de1a86fd39a5e9d543512fac0\"><code>2286076</code></a>\nfix(theme/Banner): support SS