events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/a639995637448d1901fbaa7cb088fdf4dc0492f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T08:27:42Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T08:27:42Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: avoid polynomial ReDoS when scanning emit ruleIds (#447)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nFixes GitHub CodeQL alert **#12** (`js/polynomial-redos`, high).\n`emitCatalogRuleIds` scanned emit catalog sources with:\n\n```js\n/(?:ruleIds|\"ruleIds\")\\s*:\\s*\\[([^\\]]*)\\]/g\n```\n\nCrafted input starting with `ruleIds:[` repeated without a closing `]`\ncould quadratic-backtrack. Same GHSA-class issue as CodeQL\n`js/polynomial-redos` (polynomial regular-expression denial of service).\n\n## Changes\n\n- Replace the regex block extractor in `src/rule-inventory.ts` with a\nlinear `indexOf` + first-`]` slice (quoted and unquoted `ruleIds` keys).\nInner `\"...\"` ids are collected the same way: first closing quote, no\nescape processing.\n- `showcaseCatalogRuleIds` is unchanged.\n- No public API / version / changeset change. Inventory catalog behavior\nfor `inventoryDemoCoverageErrors` / `inventory:check` is preserved\n(first `]` still closes a block).\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] Unit tests in `test/unit/rule-inventory-demo.test.ts`: normal\nblocks, quoted and unquoted keys, multiple blocks, empty arrays,\nfirst-`]` (nested quotes/arrays not parsed), pathological `ruleIds:[` /\n`\"ruleIds\":[` repetition finishes quickly\n- [x] Existing demo-coverage tests still match\n`scripts/demo-standalone-findings.mjs` + `fixtures/adapters/cases.json`\n- [x] `vp test run test/unit/rule-inventory-demo.test.ts\ntest/unit/rule-inventory-closeout.test.ts` — 2 files / 15 tests passed\n- [x] Pre-commit `vp run fmt:check` + `vp run lint --deny-warnings`\n- [x] `vp run inventory:check` — up to date (127 rules, 46 showcase, 1\nemit, 80 unit)\n\nOut of scope: HTML UI, in-browser agent, general `--fix`, private MF\nfield scraping, Vite 5→6, version bump / publish.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-657ed630-25ee-429e-8930-31139a9d854f?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-657ed630-25ee-429e-8930-31139a9d854f&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"e88a4b69696f4a6f67a8c822862cc298d62686e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/e88a4b69696f4a6f67a8c822862cc298d62686e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/a639995637448d1901fbaa7cb088fdf4dc0492f8","verification":{"payload":"tree e88a4b69696f4a6f67a8c822862cc298d62686e4\nparent 381c19e9cb5816316c1816951a40acbf99bc7540\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1789115262 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789115262 +0000\n\nfix: avoid polynomial ReDoS when scanning emit ruleIds (#447)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nFixes GitHub CodeQL alert **#12** (`js/polynomial-redos`, high).\n`emitCatalogRuleIds` scanned emit catalog sources with:\n\n```js\n/(?:ruleIds|\"ruleIds\")\\s*:\\s*\\[([^\\]]*)\\]/g\n```\n\nCrafted input starting with `ruleIds:[` repeated without a closing `]`\ncould quadratic-backtrack. Same GHSA-class issue as CodeQL\n`js/polynomial-redos` (polynomial regular-expression denial of service).\n\n## Changes\n\n- Replace the regex block extractor in `src/rule-inventory.ts` with a\nlinear `indexOf` + first-`]` slice (quoted and unquoted `ruleIds` keys).\nInner `\"...\"` ids are collected the same way: first closing quote, no\nescape processing.\n- `showcaseCatalogRuleIds` is unchanged.\n- No public API / version / changeset change. Inventory catalog behavior\nfor `inventoryDemoCoverageErrors` / `inventory:check` is preserved\n(first `]` still closes a block).\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] Unit tests in `test/unit/rule-inventory-demo.test.ts`: normal\nblocks, quoted and unquoted keys, multiple blocks, empty arrays,\nfirst-`]` (nested quotes/arrays not parsed), pathological `ruleIds:[` /\n`\"ruleIds\":[` repetition finishes quickly\n- [x] Existing demo-coverage tests still match\n`scripts/demo-standalone-findings.mjs` + `fixtures/adapters/cases.json`\n- [x] `vp test run test/unit/rule-inventory-demo.test.ts\ntest/unit/rule-inventory-closeout.test.ts` — 2 files / 15 tests passed\n- [x] Pre-commit `vp run fmt:check` + `vp run lint --deny-warnings`\n- [x] `vp run inventory:check` — up to date (127 rules, 46 showcase, 1\nemit, 80 unit)\n\nOut of scope: HTML UI, in-browser agent, general `--fix`, private MF\nfield scraping, Vite 5→6, version bump / publish.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-657ed630-25ee-429e-8930-31139a9d854f?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-657ed630-25ee-429e-8930-31139a9d854f&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqo7t+CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAo4AQAATtsMagrbBwLLD4YSuVOL4z\ntCGxb197D7J2w7G1unqXHL0R7QHNvpdQql7xbnPgBxF0nCRregokgbuWKBmZTT7N\nbq7G7X35YtV9T7EWCwK/sLqLkdQ6BpZlFzP78KC2Rg8VtagUZKVpQu850v0a8Ivm\n+PbuKIwoZMUmjykeGQV5AeV5KsaqCRTYC5IKmFnkJU6bDc7fOaI73XpEc2HhQ7VJ\na1nitjD6XLnYjQrHn8tJfPIz3LvvH5GaKuZfAjgyH4RWOMaUXEeHKhBp5Yl