92f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/a639995637448d1901fbaa7cb088fdf4dc0492f8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70775490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/381c19e9cb5816316c1816951a40acbf99bc7540/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-11T07:19:25Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-11T07:19:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): override vitest@4 to 4.1.11 (Dependabot #54/#55) (#446)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nForce patched `vitest@4.1.11` and the `@vitest/*` packages that\n`vite-plus@0.2.9` pins via scoped pnpm overrides, to clear Dependabot\nalerts #54/#55\n([GHSA-82fw-gwwq-j7x9](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-82fw-gwwq-j7x9)).\n\nRoot already has `vite-plus@0.3.0` + `vitest@4.1.11` (#444); that tree\nis clean. Alerts stayed open because `examples/compatibility/rolldown`\nstill pins `vite-plus@0.2.9` (and `vite` →\n`@voidzero-dev/vite-plus-core@0.2.9`), which nested `vitest@4.1.10` and\n`@vitest/mocker@4.1.10`. Patched line is `4.1.11` for both.\n\nPreferred path (taken): scoped override, same pattern as nanoid (#367)\nand fast-uri (#441). The rolldown cell keeps `vite-plus@0.2.9`. Did not\nbump that example to 0.3.0 — overrides did not fight peer resolution.\n\n## Changes\n\n- `pnpm-workspace.yaml`: add `\"vitest@4\"` / `\"@vitest/*@4\"` overrides to\n`4.1.11` for the packages `vite-plus@0.2.9` actually pulled at 4.1.10\n(`vitest`, `@vitest/mocker`, plus\nbrowser/expect/pretty-format/runner/snapshot/spy/utils)\n- `pnpm-lock.yaml`: refresh so the rolldown `vite-plus@0.2.9` tree\nresolves those packages to `4.1.11`; no `vitest@4.1.10` or\n`@vitest/mocker@4.1.10` remain\n- `examples/compatibility/rolldown/package.json` unchanged\n(`vite-plus@0.2.9`)\n- No `minimumReleaseAgeExclude` additions — `4.1.11` was already in the\nlockfile from #444\n\n## Scoped override rationale\n\nUsed `\"vitest@4\": 4.1.11` (and matching `@vitest/*@4` selectors) rather\nthan a bare `vitest: 4.1.11` so any future non-4.x consumers are not\nforced onto the 4.x line.\n\nOptional `vite-plus@0.2.9` peers `@vitest/browser-playwright` /\n`@vitest/browser-webdriverio` 4.1.10 are declared but not installed; no\noverride for those.\n\nDrop these overrides when `examples/compatibility/rolldown` pins a\n`vite-plus` that includes vitest `>=4.1.11`.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- No rolldown `vite-plus` 0.2.9→0.3.0 bump (overrides were sufficient;\nnot a toolchain migration)\n- No package version bump, changeset, npm publish, or GitHub Release\n- Vite 5.4.21 compat cells unchanged\n- Dependabot #56 / `adm-zip` (no upstream patch)\n- Issue #29 / PRs #356 / #314\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm install` succeeds without new age-exclude entries\n- [x] Lockfile has no `vitest@4.1.10` / `@vitest/mocker@4.1.10`;\nrolldown `vite-plus@0.2.9` resolves `4.1.11`\n- [x] Pre-commit fmt + lint passed\n- [x] `pnpm run test:unit` — 92 files / 1159 tests passed\n- [x] `pnpm run test:integration` — 4 files / 79 tests passed\n- [x] GitHub Quality + mixed-federation E2E (and remaining PR checks)\npassed on the override commit\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-7e4d6095-20b9-4c50-936a-14763867bd3b?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-7e4d6095-20b9-4c50-936a-14763867bd3b&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"8fae41a72778023ba1d7d10df81492995217c94e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/8fae41a72778023ba1d7d10df81492995217c94e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/381c19e9cb5816316c1816951a40acbf99bc7540","verification":{"payload":"tree 8fae41a72778023ba1d7d10df81492995217c94e\nparent 0058d82ebdcb3ab7fc51f3f353a810d4f82b1508\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1789111165 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789111165 +0000\n\nchore(deps): override vitest@4 to 4.1.11 (Dependabot #54/#55) (#446)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nForce patched `vitest@4.1