undler.name: unknown`.\n- `partial-bundler` on that static check comes from the missing\n`mfdoctor.config` default (`bundler: unknown`), not from emit\n`lifecycle.flavor=rolldown-vite`.\n\n## Scope\n\nOnly `.cursor/skills/verify-mfdoctor/` (`features/plugin-emit.md`,\n`features/check.md`, `evidence/plugin-emit/notes.txt`). No product code,\nno version bump, no publish.\n\n## Coverage\n\n| Feature | Source | Live |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| capabilities | match | `node dist/cli.js capabilities` exit 0 |\n| check | match | disposable showcase `--no-write`;\n`config/remote-http-insecure` + `missing-emit` |\n| workspace | match | conflict exit 1 / clean exit 0 |\n| federation | match | version-conflict exit 1 / unmatched exit 2 |\n| prompt | match | finding / fingerprint / top / unknown |\n| baseline | match | generate / update / prune-missing |\n| runtime | match | mismatch exit 1 / green exit 0 / missing trace exit\n2 |\n| plugin-emit | match + this fix | `@mfdoctor-standalone/vite` build;\ncore emit ruleIds present |\n| rules | match | catalog / one / vite-only / unknown |\n\nChurn since 2026-09-10: none on CLI/plugin source (dep pins only).\nOffline default. `probe` / `compare` not driven.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm install && pnpm build`\n- [x] Doctor `node dist/cli.js capabilities`\n- [x] Live drive of every mapped feature\n- [x] Re-drive plugin-emit optional check **with** `--no-write` and\nconfirm emit `project.json` keeps\n`bundler.lifecycle.flavor=rolldown-vite`\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-2d72e50b-bd8c-4cf8-a7dc-2e4d30726208?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open