a52342a6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-07T07:18:49Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T07:18:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps): override fast-uri@3 to 3.1.6 (Dependabot #49–#52) (#441)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nForce patched `fast-uri@3.1.6` via a scoped pnpm override to clear\nDependabot alerts #49–#52\n([GHSA-jqff-g426-hqxp](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-jqff-g426-hqxp),\n[GHSA-f65p-4m7j-42xc](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-f65p-4m7j-42xc),\n[GHSA-5jgf-p345-68v8](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-5jgf-p345-68v8),\n[GHSA-fph4-wmhf-6fwf](https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-fph4-wmhf-6fwf)).\n\nPatched line is `3.1.6` on the 3.x series (`ajv@8.20.0` depends on\n`fast-uri: ^3.0.1`). Same pattern as the nanoid override (#367).\n\n## Changes\n\n- `pnpm-workspace.yaml`: add `\"fast-uri@3\": 3.1.6` override (exact\nversion); keep existing `react-router: 8.3.0` and `\"nanoid@3\": 3.3.18`\n- `pnpm-workspace.yaml`: drop `fast-uri@3.1.5` from\n`minimumReleaseAgeExclude` — `fast-uri@3.1.6` was published 2026-08-23,\nolder than `minimumReleaseAge: 14400` (10 days)\n- `pnpm-lock.yaml`: refresh so the only 3.x instance (`ajv@8.20.0` →\n`fast-uri`) resolves to `3.1.6`\n\n## Scoped override rationale\n\nLockfile only had `fast-uri@3.1.5` (no 2.x/4.x consumers). Used\n`\"fast-uri@3\": 3.1.6` rather than a bare `fast-uri: 3.1.6` so any future\nnon-3.x consumers are not forced onto the 3.x line.\n\nDid not pin `3.1.7` (published 2026-09-02): still inside the ten-day age\nwindow, and 3.1.6 is the GHSA patched line.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- No package version bump, changeset, or npm publish\n- Vite 5.4.21 compat pins, esbuild, scored-backlog rule work\n- `mfdoctor probe` / network checks\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm install` succeeds without a `fast-uri` age-exclude\n- [x] Lockfile has `fast-uri@3.1.6` only; no `fast-uri < 3.1.6`\n- [x] Pre-commit fmt + lint passed\n- [x] `pnpm run test:unit` — 92 files / 1159 tests passed\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-a51d1ea5-cb23-49bd-a19c-ee80e801d56a?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-a51d1ea5-cb23-49bd-a19c-ee80e801d56a&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"75ca28e0526c8995698f104cb7821ff68407ba8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/75ca28e0526c8995698f104cb7821ff68407ba8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/a9d59705e3d2d5ef3a7eff96b969a819a52342a6","verification":{"payload":"tree 75ca28e0526c8995698f104cb7821ff68407ba8d\nparent d74d26e84fd2b90709de1dd904e311bad2aad8fd\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788765529 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788765529 +0000\n\nchore(deps): override fast-uri@3 to 3.1.6 (Dependabot #49–#52) (#441)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nForce patched `fast-uri@3.1.6` via a scoped pnpm override to clear\nDependabot alerts #49–#52\n([G