,"verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-07T07:12:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commit/d74d26e84fd2b90709de1dd904e311bad2aad8fd","node_id":"C_kwDOTjIi_9oAKGQ3NGQyNmU4NGZkMmI5MDcwOWRlMWRkOTA0ZTMxMWJhZDJhYWQ4ZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commit/2d933fe67cfc2dbf1985a9e245dc2c35b399d9cb","sha":"2d933fe67cfc2dbf1985a9e245dc2c35b399d9cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/2d933fe67cfc2dbf1985a9e245dc2c35b399d9cb"}],"sha":"d74d26e84fd2b90709de1dd904e311bad2aad8fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/d74d26e84fd2b90709de1dd904e311bad2aad8fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70775490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/2d933fe67cfc2dbf1985a9e245dc2c35b399d9cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:09:36Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:09:36Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: keep GitHub Releases draft until npm stage succeeds (#439)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Why\n\nMerging the Changesets version PR currently creates a **published**\nGitHub Release immediately, then dispatches `publish-on-release.yml` via\n`workflow_dispatch`. If Verify fails or Stage never runs, the GitHub\nRelease is still public — the 2.0.0 GitHub-Release-without-npm drift.\n\n## New contract\n\n1. **Version-PR merge** (`create-release.yml`) still creates the\nimmutable plain-semver tag.\n2. The GitHub Release is created as a **draft** (`gh release create …\n--draft`).\n3. `release-files.yml` and `publish-on-release.yml` are still dispatched\non `main` with `tag=$VERSION` (GITHUB_TOKEN cannot rely on `release`\nevents). `release-files.yml` uploads onto the draft through that\ndispatch path.\n4. After the `stage` job successfully runs `npm stage publish`,\n`promote-github-release` publishes the draft (`gh release edit …\n--draft=false`) with `contents: write`.\n5. If Verify fails, Stage is skipped (including first-package\nbootstrap), or Stage fails, the promote job does not run — the Release\nstays draft.\n\n## Double-stage\n\n- Undrafting uses `GITHUB_TOKEN`, which does not recurse into `release:\npublished` workflows (GitHub default).\n- `publish-on-release.yml` still listens to `release: types:\n[published]` for human publishes.\n- `resolve-ref` skips `release` events from `github-actions[bot]` so a\nPAT/token change cannot double-stage. `workflow_dispatch` from\ncreate-release still runs when the actor is the bot.\n- Promote has **no** job-level `if:` so a skipped `stage` cannot\naccidentally publish.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- No version bump, no npm publish from this PR, no rewrite of the\nexisting `2.0.0` tag/release.\n- Post-emit doctor architecture is unchanged (CI/workflow only).\n\n## Tests\n\n`test/unit/release-workflows.test.ts` covers the draft → dispatch →\nstage → undraft contract.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-25d37310-c959-40e2-b8d6-cb33c24cc696?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-25d37310-c959-40e2-b8d6-cb33c24cc696&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"abe0e59c9219f4658aae9ebb1ce0fceaa82509a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/abe0e59c9219f4658aae9ebb1ce0fceaa82509a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/2d933fe67cfc2dbf1985a9e245dc2c35b399d9cb","verification":{"payload":"tree abe0e59c9219f4658aae9ebb1ce0fceaa82509a0\nparent dba10ef5f86c2da2b63a5ca980906627cc612e58\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788732576 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788732576 +0000\n\nfix: keep GitHub Releases draft until npm stage succeeds (#439)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Why\n\nMerging the Changesets version PR currently creates a **published**\nGitHub Release immediately, then dispatches `publish-on-release.yml` via\n`workflow_dispatch`. If Verify fails or Stage never runs, the GitHub\nRelease is still public — the 2.0.0 GitHub-Release-without-npm drift.\n\n## New contract\n\n1. **Version-PR merge** (`create-release.yml`) still creates the\nimmutable plain-semver tag.\n2. The GitHub Release is created as a **draft** (`gh release create …\n--draft`).\n3. `release-files.yml` and `publish-on-release.yml` are still dispatched\non `main` with `tag=$VERSION` (GITHUB_TOKEN cannot rely on `release`\nevents). `release-files.yml` uploads onto the draft through that\ndispatch path.\n4. After the `stage` job successfully runs `npm stage publish`,\n`promote-github-release` publishes the draft (`gh release edit …\n--draft=false`) with `contents: write`.\n5. If Verify fails, Stage is skipped (including first-package\nbootstrap), or Stage fails, the promote job does not run — the Release\nstays draft.\n\n## Double-stage\n\n- Undrafting uses `GITHUB_TOKEN`, which does not recurse into `release:\npublished` workflows (GitHub default).\n- `publish-on-release.yml` still listens to `release: types:\n[published]` for human publishes.\n- `resolve-ref` skips `release` events from `github-actions[bot]` so a\nPAT/token change cannot double-stage. `workflow_dispatch` from\ncreate-release still runs when the actor is the bot.\n- Promote has **no** job-level `if:` so a skipped `stage` cannot\naccidentally publish.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- No version bump, no npm publish from this PR, no rewrite of the\nexisting `2.0.0` tag/release.\n- Post-emit doctor architecture is unchanged (CI/workflow only).\n\n## Tests\n\n`test/unit/release-workflows.test.ts` covers the draft → dispatch →\nstage → undraft contract.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-25d37310-c959-40e2-b8d6-cb33c24cc696?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-25d37310-c959-40e2-b8d6-cb33c24cc696&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqneSgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAnoAQAKtKh+yDLL5R6jctVgEhb356\nENQERUHSxDaJqQ6tWW0/vTs1tx9XNQGKrTaiedVWAv6xTOQNJHtzL0wo7jF801MP\n+H1+OvbnEzP9hnl5VeAykOHZ2WPlxVLEt/rK5p3bx3IWHm1uFZxFHyK43UYRJN9i\nNHwxGwW4BjCXuXw/73eouPLWLU00XczjLq+S