on builds) before\n`test:e2e`. Main''s dedicated e2e workflow passes with the overlaid\nexamples; only the full-check ordering reproduces the stale React\nloadShare runtime failure on tag checkout.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `vp test run test/unit/release-workflows.test.ts`\n- [ ] Merge and re-dispatch `publish-on-release.yml` with `tag=2.0.0`\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"e2ca4f7c8d27bac08ca31a9c85756b39af3d5e67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/e2ca4f7c8d27bac08ca31a9c85756b39af3d5e67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/dba10ef5f86c2da2b63a5ca980906627cc612e58","verification":{"payload":"tree e2ca4f7c8d27bac08ca31a9c85756b39af3d5e67\nparent 6a8e9541d8302f321fc4cb8b0507971d9542422d\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788730428 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788730428 +0000\n\nfix: run pack:check and test:e2e in tagged Verify (#438)\n\n## Summary\n- Replace `vp run check` in publish-on-release Verify with `vp run\npack:check && vp run test:e2e`\n- Keeps the publish gate focused on tarball validation plus runtime\nsmoke, avoiding the integration-test build ordering that breaks\nmixed-federation Playwright on immutable tag `2.0.0` in Linux CI\n\n## Why\nVerify still failed after #437 because full check runs\n`test:integration` (mixed-federation production builds) before\n`test:e2e`. Main''s dedicated e2e workflow passes with the overlaid\nexamples; only the full-check ordering reproduces the stale React\nloadShare runtime failure on tag checkout.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `vp test run test/unit/release-workflows.test.ts`\n- [ ] Merge and re-dispatch `publish-on-release.yml` with `tag=2.0.0`\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqndw8CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzKw