adShare harness files and\nwipe stale example `dist`/`.mf`/Vite cache before `vp run check`\n- Clean mixed-federation example builds inside giga-smoke so earlier\ncheck steps cannot leave stale bundles for runtime smoke\n\n## Why\nVerify for `@tonoizer/mfdoctor@2.0.0` still failed green-path Playwright\nafter #436 because the tag checkout kept the old giga-smoke script and\nstale federation dist from earlier check builds. Node 22 logs showed the\nknown React 19 `.S` runtime failure.\n\n## Test plan\n- [x] `vp test run test/unit/release-workflows.test.ts`\n- [ ] Merge, dispatch `publish-on-release.yml` with `tag=2.0.0`, confirm\nVerify is green and stage succeeds\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"246ac5fc0cb506473cf3f49519ec6638d4474769","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/246ac5fc0cb506473cf3f49519ec6638d4474769"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/6a8e9541d8302f321fc4cb8b0507971d9542422d","verification":{"payload":"tree 246ac5fc0cb506473cf3f49519ec6638d4474769\nparent ac65745498421568ada821facda2ce431b322ca4\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788729668 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788729668 +0000\n\nfix: refresh giga-smoke overlay for tagged 2.0.0 Verify (#437)\n\n## Summary\n- Overlay `scripts/giga-smoke.mjs` from main during publish-on-release\nVerify so immutable tag `2.0.0` picks up the federation dist/cache\ncleanup before Playwright\n- Assert overlaid mixed-federation React loadShare harness files and\nwipe stale example `dist`/`.mf`/Vite cache before `vp run check`\n- Clean mixed-federation example builds inside giga-smoke so earlier\ncheck steps cannot leave stale bundles for runtime smoke\n\n## Why\nVerify for `@tonoizer/mfdoctor@2.0.0` still failed green-path Playwright\nafter #436 because the tag checkout kept the old giga-smoke script and\nstale federation dist from 