:46Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:51:46Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: overlay federation examples onto tagged Verify for 2.0.0 (#436)\n\n## Why\n\n`publish-on-release` Verify for tag `2.0.0` fails because the immutable\ntag does not include the mixed-federation Playwright fixes from #434.\nThe tag cannot be moved (protected release tags).\n\n## Fix\n\nOverlay `scripts/pack-check.mjs`, `test/e2e/mixed-federation.spec.ts`,\nand the affected example trees from `main` onto the tagged checkout\nduring Verify — same pattern as the existing pack harness overlay.\n\n## After merge\n\nRun `Stage npm package on release` with tag `2.0.0` to publish\n`@tonoizer/mfdoctor@2.0.0`.\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc7056acf8792d3fe9c614e8ae495024a394158f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/bc7056acf8792d3fe9c614e8ae495024a394158f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/ac65745498421568ada821facda2ce431b322ca4","verification":{"payload":"tree bc7056acf8792d3fe9c614e8ae495024a394158f\nparent 8e5258134692549e12365ca1b65fe4b2ec8a092b\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788727906 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788727906 -0700\n\nfix: overlay federation examples onto tagged Verify for 2.0.0 (#436)\n\n## Why\n\n`publish-on-release` Verify for tag `2.0.0` fails because the immutable\ntag does not include the mixed-federation Playwright fixes from #434.\nThe tag cannot be moved (protected release tags).\n\n## Fix\n\nOverlay `scripts/pack-check.mjs`, `test/e2e/mixed-federation.spec.ts`,\nand the affected example trees from `main` onto the tagged checkout\nduring Verify — same pattern as the existing pack harness overlay.\n\n## After merge\n\nRun `Stage npm package on release` with tag `2.0.0` to publish\n`@tonoizer/mfdoctor@2.0.0`.\n\n\nMade with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqndJiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA0GkQADL798Dd0XHzA4JMeql6CoFd\nLHpxOrYN5nJusrSjTJmqK08K8dDFZqaEUdzG1n939Fgo3url8SzJUC0miOWwgqw1\nqWIlxvN9mEDzqAtFPoj6jwvcFaYkq+e5q5Gx7RM/E8gY/MMy+T9YhkRCmWfcytkK\n0USLMF6+4A8hoN3QQfe7I2WfYOx84Ufj3++fxRzPrbihouzJoRcnav5jK/V8aeiF\n2+QEq4gNKEu6yo/FGIY6iS6yHy4MJeS7yjMWH9lAIPX7aWoDfrw5utGW9lat6HRt\nZJAsx+zizZakvdzebbK35ZgIUb/Rzo2v7LcdwaabyKMi0kJ9i++/y2+lnDlICgim\nfNW/wzzjEj3hFR1cljIl0dHwfN4bTRUDKOrsFVr19uxw3OaYVcUa7VvxSkyArV3M\ny6ITmf3/zCQO/StL7oSuauCwYogBF8N41dXHTnkUOSNk7oT1yuRFtIslYQ3In26n\nzk98zT7P4tDm2gulmlaGFULCuHACWPdu1fY/y8Hkjdhf0CbUoCUyr0Bx+0c6ss/t\n2JnCUwat6E8ep6qj7fNQw56IO6H3mr7VujynCOaC6t6ZRmlxqXbUnp7tpVsogawb\nhVcUuziHFkUCc+XTu7As7VLHnDV4qTw+kDvcriA07PBZS+isgz/WN4txKZcdsPUH\njR+juGaPHj7olAM6o4Nv\n=FAID\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-06T20:51:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commit/ac65745498421568ada821facda2ce431b322ca4","node_id":"C_kwDOTjIi_9oAKGFjNjU3NDU0OTg0MjE1NjhhZGE4MjFmYWNkYTJjZTQzMWIzMjJjYTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commit/8e5258134692549e12365ca1b65fe4b2ec8a092b","sha":"8e5258134692549e12365ca1b65fe4b2ec8a092b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/8e5258134692549e12365ca1b65fe4b2ec8a092b"}],"sha":"ac65745498421568ada821facda2ce431b322ca4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/ac65745498421568ada821facda2ce431b322ca4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70775490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/8e5258134692549e12365ca1b65fe4b2ec8a092b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:34:02Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T20:34:02Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: mixed-federation Playwright smoke under publish-on-release Verify (#434)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Why\n\n`publish-on-release` Verify for tag `2.0.0` failed on Node 22/24/26\nduring mixed-federation Playwright smoke ([run\n34056402589](https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/actions/runs/34056402589)):\n\n1. `rspack remote (http://127.0.0.1:3001/remoteEntry.js) did not render`\n2. `the intentional React shared-version mismatch did not surface at\nruntime` — received `pageerror: Cannot read properties of undefined\n(reading ''S'')`\n\nUnit tests and adapter integration already passed. Isolated `vp run\ntest:e2e` on the same SHA was green; `vp run check` (the Verify path)\nwas not.\n\n## Cause\n\nNot the release pack harness overlay, and not a new rspack listen\nfailure — preview servers came up on 3001/3002/5173. The `ParseError:\nUnexpected keyword ''this''.` line is an unrelated CLI unit-test fixture\n(`mfdoctor.config.ts` containing `this`).\n\n`#433` stopped Rolldown `MISSING_EXPORT` for `import { Suspense, lazy }\nfrom \"react\"` by reading those members from the CJS default.\n`@module-federation/vite` still emits a virtual loadShare module whose\ndefault can be `{ default: React }` rather than React itself.\nDestructuring then leaves `Suspense`/`lazy` undefined, and the automatic\n`react/jsx-runtime` (not covered by the existing `react-dom/` prefix\nshare) hits React 19 internals (minified `.S`). After earlier `vp run\ncheck` example builds, that wrapper shape shows up at runtime even\nthough a clean isolated e2e build can look fine.\n\n## Fix\n\n- Unwrap CJS loadShare defaults until `Suspense` / `useState` exist.\n- Share `react/` (jsx-runtime) the same way these examples already share\n`react-dom/`.\n- Treat production React 19’s `reading ''S''` as the same intentional\nmismatch signal as `ReactCurrentDispatcher`.\n\nNo version bump, no tag rewrite, no npm publish, no suppressions, no new\nadapters.\n\n## Proof (local)\n\n- `vp run --filter @mfdoctor-example/host-vite build` — success; host\ndist now emits `loadShare__react_mf_1_jsx_mf_2_runtime`\n- `vp test run test/integration/adapters.test.ts` — 15/15 (includes\nmixed-federation production build)\n- `vp run --filter . test:e2e` after that integration run — 16/16\nPlaywright, including both previously failing mixed-federation smokes;\n`FULL_E2E_GATE_OK`\n- Host/issues/nested host `tsc` — success\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-997895a3-68f2-4156-8983-56f4cf7a895e?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-997895a3-68f2-4156-8983-56f4cf7a895e&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"e3a311497d90bfa86696d76cde162f7a2521cff2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/e3a311497d90bfa86696d76cde162f7a2521cff2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/8e5258134692549e12365ca1b65fe4b2ec8a092b","verification":{"payload":"tree e3a311497d90bfa86696d76cde162f7a2521cff2\nparent 92cf7d174c3bf6320f3eac286ba09063602eb740\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788726842 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788726842 +0200\n\nfix: mixed-federation Playwright smoke under publish-on-release Verify (#434)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Why\n\n`publish-on-release` Verify for tag `2.0.0` failed on Node 22/24/26\nduring mixed-federation Playwright smoke ([run\n34056402589](https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/actions/runs/34056402589)):\n\n1. `rspack remote (http://127.0.0.1:3001/remoteEntry.js) did not render`\n2. `the intentional React shared-version mismatch did not surface at\nruntime` — received `pageerror: Cannot read properties of undefined\n(reading ''S'')`\n\nUnit tests and adapter integration already passed. Isolated `vp run\ntest:e2e` on the same SHA was green; `vp run check` (the Verify path)\nwas not.\n\n## Cause\n\nNot the release pack harness overlay, and not a new rspack listen\nfailure — preview servers came up on 3001/3002/5173. The `ParseError:\nUnexpected keyword ''this''.` line is an unrelated CLI unit-test fixture\n(`mfdoctor.config.ts` containing `this`).\n\n`#433` stopped Rolldown `MISSING_EXPORT` for `import { Suspense, lazy }\nfrom \"react\"` by reading those members from the CJS default.\n`@module-federation/vite` still emits a virtual loadShare module whose\ndefault can be `{ default: React }` rather than React itself.\nDestructuring then leaves `Suspense`/`lazy` undefined, and the automatic\n`react/jsx-runtime` (not covered by the existing `react-dom/` prefix\nshare) hits React 19 internals (minified `.S`). After earlier `vp run\ncheck` example builds, that wrapper shape shows up at runtime even\nthough a clean isolated e2e build can look fine.\n\n## Fix\n\n- Unwrap CJS loadShare defaults until `Suspense` / `useState` exist.\n- Share `react/` (jsx-runtime) the same way these examples already share\n`react-dom/`.\n- Treat production React 19’s `reading ''S''` as the same intentional\nmismatch signal as `ReactCurrentDispatcher`.\n\nNo version bump, no tag rewrite, no npm publish, no suppressions, no new\nadapters.\n\n## Proof (local)\n\n- `vp run --filter @mfdoctor-example/host-vite build` — success; host\ndist now emits `loadShare__react_mf_1_jsx_mf_2_runtime`\n- `vp test run test/integration/adapters.test.ts` — 15/15 (includes\nmixed-federation production build)\n- `vp run --filter . test:e2e` after that integration run — 16/16\nPlaywright, including both previously failing mixed-federation smokes;\n`FULL_E2E_GATE_OK`\n- Host/issues/nested host `tsc` — success\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-997895a3-68f2-4156-8983-56f4cf7a895e?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-997895a3-68f2-4156-8983-56f4cf7a895e&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnc46CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJMEQAA+M95yQRWVx50nuk0N0NveY\ngemIVKpWrfssC25iOxyqZMdW6OHLr7aH8Xj8V0JCiFyrxwx/fb004Hl7sc84qWI0\nzll/NgMQiGlfLlBRU+DcIqCJqq+z9iujfi89Zj+cxGNfMVFo0u1dcI7Kjvvs+C5X\n7YtTBc0jn7WXqRJANa528J3Ktka0Q7gPQrGL8SveALOfzgo8r33BbrCqnnVWPoD7\nu59TkmAEQjjjSgd+T2t9Zi5FChhIb62LjM+bKM6f5oaNMR