ype":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commit/92cf7d174c3bf6320f3eac286ba09063602eb740","node_id":"C_kwDOTjIi_9oAKDkyY2Y3ZDE3NGMzYmY2MzIwZjNlYWMyODZiYTA5MDYzNjAyZWI3NDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commit/0951e8de74847c491e038f019982b70b3355554c","sha":"0951e8de74847c491e038f019982b70b3355554c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/0951e8de74847c491e038f019982b70b3355554c"}],"sha":"92cf7d174c3bf6320f3eac286ba09063602eb740","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/92cf7d174c3bf6320f3eac286ba09063602eb740"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","id":49699333,"login":"dependabot[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/0951e8de74847c491e038f019982b70b3355554c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T19:48:20Z","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"dependabot[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T19:48:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore(deps-dev): bump @changesets/cli from 2.31.1 to 3.0.1 (#369)\n\nBumps\n[@changesets/cli](https://github.com/changesets/changesets/tree/HEAD/packages/cli)\nfrom 2.31.1 to 3.0.1.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/releases\">@​changesets/cli''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><code>@​changesets/cli</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/3\"><code>@​3</code></a>.0.1</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2239\">#2239</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/fdfdc93efeff2034a6211db13a69b3487d00a3dd\"><code>fdfdc93</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nUpdate links in default generated <code>.changeset/README.md</code>\nfile</li>\n<li>Updated dependencies [<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/d0386b69c8a8bd14a702e7636ab01c1e83b1914e\"><code>d0386b6</code></a>]:\n<ul>\n<li><code>@​changesets/write</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/1\"><code>@​1</code></a>.0.1</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><code>@​changesets/cli</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/3\"><code>@​3</code></a>.0.0</h2>\n<h3>Major Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2128\">#2128</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/7113c014330b3f972e54ece8e67731613193958f\"><code>7113c01</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! -\nRenamed the <code>changeset tag</code> command to <code>changeset\ngit-tag</code>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2074\">#2074</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/3599e47217d2ed2dd60da628fe4d1d3fc4b849c7\"><code>3599e47</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nSet supported package manager versions in\n<code>&quot;engines&quot;</code> field, including npm &gt;=10.9.0, pnpm\n&gt;=10.0.0, and yarn &gt;=4.5.2.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1860\">#1860</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/92b1c1b6b1733b1f1799a73828d378646b068798\"><code>92b1c1b</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/mixelburg\"><code>@​mixelburg</code></a>! -\n<code>changeset version</code> now exits with code 1 when there are no\nunreleased changesets, instead of silently exiting with code 0.</p>\n<p>This makes it easier to detect when a version step is a no-op — for\nexample, to prevent accidentally publishing packages with incorrect\nversion tags when using <code>--snapshot</code> mode.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1482\">#1482</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/df424a4a09eea15b0fa9159ee0b98af0d95f58a7\"><code>df424a4</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! - Bumped\nsupported Node versions to <code>^22.11 || ^24 || &gt;=26</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1994\">#1994</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/062530b825d53abc9d8934f3a50cc61ff3ff82b8\"><code>062530b</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nThe <code>prettier</code> option in <code>.changeset/config.json</code>\nhas been removed in favor of <code>format</code>. <code>format</code>\nsupports <code>&quot;auto&quot;</code>,\n<code>&quot;prettier&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;oxfmt&quot;</code>,\n<code>&quot;deno&quot;</code>, and <code>&quot;dprint&quot;</code>, and\n<code>false</code> disables formatting. If you previously used\n<code>prettier: false</code>, migrate to <code>format: false</code> or\nremove the option to use automatic formatter detection.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2190\">#2190</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/96b65eec4af2c58301a11cd7dff42a6bde9c9f8a\"><code>96b65ee</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nMove versioned prerelease changesets to <code>.changeset/pre/</code>\nfolder instead of accumulating in the root and tracking the versioned\nchangeset ids in the <code>.changeset/pre.json</code> file. Existing\n<code>pre.json</code> will auto-migrate to this new structure on the\nnext run of <code>changeset version</code> or when calling\n<code>changeset status</code>.</p>\n<p>This change allows easier management of versioned prerelease\nchangesets (for the final stable release) and current queued changesets\n(for the next prerelease). Changesets in <code>.changeset/pre/</code>\ncan be edited or deleted depending if it''s still relevant for the final\nstable release of a package. There''s no need to synchronize the\nchangeset ids in <code>pre.json</code> if certain changesets are\ndeleted.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2145\">#2145</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/f5887ff54a6b78eae87ae85fdac3294c4464da78\"><code>f5887ff</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! -\nRemoved Yarn Classic support</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2097\">#2097</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/8c88f6a3362628ca580835a1a1f2310056ee5743\"><code>8c88f6a</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! -\nPackages with only prerelease versions published will now be published\nwith the prerelease tag in the prerelease mode <em>if</em> the target\nregistry doesn''t auto-assign <code>latest</code> tag. npm registry\nitself does that and such packages will continue to be released with\n<code>latest</code> tag (and not with the configured prerelease\ntag).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1879\">#1879</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/c76b232abc76f73592a21f0d5df9cc89406a31dc\"><code>c76b232</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/beeequeue\"><code>@​beeequeue</code></a>! -\nRemoved warning messages about using v1 configs. They will now be\nsilently ignored.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1655\">#1655</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/db46911e57603f20a158a47bbbebd112272c84e2\"><code>db46911</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nUpdate <code>@manypkg/get-packages</code> which drops support for\ndetecting packages in Bolt monorepos and adds support for npm\nmonorepos</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1651\">#1651</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/e1df8625800a1b3c4f66474a0e3c01b08214465c\"><code>e1df862</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nRemove support for the <code>--sinceMaster</code> flag for\n<code>changeset status</code>. Use <code>--since=master</code> or\n<code>--since=main</code> instead.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2117\">#2117</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/813bbf314d051bfee3b46a793f94b396ef2a4df1\"><code>813bbf3</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nRemove the <code>pre.json</code> <code>initialVersions</code> property\nand handling as it''s unused internally</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1961\">#1961</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/07278a726343388eb6dfc56e7a8213872d4c8857\"><code>07278a7</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/beeequeue\"><code>@​beeequeue</code></a>! -\n<code>CommitFunctions</code> can now be both sync and async, and the\n<code>defaultCommitFunctions</code> are now sync.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1482\">#1482</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/df424a4a09eea15b0fa9159ee0b98af0d95f58a7\"><code>df424a4</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! - From\nnow on this package is going to be published as ES module.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1652\">#1652</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/a0b5326570e8e7bf5e35c1cefe8f70d9a51a5cd7\"><code>a0b5326</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nRemove support for the deprecated\n<code>___experimentalUnsafeOptions_WILL_CHANGE_IN_PATCH.useCalculatedVersionForSnapshots</code>\nconfig. The <code>snapshot.useCalculatedVersion</code> config should be\nused instead.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2186\">#2186</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/3910adf3ebaef14196093715228885c4819d0cbf\"><code>3910adf</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! -\nPrivate packages are no longer versioned by default. Set\n<code>privatePackages</code> to <code>true</code> to opt into versioning\nand tagging them, or set <code>privatePackages.version</code> to\n<code>true</code> to version them without tagging.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1879\">#1879</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/c76b232abc76f73592a21f0d5df9cc89406a31dc\"><code>c76b232</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/beeequeue\"><code>@​beeequeue</code></a>! -\nMigrated from <code>enquirer</code> +\n<code>@inquirer/launch-editor</code> to <code>@clack/prompts</code> +\n<code>launch-editor</code>.</p>\n<p>This means the CLI flows will have minor changes, but they are\nlargely the same.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/blob/main/packages/cli/CHANGELOG.md\">@​changesets/cli''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>3.0.1</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2239\">#2239</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/fdfdc93efeff2034a6211db13a69b3487d00a3dd\"><code>fdfdc93</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nUpdate links in default generated <code>.changeset/README.md</code>\nfile</li>\n<li>Updated dependencies [<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/d0386b69c8a8bd14a702e7636ab01c1e83b1914e\"><code>d0386b6</code></a>]:\n<ul>\n<li><code>@​changesets/write</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/1\"><code>@​1</code></a>.0.1</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>3.0.0</h2>\n<h3>Major Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2128\">#2128</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/7113c014330b3f972e54ece8e67731613193958f\"><code>7113c01</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! -\nRenamed the <code>changeset tag</code> command to <code>changeset\ngit-tag</code>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2074\">#2074</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/3599e47217d2ed2dd60da628fe4d1d3fc4b849c7\"><code>3599e47</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nSet supported package manager versions in\n<code>&quot;engines&quot;</code> field, including npm &gt;=10.9.0, pnpm\n&gt;=10.0.0, and yarn &gt;=4.5.2.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1860\">#1860</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/92b1c1b6b1733b1f1799a73828d378646b068798\"><code>92b1c1b</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/mixelburg\"><code>@​mixelburg</code></a>! -\n<code>changeset version</code> now exits with code 1 when there are no\nunreleased changesets, instead of silently exiting with code 0.</p>\n<p>This makes it easier to detect when a version step is a no-op — for\nexample, to prevent accidentally publishing packages with incorrect\nversion tags when using <code>--snapshot</code> mode.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1482\">#1482</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/df424a4a09eea15b0fa9159ee0b98af0d95f58a7\"><code>df424a4</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! - Bumped\nsupported Node versions to <code>^22.11 || ^24 || &gt;=26</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1994\">#1994</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/062530b825d53abc9d8934f3a50cc61ff3ff82b8\"><code>062530b</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nThe <code>prettier</code> option in <code>.changeset/config.json</code>\nhas been removed in favor of <code>format</code>. <code>format</code>\nsupports <code>&quot;auto&quot;</code>,\n<code>&quot;prettier&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;oxfmt&quot;</code>,\n<code>&quot;deno&quot;</code>, and <code>&quot;dprint&quot;</code>, and\n<code>false</code> disables formatting. If you previously used\n<code>prettier: false</code>, migrate to <code>format: false</code> or\nremove the option to use automatic formatter detection.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2190\">#2190</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/96b65eec4af2c58301a11cd7dff42a6bde9c9f8a\"><code>96b65ee</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nMove versioned prerelease changesets to <code>.changeset/pre/</code>\nfolder instead of accumulating in the root and tracking the versioned\nchangeset ids in the <code>.changeset/pre.json</code> file. Existing\n<code>pre.json</code> will auto-migrate to this new structure on the\nnext run of <code>changeset version</code> or when calling\n<code>changeset status</code>.</p>\n<p>This change allows easier management of versioned prerelease\nchangesets (for the final stable release) and current queued changesets\n(for the next prerelease). Changesets in <code>.changeset/pre/</code>\ncan be edited or deleted depending if it''s still relevant for the final\nstable release of a package. There''s no need to synchronize the\nchangeset ids in <code>pre.json</code> if certain changesets are\ndeleted.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2145\">#2145</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/f5887ff54a6b78eae87ae85fdac3294c4464da78\"><code>f5887ff</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! -\nRemoved Yarn Classic support</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2097\">#2097</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/8c88f6a3362628ca580835a1a1f2310056ee5743\"><code>8c88f6a</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! -\nPackages with only prerelease versions published will now be published\nwith the prerelease tag in the prerelease mode <em>if</em> the target\nregistry doesn''t auto-assign <code>latest</code> tag. npm registry\nitself does that and such packages will continue to be released with\n<code>latest</code> tag (and not with the configured prerelease\ntag).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1879\">#1879</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/c76b232abc76f73592a21f0d5df9cc89406a31dc\"><code>c76b232</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/beeequeue\"><code>@​beeequeue</code></a>! -\nRemoved warning messages about using v1 configs. They will now be\nsilently ignored.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1655\">#1655</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/db46911e57603f20a158a47bbbebd112272c84e2\"><code>db46911</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nUpdate <code>@manypkg/get-packages</code> which drops support for\ndetecting packages in Bolt monorepos and adds support for npm\nmonorepos</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1651\">#1651</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/e1df8625800a1b3c4f66474a0e3c01b08214465c\"><code>e1df862</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nRemove support for the <code>--sinceMaster</code> flag for\n<code>changeset status</code>. Use <code>--since=master</code> or\n<code>--since=main</code> instead.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2117\">#2117</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/813bbf314d051bfee3b46a793f94b396ef2a4df1\"><code>813bbf3</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nRemove the <code>pre.json</code> <code>initialVersions</code> property\nand handling as it''s unused internally</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1961\">#1961</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/07278a726343388eb6dfc56e7a8213872d4c8857\"><code>07278a7</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/beeequeue\"><code>@​beeequeue</code></a>! -\n<code>CommitFunctions</code> can now be both sync and async, and the\n<code>defaultCommitFunctions</code> are now sync.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1482\">#1482</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/df424a4a09eea15b0fa9159ee0b98af0d95f58a7\"><code>df424a4</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! - From\nnow on this package is going to be published as ES module.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1652\">#1652</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/a0b5326570e8e7bf5e35c1cefe8f70d9a51a5cd7\"><code>a0b5326</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nRemove support for the deprecated\n<code>___experimentalUnsafeOptions_WILL_CHANGE_IN_PATCH.useCalculatedVersionForSnapshots</code>\nconfig. The <code>snapshot.useCalculatedVersion</code> config should be\nused instead.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2186\">#2186</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/3910adf3ebaef14196093715228885c4819d0cbf\"><code>3910adf</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! -\nPrivate packages are no longer versioned by default. Set\n<code>privatePackages</code> to <code>true</code> to opt into versioning\nand tagging them, or set <code>privatePackages.version</code> to\n<code>true</code> to version them without tagging.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1879\">#1879</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/c76b232abc76f73592a21f0d5df9cc89406a31dc\"><code>c76b232</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/beeequeue\"><code>@​beeequeue</code></a>! -\nMigrated from <code>enquirer</code> +\n<code>@inquirer/launch-editor</code> to <code>@clack/prompts</code> +\n<code>launch-editor</code>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/bed458124f623463c581521ab56d040eba2a8b20\"><code>bed4581</code></a>\nVersion Packages (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/tree/HEAD/packages/cli/issues/2242\">#2242</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/fdfdc93efeff2034a6211db13a69b3487d00a3dd\"><code>fdfdc93</code></a>\nUpdate default generated readme (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/tree/HEAD/packages/cli/issues/2239\">#2239</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/d5f5ae83b8541aecff1ee2c446543e19434158a4\"><code>d5f5ae8</code></a>\nFix Windows PTY snapshot normalization (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/tree/HEAD/packages/cli/issues/2233\">#2233</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/f44222190fbe8adcea27582f6a35a0f095a34532\"><code>f442221</code></a>\nVersion Packages (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/tree/HEAD/packages/cli/issues/2235\">#2235</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/e3facadb06212677ffcf30b90e95536ca7a34468\"><code>e3facad</code></a>\nVersion Packages (next) (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/tree/HEAD/packages/cli/issues/2228\">#2228</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/c98af4c33d8ee307c6229023ea6907fb0df4bf26\"><code>c98af4c</code></a>\nDo not bump ignored independent packages when exiting pre mode (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/tree/HEAD/packages/cli/issues/2092\">#2092</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/496ca21c53ac58b0d0e160a3af1fecfe39322564\"><code>496ca21</code></a>\nBuild(deps-dev): Bump the development-dependencies group with 6 updates\n(<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/tree/HEAD/packages/cli/issues/2225\">#2225</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/d1053acaab60d7bba903cf0f25da9d94ada43d0d\"><code>d1053ac</code></a>\nBuild(deps): Bump the production-dependencies group across 1 directory\nwith 2...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/68ea6ecc70f48dc4f5f0dbec7fd92ce30d8d2527\"><code>68ea6ec</code></a>\nFix linked and fixed glob patterns expansion (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/tree/HEAD/packages/cli/issues/2222\">#2222</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/c1b6f8ca6e63190530117b957c160b647c1b1c59\"><code>c1b6f8c</code></a>\nfix missing coloring of name (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/tree/HEAD/packages/cli/issues/2218\">#2218</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commits/@changesets/cli@3.0.1/packages/cli\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e24ce1136229017ee83ec7b636c52e4c8da9768c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/e24ce1136229017ee83ec7b636c52e4c8da9768c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/0951e8de74847c491e038f019982b70b3355554c","verification":{"payload":"tree e24ce1136229017ee83ec7b636c52e4c8da9768c\nparent 9e0f7a499e7a316c4f89d275a3ea238b30a3bd77\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1788724100 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788724100 +0000\n\nchore(deps-dev): bump @changesets/cli from 2.31.1 to 3.0.1 (#369)\n\nBumps\n[@changesets/cli](https://github.com/changesets/changesets/tree/HEAD/packages/cli)\nfrom 2.31.1 to 3.0.1.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/releases\">@​changesets/cli''s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><code>@​changesets/cli</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/3\"><code>@​3</code></a>.0.1</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2239\">#2239</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/fdfdc93efeff2034a6211db13a69b3487d00a3dd\"><code>fdfdc93</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nUpdate links in default generated <code>.changeset/README.md</code>\nfile</li>\n<li>Updated dependencies [<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/d0386b69c8a8bd14a702e7636ab01c1e83b1914e\"><code>d0386b6</code></a>]:\n<ul>\n<li><code>@​changesets/write</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/1\"><code>@​1</code></a>.0.1</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><code>@​changesets/cli</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/3\"><code>@​3</code></a>.0.0</h2>\n<h3>Major Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2128\">#2128</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/7113c014330b3f972e54ece8e67731613193958f\"><code>7113c01</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! -\nRenamed the <code>changeset tag</code> command to <code>changeset\ngit-tag</code>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2074\">#2074</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/3599e47217d2ed2dd60da628fe4d1d3fc4b849c7\"><code>3599e47</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nSet supported package manager versions in\n<code>&quot;engines&quot;</code> field, including npm &gt;=10.9.0, pnpm\n&gt;=10.0.0, and yarn &gt;=4.5.2.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1860\">#1860</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/92b1c1b6b1733b1f1799a73828d378646b068798\"><code>92b1c1b</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/mixelburg\"><code>@​mixelburg</code></a>! -\n<code>changeset version</code> now exits with code 1 when there are no\nunreleased changesets, instead of silently exiting with code 0.</p>\n<p>This makes it easier to detect when a version step is a no-op — for\nexample, to prevent accidentally publishing packages with incorrect\nversion tags when using <code>--snapshot</code> mode.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1482\">#1482</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/df424a4a09eea15b0fa9159ee0b98af0d95f58a7\"><code>df424a4</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! - Bumped\nsupported Node versions to <code>^22.11 || ^24 || &gt;=26</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1994\">#1994</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/062530b825d53abc9d8934f3a50cc61ff3ff82b8\"><code>062530b</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nThe <code>prettier</code> option in <code>.changeset/config.json</code>\nhas been removed in favor of <code>format</code>. <code>format</code>\nsupports <code>&quot;auto&quot;</code>,\n<code>&quot;prettier&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;oxfmt&quot;</code>,\n<code>&quot;deno&quot;</code>, and <code>&quot;dprint&quot;</code>, and\n<code>false</code> disables formatting. If you previously used\n<code>prettier: false</code>, migrate to <code>format: false</code> or\nremove the option to use automatic formatter detection.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2190\">#2190</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/96b65eec4af2c58301a11cd7dff42a6bde9c9f8a\"><code>96b65ee</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nMove versioned prerelease changesets to <code>.changeset/pre/</code>\nfolder instead of accumulating in the root and tracking the versioned\nchangeset ids in the <code>.changeset/pre.json</code> file. Existing\n<code>pre.json</code> will auto-migrate to this new structure on the\nnext run of <code>changeset version</code> or when calling\n<code>changeset status</code>.</p>\n<p>This change allows easier management of versioned prerelease\nchangesets (for the final stable release) and current queued changesets\n(for the next prerelease). Changesets in <code>.changeset/pre/</code>\ncan be edited or deleted depending if it''s still relevant for the final\nstable release of a package. There''s no need to synchronize the\nchangeset ids in <code>pre.json</code> if certain changesets are\ndeleted.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2145\">#2145</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/f5887ff54a6b78eae87ae85fdac3294c4464da78\"><code>f5887ff</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! -\nRemoved Yarn Classic support</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2097\">#2097</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/8c88f6a3362628ca580835a1a1f2310056ee5743\"><code>8c88f6a</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! -\nPackages with only prerelease versions published will now be published\nwith the prerelease tag in the prerelease mode <em>if</em> the target\nregistry doesn''t auto-assign <code>latest</code> tag. npm registry\nitself does that and such packages will continue to be released with\n<code>latest</code> tag (and not with the configured prerelease\ntag).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1879\">#1879</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/c76b232abc76f73592a21f0d5df9cc89406a31dc\"><code>c76b232</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/beeequeue\"><code>@​beeequeue</code></a>! -\nRemoved warning messages about using v1 configs. They will now be\nsilently ignored.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1655\">#1655</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/db46911e57603f20a158a47bbbebd112272c84e2\"><code>db46911</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nUpdate <code>@manypkg/get-packages</code> which drops support for\ndetecting packages in Bolt monorepos and adds support for npm\nmonorepos</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1651\">#1651</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/e1df8625800a1b3c4f66474a0e3c01b08214465c\"><code>e1df862</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nRemove support for the <code>--sinceMaster</code> flag for\n<code>changeset status</code>. Use <code>--since=master</code> or\n<code>--since=main</code> instead.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2117\">#2117</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/813bbf314d051bfee3b46a793f94b396ef2a4df1\"><code>813bbf3</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nRemove the <code>pre.json</code> <code>initialVersions</code> property\nand handling as it''s unused internally</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1961\">#1961</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/07278a726343388eb6dfc56e7a8213872d4c8857\"><code>07278a7</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/beeequeue\"><code>@​beeequeue</code></a>! -\n<code>CommitFunctions</code> can now be both sync and async, and the\n<code>defaultCommitFunctions</code> are now sync.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1482\">#1482</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/df424a4a09eea15b0fa9159ee0b98af0d95f58a7\"><code>df424a4</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! - From\nnow on this package is going to be published as ES module.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1652\">#1652</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/a0b5326570e8e7bf5e35c1cefe8f70d9a51a5cd7\"><code>a0b5326</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nRemove support for the deprecated\n<code>___experimentalUnsafeOptions_WILL_CHANGE_IN_PATCH.useCalculatedVersionForSnapshots</code>\nconfig. The <code>snapshot.useCalculatedVersion</code> config should be\nused instead.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2186\">#2186</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/3910adf3ebaef14196093715228885c4819d0cbf\"><code>3910adf</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! -\nPrivate packages are no longer versioned by default. Set\n<code>privatePackages</code> to <code>true</code> to opt into versioning\nand tagging them, or set <code>privatePackages.version</code> to\n<code>true</code> to version them without tagging.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1879\">#1879</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/c76b232abc76f73592a21f0d5df9cc89406a31dc\"><code>c76b232</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/beeequeue\"><code>@​beeequeue</code></a>! -\nMigrated from <code>enquirer</code> +\n<code>@inquirer/launch-editor</code> to <code>@clack/prompts</code> +\n<code>launch-editor</code>.</p>\n<p>This means the CLI flows will have minor changes, but they are\nlargely the same.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/blob/main/packages/cli/CHANGELOG.md\">@​changesets/cli''s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>3.0.1</h2>\n<h3>Patch Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2239\">#2239</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/fdfdc93efeff2034a6211db13a69b3487d00a3dd\"><code>fdfdc93</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nUpdate links in default generated <code>.changeset/README.md</code>\nfile</li>\n<li>Updated dependencies [<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/d0386b69c8a8bd14a702e7636ab01c1e83b1914e\"><code>d0386b6</code></a>]:\n<ul>\n<li><code>@​changesets/write</code><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/1\"><code>@​1</code></a>.0.1</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>3.0.0</h2>\n<h3>Major Changes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2128\">#2128</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/7113c014330b3f972e54ece8e67731613193958f\"><code>7113c01</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! -\nRenamed the <code>changeset tag</code> command to <code>changeset\ngit-tag</code>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2074\">#2074</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/3599e47217d2ed2dd60da628fe4d1d3fc4b849c7\"><code>3599e47</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nSet supported package manager versions in\n<code>&quot;engines&quot;</code> field, including npm &gt;=10.9.0, pnpm\n&gt;=10.0.0, and yarn &gt;=4.5.2.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1860\">#1860</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/92b1c1b6b1733b1f1799a73828d378646b068798\"><code>92b1c1b</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/mixelburg\"><code>@​mixelburg</code></a>! -\n<code>changeset version</code> now exits with code 1 when there are no\nunreleased changesets, instead of silently exiting with code 0.</p>\n<p>This makes it easier to detect when a version step is a no-op — for\nexample, to prevent accidentally publishing packages with incorrect\nversion tags when using <code>--snapshot</code> mode.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1482\">#1482</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/df424a4a09eea15b0fa9159ee0b98af0d95f58a7\"><code>df424a4</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! - Bumped\nsupported Node versions to <code>^22.11 || ^24 || &gt;=26</code></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1994\">#1994</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/062530b825d53abc9d8934f3a50cc61ff3ff82b8\"><code>062530b</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nThe <code>prettier</code> option in <code>.changeset/config.json</code>\nhas been removed in favor of <code>format</code>. <code>format</code>\nsupports <code>&quot;auto&quot;</code>,\n<code>&quot;prettier&quot;</code>, <code>&quot;oxfmt&quot;</code>,\n<code>&quot;deno&quot;</code>, and <code>&quot;dprint&quot;</code>, and\n<code>false</code> disables formatting. If you previously used\n<code>prettier: false</code>, migrate to <code>format: false</code> or\nremove the option to use automatic formatter detection.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2190\">#2190</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/96b65eec4af2c58301a11cd7dff42a6bde9c9f8a\"><code>96b65ee</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nMove versioned prerelease changesets to <code>.changeset/pre/</code>\nfolder instead of accumulating in the root and tracking the versioned\nchangeset ids in the <code>.changeset/pre.json</code> file. Existing\n<code>pre.json</code> will auto-migrate to this new structure on the\nnext run of <code>changeset version</code> or when calling\n<code>changeset status</code>.</p>\n<p>This change allows easier management of versioned prerelease\nchangesets (for the final stable release) and current queued changesets\n(for the next prerelease). Changesets in <code>.changeset/pre/</code>\ncan be edited or deleted depending if it''s still relevant for the final\nstable release of a package. There''s no need to synchronize the\nchangeset ids in <code>pre.json</code> if certain changesets are\ndeleted.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2145\">#2145</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/f5887ff54a6b78eae87ae85fdac3294c4464da78\"><code>f5887ff</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! -\nRemoved Yarn Classic support</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2097\">#2097</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/8c88f6a3362628ca580835a1a1f2310056ee5743\"><code>8c88f6a</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! -\nPackages with only prerelease versions published will now be published\nwith the prerelease tag in the prerelease mode <em>if</em> the target\nregistry doesn''t auto-assign <code>latest</code> tag. npm registry\nitself does that and such packages will continue to be released with\n<code>latest</code> tag (and not with the configured prerelease\ntag).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1879\">#1879</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/c76b232abc76f73592a21f0d5df9cc89406a31dc\"><code>c76b232</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/beeequeue\"><code>@​beeequeue</code></a>! -\nRemoved warning messages about using v1 configs. They will now be\nsilently ignored.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1655\">#1655</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/db46911e57603f20a158a47bbbebd112272c84e2\"><code>db46911</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nUpdate <code>@manypkg/get-packages</code> which drops support for\ndetecting packages in Bolt monorepos and adds support for npm\nmonorepos</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1651\">#1651</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/e1df8625800a1b3c4f66474a0e3c01b08214465c\"><code>e1df862</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nRemove support for the <code>--sinceMaster</code> flag for\n<code>changeset status</code>. Use <code>--since=master</code> or\n<code>--since=main</code> instead.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2117\">#2117</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/813bbf314d051bfee3b46a793f94b396ef2a4df1\"><code>813bbf3</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nRemove the <code>pre.json</code> <code>initialVersions</code> property\nand handling as it''s unused internally</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1961\">#1961</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/07278a726343388eb6dfc56e7a8213872d4c8857\"><code>07278a7</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/beeequeue\"><code>@​beeequeue</code></a>! -\n<code>CommitFunctions</code> can now be both sync and async, and the\n<code>defaultCommitFunctions</code> are now sync.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1482\">#1482</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/df424a4a09eea15b0fa9159ee0b98af0d95f58a7\"><code>df424a4</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! - From\nnow on this package is going to be published as ES module.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1652\">#1652</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/a0b5326570e8e7bf5e35c1cefe8f70d9a51a5cd7\"><code>a0b5326</code></a>\nThanks <a href=\"https://github.com/bluwy\"><code>@​bluwy</code></a>! -\nRemove support for the deprecated\n<code>___experimentalUnsafeOptions_WILL_CHANGE_IN_PATCH.useCalculatedVersionForSnapshots</code>\nconfig. The <code>snapshot.useCalculatedVersion</code> config should be\nused instead.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/2186\">#2186</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/3910adf3ebaef14196093715228885c4819d0cbf\"><code>3910adf</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Andarist\"><code>@​Andarist</code></a>! -\nPrivate packages are no longer versioned by default. Set\n<code>privatePackages</code> to <code>true</code> to opt into versioning\nand tagging them, or set <code>privatePackages.version</code> to\n<code>true</code> to version them without tagging.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/changesets/changesets/pull/1879\">#1879</a>\n<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/c76b232abc76f73592a21f0d5df9cc89406a31dc\"><code>c76b232</code></a>\nThanks <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/beeequeue\"><code>@​beeequeue</code></a>! -\nMigrated from <code>enquirer</code> +\n<code>@inquirer/launch-editor</code> to <code>@clack/prompts</code> +\n<code>launch-editor</code>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/bed458124f623463c581521ab56d040eba2a8b20\"><code>bed4581</code></a>\nVersion Packages (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/tree/HEAD/packages/cli/issues/2242\">#2242</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/fdfdc93efeff2034a6211db13a69b3487d00a3dd\"><code>fdfdc93</code></a>\nUpdate default generated readme (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/tree/HEAD/packages/cli/issues/2239\">#2239</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/d5f5ae83b8541aecff1ee2c446543e19434158a4\"><code>d5f5ae8</code></a>\nFix Windows PTY snapshot normalization (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/tree/HEAD/packages/cli/issues/2233\">#2233</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/f44222190fbe8adcea27582f6a35a0f095a34532\"><code>f442221</code></a>\nVersion Packages (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/tree/HEAD/packages/cli/issues/2235\">#2235</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/e3facadb06212677ffcf30b90e95536ca7a34468\"><code>e3facad</code></a>\nVersion Packages (next) (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/tree/HEAD/packages/cli/issues/2228\">#2228</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/changesets/changesets/commit/c98af4c33d8ee307c6229023ea6907fb0df4bf26\"><code>c98af4c</code></a>\nDo not bump ignored independent packages when exiting pre mode (<a\nhref=\"htt