a316c4f89d275a3ea238b30a3bd77"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70775490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/0080608ecdf5d58aed95a751cd8691fd7d2919bf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T19:28:20Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T19:28:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: Vite host React loadShare named exports under Rolldown (#433)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Why\n\n`publish-on-release.yml` run\n[34053928037](https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/actions/runs/34053928037)\nfailed at `vp run check` on Node 22/24/26. The only failing test was:\n\n`test/integration/adapters.test.ts` → *builds the clean mixed-federation\nexample through real bundler hooks*\n\n`vp run --filter @mfdoctor-example/host-vite build` died with Rolldown\n`MISSING_EXPORT`: `Suspense` and `lazy` are not exported by the virtual\nMF `loadShare` module for `react`.\n\n## Cause\n\n`@module-federation/vite` rewrites shared `react` through a virtual\n`loadShare` module. React’s package entry is CJS. On Rollup, named ESM\nimports (`import { Suspense, lazy } from \"react\"`) are wired via\n`syntheticNamedExports`. **Rolldown (Vite 8) does not support that\nhook**, so those names are not ESM exports of the virtual module.\n\nThe plugin can emit explicit named re-exports when `require(\"react\")`\nexport scanning succeeds. When that scan is incomplete or skipped, only\n`export default` remains — enough for a default import, not for named\nimports. `shareStrategy` is unrelated; this is a bundler bind-time\nerror.\n\n## Fix\n\nUse the CJS default namespace in Vite MF examples that named-imported\nfrom shared `react`:\n\n```ts\nimport React from \"react\";\nconst { Suspense, lazy } = React;\n```\n\nSame pattern for `useState` in the Nitro+Vite compatibility cell.\nRuntime still shares one React singleton; Rolldown no longer needs\nsynthetic named exports.\n\nTouched:\n\n- `examples/mixed-federation/host-vite/src/bootstrap.tsx` (the failing\nbuild)\n- `examples/mixed-federation-issues/host-vite/src/bootstrap.tsx`\n- `examples/nested-federation/host-vite/src/bootstrap.tsx`\n- `examples/nested-federation/remote-vite/src/Panel.tsx`\n- `examples/compatibility/vite-nitro-react/src/app.tsx`\n\nNo version bump, no publish, no new adapters, no suppressions.\n\n## Proof (local)\n\n- `vp run --filter @mfdoctor-example/host-vite build` — success\n- `vp test run test/integration/adapters.test.ts` — 15/15 passed\n(includes the previously failing mixed-federation case)\n- Also built: mixed-federation-issues host-vite, nested host-vite,\nnested remote-vite, vite-nitro-react\n- `vp run --filter @mfdoctor-example/host-vite typecheck` — success\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-4f8f9de6-d9e3-43b0-95c8-c566866ceaa3?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-4f8f9de6-d9e3-43b0-95c8-c566866ceaa3&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"d8e2865c688afedacab863111a0a86c29e97e66f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/d8e2865c688afedacab863111a0a86c29e97e66f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/0080608ecdf5d58aed95a751cd8691fd7d2919bf","verification":{"payload":"tree d8e2865c688afedacab863111a0a86c29e97e66f\nparent a3330cf57bee91f12c26b5883542a065b377e68d\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788722900 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788722900 +0000\n\nfix: Vite host React loadShare named exports under Rolldown (#433)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Why\n\n`publish-on-release.yml` run\n[34053928037](https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/actions/runs/34053928037)\nfailed at `vp run check` on Node 22/24/26. The only failing test was:\n\n`test/integration/adapters.test.ts` → *builds the clean mixed-federation\nexample through real bundler hooks*\n\n`vp run --filter @mfdoctor-example/host-vite build` died with Rolldown\n`MISSING_EXPORT`: `Suspense` and `lazy` are not exported by the virtual\nMF `loadShare` module for `react`.\n\n## Cause\n\n`@module-federation/vite` rewrites shared `react` through a virtual\n`loadShare` module. React’s package entry is CJS. On Rollup, named ESM\nimports (`import { Suspense, lazy } from \"react\"`) are wired via\n`syntheticNamedExports`. **Rolldown (Vite 8) does not support that\nhook**, so those names are not ESM exports of the virtual module.\n\nThe plugin can emit explicit named re-exports when `require(\"react\")`\nexport scanning succeeds. When that scan is incomplete or skipped, only\n`export default` remains — enough for a default import, not for named\nimports. `shareStrategy` is unrelated; this is a bundler bind-time\nerror.\n\n## Fix\n\nUse the CJS default namespace in Vite MF examples that named-imported\nfrom shared `react`:\n\n```ts\nimport React from \"react\";\nconst { Suspense, lazy } = React;\n```\n\nSame pattern for `useState` in the Nitro+Vite compatibility cell.\nRuntime still shares one React singleton; Rolldown no longer needs\nsynthetic named exports.\n\nTouched:\n\n- `examples/mixed-federation/host-vite/src/bootstrap.tsx` (the failing\nbuild)\n- `examples/mixed-federation-issues/host-vite/src/bootstrap.tsx`\n- `examples/nested-federation/host-vite/src/bootstrap.tsx`\n- `examples/nested-federation/remote-vite/src/Panel.tsx`\n- `examples/compatibility/vite-nitro-react/src/app.tsx`\n\nNo version bump, no publish, no new adapters, no suppressions.\n\n## Proof (local)\n\n- `vp run --filter @mfdoctor-example/host-vite build` — success\n- `vp test run test/integration/adapters.test.ts` — 15/15 passed\n(includes the previously failing mixed-federation case)\n- Also built: mixed-federation-issues host-vite, nested host-vite,\nnested remote-vite, vite-nitro-react\n- `vp run --filter @mfdoctor-example/host-vite typecheck` — success\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-4f8f9de6-d9e3-43b0-95c8-c566866ceaa3?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-4f8f9de6-d9e3-43b0-95c8-c566866ceaa3&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnb7UCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzigQAJskQaXWzTCmzJpCHtMV/eDq\nKhz5eMho7Lm4kSExhs26o2+S00+C2RR05xPDs8gCy+I2Dkd2DxLGov2utUn3Uusm\nGZd7O6wKmFbZT0Zs6KdGaaoqGnNwqbMbqYbZPy9/W8wtcw61gS7fDMU+YN8LPhjU\nOoVoRYHpqKYOP5LhwQ2CDZyPOUkVpwIgC9pp1xVBAt2LqBp8dzECp79SU8ijGiEU\nHpgdiKDE+EdDJo9xXeWIE/xoA6CWj4ODKd4Z6kniUKa84d8nxzN0R0ieOoboqb4T\nwcUbLrLdfDL6fat/WjME+dgq+p0Vw+c9BzFOyhLvdGljLbQCeuMt34xxiYr94ZOT\nr9ozmWO9I9G2/DDyo6h/E9eZlHeKi3000hgopaF+SASheBGwngJ9teF4lq5CMmrg\nySleE5AYG1D3DugLvq2KNZdIEE8P1L9EVIfErVbQEgkJg49Ck5uxXwGDMTPP7wwk\nNPMZsuO/OzxeN7Hg10SGmK8chkvT4FpvtFGIcMS094imD/iD4nUPgB/h/kYV8XKs\n9SotzMCLRbc0DoTUJkil172zl8/joRQYzstIkFn1Tes5+u1ns78aIcGu+6m8s5nA\nmJocIRKtCwzjRRoXO2wrFtRuriFscg+TAPE7uGsstw+valtvSicaYTF7PAVaU+NF\ndXC7O5Ox0KwrRq0mKet5\n=rCFL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-06T19:28:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_