d0e4","sha":"9cf0dd88faadecbf5bc0bee85a55a2e78828d0e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/9cf0dd88faadecbf5bc0bee85a55a2e78828d0e4"}],"sha":"a3330cf57bee91f12c26b5883542a065b377e68d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/a3330cf57bee91f12c26b5883542a065b377e68d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70775490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/9cf0dd88faadecbf5bc0bee85a55a2e78828d0e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T15:26:18Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T15:26:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: stop exporting migrated rule-group constants (#426)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements BL-55: stop re-exporting migrated rule-group id arrays from\nthe public `@tonoizer/mfdoctor` root.\n\nRebased onto latest `main` after #424 (BL-58, un-export\n`DEFAULT_ANALYSIS_CACHE_OPTIONS`) and #421/#419.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Dropped `MIGRATED_GROUP1_*` … `MIGRATED_GROUP6_RULE_IDS` from\n`src/index.ts`. The arrays stay on `src/rule-inventory.ts`.\n- Evidence bridges already import from `./rule-inventory.js`; tests keep\nusing that path.\n- Removed those names from the knip unused-export allowlist.\n`ALL_MIGRATED_RULE_IDS` stays on `.` because\n`scripts/generate-rule-inventory.mjs` still reads it from the published\nentry.\n- Added `test/unit/migrated-group-root-exports.test.ts` so the root\ncannot grow those exports back.\n\n## Why\n\nGroup id arrays are migration archaeology. App authors do not need them\non `.`; bridges and tests do.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- No HTML UI / in-browser agent / general `--fix`\n- No version bump, npm publish, or GitHub Release\n- `ALL_MIGRATED_RULE_IDS` stays on `.` until a later slim\n\n## Proof\n\n- After rebase: `vp test run test/unit` — 90 files, 1124 tests passed\n- `vp run knip`, `vp lint --deny-warnings .`, `tsc -p tsconfig.json` —\nexit 0\n- Built `dist/index.js` has no `MIGRATED_GROUP*` or\n`DEFAULT_ANALYSIS_CACHE_OPTIONS`; `ALL_MIGRATED_RULE_IDS` remains\n\nThis is a breaking change only for consumers who imported\n`MIGRATED_GROUP*` from the package root. The arrays remain in source.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-6c9da78c-b53b-4a96-8344-def919dd167d?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-6c9da78c-b53b-4a96-8344-def919dd167d&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-i