DS` stays on `.` until a later slim\n\n## Proof\n\n- After rebase: `vp test run test/unit` — 90 files, 1124 tests passed\n- `vp run knip`, `vp lint --deny-warnings .`, `tsc -p tsconfig.json` —\nexit 0\n- Built `dist/index.js` has no `MIGRATED_GROUP*` or\n`DEFAULT_ANALYSIS_CACHE_OPTIONS`; `ALL_MIGRATED_RULE_IDS` remains\n\nThis is a breaking change only for consumers who imported\n`MIGRATED_GROUP*` from the package root. The arrays remain in source.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-6c9da78c-b53b-4a96-8344-def919dd167d?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-6c9da78c-b53b-4a96-8344-def919dd167d&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnYYaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXrgQAEYWWHgE1etS7G06p129P0la\nGTi76AjvE+zzsftXfmscWXAzIvprVtyGjtSWBNq0XkuCS44+MAvCIltxieNmelQy\n5hLRqHPnWe+3FLhoZ357vl46OIjg3pf+jTCmxWCipBz50yzA8l0VyEcHj5lPgqre\n+ijJubHO4Z6iMRWZfUQqQwjPyKRIgKtEA2xjL4Wgkrw0MXLHbGnWAA2Yu2skLwcz\ndXl793PGKWqvNeFMVeVpshGc3Ybp7wSI69JTRvY325EYhtWrvYJqaUd79hhpKLlm\nTFOu1CaBbH+A3H6CAZ