"parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commit/dfb1f1ed2f24f133b8ecbc55513dc83728256210","sha":"dfb1f1ed2f24f133b8ecbc55513dc83728256210","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/dfb1f1ed2f24f133b8ecbc55513dc83728256210"}],"sha":"cdf26e24983bc5850c3395c80d7cf5ea8583d6be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/cdf26e24983bc5850c3395c80d7cf5ea8583d6be"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70775490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/dfb1f1ed2f24f133b8ecbc55513dc83728256210/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T15:11:33Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T15:11:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: prove Modern/Rsbuild adapters pass transformImport libraries (#425)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nCloses the BL-45 gap: `config/transform-import-share-conflict` used to\nskip whenever `bundler.transformImportLibraries` was unknown, and unit\ntests only injected synthetic facts. Modern.js and Rsbuild ship public\n`source.transformImport`; adapters now collect those library names so\nantd/arco-style overlaps emit the rule.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Observe public `source.transformImport` (`libraryName` / string\nentries). `false` is an empty observed list. Function-form values are\n**not** invoked and stay unknown (documented skip).\n- Rsbuild adapter reads `getNormalizedConfig` then `getRsbuildConfig` at\n`onAfterBuild`.\n- Modern adapter reads public CLI plugin APIs `getNormalizedConfig` then\n`getConfig` inside `modifyBundlerChain` (available after `onPrepare`).\n- Facts flow through `BuildDiagnostics.transformImportLibraries` into\nproject emit, same overlay path as externals/aliases.\n- Adapter tests drive real plugin setup (not synthetic `ProjectFacts`\nonly) with shared `antd` + `@arco-design/web-react`.\n- Stub Modern APIs without config getters still skip honestly\n(Rspack-stub / no app-tools).\n\n## Acceptance\n\n`test/unit/plugin-transform-import.test.ts`:\n\n- Rsbuild + Modern public `source.transformImport` + shared antd/arco\n**emits** `config/transform-import-share-conflict`.\n- Function-form transformImport: not invoked, libraries absent, rule\ndoes not fire.\n- `transformImport: false`: empty observed list, no finding.\n- Modern stub without `getConfig` / `getNormalizedConfig`: unknown skip.\n\nAlso covered: helper unit tests, `DoctorOptions.transformImport`\nnormalization, existing synthetic rule tests still pass.\n\n## Out of scope\n\nNo Next.js adapter, no private MF field scraping, no version bump /\npublish, no HTML UI / `--fix`.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-cb81d96f-656d-42ea-b327-347228a2b4de?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-cb81d96f-656d-42ea-b327-347228a2b4de&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"09938e3af099a77a797dfe3f412983e3fc651662","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/09938e3af099a77a797dfe3f412983e3fc651662"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/dfb1f1ed2f24f133b8ecbc55513dc83728256210","verification":{"payload":"tree 09938e3af099a77a797dfe3f412983e3fc651662\nparent 8af3420bbca03626c439004d4f246a98544b1787\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788707493 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788707493 +0000\n\ntest: prove Modern/Rsbuild adapters pass transformImport libraries (#425)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nCloses the BL-45 gap: `config/transform-import-share-conflict` used to\nskip whenever `bundler.transformImportLibraries` was unknown, and unit\ntests only injected synthetic facts. Modern.js and Rsbuild ship public\n`source.transformImport`; adapters now collect those library names so\nantd/arco-style overlaps emit the rule.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Observe public `source.transformImport` (`libraryName` / string\nentries). `false` is an empty observed list. Function-form values are\n**not** invoked and stay unknown (documented skip).\n- Rsbuild adapter reads `getNormalizedConfig` then `getRsbuildConfig` at\n`onAfterBuild`.\n- Modern adapter reads public CLI plugin APIs `getNormalizedConfig` then\n`getConfig` inside `modifyBundlerChain` (available after `onPrepare`).\n- Facts flow through `BuildDiagnostics.transformImportLibraries` into\nproject emit, same overlay path as externals/aliases.\n- Adapter tests drive real plugin setup (not synthetic `ProjectFacts`\nonly) with shared `antd` + `@arco-design/web-react`.\n- Stub Modern APIs without config getters still skip honestly\n(Rspack-stub / no app-tools).\n\n## Acceptance\n\n`test/unit/plugin-transform-import.test.ts`:\n\n- Rsbuild + Modern public `source.transformImport` + shared antd/arco\n**emits** `config/transform-import-share-conflict`.\n- Function-form transformImport: not invoked, libraries absent, rule\ndoes not fire.\n- `transformImport: false`: empty observed list, no finding.\n- Modern stub without `getConfig` / `getNormalizedConfig`: unknown skip.\n\nAlso covered: helper unit tests, `DoctorOptions.transformImport`\nnormalization, existing synthetic rule tests still pass.\n\n## Out of scope\n\nNo Next.js adapter, no private MF field scraping, no version bump /\npublish, no HTML UI / `--fix`.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-cb81d96f-656d-42ea-b327-347228a2b4de?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-cb81d96f-656d-42ea-b327-347228a2b4de&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrc