"commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T15:03:29Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T15:03:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: label semantic-graph and identity correlation experimental (#422)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements BL-52: mark semantic-graph and identity-correlation helpers\nas `@experimental` so agents do not treat the `.` export as a second\ngraph product.\n\nRebased onto latest `main` after BL-49 (#421) and other merges. Conflict\nin `src/index.ts` kept #421’s un-export of `projectV1Suppression` and\nthis PR’s `@experimental` semantic-graph comment.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Added `@experimental` JSDoc on the identity-correlation and\nsemantic-graph re-exports in `src/index.ts` (library-only, ADR 0086; not\nCLI reports, fingerprints, or exit codes; not an HTML UI or in-browser\nagent).\n- Added the same `@experimental` note on `src/identity-correlation.ts`\nand `src/semantic-graph.ts` so published `.d.ts` carries the warning.\n- Documented the contract on the generated public API catalog\n(`apps/docs/docs/api.md`, via `scripts/generate-api-doc.mjs`) with\nGerman locale parity.\n\n## Why\n\n`apps/docs/docs/capabilities.md` already demotes 1.1.0 library\ncontracts, but the root entry still looks like productized graph\nintegration. Catalog + index/source comments are enough to stop agents\nfrom “finishing” that work.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- No runtime behavior change (exports, CLI, reports, fingerprints, and\nexit codes unchanged)\n- No HTML UI / in-browser agent / general `--fix`\n- No version bump, npm publish, or GitHub Release\n- Other BL items (including further root-export slimming) are not\nbundled\n- Vercel Pro rate-limit fails are not required\n\n## Proof\n\n- `vp fmt --check` / `vp lint --deny-warnings` on touched files — exit 0\n- `node scripts/generate-api-doc.mjs --check` — exit 0\n- `node scripts/generate-german-docs.mjs --check` — exit 0\n- Diff vs `main` is comments/docs only (6 files, +32/−2)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-9a0b6ba6-cbfd-467a-8008-6e0b5407cd07?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-9a0b6ba6-cbfd-467a-8008-6e0b5407cd07&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"9d86e18e2481ee59a8cdaf24c43b84a89748f130","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/9d86e18e2481ee59a8cdaf24c43b84a89748f130"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/8af3420bbca03626c439004d4f246a98544b1787","verification":{"payload":"tree 9d86e18e2481ee59a8cdaf24c43b84a89748f130\nparent 1dbaa1f366f1b29cbee580aeafac1636475ee765\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788707009 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788707009 +0000\n\ndocs: label semantic-graph and identity correlation experimental (#422)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements BL-52: mark semantic-graph and identity-correlation helpers\nas `@experimental` so agents do not treat the `.` exp