tps://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/1dbaa1f366f1b29cbee580aeafac1636475ee765/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T15:02:17Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T15:02:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: un-export DEFAULT_ANALYSIS_CACHE_OPTIONS (#424)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements BL-58 from `docs/agent/improvement-backlog.md`.\n\n`DEFAULT_ANALYSIS_CACHE_OPTIONS` was only re-exported from the public\nroot and sat on the knip unused-export allowlist. The cache class and\nits internal default are still used by collect and `vp run\nbenchmark:analysis`.\n\nRebased onto latest `main` after BL-49 (#421) and related exports\nlanded. Conflicts in `CONTRIBUTING.md` and\n`scripts/knip-index-export-allowlist.mjs` were resolved by keeping the\nBL-39/BL-49 notes and dropping `DEFAULT_ANALYSIS_CACHE_OPTIONS` (without\nrestoring `RULE_COMPATIBILITY_EXCEPTIONS` from #419).\n\n## Changes\n\n- Stop re-exporting `DEFAULT_ANALYSIS_CACHE_OPTIONS` from\n`src/index.ts`.\n- Keep the const in `src/analysis-cache.ts` so `AnalysisContentCache`\nstill applies the same default bounds when options are omitted.\n- Leave public type `AnalysisCacheOptions` (and `AnalysisContentCache`)\non the root entry.\n- Drop the name from `scripts/knip-index-export-allowlist.mjs`.\n- Cover the internal default and the missing public export in\n`test/unit/analysis-cache.test.ts`.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- [x] `DEFAULT_ANALYSIS_CACHE_OPTIONS` is no longer a public root export\n- [x] Internal default remains usable by collect/benchmarks\n- [x] `AnalysisCacheOptions` type stays public\n- [ ] CI green on required checks (Vercel Pro rate-limit fails are not\nrequired)\n\nNo version bump, changeset, or npm publish.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-192d5feb-2963-4475-add7-4987b0840362?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-192d5feb-2963-4475-add7-4987b0840362&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc02b2c7338d862e4e08e92e551e64188e45e5b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/cc02b2c7338d862e4e08e92e551e64188e45e5b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/1dbaa1f366f1b29cbee580aeafac1636475ee765","verification":{"payload":"tree cc02b2c7338d862e4e08e92e551e64188e45e5b3\nparent 2623b9c7f1202d6dc2fb1ba09686733a32c39a13\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788706937 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788706937 +0000\n\nchore: un-export DEFAULT_ANALYSIS_CACHE_OPTIONS (#424)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements BL-58 from `docs/agent/improvement-backlog.md`.\n\n`DEFAULT_ANALYSIS_CACHE_OPTIONS` was only re-exported from the public\nroo