3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T15:01:24Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T15:01:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: warn invalid virtualModuleDir and untested ignoreOrigin (#432)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements **BL-53** only (`docs/agent/improvement-backlog.md`): honest\nVite dialect coverage for `virtualModuleDir` and `ignoreOrigin`.\n\n## What\n\nTwo Vite-only built-ins, on the existing post-emit doctor path:\n\n- **`vite/virtual-module-dir`** (warning) — `virtualModuleDir` contains\n`/` or `\\` (not a simple folder name).\n- **`vite/ignore-origin`** (info) — `ignoreOrigin: true` while\nplugin-observed `server.origin` is missing/empty. CLI/config-only\nanalysis without that origin fact **skips** in V1 and is **unknown** on\nthe evidence bridge (honest partial), rather than a false pass.\n\nInventory, guidance, Group 6 evidence wiring, generated rule pages\n(EN/DE), and configuration-audit / Vite integration cross-links are\nincluded. No adapters, no suppressions, no version bump, no `--fix` /\nHTML UI.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Focused unit cases for both findings, quiet paths, webpack skip, and\n`analyze()`.\n- Evidence: `ignoreOrigin: true` without origin → `unknown`; observed\nnull origin → fail; simple `virtualModuleDir` stays pass.\n- `vp fmt --check`, lint (pre-commit), `tsc`, full **unit** suite\n(1104), `inventory:check` (126 rules), generated rule/German docs\n`--check`.\n\nNot in this PR: other BL items, publish/release, evidence-v2 default\nchange.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-d5a71993-686b-4bb7-8280-8f57c5f45720?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-d5a71993-686b-4bb7-8280-8f57c5f45720&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5cff70216072e4dd27a2eb2802a0626a718ed4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/a5cff70216072e4dd27a2eb2802a0626a718ed4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/2623b9c7f1202d6dc2fb1ba09686733a32c39a13","verification":{"payload":"tree a5cff70216072e4dd27a2eb2802a0626a718ed4b\nparent f317670a15831574eb7ec1decdffb9c5483eb5ec\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788706884 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788706884 +0000\n\nfeat: warn invalid virtualModuleDir and untested ignoreOrigin (#432)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements **BL-53** only (`docs/agent/improvement-backlog.md`): honest\nVite dialect coverage for `virtualModuleDir` and `ignoreOrigin`.\n\n## What\n\nTwo Vite-only built-ins, on the existing post-emit doctor path:\n\n- **`vite/virtual-module-dir`** (warning) — `virtualModuleDir` contains\n`/` or `\\` (not a simple folder name).\n- **`vite/ignore-origin`** (info) — `ignoreOrigin: true` while\nplugin-observed `server.origin` is missing/empty. CLI/config-only\nanalysis without that origin fact **skips** in V1 and is **unknown** on\nthe evidence bridge (honest partial), rather than a false pass.\n\nInventory, guidance, Group 6 evidence wiring, generated rule pages\n(EN/DE), and configuration-audit / Vite integration cross-links are\nincluded. No adapters, no suppressions, no version bump, no `--fix` /\nHTML UI.\n\n## Tests\n\n- Focused unit cases for both findings, quiet paths, webpack skip, and\n`analyze()`.\n- Evidence: `ignoreOrigin: true` without origin → `unknown`; observed\nnull origin → fail; simple `virtualModuleDir` stays pass.\n- `vp fmt --check`, lint (pre-commit), `tsc`, full **unit** suite\n(1104), `inventory:check` (126 rules), generated rule/German docs\n`--check`.\n\nNot in this PR: other BL items, publish/release, evidence-v2 default\nchange.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-d5a71993-686b-4bb7-8280-8f57c5f45720?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-d5a71993-686b-4bb7-8280-8f57c5f45720&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnYBECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaoEQAFyzTCk77tU5qFZrLTf7hXJR\nS+UxkrnA5BnhRhNcWqO1HrSYEeVK08Q19MLmhjZVVtQbE8AlFDJ