inding conversion, V1 projection, rule-option mapping, and\nrun-completion. Both already used `evidence-graph-projection.ts`. A\nhelper extract is the mini-PR; merging runners or flipping `legacy`\ndefaults is the architecture rewrite `EVIDENCE_ROLLOUT_V2.md` forbids.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Shared `toEvidenceFinding`, `ruleOptionsFromSettings`,\n`completeEvidenceRun`, and `projectConclusiveFailures` in\n`src/evidence-graph-projection.ts`\n- Rule and federation bridges keep separate runners\n(`runMigratedEvidenceRules` / `runMigratedRuntimeEvidenceRules` /\n`runMigratedFederationRules`)\n- Fingerprint inputs stay `ruleId + project + federationInstanceId +\nlocation + evidence` (details still omitted)\n- No changes to `createEvidenceRolloutController` defaults or\n`EVIDENCE_ROLLOUT_V2.md`\n\nProduction source for the three files: **1066 → 1050** lines.\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- [x] Net production LOC down\n- [x] Tests green for touched surfaces\n- [x] No rollout default change\n- [x] No report fingerprint change (`config/remote-http-insecure` still\n`aad0eafc068fda2276d500d41467e3aff6e518386627d6d6f1803602c6d19e7d`)\n\n## Proof\n\n- `vp fmt --check` + `vp lint --deny-warnings` (pre-commit)\n- `vp exec tsc -p tsconfig.json`\n- `vp test run test/unit` — 82 files, 1020 tests\n- `vp test run test/integration/evidence-rollout-bridge.test.ts` — 54\ntests\n- `node dist/cli.js capabilities` — `@tonoizer/mfdoctor` CLI contract\n- verify-mfdoctor offline `check` on\n`examples/showcase/config/remote-http-insecure` (`--output -\n--no-write`): finding `config/remote-http-insecure`,\n`status.incompleteReasons: [\"missing-emit\"]` (not claimed green)\n\nUnrelated: `test/integration/adapters.test.ts` mixed-federation Vite\nexample build failed on missing `react` `Suspense`/`lazy` re-exports\nfrom the MF loadShare virtual module. That example is outside this\nhelper extract.\n\n## Out of scope\n\nNo HTML UI, in-browser agent, general `--fix`, new bundler adapters,\nversion bump, or other BL items.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-31051a1e-f4ec-4c54-a8a0-fe77f219858e?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-31051a1e-f4ec-4c54-a8a0-fe77f219858e&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"3cfbbc2a5d014739da4bf702178962a0edc2bd97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/3cfbbc2a5d014739da4bf702178962a0edc2bd97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/f317670a15831574eb7ec1decdffb9c5483eb5ec","verification":{"payload":"tree 3cfbbc2a5d014739da4bf702178962a0edc2bd97\nparent 9edb22dacca1aa9d2fa57d4fc7880523b1b8d998\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788706663 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788706663 +0000\n\nrefactor: share evidence projection helpers between bridges (#429)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements **BL-51** only: share evidence projection helpers between the\nrule and federation bridges. Does not merge the runners or change\nevidence v2 rollout defaults.\n\n## Why\n\n`evidence-rule-brid