er_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/9edb22dacca1aa9d2fa57d4fc7880523b1b8d998/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:57:12Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:57:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: mention tsgo compilerInstance on the DTS audit page (#417)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements BL-43 from `docs/agent/improvement-backlog.md`.\n\n## Why\n\nModule Federation can generate DTS with\n`dts.generateTypes.compilerInstance` (`tsc` by default; `\"tsgo\"` is the\nfaster native TypeScript instance). MFDoctor only audits DTS enablement\n/ `outputDir` / nested extract. A default **warning** rule for `tsgo` is\nlow-confidence and easy to over-nag, so this change documents the option\non the configuration-audit checklist instead of adding a rule.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Added a configuration-audit row for\n`dts.generateTypes.compilerInstance` / `\"tsgo\"` when type generation is\nslow.\n- Kept the German locale twin in sync\n(`apps/docs/locales/de/configuration-audit.md`).\n- No rule, no recommended-profile info finding, no changeset / version\nbump (docs-only).\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Optional later info rule behind the recommended profile\n- HTML UI / `--fix` / private field scraping\n\n## Acceptance\n\nConfiguration-audit mentions `compilerInstance` / `tsgo`.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-b0d54a7d-29b2-45af-9798-a0b84d5fa7e7?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-b0d54a7d-29b2-45af-9798-a0b84d5fa7e7&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"2d929f866951d404f465cffb03cbb6f9f5b1d4f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/2d929f866951d404f465cffb03cbb6f9f5b1d4f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/9edb22dacca1aa9d2fa57d4fc7880523b1b8d998","verification":{"payload":"tree 2d929f866951d404f465cffb03cbb6f9f5b1d4f2\nparent e2ac779a39c889b08b113a2e43f1417a0e04c50b\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788706632 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788706632 +0000\n\ndocs: mention tsgo compilerInstance on the DTS audit page (#417)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements BL-43 from `docs/agent/improvement-backlog.md`.\n\n## Why\n\nModule Federation can generate DTS with\n`dts.generateTypes.compilerInstance` (`tsc` by default; `\"tsgo\"` is the\nfaster native TypeScript instance). MFDoctor only audits DTS enablement\n/ `outputDir` / nested extract. A default **warning** rule for `tsgo` is\nlow-confidence and easy to over-nag, so this change documents the option\non the configuration-audit checklist instead of adding a rule.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Added a configuration-audit row for\n`dts.generateTypes.compilerInstance` / `\"tsgo\"` when type generation is\nslow.\n- Kept the German locale twin in sync\n(`apps/docs/locales/de/configuration-audit.md`).\n- No rule, no recommended-profile info finding, no changeset / version\nbump (docs-only).\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Optional later info rule behind the recommended profile\n- HTML UI / `--fix` / private field scraping\n\n## Acceptance\n\nConfiguration-audit mentions `compilerInstance` / `tsgo`.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-b0d54a7d-29b2-45af-9798-a0b84d5fa7e7?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-b0d54a7d-29b2-45af-9798-a0b84d5fa7e7&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-b