d998","node_id":"C_kwDOTjIi_9oAKDllZGIyMmRhY2NhMWFhOWQyZmE1N2Q0ZmM3ODgwNTIzYjFiOGQ5OTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commit/e2ac779a39c889b08b113a2e43f1417a0e04c50b","sha":"e2ac779a39c889b08b113a2e43f1417a0e04c50b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/e2ac779a39c889b08b113a2e43f1417a0e04c50b"}],"sha":"9edb22dacca1aa9d2fa57d4fc7880523b1b8d998","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/9edb22dacca1aa9d2fa57d4fc7880523b1b8d998"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70775490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/e2ac779a39c889b08b113a2e43f1417a0e04c50b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:57:07Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:57:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: split runtime-capture file-import from unused transports (#428)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nCloses BL-54 from `docs/agent/improvement-backlog.md`.\n\n## Why\n\n`src/capture.ts` was a ~3.7k-line module mixing the offline file-import\npath used by `mfdoctor runtime` with unused library transports (browser\nattach, snapshot/instance fallback, network/error fallback). That made\nthe CLI path harder to maintain and made the capture entry easy to\nconfuse with an in-browser doctor.\n\n## What changed\n\n- **File-import / CLI path** lives in `src/runtime-capture-contract.ts`\n(~1.1k LOC): envelope types, quotas, redaction, and\n`validateRuntimeCaptureEnvelope`.\n- `src/runtime-trace.ts` (`mfdoctor runtime`) imports that contract\nmodule only.\n- **File/export adapters** (`loadRuntimeCaptureExportFile`,\nObservability/DevTools/app/Node JSON) live in\n`src/runtime-capture-file.ts`.\n- **Unused transports** (browser connector, snapshot/instance fallback,\nnetwork/error fallback) are isolated in\n`src/runtime-capture-transports.ts` with tests. No transports were\nadded.\n- `@tonoizer/mfdoctor/capture` remains a re-export barrel. No in-browser\ninjection. ADR 0084 closeout is not in this PR. No version bump.\n\n## Proof\n\n- Unit tests: 1095 passed (including capture, runtime-trace, isolated\ntransports).\n- Isolation test asserts `mfdoctor runtime` does not import unused\ntransports and that those modules do not inject into a page.\n- CLI: `mfdoctor runtime` shared-mismatch exit `1`\n(`runtime/shared-mismatch`); green exit `0`; missing trace exit `2`;\n`--no-write` did not create `.mf/doctor`.\n- `scripts/verify-runtime-capture-compatibility.mjs` (9 cases) and knip\nboth passed.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-c1a4038c-088a-427a-a7d3-471c77e61491?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-c1a4038c-088a-427a-a7d3-471c77e61491&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"dea27eab54ef37cd14c380a4a7040e31df998a27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/dea27eab54ef37cd14c380a4a7040e31df998a27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/e2ac779a39c889b08b113a2e43f1417a0e04c50b","verification":{"payload":"tree dea27eab54ef37cd14c380a4a7040e31df998a27\nparent f00bf47004115925d9ae859bc7da6730353f8d40\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788706627 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788706627 +0000\n\nrefactor: split runtime-capture file-import from unused transports (#428)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nCloses BL-54 from `docs/agent/improvement-backlog.md`.\n\n## Why\n\n`src/capture.ts` was a ~3.7k-line module mixing the offline file-import\npath used by `mfdoctor runtime` with unused library transports (browser\nattach, snapshot/instance fallback, network/error fallback). That made\nthe CLI path harder to maintain and made the capture entry easy to\nconfuse with an in-browser doctor.\n\n## What changed\n\n- **File-import / CLI path** lives in `src/runtime-capture-contract.ts`\n(~1.1k LOC): envelope types, quotas, redaction, and\n`validateRuntimeCaptureEnvelope`.\n- `src/runtime-trace.ts` (`mfdoctor runtime`) imports that contract\nmodule only.\n- **File/export adapters** (`loadRuntimeCaptureExportFile`,\nObservability/DevTools/app/Node JSON) live in\n`src/runtime-capture-file.ts`.\n- **Unused transports** (browser connector, snapshot/instance fallback,\nnetwork/error fallback) are isolated in\n`src/runtime-capture-transports.ts` with tests. No transports were\nadded.\n- `@tonoizer/mfdoctor/capture` remains a re-export barrel. No in-browser\ninjection. ADR 0084 closeout is not in this PR. No version bump.\n\n## Proof\n\n- Unit tests: 1095 passed (including capture, runtime-trace, isolated\ntransports).\n- Isolation test asserts `mfdoctor runtime` does not import unused\ntransports and that those modules do not inject into a page.\n- CLI: `mfdoctor runtime` shared-mismatch exit `1`\n(`runtime/shared-mismatch`); green exit `0`; missing trace exit `2`;\n`--no-write` did not create `.mf/doctor`.\n- `scripts/verify-runtime-capture-compatibility.mjs` (9 cases) and knip\nboth passed.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-c1a4038c-088a-427a-a7d3-471c77e61491?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-c1a4038c-088a-427a-a7d3-471c77e61491&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/image