er/module-federation-doctor/commit/e2ac779a39c889b08b113a2e43f1417a0e04c50b","node_id":"C_kwDOTjIi_9oAKGUyYWM3NzlhMzljODg5YjA4YjExM2EyZTQzZjE0MTdhMGUwNGM1MGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commit/f00bf47004115925d9ae859bc7da6730353f8d40","sha":"f00bf47004115925d9ae859bc7da6730353f8d40","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/f00bf47004115925d9ae859bc7da6730353f8d40"}],"sha":"e2ac779a39c889b08b113a2e43f1417a0e04c50b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/e2ac779a39c889b08b113a2e43f1417a0e04c50b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70775490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/f00bf47004115925d9ae859bc7da6730353f8d40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:53:01Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:53:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: stress that ui schema is not a shipped dashboard (#423)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nImplements BL-56: stress that `buildUiPayload` /\n`schemas/ui.schema.json` is **not** a shipped HTML dashboard.\n\nAgents still grep `ui` and invent `--ui`. The generated [public API\nsurface](apps/docs/docs/api.md) now:\n\n- labels the `ui.schema.json` row as a programmatic graph contract (not\nan HTML dashboard or `--ui` flag)\n- adds a one-liner with cross-links to\n[limitations](apps/docs/docs/limitations.md) and [report\nschemas](apps/docs/docs/report-schemas.md)\n\nLimitations now links back to the API page. German locale pages stay in\nparity.\n\n**Not in this PR:** schema deletion, an HTML UI, `--ui`, version bump,\nor npm publish. `schemas/ui.schema.json` is kept.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `node scripts/generate-api-doc.mjs --check`\n- [x] `node scripts/generate-german-docs.mjs --check` (290 pages, 2\nsnapshots)\n- [x] `node scripts/check-doc-parity.mjs` (2 snapshots)\n- [x] `node scripts/check-doc-links.mjs` / `check-doc-snippets.mjs`\n- [x] `vp fmt --check` and `vp lint --deny-warnings` on the generator\n- [x] `vp run --filter @tonoizer/mfdoctor-docs build`\n- [x] Confirm `schemas/ui.schema.json` is unchanged\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-e979560e-8d39-4198-8ff6-dd04e9b962a3?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-e979560e-8d39-4198-8ff6-dd04e9b962a3&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\n