wers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/002f1cf75823aa04f35c2e179a9182d68fabfacb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:50:10Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:50:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: document SSR host-init as Vite-only until Rsbuild/Modern facts exist (#420)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements BL-48 from `docs/agent/improvement-backlog.md`.\n\n`vite/host-init-inject-ssr` is a Vite dialect check: it reads\n`@module-federation/vite`''s public `hostInitInjectLocation` option.\nRsbuild and Modern.js SSR hosts inject federation bootstrap through\ndifferent public APIs. This PR documents that gap instead of inventing a\nfake Rsbuild/Modern finding.\n\n## Changes\n\n- **Limitations** (EN + DE): new *SSR host-init inject (Vite-only)*\nsection with a bundler table and an explicit skip (not\n`doctor/partial-analysis`).\n- **Vite integration** + **configuration audit** (EN + DE): cross-links\nso copied Vite keys stay `config/copied-vite-options-on-webpack` and no\nhost-init analogue is claimed.\n- Rule skip comment plus a unit test that Rsbuild, Modern, Webpack, and\nRspack stay quiet even when SSR signals exist.\n\nNo new rule, no version bump, no changeset.\n\n## Local proof\n\n- `vp fmt --check .`\n- `vp lint --deny-warnings .`\n- `pnpm exec tsc -p tsconfig.json` and docs typecheck\n- `vp test run test/unit/rules.test.ts -t \"hostInit|host-init|SSR\nproducer|SSR with entry\"` — 8 passed\n- `pnpm run docs:build` (German docs, parity, snippets, links, Rspress)\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- [x] Limitations or vite-integration cross-link present (EN + DE)\n- [x] No fake Rsbuild finding\n- [x] Tests/docs CI green locally\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-e1b159ca-caa8-44b9-9d92-96d305e59df7?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-e1b159ca-caa8-44b9-9d92-96d305e59df7&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"da6672a0951071a0a1c6d03dabbe8d44362d379f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/da6672a0951071a0a1c6d03dabbe8d44362d379f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/002f1cf75823aa04f35c2e179a9182d68fabfacb","verification":{"payload":"tree da6672a0951071a0a1c6d03dabbe8d44362d379f\nparent edd7d7e566524b3e5fe4df609b4b55c65a6ee46b\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788706210 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788706210 +0000\n\ndocs: document SSR host-init as Vite-only until Rsbuild/Modern facts exist (#420)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements BL-48 from `docs/agent/improvement-backlog.md`.\n\n`vite/host-init-inject-ssr` is a Vite dialect check: it reads\n`@module-federation/vite`''s public `hostInitInjectLocation` option.\nRsbuild and Modern.js SSR hosts inject federation bootstrap through\ndifferent public APIs. This PR documents that gap instead of inventing a\nfake Rsbuild/Modern finding.\n\n## Changes\n\n- **Limitations** (EN + DE): new *SSR host-init inject (Vite-only)*\nsection with a bundler table and an explicit skip (not\n`doctor/partial-analysis`).\n- **Vite integration** + **configuration audit** (EN + DE): cross-links\nso copied Vite keys stay `config/copied-vite-options-on-webpack` and no\nhost-init analogue is claimed.\n- Rule skip comment plus a unit test that Rsbuild, Modern, Webpack, and\nRspack stay quiet even when SSR signals exist.\n\nNo new rule, no version bump, no changeset.\n\n## Local proof\n\n- `vp fmt --check .`\n- `vp lint --deny-warnings .`\n- `pnpm exec tsc -p tsconfig.json` and docs typecheck\n- `vp test run test/unit/rules.test.ts -t \"hostInit|host-init|SSR\nproducer|SSR with entry\"` — 8 passed\n- `pnpm run docs:build` (German docs, parity, snippets, links, Rspress)\n\n## Acceptance\n\n- [x] Limitations or vite-integration cross-link present (EN + DE)\n- [x] No fake Rsbuild finding\n- [x] Tests/docs CI green locally\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-e1b159ca-caa8-44b9-9d92-96d305e59df7?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.p