vents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/edd7d7e566524b3e5fe4df609b4b55c65a6ee46b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:42:04Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:42:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: stop exporting unused v1-compatibility helpers (#421)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements **BL-49**: stop advertising unused v1-compatibility helpers\non the public `@tonoizer/mfdoctor` root.\n\n`src/v1-compatibility.ts` is tests/docs/ADR only and is not used by the\nbaseline CLI. This PR drops the dead compatibility layer from `.`\nwithout deleting the module.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Removed `projectV1Suppression` and `V1_COMPATIBILITY_SCHEMA_VERSION`\n(and related types) from `src/index.ts`.\n- Removed those names from the knip unused-export allowlist.\n- Kept `src/v1-compatibility.ts` for ADR unit tests via relative import.\n- Documented the library-only contract in capabilities (EN + DE) and\nCONTRIBUTING.\n- Unit + pack-check assertions that the published `.` entry does not\nexport those helpers.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- No HTML UI / `--fix` / in-browser agent\n- No private MF field scraping\n- No version bump, changeset, or npm publish\n- Lineage/waiver un-export already landed in BL-39; semantic-graph stays\non `.` (BL-52)\n\n## Proof\n\n- `vp run knip` — exit 0\n- `vp test run test/unit` — 87 files, 1090 tests passed (includes the\nnew root-export assertion)\n- `vp exec tsc -p tsconfig.json` — exit 0\n- `vp fmt --check` / `vp lint --deny-warnings` — exit 0\n- `node dist/cli.js capabilities` — exit 0, `package.name`\n`@tonoizer/mfdoctor`, `baseline` still among commands\n- Published `dist/index.js` omits `projectV1Suppression` /\n`V1_COMPATIBILITY_SCHEMA_VERSION`; relative import from\n`src/v1-compatibility.ts` still works in unit tests\n- German docs check and changeset-contract — exit 0\n\nThis is a breaking change only for consumers who imported those helpers\nfrom the package root. The module remains in source.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-b943aad2-3850-4bec-b7d4-49f7f9cc8d3e?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-b943aad2-3850-4bec-b7d4-49f7f9cc8d3e&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"818f1d5ff1064b987b739b64f8d77450b0938291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/818f1d5ff1064b987b739b64f8d77450b0938291"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/edd7d7e566524b3e5fe4df609b4b55c65a6ee46b","verification":{"payload":"tree 818f1d5ff1064b987b739b64f8d77450b0938291\nparent 0ac5abb67d60268aa1cf5bab4ba