izer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/0ac5abb67d60268aa1cf5bab4ba9f5de483b4807/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:36:09Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:36:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: drop empty RULE_COMPATIBILITY_EXCEPTIONS export (#419)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements **BL-46** (score 65, P3): drop the public empty\n`RULE_COMPATIBILITY_EXCEPTIONS` export left over from V1 closeout.\n\nEvery current built-in is already `migrated`. The empty list was still a\npublic `.` export, knip-allowlisted, and tested for length 0. Nothing\nwill be added, so the export and `RuleCompatibilityException` type go\naway.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Removed `RULE_COMPATIBILITY_EXCEPTIONS` and\n`RuleCompatibilityException` from `src/rule-inventory.ts` and the\n`@tonoizer/mfdoctor` root entry\n- Replaced them with a one-line inventory comment: every current\nbuilt-in is migrated; no compatibility exceptions\n- Simplified inventory status/notes so a missing migrated id fails\ninstead of consulting an empty exception list\n- Dropped the name from the knip unused-export allowlist\n- Generator still writes schema-required `compatibilityExceptionCount:\n0` / `compatibilityExceptions: []` into\n`fixtures/rule-inventory/v1.json` (not a public TS export)\n- Closeout test proves every built-in is migrated, the fixture exception\nlist is empty, and the root entry does not export\n`RULE_COMPATIBILITY_EXCEPTIONS`\n- Current evidence-aware docs and ADR 0083 no longer tell authors to add\nto the public list. Frozen `1.0.0` docs are unchanged.\n\nChangeset: **major** (removed public symbols). No version bump or npm\npublish in this PR.\n\n## Out of scope\n\nNo HTML UI, in-browser agent, general `--fix`, private MF field\nscraping, Next.js adapter, or other BL-* items.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-e3556466-90f3-4c87-bdfe-a3333a5928af?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-e3556466-90f3-4c87-bdfe-a3333a5928af&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"84367e4ea39f2f4f1afa11bdbddec34d5ef837b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/84367e4ea39f2f4f1afa11bdbddec34d5ef837b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/0ac5abb67d60268aa1cf5bab4ba9f5de483b4807","verification":{"payload":"tree 84367e4ea39f2f4f1afa11bdbddec34d5ef837b1\nparent 66dcaeaf66bac143d4f5e88eaed0f05856113515\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788705369 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788705369 +0000\n\nchore: drop empty RULE_COMPATIBILITY_EXCEPTIONS export (#419)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements **BL-46** (score 65, P3): drop the public empty\n`RULE_COMPATIBILITY_EXCEPTIONS` export left over from V1 closeout.\n\nEvery current built-in is already `migrated`. The empty list was still a\npublic `.` export, knip-allowlisted, and tested for length 0. Nothing\nwill be added, so the export and `RuleCompatibilityException` type go\naway.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Removed `RULE_COMPATIBILITY_EXCEPTIONS` and\n`RuleCompatibilityException` from `src/rule-inventory.ts` and the\n`@tonoizer/mfdoctor` root entry\n- Replaced them with a one-line inventory comment: every current\nbuilt-in is migrated; no compatibility exceptions\n- Simplified inventory status/notes so a missing migrated id fails\ninstead of consulting an empty exception list\n- Dropped the name from the knip unused-export allowlist\n- Generator still writes schema-required `compatibilityExceptionCount:\n0` / `compatibilityExceptions: []` into\n`fixtures/rule-inventory/v1.json` (not a public TS export)\n- Closeout test proves every built-in is migrated, the fixture exception\nlist is empty, and the root entry does not export\n`RULE_COMPATIBILITY_EXCEPTIONS`\n- Current evidence-aware docs and ADR 0083 no longer tell authors to add\nto the public list. Frozen `1.0.0` docs are unchanged.\n\nChangeset: **major** (removed public symbols). No version bump or npm\npublish in this PR.\n\n## Out of scope\n\nNo HTML UI, in-browser agent, general `--fix`, private MF field\nscraping, Next.js adapter, or other BL-* items.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-e3556466-90f3-4c87-bdfe-a3333a5928af?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/