r/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/66dcaeaf66bac143d4f5e88eaed0f05856113515/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:25:33Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:25:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: mark Next.js Module Federation as out of scope (#411)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nNames Next.js Module Federation as **unsupported / out of scope** so\nagents do not start a Next adapter.\n\n`@module-federation/nextjs-mf` is Pages Router only and unmaintained.\nProduct limitations already cover runtime-only hosts and Nuxt/Modern\npartials, but never said Next Federation is out of scope.\n\nImplements BL-36 from `docs/agent/improvement-backlog.md`.\n\nRebased onto latest `main` (includes #404 Modern.js App Tools lockfile\ntrust notes). Conflicts in EN+DE compatibility tables and limitations\npost-v1 copy were resolved by keeping #404 wording and adding the\nNext.js unsupported row.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Limitations: Next.js is unsupported; no adapter planned; prefer\nRsbuild or Modern.js. Post-v1 is not a deferred Next adapter.\n- Compatibility: bundlers table **unsupported** row, prose next to the\nruntime-only note, and a non-blocking failure-policy entry.\n- Agent loop / integrations: explicit “do not invent a Next adapter”\npointers on the pages agents use to pick an adapter.\n- German locale copies under `apps/docs/locales/de/` (docs lifecycle\nparity). Historical `versions/1.0.0` is unchanged.\n\n## Non-goals\n\n- No Next.js code adapter.\n- No `fixtures/compatibility-matrix.json` row (that contract only lists\nsupported/partial cells with adapter exports).\n- No HTML UI, in-browser agent, general `--fix`, version bump, or\nchangeset.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] Diff is docs-only (English + German locale pages).\n- [x] Grep `apps/docs` for Next.js / `nextjs-mf` hits the new\nunsupported wording, not an adapter.\n- [x] Rebased onto latest main; #404 Modern.js trustPolicy notes kept.\n- [x] `vp fmt --check` on the touched docs pages.\n- [ ] CI quality / docs build on this PR.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-d5093410-cec1-4d07-a986-7b51808d851c?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-d5093410-cec1-4d07-a986-7b51808d851c&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"ed9e986e6e37cfe10d759674bced7edced0b9f58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/ed9e986e6e37cfe10d759674bced7edced0b9f58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/66dcaeaf66bac143d4f5e88eaed0f05856113515","verification":{"payload":"tree e