tps://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/7d681b55fc2cef042903a024ba97c8075f507b16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:24:00Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:24:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: lead Modern smoke README with partial-status warning (#416)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements **BL-44** from `docs/agent/improvement-backlog.md`.\n\nAgents treat a green `examples/compatibility/modern` smoke as full\nModern.js App Tools support. The warning already existed, but it sat in\nthe **second** paragraph after a how-the-adapter-works lead.\n\nRebased onto latest `main` (includes **#404** / BL-26 lockfile trust\nblocker). Conflict in `examples/compatibility/modern/README.md` resolved\nby keeping the **partial-status warning as the first paragraph** and\nretaining #404’s lockfile / #130 detail below it.\n\n## Change\n\nLead `examples/compatibility/modern/README.md` with a first-paragraph\nshout:\n\n- **partial**, not **supported**\n- **Rspack stub**, not a full `@modern-js/app-tools` app\n- do not treat a green `modern-smoke` as first-class App Tools support\n- App Tools CI is lockfile-blocked (`trustPolicy: no-downgrade`);\nupstream core-demo re-soak remains\n[#130](https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/issues/130)\n\nHow-it-works (`modifyBundlerChain` + Rspack-under-the-hood) and the #404\nlockfile note stay in the following paragraphs. No matrix status\nupgrade.\n\n## Out of scope\n\nDocs only. No version bump, npm publish, changeset, HTML UI, `--fix`,\nprivate scraping, suppressions, or `probe`.\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-bbfadaf3-d284-41f0-a4df-2d53773796e8?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-bbfadaf3-d284-41f0-a4df-2d53773796e8&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd8bfa7afbbdbe96c143c5a63aef3ddebe5c3ac1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/dd8bfa7afbbdbe96c143c5a63aef3ddebe5c3ac1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/7d681b55fc2cef042903a024ba97c8075f507b16","verification":{"payload":"tree dd8bfa7afbbdbe96c143c5a63aef3ddebe5c3ac1\nparent 83d02bb352c90b5ac73a93f01e99d4d0de041be4\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788704640 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <n