n` stay\non `.` for later slim PRs (BL-49 / BL-52)\n\n## Proof\n\n- `vp run knip` — exit 0\n- `vp test run test/unit` — 86 files, 1073 tests passed (includes\nlineage/waiver root-export tests, baseline CLI tests)\n- `vp exec tsc -p tsconfig.json` — exit 0\n- `vp fmt --check` / `vp lint --deny-warnings` — exit 0\n- `node dist/cli.js capabilities` still lists `baseline` among commands;\nno waiver/lineage CLI commands\n- `mfdoctor --help` still documents fingerprint `baseline\ngenerate|update|prune` only\n- Docs generation/parity/snippet/link checks passed (`generate-api-doc`,\nGerman docs, parity)\n\nThis is a breaking change only for consumers who imported those helpers\nfrom the package root. The modules remain in source.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-bba1f3f8-1bb8-4ebe-b7b6-a9cfea66ce2f?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-bba1f3f8-1bb8-4ebe-b7b6-a9cfea66ce2f&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"fca2d9f034eb5dd7d39df05defb1ed323432e488","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/t