)\n- Dual **client/SSR** lifecycle (Nuxt fires `vite:extendConfig` for both\nbuilds)\n- Adapter-default `manifest: true` and no webpack compilation stats\n\nHistorical `1.0.0` snapshots are unchanged. No architecture rewrite,\nversion bump, publish, or suppressions.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] English and German tables include a Nuxt 3/4 (**partial**) column\n- [x] `node scripts/generate-german-docs.mjs --check` (289 pages, 2\nsnapshots)\n- [x] `node scripts/check-doc-parity.mjs` (2 snapshots)\n- [x] `vp fmt --check` (pre-commit + Quality fmt)\n- [x] `vp run --filter @tonoizer/mfdoctor-docs build` (rule/api drift,\nGerman check, parity, snippets, links, rspress)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-6448a631-c85f-4ccd-850c-58912928775a?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-6448a631-c85f-4ccd-850c-58912928775a&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"7798151b4ffaeca00ffd48439dba5a984b5b90bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/7798151b4ffaeca00ffd48439dba5a984b5b90bd"},"