pi.github.com/users/tonoizer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/0b3928c7e8bdbb273cbaacf32ae0bfe93f4dde1c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:04:05Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T14:04:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test: document Modern.js App Tools lockfile trust blocker (#404)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\n## Summary\n\nBL-26 asked for a real `@modern-js/app-tools` production emit cell, or\nan honest remaining-blocker with **partial** status. This PR takes the\nsecond path after verifying the first is lockfile-blocked.\n\nI built a throwaway Modern.js 3.8.2 +\n`@module-federation/modern-js-v3@2.8.2` CSR producer **outside** this\nlockfile. `modern build` succeeded and wrote `dist/remoteEntry.js`,\n`dist/mf-manifest.json`, and `dist/mf-stats.json`. The adapter API\n(`modifyBundlerChain`) is present on App Tools 3.\n\nAdding those packages here fails `pnpm install` with:\n\n```\n[ERR_PNPM_TRUST_DOWNGRADE] High-risk trust downgrade for \"@modern-js/app-tools@3.8.2\"\n```\n\nEarlier `2.63.x` releases published npm provenance; `2.64+` and all\n`3.x` dropped it. The last provenance-attested **stable** is `2.63.3`\n(2024-12-18), which is too old to pair with Module Federation `2.8.2`.\nThe same downgrade hits at least 14 `@modern-js/*@3.8.2` packages.\nPunching that many `trustPolicyExclude` holes would weaken the\nsupply-chain policy this repo documents as exact-only (see the existing\n`vite@5.4.21` exception, which is a false positive, not a real\nprovenance drop).\n\nRebased onto latest `main` (including knip allowlist / `root.`\npreprocessor fix from #395, Rolldown lockfile snapshots,\n#397/#408/#409). Matrix status stays **partial**. No App Tools lockfile\nchange, no extra knip allowlist names from this branch.\n\n## What changed\n\n- Matrix status stays **partial**. No relabel to supported.\n- `fixtures/compatibility-matrix.json` `modern` `localCi.coverage`\nrecords the lockfile trust blocker.\n- Compatibility / limitations / integrations / README / example README\nnow pin:\n  - in-repo cell = Rspack-under-the-hood stub\n  - App Tools CI emit = blocked by `trustPolicy: no-downgrade`\n- upstream core-demo re-soak =\n[#130](https://github.com/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/issues/130)\n\n## Testing\n\n- [x] Isolated App Tools 3.8.2 production build outside the lockfile\n(`modern build` exit 0, MF artifacts present)\n- [x] In-repo `pnpm install` with App Tools 3.8.2 fails `trustPolicy:\nno-downgrade`\n- [x] German docs check, doc parity, oxfmt\n- [x] `vp run knip` (exit 0 after rebase onto main’s allowlist /\n`issue.symbol` preprocessor)\n- [x] `vp test run test/unit/capabilities.test.ts test/unit/cli.test.ts`\n(36 passed, pre-rebase)\n- [x] modern-smoke emit cell (`bundler=modern`, 0 findings, pre-rebase)\n\nNo version bump / npm publish.\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-21facd59-c6d6-4b6f-89e9-27c8c3d25016?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: 