8129","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/49b7c46d765e6e3b3eb512cd4927e12d79b28129"}],"sha":"436b02367a569ca64747c4e2698a05b80a0cee2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/436b02367a569ca64747c4e2698a05b80a0cee2b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/70775490?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tonoizer","id":70775490,"login":"tonoizer","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwNzc1NDkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tonoizer","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/commits/49b7c46d765e6e3b3eb512cd4927e12d79b28129/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-06T13:50:11Z","email":"hey@kevinbeier.com","name":"Kevin Beier"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T13:50:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: flag browser remotes that target SSR entries (#406)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements BL-32: flag browser remotes that target SSR entries, and the\nreverse when facts exist.\n\nRebased onto latest `main` (including BL-19 `#395`). Lockfile is\nunchanged vs main — the previous CI\n`ERR_PNPM_LOCKFILE_MISSING_DEPENDENCY` was a merge-commit lockfile\nsmash, not a BL-32 edit.\n\n## Why\n\nSvelteKit `remoteEntry.ssr.js` is already a unit false-positive guard\nfor `artifact/remote-entry-missing`. There was no general rule that a\n**browser** host remote URL pointing at an SSR entry (or an SSR host\npointing at a browser `remoteEntry.js`) mismatches `experiments.target`\n/ `builds.targetKind`. Dual-env Nitro client+server pairing stays\nlifecycle-tested, not this producer/consumer contract.\n\n## What\n\nNew Vite/Rspack rule `ssr/remote-entry-target-mismatch` (error):\n\n- Fires when the consumer has targetKind facts (`experiments.target`,\n`vite.target`, `ssrMode`, or unambiguous `builds.targetKind`) **and** a\nremote URL classifies as the other environment (`remoteEntry.ssr.js`,\n`/ssr/` paths vs `remoteEntry.js`).\n- Missing targetKind → skip (no finding).\n- Mixed web+ssr/node builds (Nitro dual-env) → skip.\n- Bare `builds.targetKind=node` (Vite default `ssr.target` noise) →\nskip.\n- Browser `mf-manifest.json` on node hosts stays with\n`ssr/node-remote-manifest`.\n- Existing SvelteKit SSR-suffixed producer fixture does not\nfalse-positive.\n\nNo version bump, no suppressions, no `probe`, no HTML UI / `--fix`.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `test/unit/ssr-dual-env.test.ts` — mismatch, reverse, skip/partial,\nNitro skip, SvelteKit guard\n- `test/unit/rules.test.ts` behavior fixture + catalog snapshot\n- `test/integration/evidence-rollout-bridge.test.ts` Group 1 ledger\n(project subject, not remote)\n- Inventory/docs generated for the new rule (`demo: unit`)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-dbef1940-83e2-40e1-8821-51d2ec689733?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-dbef1940-83e2-40e1-8821-51d2ec689733&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"9131eaf2bfa813f5be89fe18a89a12c865992ea7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/trees/9131eaf2bfa813f5be89fe18a89a12c865992ea7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tonoizer/module-federation-doctor/git/commits/49b7c46d765e6e3b3eb512cd4927e12d79b28129","verification":{"payload":"tree 9131eaf2bfa813f5be89fe18a89a12c865992ea7\nparent c40c8109f6b054f63498e8ddff506cfce49b005e\nauthor Kevin Beier <hey@kevinbeier.com> 1788702611 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788702611 +0000\n\nfeat: flag browser remotes that target SSR entries (#406)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_BEGIN -->\nImplements BL-32: flag browser remotes that target SSR entries, and the\nreverse when facts exist.\n\nRebased onto latest `main` (including BL-19 `#395`). Lockfile is\nunchanged vs main — the previous CI\n`ERR_PNPM_LOCKFILE_MISSING_DEPENDENCY` was a merge-commit lockfile\nsmash, not a BL-32 edit.\n\n## Why\n\nSvelteKit `remoteEntry.ssr.js` is already a unit false-positive guard\nfor `artifact/remote-entry-missing`. There was no general rule that a\n**browser** host remote URL pointing at an SSR entry (or an SSR host\npointing at a browser `remoteEntry.js`) mismatches `experiments.target`\n/ `builds.targetKind`. Dual-env Nitro client+server pairing stays\nlifecycle-tested, not this producer/consumer contract.\n\n## What\n\nNew Vite/Rspack rule `ssr/remote-entry-target-mismatch` (error):\n\n- Fires when the consumer has targetKind facts (`experiments.target`,\n`vite.target`, `ssrMode`, or unambiguous `builds.targetKind`) **and** a\nremote URL classifies as the other environment (`remoteEntry.ssr.js`,\n`/ssr/` paths vs `remoteEntry.js`).\n- Missing targetKind → skip (no finding).\n- Mixed web+ssr/node builds (Nitro dual-env) → skip.\n- Bare `builds.targetKind=node` (Vite default `ssr.target` noise) →\nskip.\n- Browser `mf-manifest.json` on node hosts stays with\n`ssr/node-remote-manifest`.\n- Existing SvelteKit SSR-suffixed producer fixture does not\nfalse-positive.\n\nNo version bump, no suppressions, no `probe`, no HTML UI / `--fix`.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `test/unit/ssr-dual-env.test.ts` — mismatch, reverse, skip/partial,\nNitro skip, SvelteKit guard\n- `test/unit/rules.test.ts` behavior fixture + catalog snapshot\n- `test/integration/evidence-rollout-bridge.test.ts` Group 1 ledger\n(project subject, not remote)\n- Inventory/docs generated for the new rule (`demo: unit`)\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-dbef1940-83e2-40e1-8821-51d2ec689733?cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_web\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-dbef1940-83e2-40e1-8821-51d2ec689733&cursor_ref=pr_footer&cursor_cta=open_in_cursor\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img\nalt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\"\nsrc=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqnW+TCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA/E4QAIHuGV95dF+UMYnCkb5mYF57\nNbDpmigoimgW7zGVpyWtgCmwetxrFyt4RB2OSUXXBrCND+dx9IL1ywtt1+YOCXHp\nqzu6XszKVpnSP72OdvOcpyd1icca24vr+tZ/VDN729IdjZNPRI6Q+azAreY4Q+Ug\nnwMWfUC1jlWaRrLnmO0395dwCSk9UZLpoahhE06MUHzL3KONVhFVOzmimiBiA+1i\nb5S37HIbmJ+CmmfGnkO5fVwnLp1adrDVuEnaG1Ydsoo+ljkyKDhgMtS8TVBDu9eG\nCxX36MjklkLLaRCRHexHE3k8wZbYS7UWsz2aa9ZDFtAD/qaZWeMoh8OwMbRyjO40\nB/S+uSI1uKcOT5CxhmN35YnqSAhhT52IWncadoVgfZsKYL4B0SECrDlZdF8bG3/P\n23ROvH8puGM77PROm2yFdJVC/i6R4UALH5Yk0PsH0rZjnKMkMmOF/A1YwVJaq0cY\nFY3y3MGUeCIGR1dOSu2QJo+DrnAQShpV9eHvJNAGw82SVCO+MD9hO9+qt7NTHmJy\nyESndbMeQsk5ZEGBVq/w9LZm66pfYXSdk10Oh0Tw2E2C/eMx8IThglAjJbAGmtbR\nhMBAXW5phGsMc0+PmGjHQCFboBt8b8UIJSOoEN+pg+ihJZFCfothOIyEnrcV5i72\nUn4yNtF9uGFEYsnLzgUq\n=uiXD\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-06T13:50:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type