or visibility\n\nAdd support for creating multiple records from a single passbook (ROR-1B) that\nlists multiple survey numbers. When a passbook with multiple parcels is\nuploaded, the user is shown a dialog asking if they want to create a separate\nrecord for each survey number. The system will create records with the same\nowner, village, mandal, and district details but different survey numbers.\n\nAlso improve error handling in file uploads by displaying the actual error\nmessage from the server instead of a generic message, helping users understand\nwhat went wrong.\n\nChanges:\n- ScanFirst.tsx: Show actual error messages from the upload endpoint\n- PropertyActions.tsx: Detect multiple parcels from passbook readings, ask user\n  to choose between creating one record per survey or using the first one only,\n  implement batch record creation with deed filing for the first record only","tree":{"sha":"1319948ce0c44f1aca54dd516e717e3ab4a28ab8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/1319948ce0c44f1aca54dd516e717e3ab4a28ab8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/cf97c64b516cee7ac95670768d2ba6065845eaf7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"s