ode_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/c776cf00583a5af0ac4e4340d97943e9fc924937/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T08:26:33Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T08:26:33Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"chore: remove apps/web-next\n\nIt duplicated apps/web closely enough that every defect had to be fixed twice\n(three in the audit alone were the same bug in both trees), and it never\nreached deployable parity — deploy.yml carried an explicit guard refusing to\nship it, and its ECS service has always run zero tasks.\n\nRemoves the app, the deploy branch that built its container and the WEB_ORIGIN\nswitch that existed only to block it, and the parity-hook and documentation\nreferences. The two design documents are marked superseded rather than deleted,\nsince they record decisions. The dormant ALB target group and web ECS service\nare left in place and flagged in the terraform README: deleting them touches\nCloudFront routing and belongs in its own reviewed change.","tree":{"sha":"36fd63845c67a8408d1552f1c2a766e9f2e3103f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/36fd63845c67a8408d1552f1c2a766e9f2e3103f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/c776cf00583a5af0ac4e4340d97943e9fc924937","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/c776cf00583a5af0ac4e4340d97943e9fc924937","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKGM3NzZjZjAwNTgzYTVhZjBhYzRlNDM0MGQ5Nzk0M2U5ZmM5MjQ5Mzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/2506a4cfdcb600be567180c6844d5daeaadfd0e6","sha":"2506a4cfdcb600be567180c6844d5daeaadfd0e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/2506a4cfdcb600be567180c6844d5daeaadfd0e6"}],"sha":"c776cf00583a5af0ac4e4340d97943e9fc924937","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/c776cf00583a5af0ac4e4340d97943e9fc924937"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/2506a4cfdcb600be567180c6844d5daeaadfd0e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T08:26:23Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T08:26:23Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"feat(audit): move the retention sweep behind the privilege boundary\n\nApplying ROLE_BOOTSTRAP_SQL takes UPDATE on audit_events_v2 away from the\napplication login, which is the point: the record of what the application did\nmust not be editable by the application. The in-process sweep was doing\nexactly that UPDATE, so it now degrades to a single explanatory log line when\nthe boundary is applied, and scripts/audit_retention.py takes the job over\nunder a pattadar_audit_maintainer login.\n\nApplied and verified against the local database: a login holding only the\nwriter role can INSERT and SELECT the trail and drain the outbox, but UPDATE\nand DELETE are refused — including through the maintenance session flag, which\nwas previously the bypass the application login could set for itself.","tree":{"sha":"e7243b48e79e702958bd429851b77fc051257ae1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/e7243b48e79e702958bd429851b77fc051257ae1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/2506a4cfdcb600be567180c6844d5daeaadfd0e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/2506a4cfdcb600be567180c6844d5daeaadfd0e6","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKDI1MDZhNGNmZGNiNjAwYmU1NjcxODBjNjg0NGQ1ZGFlYWFkZmQwZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/2dc87499628b415ebf1bc250983091e69ddfe9a8","sha":"2dc87499628b415ebf1bc250983091e69ddfe9a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/2dc87499628b415ebf1bc250983091e69ddfe9a8"}],"sha":"2506a4cfdcb600be567180c6844d5daeaadfd0e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/2506a4cfdcb600be567180c6844d5daeaadfd0e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/2dc87499628b415ebf1bc250983091e69ddfe9a8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T06:45:52Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T06:45:52Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"fix: supply chain, deployment scripts and compliance documentation\n\nCI and containers:\n- every GitHub Action in all six workflows is pinned to a commit SHA; the\n  credentialed deploy, platform-up/down and governance workflows ran on\n  mutable tags\n- the nightly governance sweep installs an exact c7n version, and installs it\n  before assuming the AWS role rather than with credentials in the environment\n- all three service containers run as a non-root user\n- dependabot covers actions, npm, pip for three services and docker, and CI\n  scans lockfiles with osv-scanner\n\nScripts:\n- AWS_DB=1 is removed: it required making the production database\n  internet-facing and pulled the RDS master credential onto a laptop\n- platform-up.sh fails before applying when the application DB password has\n  no value, instead of reporting success while every task crash-loops\n- an unconfirmed alarm subscription now fails the bring-up\n\nCompliance:\n- adds the incident-response runbook the breach-notification section has\n  been citing, covering detection, containment, scope assessment from the\n  audit chain, and the DPDP and GDPR notification duties\n- the ROPA records assistant conversations as a distinct cross-border\n  transfer; it previously named only document extraction\n- notification_log''s documented twelve-month purge is implemented in the\n  hourly sweep and tested","tree":{"sha":"79eae6e7153957f9d96f3e113d2648953a3d7c2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/79eae6e7153957f9d96f3e113d2648953a3d7c2f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/2dc87499628b415ebf1bc250983091e69ddfe9a8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/2dc87499628b415ebf1bc250983091e69ddfe9a8","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKDJkYzg3NDk5NjI4YjQxNWViZjFiYzI1MDk4MzA5MWU2OWRkZmU5YTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/b7cdf1b05fe46a7b114205b38c97a32a6ed1066b","sha":"b7cdf1b05fe46a7b114205b38c97a32a6ed1066b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/b7cdf1b05fe46a7b114205b38c97a32a6ed1066b"}],"sha":"2dc87499628b415ebf1bc250983091e69ddfe9a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/2dc87499628b415ebf1bc250983091e69ddfe9a8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/b7cdf1b05fe46a7b114205b38c97a32a6ed1066b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-20T06:33:10Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-20T06:33:10Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"fix: close the critical and high-severity findings from the platform audit\n\nSecurity:\n- village-map plot names no longer reach Leaflet as innerHTML, and the\n  server constrains them, closing a stored-XSS path to every user''s tokens\n- POST/DELETE /village-maps require the uploader or a platform admin, run in\n  a transaction and are audited; they previously had no authorization at all\n- KMZ parsing caps decompressed size, so a crafted upload cannot OOM the api\n- the gateway caps request bodies before authenticating them\n- invite and verification tokens are stored and compared as hashes, and the\n  owner''s client no longer receives the raw token\n\nData integrity:\n- update_member takes optional arguments and writes only the fields supplied,\n  so editing one field from the Expo app stops erasing family-tree links,\n  guardian contacts and beneficiary scope\n- multi-statement deletes and money/ticket mutations run inside transactions\n  and record audit events\n\nDeployment (each of these fired on the next apply):\n- Aadhaar writes are enabled, asserted at startup and guarded by a terraform\n  check, instead of raising on every write in production\n- the api reads PG_* parts for pattadar_app; the composed master-credential\n  DSN is gone, so neither the ~7-day rotation nor terraform state carries it\n- terraform no longer drags services back to the mutable v1 image tags that\n  deploy-release.py has replaced with digest-pinned revisions\n\nReliability:\n- the assistant gets a container health check; the inactivity cron and\n  healthy-host counts get alarms","tree":{"sha":"c787529a78c678074a43240c70d5869819055aec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/c787529a78c678074a43240c70d5869819055aec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/b7cdf1b05fe46a7b114205b38c97a32a6ed1066b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/use