y Telukutla"},"message":"fix(w360): stop map overlay text colliding on Location tab\n\nDrop the standing .nogeo notice on the full Location map (.plot.live): the\nrail beside the map already carries the same sentence, so the standalone box\nwas pure duplication that landed on the top-left tools or the bottom caption\nband. It still shows on the small rail-less map surfaces (record front-page\ncard, portfolio).\n\nRaise the .mapsays band floor to 4rem on every live map so a wrapping\ninstruction sentence clears the OpenStreetMap caption row, and remove the\nnow-redundant pf-stage-only override.","tree":{"sha":"df0547ffa26110bcd77c4cbba6c85ef5ca581fb0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/df0547ffa26110bcd77c4cbba6c85ef5ca581fb0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/e4520db7f749d078cc579c0a35712434fec5d57c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/e4520db7f749d078cc579c0a35712434fec5d57c","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKGU0NTIwZGI3Zjc0OWQwNzhjYzU3OWMwYTM1NzEyNDM0ZmVjNWQ1N2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/dea354a3abd7baf1c97a6bf385a06efd1b4efa0d","sha":"dea354a3abd7baf1c97a6bf385a06efd1b4efa0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/dea354a3abd7baf1c97a6bf385a06efd1b4efa0d"}],"sha":"e4520db7f749d078cc579c0a35712434fec5d57c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/e4520db7f749d078cc579c0a35712434fec5d57c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/dea354a3abd7baf1c97a6bf385a06efd1b4efa0d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T01:43:18Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T01:43:18Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"Money: add Record a purchase, filling the empty How-you-bought-it card\n\nThe Money tab showed zero for a record with no purchase on file and there was\nno way to record one — purchase lots were read-only (no mutation, no resolver\nwrite). The card''s own empty state said so. This adds the write.\n\nBackend (web360.py): save_purchase inserts a purchase_lots registration\n(owner-scoped via _record_kind, rate derived from paid/extent, audited as\nadd_purchase), and delete_purchase removes one (audited). The incoming date is\nnormalised to DD/MM/YYYY, the shape every bought_on reader expects — an ISO\nvalue would otherwise break the value view''s year slice.\n\nFrontend: useSavePurchase/useDeletePurchase hooks, a PurchaseDrawer (amount\nrequired, everything else optional), and Record-a-purchase controls on the\nMoney header and its empty state. The stale comment claiming purchases were\nunrecordable is replaced, and the header now names its two adds distinctly\n(purchase -> purchase_lots, cost -> land_expenses).\n\nVerified end to end on the running stack: record a purchase -> paidTotal,\nblendedRate and govtTotal populate, boughtOn stored 12/06/2019; delete works;\nAudit logs add_purchase/delete_purchase. Web typecheck + build pass; web360.py\ncompiles. Full DB-backed API suite not run (needs TEST_PG_DSN).","tree":{"sha":"17fde2df97a13ec83a750a19708a102b775854d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/17fde2df97a13ec83a750a19708a102b775854d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/dea354a3abd7baf1c97a6bf385a06efd1b4efa0d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/dea354a3abd7baf1c97a6bf385a06efd1b4efa0d","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKGRlYTM1NGEzYWJkN2JhZjFjOTdhNmJmMzg1YTA2ZWZkMWI0ZWZhMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/bb3cc6007cfc35275eb3ef14ac406c717d099f72","sha":"bb3cc6007cfc35275eb3ef14ac406c717d099f72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/bb3cc6007cfc35275eb3ef14ac406c717d099f72"}],"sha":"dea354a3abd7baf1c97a6bf385a06efd1b4efa0d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/dea354a3abd7baf1c97a6bf385a06efd1b4efa0d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/bb3cc6007cfc35275eb3ef14ac406c717d099f72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T00:17:54Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T00:17:54Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"Audit: log every record change and show it on the Audit tab\n\nThe Audit tab only showed field corrections (record.corrected), and the W360\nrecord mutations wrote no audit events at all, so adding a person, filing a\npaper, recording a cost or moving the pin left no trail — the tab stayed empty.\n\nBackend (web360.py): a best-effort _audit helper (mirrors _desk_read''s lazy\nmain.log_audit import; a failed audit never blocks the change) is called from\nadd/update/delete person, add/delete expense, add/update/delete feature,\nadd/update/delete paper, set_pin, set_boundary and add_photo, each targeting\nthe record id. A new record_history resolver returns every audited action for a\nrecord (reads excluded), owner-scoped through _record_kind like corrections.\n\nFrontend: useRecordHistory + the Audit tab now renders the full activity log\nwith a humanised action phrase, who did it and when, replacing the\ncorrections-only view.\n\nVerified end to end on the running stack: adding a person logs\n''add_person / Added <name> (Tenant)'' and reads back through recordHistory.\nWeb typecheck + build pass; web360.py compiles; DB-free API tests pass. Full\nDB-backed API suite not run (needs disposable TEST_PG_DSN).","tree":{"sha":"4c08e27f138b5a889b61d59b79a7a25f7caced2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/4c08e27f138b5a889b61d59b79a7a25f7caced2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/bb3cc6007cfc35275eb3ef14ac406c717d099f72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/bb3cc6007cfc35275eb3ef14ac406c717d099f72","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKGJiM2NjNjAwN2NmYzM1Mjc1ZWIzZWYxNGFjNDA2YzcxN2QwOTlmNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/f8168f90551adee755d376e2b1b8b081c4a5c152","sha":"f8168f90551adee755d376e2b1b8b081c4a5c152","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/f8168f90551adee755d376e2b1b8b081c4a5c152"}],"sha":"bb3cc6007cfc35275eb3ef14ac406c717d099f72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/bb3cc6007cfc35275eb3ef14ac406c717d099f72"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/f8168f90551adee755d376e2b1b8b081c4a5c152/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T16:21:54Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T16:21:54Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"Location: fit the map tab to the window on desktop\n\nThe map used height: calc(100vh - 13rem), guessing almost nothing sat above it;\nwith the full record header stack (~26rem) the map ran ~490px past a 900px\nwindow, and the tall rail stretched main to 1327px, so the page scrolled with a\ndead margin under the rail. Correct the map clamp offset to 26rem, and on the\ntwo-column desktop layout bound the map''s split to the viewport and let the\nrail scroll beside it (matching the photo viewer). The map''s inline 34rem floor\nis overridden only inside that bounded split so a short window still fits; the\nsplit''s own 24rem minimum keeps the map from collapsing. Below 1201px the split\nis one column and stacks/scrolls naturally, untouched.\n\nMeasured at 1440x900: vertical overflow fell from 493px to ~20px; main from\n1327px to 854px. Mobile stacks and scrolls as before.","tree":{"sha":"d6185551451c205814696c174561f74c97951f77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/d6185551451c205814696c174561f74c97951f77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/f8168f90551adee755d376e2b1b8b081c4a5c152","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/f8168f90551adee755d376e2b1b8b081c4a5c152","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKGY4MTY4ZjkwNTUxYWRlZTc1NWQzNzZlMmIxYjhiMDgxYzRhNWMxNTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/8eef16b95121346382e103b787063e643e69b858","sha":"8eef16b95121346382e103b787063e643e69b858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/8eef16b95121346382e103b787063e643e69b858"}],"sha":"f8168f90551adee755d376e2b1b8b081c4a5c152","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/f8168f90551adee755d376e2b1b8b081c4a5c152"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/8eef16b95121346382e103b787063e643e69b858/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T15:43:06Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T15:43:06Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"Photos: fix mobile layout, end-of-strip arrows, and tab-switch flicker\n\nThree defects on the Media viewer:\n\n1. Mobile — the lightbox stayed a two-column grid (photo + 24rem panel) on a\n   390px screen, so the detail panel landed on top of the image. Add a\n   max-width:900px rule that stacks it into one column at natural height, with\n   the stage divider moving from its right edge to its bottom.\n\n2. End arrows — the previous arrow rendered (greyed, disabled) on the first\n   photo and the next arrow on the last: a control pointing at nothing. Hide\n   them with visibility at the ends so the frame does not shift as they come\n   and go.\n\n3. Flicker — opening Media briefly doubled the document height (~910 -> 1879px)\n   and snapped back once the photo''s bytes and dimensions resolved, flashing a\n   scrollbar and jumping the viewport. The stage now clips (min-height:0;\n   overflow:hidden) so the fixed-height lightbox can never be pushed taller by\n   a settling image. Measured: document scroll height is now constant through\n   the switch.\n\nVerified against the running local stack at 390px and 1440px: no horizontal\noverflow, panel stacks below the photo on mobile and sits beside it on desktop,\nfirst photo shows no prev arrow, and the tab switch holds a constant height.","tree":{"sha":"4ca889d76d3f13db7c87bb6b01afd71b87851811","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/4ca889d76d3f13db7c87bb6b01afd71b87851811"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/8eef16b95121346382e103b787063e643e69b858","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/8eef16b95121346382e103b787063e643e69b858","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKDhlZWYxNmI5NTEyMTM0NjM4MmUxMDNiNzg3MDYzZTY0M2U2OWI4NTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/b4b40ac755c487a31a0d1a4e19a2f10bc9edd372","sha":"b4b40ac755c487a31a0d1a4e19a2f10bc9edd372","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/b4b40ac755c487a31a0d1a4e19a2f10bc9edd372"}],"sha":"8eef16b95121346382e103b787063e643e69b858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/8eef16b95121346382e103b787063e643e69b858"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/b4b40ac755c487a31a0d1a4e19a2f10bc9edd372/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T15:30:49Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T15:30:49Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"Photos: fit the viewer to the window, and add a full-screen theater view\n\nThe photo lightbox used height: calc(100vh - 7.5rem), which assumed almost\nnothing sat above it. The real stack over the viewer — breadcrumb, record\nidentity, fill meter, tab strip and the section head — is ~26rem, so the viewer\novershot the window by ~300px and left a page scroll and a dead bottom margin\nbelow it. Height is now clamp(24rem, calc(100vh - 28rem), 60rem), matching how\nthe boundary map sizes itself, and main drops its large scrolling bottom\npadding when it holds a lightbox. Measured vertical overflow at 1440x900 fell\nfrom 308px to ~10px.\n\nFor a focused, edge-to-edge look, a full-screen button promotes the stage to\nthe browser''s fullscreen element (its chevrons and geo stamp come with it),\npainted in the app''s own paper rather than the white default; Esc or the button\nexits, and the toggle mirrors the browser''s own fullscreen state.\n\nVerified against the running local stack: fit confirmed, the button enters\nfullscreen on the stage with the theater class applied. Headless could not\ndrive the Esc-to-exit path; the button''s exitFullscreen and real-browser Esc\nare the exit.","tree":{"sha":"d74a5ae5f9eb83a778aa96f4006656a9b83e55dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/d74a5ae5f9eb83a778aa96f4006656a9b83e55dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/b4b40ac755c487a31a0d1a4e19a2f10bc9edd372","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/b4b40ac755c487a31a0d1a4e19a2f10bc9edd372","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKGI0YjQwYWM3NTVjNDg3YTMxYTBkMWE0ZTE5YTJmMTBiYzllZGQzNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/03c68b75e0317ba37e7ee5b2f5067fb32c0f84ab","sha":"03c68b75e0317ba37e7ee5b2f5067fb32c0f84ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/03c68b75e0317ba37e7ee5b2f5067fb32c0f84ab"}],"sha":"b4b40ac755c487a31a0d1a4e19a2f10bc9edd372","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/b4b40ac755c487a31a0d1a4e19a2f10bc9edd372"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/03c68b75e0317ba37e7ee5b2f5067fb32c0f84ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T15:10:18Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T15:10:18Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"Fix web photo upload: rewrite the local-auth proxy prefix so mock-mode gets a Bearer\n\nIn local dev, AuthProvider mints its gateway Bearer from\nPOST /api/gateway/local-auth/token, but the gateway mounts that route at the\nroot (/local-auth/token) — the same path iOS and the e2e-app @live harness call\ndirectly. The Vite proxy rule for /api/gateway/local-auth forwarded without\nstripping the prefix, so the gateway 404''d the mint, AuthProvider got no token,\nand every storage upload then returned 401 — surfaced to the user as\n''The file could not be uploaded. Check your connection and try again.''\n\nStrip the /api/gateway prefix on that one proxy rule, matching how the pattadar\nrule already rewrites. Verified end to end against the running local stack:\nupload POST 200, addPhoto 200, no on-screen error; delete confirmed; the test\nphoto was removed so founder data is unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"d7932984f1ee1a2c960695025f75cc70029b586a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/d7932984f1ee1a2c960695025f75cc70029b586a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/03c68b75e0317ba37e7ee5b2f5067fb32c0f84ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/03c68b75e0317ba37e7ee5b2f5067fb32c0f84ab","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKDAzYzY4Yjc1ZTAzMTdiYTM3ZTdlZTViMmY1MDY3ZmIzMmMwZjg0YWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/d707d59373b57d549f69d526c0d4095f5914832c","sha":"d707d59373b57d549f69d526c0d4095f5914832c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/d707d59373b57d549f69d526c0d4095f5914832c"}],"sha":"03c68b75e0317ba37e7ee5b2f5067fb32c0f84ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/03c68b75e0317ba37e7ee5b2f5067fb32c0f84ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/d707d59373b57d549f69d526c0d4095f5914832c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T14:35:35Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T14:35:35Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"Add functional-acceptance skill: exercise every CRUD operation end to end\n\nA feature that typechecks, builds and renders an empty state is not proven to\nwork. There was no skill that required actually operating each create, read,\nupdate, delete and add-content path — including its failure path — before\ncalling a mutating surface done, which is how a broken photo upload passed a\nreview that only ran typecheck and build.\n\nAdds the functional-acceptance skill and wires it through the catalog, the\nportfolio and collision eval fixtures, the always-on change-governance testing\ndimension, and the web-feature-delivery handoff, so any create/read/update/\ndelete/add-content surface must have every operation exercised end to end.","tree":{"sha":"b8acbddf8d96589918d5c66cee33c356e2285442","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/b8acbddf8d96589918d5c66cee33c356e2285442"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/d707d59373b57d549f69d526c0d4095f5914832c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"l