"url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/30df80f795e34a03940e9cc547dcda5aed72597d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T13:49:31Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T13:49:31Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"Collapse Media empty state to one drop zone; add affordance/IA audit to UX skills\n\nThe Record Photos empty state rendered six near-identical drop tiles that\nall opened the same drawer and filed to the same place — one action shown\nsix ways. Replace them with a single drop zone (click or drop), keeping the\nheader''s Add photos or video button and the shared upload drawer as the only\nentry points.\n\nAlso close the review gap that missed this: design-system-governance now\nrequires an affordance/information-architecture pass that counts how many\ncontrols expose each primary action and flags duplicate/competing entry\npoints as a defect, web-feature-delivery makes that pass mandatory on any UX\nreview, and the skill-eval portfolio grades for it.","tree":{"sha":"59d71300baa92185d96544ed6203f597340b3be3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/59d71300baa92185d96544ed6203f597340b3be3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/30df80f795e34a03940e9cc547dcda5aed72597d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"h