Account\nButton/Link rows kept rendering amber beside black NavigationLink\nrows. Concrete colours win: titles in Color(.label), glyphs in the\naccent, sublines in secondaryLabel — confirmed by the screenshot tour.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7a0e2f67d04137cc9bc9589b764d702cc114d593","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/7a0e2f67d04137cc9bc9589b764d702cc114d593"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/8e76053ea729e92b8887abb73b8df33b0dd333dd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/8e76053ea729e92b8887abb73b8df33b0dd333dd","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKDhlNzYwNTNlYTcyOWU5MmI4ODg3YWJiNzNiOGRmMzNiMGRkMzMzZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/9c60165f82ddc29af289e47b1baec64982317a32","sha":"9c60165f82ddc29af289e47b1baec64982317a32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/9c60165f82ddc29af289e47b1baec64982317a32"}],"sha":"8e76053ea729e92b8887abb73b8df33b0dd333dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/8e76053ea729e92b8887abb73b8df33b0dd333dd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/9c60165f82ddc29af289e47b1baec64982317a32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-17T02:05:56Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-17T02:05:56Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"fix(ios): the app grows a pair of eyes, and what they saw gets fixed\n\nA screenshot tour (PattadarUITour) — XCUITest walking every reachable\nscreen and photographing it, because this Mac''s simulators run\nheadless and BUILD SUCCEEDED says nothing about what a screen looks\nlike. What the tour caught, fixed:\n\n- Button and Link rows wore the accent like hyperlinks beside black\n  NavigationLink rows (More, Account) — content goes primary, glyphs\n  keep the accent, and the destructive subline stops bleeding pink.\n- Zero-inset text rows clipped at the list margins (Customise intro,\n  Search footnote, Services subtitle, Share and Order headers).\n- The Services bundle card''s border was a listRowBackground trick that\n  drew clipped; it draws its own surface and border now.\n- Properties: one ground colour for the whole screen (the controls\n  band sat on white over a grey list); the hero card sheds the\n  NavigationLink chrome via the hidden-link pattern; Mine''s totals\n  card aligns to the grouped margins.\n- The 360''s pinned Share bar stacked on the tab bar — a detail hides\n  the tab bar now, which is also exactly what the comp draws.\n- Papers: no shelf section and no \"0 papers\" header on an empty vault.\n- Search opens with the field focused.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"df2e42c222c7ecaf1ff5309c23175b20dae2a7a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/df2e42c222c7ecaf1ff5309c23175b20dae2a7a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/9c60165f82ddc29af289e47b1baec64982317a32","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_