avatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/f4d08605e4fd7f01d5dac9801f6b97693ce3b68f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T23:08:14Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T23:08:14Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"feat(ios): Papers and More — the M-series shell lands (M20, M24)\n\nThe Vault tab says Papers now (the contents, not the lock) and You\nbecomes More: a hub of places — Maps, Groups, Services, Invitations,\nWallet, Tools, Audit log — with the person one push inside on a real\nAccount screen (M20): identity block with Face-ID-gated copy and an\nexpiring clipboard, app preferences (appearance applies at the root),\ndata actions, help & legal.\n\nTab case names and WidgetLink vocabulary are untouched, so installed\nwidgets keep deep-linking. The tab-bar avatar machinery goes with the\nface it drew; SampleData.swift opens the one seam every dummy-data\nscreen will feed from.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f616873e66b7a3d9fa3fef3459cb790881a978e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/9f616873e66b7a3d9fa3fef3459cb790881a978e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/f4d08605e4fd7f01d5dac9801f6b97693ce3b68f","verification":{"payload"