ree of the four paths into AddPassbookScreen (the File tab among them)\nconstructed it bare, so findExistingPassbook matched against nothing and a\nre-scan of khata 567 became twins — the exact failure the routing screen\nalready grew a fetch-fallback for after khata 5001. The same net lands\nhere: when the caller hands nothing in, the screen fetches passbooks and\nparcels itself and re-matches once they arrive. Save gets a last net too —\na tap that raced the fetch diverts to the reconcile review instead of\nwriting. Downstream already does the right things: an identical scan says\n\"Nothing has changed\", a differing one is applied row by row.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c04aa0afaa2a6a114dcd89d4cf847a30767004a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/c04aa0afaa2a6a114dcd89d4cf847a30767004a2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/75aebc262beed18ef2b86f5490058333cbcb5aa3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/75aebc262beed18ef2b86f5490058333cbcb5aa3","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKDc1YWViYzI2MmJlZWQxOGVmMmI4NmY1NDkwMDU4MzMzY2JjYjVhYTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/006355ccf56443ac18c66051e371f1e5431b02ff","sha":"006355ccf56443ac18c66051e371f1e5431b02ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/006355ccf56443ac18c66051e371f1e5431b02ff"}],"sha":"75aebc262beed18ef2b86f5490058333cbcb5aa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/75aebc262beed18ef2b86f5490058333cbcb5aa3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/006355ccf56443ac18c66051e371f1e5431b02ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T05:51:08Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T05:51:08Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"fix(ios): a tab you return to starts at its first page\n\niOS freezes each tab''s stack where you left it, so returning to Properties\nshowed a survey detail from an earlier visit instead of the list. For this\napp tabs are places, and a place has a door: the tab being LEFT resets\noffscreen (its screen identity changes), and every return lands on the\ntab''s root. The filing bounce is exempt — opening the sheet must not\nrestart the tab underneath it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"236d3d9cfd0f68efd8b0135bf42433685e7ca6fa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/236d3d9cfd0f68efd8b0135bf42433685e7ca6fa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/006355ccf56443ac18c66051e371f1e5431b02ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/006355ccf56443ac18c66051e371f1e5431b02ff","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKDAwNjM1NWNjZjU2NDQzYWMxOGM2NjA1MWUzNzFmMWU1NDMxYjAyZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/aac8cdd201dee43e0901ed962d44df039a423e10","sha":"aac8cdd201dee43e0901ed962d44df039a423e10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/aac8cdd201dee43e0901ed962d44df039a423e10"}],"sha":"006355ccf56443ac18c66051e371f1e5431b02ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/006355ccf56443ac18c66051e371f1e5431b02ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/aac8cdd201dee43e0901ed962d44df039a423e10/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T05:50:38Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T05:50:38Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"fix(api,ios): a deed''s reading becomes a job — submit fast, poll the result\n\nA phone cannot hold an HTTP response open for the minutes a deed takes to\nread: iOS background transfers hang up during the silence and silently\nre-send (one deed was read five times, delivered zero), and CloudFront caps\norigin reads at 60s in production regardless. So the import splits in two —\nimport-registered-document-async acks with a job id in seconds, and\nimport-status/{job} answers running / done / failed, holding results for 30\nminutes. The app polls every few seconds, lands the result in the same\nreview flow, and keeps the job id with the pending read so a relaunched app\nresumes the poll — \"close this and carry on\" is finally true. The web''s\nsync endpoint is unchanged. Foreground uploads also stop inheriting\nURLRequest''s 60s default, which silently beat both sessions'' configured\ntimeouts.\n\nDeploy note: the app now requires these endpoints — roll the api image\nwith (or before) any app release.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5c90a9a27ba613524860b69144330f086481768f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/5c90a9a27ba613524860b69144330f086481768f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/aac8cdd201dee43e0901ed962d44df039a423e10","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/aac8cdd201dee43e0901ed962d44df039a423e10","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKGFhYzhjZGQyMDFkZWU0M2UwOTAxZWQ5NjJkNDRkZjAzOWE0MjNlMTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/1998a2c97b371217f5acbeb3fdea45ceee74cbef","sha":"1998a2c97b371217f5acbeb3fdea45ceee74cbef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/1998a2c97b371217f5acbeb3fdea45ceee74cbef"}],"sha":"aac8cdd201dee43e0901ed962d44df039a423e10","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/aac8cdd201dee43e0901ed962d44df039a423e10"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/1998a2c97b371217f5acbeb3fdea45ceee74cbef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T05:50:06Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T05:50:06Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"feat(ios): real satellite imagery under the georeferenced FMB sketch\n\nThe imagery slot is a slot no longer: satellite mode fetches an Apple Maps\nsnapshot of the corners and draws the ring in the snapshot''s own projection,\nso the boundary lands where the ground is and the scale bar recalibrates\nfrom the ring itself. Marks earn shadows and white labels over photography.\nThe corner chip is honest in all three states — credit, loading, failure —\nand the toggle became a menu that names what is shown and offers the choice,\ninstead of a label that inverts on tap. Bhuvan tiles can replace the source\nlater without touching the drawing.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e4c6fb0426964376c0ee3117f08ed15f51e55b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/9e4c6fb0426964376c0ee3117f08ed15f51e55b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/1998a2c97b371217f5acbeb3fdea45ceee74cbef","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/1998a2c97b371217f5acbeb3fdea45ceee74cbef","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKDE5OThhMmM5N2IzNzEyMTdmNWFjYmViM2ZkZWE0NWNlZWU3NGNiZWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/cd192b7164d5eb68d33a5280e7d8ec473e713bff","sha":"cd192b7164d5eb68d33a5280e7d8ec473e713bff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/cd192b7164d5eb68d33a5280e7d8ec473e713bff"}],"sha":"1998a2c97b371217f5acbeb3fdea45ceee74cbef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/1998a2c97b371217f5acbeb3fdea45ceee74cbef"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/cd192b7164d5eb68d33a5280e7d8ec473e713bff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T05:49:57Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T05:49:57Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"feat(ios): the FMB card is named by its sheet, not its filing date\n\nDesign frame 01, applied to the map family end to end: the spine names a\nmap \"Sy. 1 sheet\" and measures the ground its ring covers (\"59.9 ac\nmapped\"), the row''s second line is grouping-aware (subdivisions under a\nproperty header, the village elsewhere), and the tile''s era is the survey''s\n— \"Re-survey\" when the paper says so, the registration year when known,\nand nothing otherwise. The filing year is gone from map tiles: an FMB\nbadged \"2026\" claimed a sheet that new.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9de07b2c655fe50755d42e4f35f086c8d0e0ed29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/9de07b2c655fe50755d42e4f35f086c8d0e0ed29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/cd192b7164d5eb68d33a5280e7d8ec473e713bff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscr