ps://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/d6fc316f48e9618cb68f2a308ba7467fe7f890bc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T00:17:33Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T00:17:33Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"fix(ios): the signed-out error is a door, not a wall\n\nLoadFailure recognises a missing session — no Cognito sign-in, a 401,\na bearer complaint — and offers Sign in on the spot, in words: ''Your\nsession ended. Sign in and your records are right where you left\nthem.'' The sign-in sheet only ever appeared on first launch, so a\nphone signed out mid-session was stranded on every tab with raw JSON.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4f3f7af7a11b97175f840c61b03a8367ce387f9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/4f3f7af7a11b97175f840c61b03a8367ce387f9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/d6fc316f48e9618cb68f2a308ba7467fe7f890bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U