s promise was broken the day it shipped. Now the Identity\nsection on the details page reads the number off the scan stored on\nTHIS phone at tap time (PDFKit text layer, nothing fetched, nothing\nstored), shows it for a minute, and copies it to a clipboard that\nclears itself after 60 seconds. The full printed address gets its own\nrow and copy button, from the reader''s address field or the key point\nthat already carries it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"65873496747ffb6ce86a03ee7d2361c32306e885","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/65873496747ffb6ce86a03ee7d2361c32306e885"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/2ed2984d1f5ff1f206fc2643891695cd4be5445e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/2ed2984d1f5ff1f206fc2643891695cd4be5445e","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKDJlZDI5ODRkMWY1ZmYxZjIwNmZjMjY0Mzg5MTY5N