ceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/efbe11bfe2ae12ca2faaaaeaedc069d5e2b9953a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T15:03:35Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T15:03:35Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"feat(ios): a paper that is not a holding files as a paper\n\nAn Aadhaar proposal opened ''New property'' — decide() sent everything\nthat was not a passbook to the property form. Deeds still route to\nproperty/parcel; identity cards, ECs, receipts, court orders and\nunplaceable papers route to a File-this-paper screen that shows the\nreading and files it into the vault on a person''s say-so.\n\nIdentity papers also learn to present as themselves: a Personal &\nidentity shelf (an Aadhaar''s village is an address, not a holding),\nrows read ''Aadhaar · <person>'' over masked number · DOB, and the\ndocument page shows the card''s own tiles — Number, Full name, Date of\nbirth, Address on card. The spine''s quantum slot carries the DOB, as\nthe founder''s spine table writes it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"89ef4dae49ceb64fe31202369ca5b6180b58574f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/89ef4dae49ceb64fe31202369ca5b6180b58574f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/efbe11bfe2ae12ca2faaaaeaedc069d5e2b9953a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercon