tarred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/6392df64faab7b399f0ffb0ba3653500e24ab89c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T14:20:00Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T14:20:00Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"fix(ios): the template''s own voice — and eight faults the review caught\n\nThe serif line says ''Sale Deed · 6337 / 2024'' the way the founder''s\ntemplate does; the four spine tiles are ONE hairline-divided box, not\nfour floating cards; the holding card no longer names its village\ntwice; the last card clears the floating tab bar.\n\nFrom the adversarial review: a sensitive identity number is masked AT\nthe spine (rows, tiles, titles and search inherit the safe form), the\nproperty shelf key is normalised so one holding is one section, numeric\nsubdivisions survive the reader spine, plot numbers and summaries are\nsearchable again, the re-mask timer cancels on toggle, a masked value\nno longer costs a field its page-tap, joint-deed rows keep distinct\nidentities, and a filter whose chip vanished resets instead of\ninvisibly emptying the vault.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2070f575f50c89e5dc72ec17704cb5c32d66f8fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/2070f575f50c89e5dc72ec17704cb5c32d66f8fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/6392df64faab7b399f0ffb0ba3653500e24ab89c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/re