ed_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/924d0bf8951f580e8f3b3b328ec610bb8b898513/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T13:57:38Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T13:57:38Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"feat(ios): the document page answers, the details page proves\n\nPage 1: the chip owns the kind, the serif line owns the identity, one\nsubline says where and when — nothing repeats. Four spine tiles (absent\nslots are absent, not blank), ONE amber review card absorbing the caveat\nprose, the watch-out line and the read-by caption — itemised, severity-\ndotted, page chips opening the scan, the reminder inside. The paper\ntrail renders the deed''s own prior-title citation (links[]-ready,\ndashed amber when missing). Delete leaves the scroll for the ⋯ menu.\nA paper filed before deep reading says so in grey, never amber.\n\nPage 2, new: every field with its page and flags; the file map merges\nconsecutive same-kind pages into runs — ''p. 3–9'', not eleven\nalternating rows — in family colour, single-run files included.\nAadhaar/PAN-shaped values render masked and re-mask 60s after reveal.\nwatch_out keeps its voice: high severity, banner-visible.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e334ad22d5f2439d735cd54672be8ca0e419958b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/e334ad22d5f2439d735cd54672be8ca0e419958b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pat