b.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/35d8096b4c9d7be45b26fc80cceb1e9de7e13fb1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T13:46:21Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T13:46:21Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"feat(ios): the vault reads the spine — four shelvings, family chips, one honest banner\n\nSpines parse once at load. Rows: family tile (kind letters + year),\ntype · identity title, mode-aware second line that never echoes its own\nheader. Group by Property (village + base survey), Type, Person (merged\non nameKey) or Recent; chips exist only for families present. The amber\nbanner counts reader-emitted review items — legacy caveats stay quiet in\nthe list and speak on the document page. vaultKeyInfo and VaultFilter\nretire; the detail headline now reads the spine too.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6ae5925e005d88e583e51fc949f7cfbceffc84d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/6ae5925e005d88e583e51fc949f7cfbceffc84d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/35d8096b4c9d7be45b26fc80cceb1e9de7e13fb1","verificatio