om/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/2b369c1da652522909b8a66bff620e0c74a2de6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T11:58:10Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T11:58:10Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"feat(ios): the app lives on production — the laptop tunnel is retired\n\nThe phone talked to a server that slept when the laptop lid closed. The\nbundle default is now https://api.pattadar.com/api/gateway/pattadar —\nthe ALB door rather than CloudFront, because a deed read runs ~90\nseconds and CloudFront caps origin reads at 60 while the ALB and\ngateway both allow 200. Identity is the Cognito token; the gateway\nstrips every identity claim a client makes. The Xcode Run scheme keeps\n127.0.0.1 for development.\n\nBuilt and installed; ngrok killed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2d803a2b375fdfb7277db1a7b0eb38ec0ce4128","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/a2d803a2b375fdfb7277db1a7b0eb38ec0ce4128"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/2b369c1da652522909b8a66bff620e0c74a2de6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations