_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/3e580a12274b713d5e23da21ec049da18c3e4937/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T06:58:41Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T06:58:41Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"fix(ios): an emptied account gets the beginning, not a void\n\nThe welcome state only appeared when documents were ALSO zero, so an\naccount with vault papers or waiting readings but no land fell into the\nnormal branch — greeting, dead chips, black screen. The gate is\nHOLDINGS now: no land shows the greeting, any readings still waiting,\nthe way in (welcome steps without a second Namaste — the greeting\nabove already greets), and a chip into the vault when documents exist.\n\nBuilt and installed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"60390e70c43e38142dd0f3ff9c2f7b65c92c4080","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/60390e70c43e38142dd0f3ff9c2f7b65c92c4080"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/3e580a12274b713d5e23da21ec049da18c3e4937","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.