he khata and whose name is on it; an FMB by the village and the\nextent it draws; an Aadhaar by name and date of birth; an unknown paper\nby whatever identifying facts its reading contains, found automatically.\nvaultKeyInfo() in the kit picks the line per kind, pinned by tests on\nthe founder''s real documents.\n\nCaveats are gone from the master list entirely — they belong to the\ndetail screen, and rows wearing warnings drowned the facts.\n\nNot built on request — batching builds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"60f56b44004c1d8688c73c06d3e66d1c53e73a14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/60f56b44004c1d8688c73c06d3e66d1c53e73a14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/469117f988ef6a09615bf8d0269b64d74154e58f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/469117f988ef6a09615bf8d0269b64d74154e58f","node_id":