 title already says. Master rows now distil\nthe columns — Sy 1 · 25.00 acres · ₹50.0L · Doc 6337 — and the full\nstory stays on the detail screen, which the founder is happy with.\nHeadline remains the fallback when a reading produced no columns.\n\nNot built/installed on request — batching builds to control cost.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e9ad23b250f8bc0830f0fc73c6a34b9130200547","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/e9ad23b250f8bc0830f0fc73c6a34b9130200547"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/a2fcc1e13e58730a2ac1a3857f716cad42c1c826","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/a2fcc1e13e58730a2ac1a3857f716cad42c1c826","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKGEyZmNjMWUxM2U1ODczMGEyYWMxYTM4NTdmNzE2Y2FkNDJjMWM4MjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/695b605a944db3da2214bbe323e20999df5938c4","sha":"695b605a944db3da2214bbe323e20999df5938c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/695b605a944db3da2214bbe323e20999df5938c4"}],"sha":"a2fcc1e13e58730a2ac1a3857f716cad42c1c826","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/a2fcc1e13e58730a2ac1a3857f716cad42c1c826"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/695b605a944db3da2214bbe323e20999df5938c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T05:48:21Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T05:48:21Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"fix(ios): the vault files by place, dates its rows, and saves amber for real warnings\n\nFive rows all titled \"ROR/Adangal\", each wearing a truncated amber pill,\nsaid nothing about any of them. Three changes:\n\n- Grouped by the PLACE the paper is about — the way a family almirah is\n  organised and the way the Properties list already groups. Documents\n  naming no place file under their own heading at the end.\n- The year sits beside the kind, because five revenue records of one\n  village are told apart by date.\n- Amber only for a caveat that names something to CHECK. The reader\n  also writes benign explainers (\"no transfer parties — this is a land\n  record\"), and a vault where every row wears amber says nothing;\n  explainers stay on the detail screen.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8cc322905be6e1eba7d94bf713481929de7f7926","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/8cc322905be6e1eba7d94bf713481929de7f7926"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/695b605a944db3da2214bbe323e20999df5938c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/695b605a944db3da2214bbe323e20999df5938c4","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKDY5NWI2MDVhOTQ0ZGIzZGEyMjE0YmJlMzIzZTIwO