dy used for needs-attention. A summary you\ncannot open is a dead end.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"628a4f2b2bde8fc0423d0d6ab1f4dadd3eb2b19e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/628a4f2b2bde8fc0423d0d6ab1f4dadd3eb2b19e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/4dbd3566a4004ec5fc62feb9585325ab6a525726","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/4dbd3566a4004ec5fc62feb9585325ab6a525726","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKDRkYmQzNTY2YTQwMDRlYzVmYzYyZmViOTU4NTMyNWFiNmE1MjU3MjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/eccfb5d514627694f3d9358d00de082d338c928b","sha":"eccfb5d514627694f3d9358d00de082d338c928b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/eccfb5d514627694f3d9358d00de082d338c928b"}],"sha":"4dbd3566a4004ec5fc62feb9585325ab6a525726","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/4dbd3566a4004ec5fc62feb9585325ab6a525726"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/eccfb5d514627694f3d9358d00de082d338c928b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T05:30:55Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T05:30:55Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"fix(ios): discard on the review card actually discards\n\nTwo faults stacked. The review queue was not @Observable, so even a\nsuccessful removal never repainted — a discard that worked looked dead.\nAnd the row''s discard was a .swipeActions, which only functions inside a\nList; the card lives in Home''s scroll view, where the swipe rendered\nand answered nothing.\n\nThe queue is observable now, and discard is a real button on the row —\nsibling to open, not nested in it — behind a confirmation, because\nthrowing a reading away should be deliberate and a stray tap should not\ndo it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"134127836cbac845fae72b05e0d1cbdbf612ea09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/134127836cbac845fae72b05e0d1cbdbf612ea09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/eccfb5d514627694f3d9358d00de082d338c928b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/eccfb5d514627694f3d9358d00de082d338c928b","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKGVjY2ZiNWQ1MTQ2Mjc2OTRmM2Q5MzU4ZDAwZGUwODJkMzM4YzkyOGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/184a1bd2a40af1a50519636c684e7069e92e0482","sha":"184a1bd2a40af1a50519636c684e7069e92e0482","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/184a1bd2a40af1a50519636c684e7069e92e0482"}],"sha":"eccfb5d514627694f3d9358d00de082d338c928b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/eccfb5d514627694f3d9358d00de082d338c928b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/184a1bd2a40af1a50519636c684e7069e92e0482/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T03:50:22Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T03:50:22Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"fix(ios): the duplicate detector always has eyes; a filed reading leaves the list\n\nTwo bugs, both found by the founder''s own data.\n\nKhata 5001 became twins because Home''s review sheet and the filing sheet\nopened AddHoldingScreen with `passbooks: []` — the duplicate detector\nhad nothing to match against, so a second reading of the same passbook\nsaved as a new one. The screen now FETCHES what exists whenever a caller\nhands it nothing; a lazy call site can never starve the check again.\n\nAnd Home''s \"read, waiting for you\" list kept documents the founder had\nalready filed. Every finished background read queues a review entry (in\ncase nobody is around), but a flow that consumed the result live never\nlearned the entry''s id — only flows STARTED from the list cleared it.\nThe reader now hands the entry id to whichever flow adopts the result,\nand every add-flow completes it on save (the property flow, which never\ncalled completeReview at all, now does).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"017f5d7ec24053b0294027deaa708488900dac5a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/017f5d7ec24053b0294027deaa708488900dac5a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/184a1bd2a40af1a50519636c684e7069e92e0482","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/184a1bd2a40af1a50519636c684e7069e92e0482","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKDE4NGExYmQyYTQwYWYxYTUwNTE5NjM2YzY4NGU3MDY5ZTkyZTA0ODI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/a8f6934fe3b1c868e969ef702ebb84d5358dea3b","sha":"a8f6934fe3b1c868e969ef702ebb84d5358dea3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/a8f6934fe3b1c868e969ef702ebb84d5358dea3b"}],"sha":"184a1bd2a40af1a50519636c684e7069e92e0482","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/184a1bd2a40af1a50519636c684e7069e92e0482"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/a8f6934fe3b1c868e969ef702ebb84d5358dea3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T02:06:38Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T02:06:38Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"fix: one extent rule for every reader; a wrong deed offers the right exit\n\nThe acres-cents rule was written into the doc-import prompt and nowhere\nelse — and the property flow reads deeds through ITS OWN prompt, whose\nschema even hard-coded the unit as \"Sq.yd\". The same deed that was fixed\nonce came back as \"25 Cents\" through the other door. The rule is now a\nsingle shared constant injected into every extraction prompt (doc\nimport, property, passbook), the property schema takes the unit AS\nWRITTEN, and the fix is proven against the real deed: /extract-property\nnow answers 25.0 Acres, \"25.00 acres (Ac.25-00) equivalent to 10.00\nhectares\".\n\nAnd when an attached deed does not match the holding, the sheet now\noffers the honest exit alongside the warning: \"This is different land —\nfile it as a NEW property\", carrying the finished reading straight into\nthe new-property form instead of forcing a bad attach or a re-scan.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6523f34f3495016a258eb731730db9cea1685ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/e6523f34f3495016a258eb731730db9cea1685ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/a8f6934fe3b1c868e969ef702ebb84d5358dea3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/a8f6934fe3b1c868e969ef702ebb84d5358dea3b","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKGE4ZjY5MzRmZTNiMWM4NjhlOTY5ZWY3MDJlYmI4NGQ1MzU4ZGVhM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/641ab368b1bf1662a464046fe837c61141eeaee7","sha":"641ab368b1bf1662a464046fe837c61141eeaee7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/641ab368b1bf1662a464046fe837c61141eeaee7"}],"sha":"a8f6934fe3b1c868e969ef702ebb84d5358dea3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/a8f6934fe3b1c868e969ef702ebb84d5358dea3b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commits/641ab368b1bf1662a464046fe837c61141eeaee7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T00:59:22Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T00:59:22Z","email":"sankara@reddy.sh","name":"Sankara Reddy Telukutla"},"message":"feat(ios): agricultural land is a property type of its own\n\nThe founder''s 25-acre deed had to masquerade as an \"open plot\" because\nthe type list had no farmland entry. \"Agricultural land\" now leads the\nlist, maps to the farmland kind (so it counts in acres on Home), and\nmanual entry defaults its unit to acres — a scanned deed''s own unit\nstill wins over the type.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"69135d1eec442260a4fb063ec02c4c11556b780a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/trees/69135d1eec442260a4fb063ec02c4c11556b780a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/git/commits/641ab368b1bf1662a464046fe837c61141eeaee7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/204504651?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh","id":204504651,"login":"reddy-sh","node_id":"U_kgDODDB-Sw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/reddy-sh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/641ab368b1bf1662a464046fe837c61141eeaee7","node_id":"C_kwDOTjOA8doAKDY0MWFiMzY4YjFiZjE2NjJhNDY0MDQ2ZmU4MzdjNjExNDFlZWFlZTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/reddy-sh/pattadar-platform/commit/939d