api.github.com/users/723malak/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/723malak","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohcinelamtanez/BanqueApp-SpringBoot/commits/ea2f2999814cb08162115abd37bac4435f759070/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T16:14:32Z","email":"malak.elkiram@gmail.com","name":"Malak Elkiram"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T16:14:32Z","email":"malak.elkiram@gmail.com","name":"Malak Elkiram"},"message":"[ADD] Frontend notifications : icone avec compteur et panneau de notifications\n\n- Ajout de notificationService.js : appels a GET /api/v1/notifications/me, GET /api/v1/notifications/me/unread-count et PATCH /api/v1/notifications/{id}/read\n- Ajout de useNotifications.js : compteur de non lues, mise a jour toutes les 30 secondes, marquage comme lu d''une notification ou de toutes\n- Ajout de NotificationBell.jsx : icone de notification avec le nombre de non lues et animation a l''arrivee d''une notification\n- Modification de NotificationCenter.jsx : icone et couleur selon le type, style different pour lu et non lu, filtres All et Unread, bouton Mark all as read\n- Modification de AdminLayout.jsx et ClientLayout.jsx : utilisation de l''icone et du panneau\n- Modification de globals.css : styles du compteur, de l''animation et du panneau","tree":{"sha":"f6b31479ffb51a9c880827a641b7bf78feceb447","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohcinelamtanez/BanqueApp-SpringBoot/git/trees/f6b31479ffb51a9c880827a641b7bf78feceb447"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mohcinelamtanez/BanqueApp-SpringBoot/git/commits/ea2f2999814cb08162115abd37bac4435f759070","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/126174902?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/723malak/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/723malak/followers","foll