ser}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/c4adcdbda85889d90b598e6db2bd0635356bf94f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:09:38Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T20:09:38Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"feat(support): add live request updates\n\nSupport request detail, the staff queue and the player''s own list now use\nHasura subscriptions (same pattern as the verification application pages),\nso replies, close/reopen and new requests appear without a reload.\n\nDetail page: no fetch on mount and no refetch after replying or changing\nstatus; the reported-player panel reloads only when the report changes;\nthe page resets when navigating between requests; a subscription error\nfalls back to one plain fetch.\n\nNo Hasura or API change: the existing select permissions already scope\nplayers to their own requests and staff to the queue.\n\nTests: component spec for live replies, ordering and no duplicates,\nclose/reopen, attachments, sender identity, and both lists.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51daf941856472d5454748982d702fe095961143","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web