},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/421346bc52242f59a9918208bb2c00105bd4fb96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:38:29Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T12:38:29Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"feat(matches): align match views with 5Stack\n\nScoreboard width\n- Keep the expanded PlayerMatchScoreboard fixed to its container: w-full,\n  min-w-0 and max-w-full on the root, tabs, tab panels and scroll wrapper.\n- PlayerMatchesTable is always min-w-0 so a wide stats table can no longer\n  widen a grid parent (tournament Matches) or the page. Wide Utility,\n  Trades and Aim tables scroll inside their own area.\n\n/matches\n- Port current 5Stack /matches: hidden h1, create button in the filter\n  bar, skeleton and filtered/empty states, and the shared neutral\n  PlayerMatchesTable via a new MatchRowsTable wrapper with per-page stats.\n- Add en strings for the empty and filtered-empty states.\n\n/watch\n- Remove the large WATCH banner and the MATCHES heading (kept as sr-only).\n- Move \"See all\" beside the scroll arrows in plain 5Stack text style.\n\nTests updated for the new structure. No API, Hasura, database, tournament,\nmatch result or season changes.\n\nPre-existing failures, identical on e0386f4f: 7 in highlights-refresh.spec.ts\nand the homepage assertion in tactical-page-header.test.mjs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a957b9705c0372dfd6fb98d1d72573ec1c7b399a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/a957b9705c0372dfd6fb98d1d72573ec1c7b399a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/421346bc52242f59a9918208bb2c00105bd4fb96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.gith