deafcs-web/commits/f946996886dc15773dbc37245c67af38dc823d8f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T23:01:07Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T23:01:07Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"feat(matches): align tournament and profile results with 5Stack\n\nReuse the shared responsive profile match rows for tournament results, with persisted pagination and page-scoped canonical rating/stat enrichment. Preserve DEAFCS mode badges, map labels, timezone tooltips, and five-player MVP rules.\n\nShow unknown scores for historical records without played maps and use explicit BO labels in related watch results. No tournament lifecycle or historical data changes.\n\nValidation: 47 focused component tests and 13 utility/timezone tests passed; Nuxt production build and diff checks passed. Full vue-tsc reports repository-wide diagnostics.","tree":{"sha":"af6fdb46fc0cd0a1a921472c5f33ac2e0bf76371","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/af6fdb46fc0cd0a1a921472c5f33ac2e0bf76371"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/f946996886dc15773dbc37245c67af38dc823d8f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events