":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/be8d1021974d674ff091efb12df9b3f1ffaf0959/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:34:41Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T21:34:41Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"feat(profile): align highlights and tournaments with 5Stack\n\nAlign the player profile Highlights and Tournaments rows and the /watch\ntournament card with current 5Stack WEB (b4b83f23), keeping DEAFCS rules.\n\nProfile:\n- Highlights use the shared ClipTile (same tile as /watch and\n  /highlights): 16:9 thumbnails, kill badge, duration chip, title, the\n  playlist queue, newest first.\n- Tournaments use the 5Stack simple 320px tiles in a scroll row via a new\n  TournamentCard wrapper, with a \"see all\" dialog and section\n  description; CheckInReview tournaments are included. Tiles show the\n  player''s finishing rank and the current stage of a running multi-stage\n  tournament. DEAFCS keeps mode-coloured badges, the Random player count\n  and Awards-system podium data (passed through to compact cards).\n\n/watch:\n- Finished cards name only the champion; 2nd/3rd stay on the\n  tournament page (results data unchanged).\n- Details/Results use the dark-grey secondary button; Register stays\n  amber.\n\nNo API, schema, tournament logic, registration, ELO or Awards changes.\n\nTests: new profile-watch parity tests (7/7); watch-page spec 25/25.\nNode suite failures unchanged from baseline (4 check-in explainer\nfailures also fail on untouched HEAD 96398157); Vitest 852/859 with only\nthe 7 pre-existing Highlights failures; Nuxt production build passes.\n\nAdapted from 5Stack WEB; MIT Copyright (c) 2025 5Stack.gg.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ef75198001e29b92d4e5e607fbf4dda4f1ddae3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/9ef75198001e29b92d4e5e607fbf4dda4f1ddae3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/be8d1021974d674ff091efb12df9b3f1ffaf0959","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/be8d1021974d674ff091efb12df9b3f1ffaf0959","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKGJlOGQxMDIxOTc0ZDY3NGZmMDkxZWZiMTJkZjliM2YxZmZhZjA5NTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https: