s{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/cc9afe4dfee62efbffe9cd1911aaf89fbd754931/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:11:26Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T20:11:26Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"fix(tournaments): show eligibility verdict and align check-in card\n\nRequest the stored-role eligibility verdict in the live tournament subscription so failed requirements render for legacy and unified registration.\n\nShare the current 5Stack before-registration card while retaining legacy timing and unified check-in states. Display local times with compact date-correct timezone tooltips.\n\nValidated with 96 component tests, responsive fixtures and a Nuxt production build. Node checks have 50 passes and two documented pre-existing organizer-form assertion failures. API and SQL remain unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"7d92d563d602aac18a0b23c9f51364d388770db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/7d92d563d602aac18a0b23c9f51364d388770db5"},"url":"https://api.githu