d":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/cd792cab7890748ade94ebf8d126ff4f22f319c3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T17:01:37Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T17:01:37Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"feat(tournaments): align public UX with current 5Stack\n\nPort the current 5Stack WEB (25dbf95d) tournament public page and bracket\npresentation, adapted to DEAFCS, and fix the Manage console remounting on\nevery section switch.\n\nPublic page:\n- Hero follows 5Stack: banner band, status / mode / category badges,\n  title, meta row (relative start, location, format, homepage, compact\n  organizer avatars), actions on the right. DEAFCS mode colours kept.\n- Homepage link only for meaningful external sites (never deafcs.net or\n  this site; unsafe or credential-carrying URLs dropped).\n- Stat bar shows date and clock; the timezone (CEST/CET from the real\n  date) moves into the hover/focus tooltip. Always-visible timezone\n  lines removed.\n- 5Stack underline tab row; the blank public \"Tournament Settings\" tab is\n  removed (rules link moved into Overview > Match Setup).\n- Chat Room becomes a header action; organizers get a Manage button group\n  whose menu jumps to Manage sections. Status actions stay in Manage.\n- Entry requirements sit under the header, above the tabs, for every\n  registration version (display only, backend-computed fields). Adds the\n  missing English entry-requirement strings.\n\nBracket:\n- Flat 5Stack match card (header strip, slot rows with seed chips and\n  score column, footer for schedule/negotiation/destinations), round\n  pills, 48px columns, gradient upper/lower headers.\n- Quiet connectors that land on the team''s slot, dashed loser drops.\n- Follow Team ring, row tint and amber path kept; off-path cards dim.\n- Public bracket never shows stage editing; empty state links to Manage.\n\nManage:\n- manage.vue persists ?section= in the page key, so section switches no\n  longer remount the page; each switch is a history entry so Back/Forward\n  work, and no-op switches are skipped.\n\nTests: new parity and Manage navigation tests; updated assertions that\npinned the old visuals/tab layout; local fixture preview for the public\npage. Node suite failures unchanged from baseline (24 pre-existing);\nVitest 820/827 with only the 7 pre-existing Highlights failures; Nuxt\nproduction build passes (6 GB heap, as in the Dockerfile).\n\nAdapted from 5Stack WEB; MIT Copyright (c) 2025 5Stack.gg.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d55539f00fb97fd98d7441dbd9c6e679e4fb039d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/d55539f00fb97fd98d7441dbd9c6e679e4fb039d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/cd792cab7890748ade94ebf8d126ff4f22f319c3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/cd792cab7890748ade94ebf8d126ff4f22f319c3","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKGNkNzkyY2FiNzg5MDc0OGFkZTk0ZWJmOGQxMjZmZjRmMjJmMzE5YzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/aa56db38a6263952e88c0371b8dcfd58cca7795b","sha":"aa56db38a6263952e88c0371b8dcfd58cca7795b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/aa56db38a6263952e88c0371b8dcfd58cca7795b"}],"sha":"cd792cab7890748ade94ebf8d126ff4f22f319c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/cd792cab7890748ade94ebf8d126ff4f22f319c3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/aa56db38a6263952e88c0371b8dcfd58cca7795b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T14:20:11Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T14:20:11Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"feat(tournaments): add manage console and bracket improvements\n\nAdd a dedicated organizer console and route creation and legacy settings links into Manage. Keep player-facing tournament pages clear of administrative forms.\n\nAdd inline stage management, preserve stage map pools, hide bracket byes, and fix selected-stage sharing and responsive controls while retaining DEAFCS Awards, mode ELO, historical rosters and Random compatibility.\n\nValidation: 101 tournament component tests, 66 WEB regression checks and Nuxt build passed. Full component suite: 817 passed; seven existing Highlights failures reproduced independently. Include the reviewed report and local visual fixtures.","tree":{"sha":"ff59b149de3f952af5d6d2051d80d3536e7ccf88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/ff59b149de3f952af5d6d2051d80d3536e7ccf88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/aa56db38a6263952e88c0371b8dcfd58cca7795b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/aa56db38a6263952e88c0371b8dcfd58cca7795b","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKGFhNTZkYjM4YTYyNjM5NTJlODhjMDM3MWI4ZGNmZDU4Y2NhNzc5NWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/6e7634d311a380c038228e6092a17015b9da04aa","sha":"6e7634d311a380c038228e6092a17015b9da04aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/6e7634d311a380c038228e6092a17015b9da04aa"}],"sha":"aa56db38a6263952e88c0371b8dcfd58cca7795b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/aa56db38a6263952e88c0371b8dcfd58cca7795b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/6e7634d311a380c038228e6092a17015b9da04aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:53:13Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:53:13Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"message":"fix(tournaments): kill wizard Next spinner lag, fix wrong \"Next LAN\" label\n\n1. The create wizard''s Next button still showed a loading spinner\n   (held for a minimum 2s by ui/Button''s minLoadingMs) on every click,\n   even after the earlier validateStep optimization. Root cause:\n   next() was async, so ui/Button auto-detects the returned promise\n   from its click handler and flashes its busy spinner for it.\n   Upstream hit this exact issue and documents the fix in a comment:\n   keep next() synchronous (void this.advance()) so the click handler\n   never hands Button a promise to react to, moving the actual async\n   validation into a separate advance() method. Applied the same\n   split here.\n\n2. The /tournaments hero now shows whichever tournament is soonest,\n   any category (from an earlier fix), but the label still\n   unconditionally said \"Next LAN\" even for an Online event -- a\n   leftover from when this component was only ever used for actual\n   LAN tournaments. Now picks the label from the tournament''s real\n   category: LAN, Location Event, or Online (the default when no\n   category fits, including none selected at all).\n\nUpdated the one test that referenced next()''s now-renamed internal\nstructure. 9/17 tournament-create-wizard tests pass (8 pre-existing\nunrelated failures from a stale attendance_open_before field rename,\ntracked separately).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"caa2f3ae27cef9a6b009402269a25c54a0028a39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/caa2f3ae27cef9a6b009402269a25c54a0028a39"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/6e7634d311a380c038228e6092a17015b9da04aa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/6e7634d311a380c038228e6092a17015b9da04aa","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKDZlNzYzNGQzMTFhMzgwYzAzODIyOGU2MDkyYTE3MDE1YjlkYTA0YWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/c0c7180890705ef4080efc4f8ef4a734d8ffae85","sha":"c0c7180890705ef4080efc4f8ef4a734d8ffae85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/c0c7180890705ef4080efc4f8ef4a734d8ffae85"}],"sha":"6e7634d311a380c038228e6092a17015b9da04aa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/6e7634d311a380c038228e6092a17015b9da04aa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/c0c7180890705ef4080efc4f8ef4a734d8ffae85/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:29:25Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:29:25Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"message":"fix(tournaments): drop redundant month, force English weekday, 24h time\n\nThree related date/time issues on the tournament list and hero cards:\n\n1. The agenda row showed weekday + month (\"SAT · SEP\") even though the\n   agenda already groups rows under a \"September 2026\" heading right\n   above them -- redundant. Now just the weekday.\n\n2. All of these date/time strings formatted with Intl.DateTimeFormat\n   using `undefined` (the viewer''s browser/UI locale), so a\n   Norwegian-language browser got \"lør.\" instead of \"Sat\". Forced to\n   \"en-GB\" everywhere this pattern appears on tournament cards\n   (TournamentAgendaRow, TournamentNextLan, WatchTournamentCard,\n   useTournamentDisplay''s shared startDay/startTime): English weekday\n   and month names, independent of the viewer''s UI language.\n\n3. \"en-GB\" rather than \"en-US\" specifically because it also defaults\n   to a 24-hour clock -- DEAFCS doesn''t use AM/PM anywhere. None of\n   this touches the actual moment being displayed: Intl only\n   localizes the text, so every time still renders in the viewer''s\n   own local timezone exactly as before.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55a57c735e55fe1713a732007b2d9a2ad6cdb4ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/55a57c735e55fe1713a732007b2d9a2ad6cdb4ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/c0c7180890705ef4080efc4f8ef4a734d8ffae85","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/c0c7180890705ef4080efc4f8ef4a734d8ffae85","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKGMwYzcxODA4OTA3MDVlZjQwODBlZmM0ZjhlZjRhNzM0ZDhmZmFlODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/25641fc1ff766fc018893ddb70b4186616b52808","sha":"25641fc1ff766fc018893ddb70b4186616b52808","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/25641fc1ff766fc018893ddb70b4186616b52808"}],"sha":"c0c7180890705ef4080efc4f8ef4a734d8ffae85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/c0c7180890705ef4080efc4f8ef4a734d8ffae85"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/25641fc1ff766fc018893ddb70b4186616b52808/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:08:49Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T12:08:49Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"message":"fix(tournaments): hero picks soonest tournament, fix missing i18n key, speed up wizard Next\n\nThree issues from live testing:\n\n1. The big hero card on /tournaments only ever considered LAN\n   tournaments, so a sooner online tournament never got the spot and\n   an older LAN one could linger there. Now picks whichever upcoming\n   tournament is soonest, any category -- `coming` is already ordered\n   start ascending. The thin-strip-vs-full-card choice (lanHero, based\n   on whether anything is live) is unaffected.\n\n2. \"0 / 4 pages.watch.events.count_teams\" -- the raw i18n key was\n   showing instead of \"teams\" because pages.watch.events.count_teams\n   was simply missing from en.json (only in_prizes existed there).\n   Added it with upstream''s exact pluralized value (\"team | teams\").\n\n3. Clicking Next on the create wizard had a perceptible lag. vee-validate''s\n   zod adapter re-parses the ENTIRE wizard schema on every\n   validateField() call (there''s no way to validate one field of a zod\n   object in isolation) -- Registration''s step check validated 9\n   fields in parallel, meaning 9 redundant full-schema parses on every\n   click, even when everything was already valid. Now runs one\n   silent validate() pass first; only falls back to today''s per-field\n   calls (with their touched/error UI) when something actually fails.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3d1a4299c42caffe4ded2e78110f62b6b69d6f88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/3d1a4299c42caffe4ded2e78110f62b6b69d6f88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/25641fc1ff766fc018893ddb70b4186616b52808","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/25641fc1ff766fc018893ddb70b4186616b52808","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKDI1NjQxZmMxZmY3NjZmYzAxODg5M2RkYjcwYjQxODY2MTZiNTI4MDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/c43e89b7b1d0f8ed4d163e2ebf317f977fe3b2fd","sha":"c43e89b7b1d0f8ed4d163e2ebf317f977fe3b2fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/c43e89b7b1d0f8ed4d163e2ebf317f977fe3b2fd"}],"sha":"25641fc1ff766fc018893ddb70b4186616b52808","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/25641fc1ff766fc018893ddb70b4186616b52808"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/c43e89b7b1d0f8ed4d163e2ebf317f977fe3b2fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:51:44Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:51:44Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"message":"feat(tournaments): rebuild the hero as a banner band over content, like 5stack\n\nDEAFCS''s tournament hero rendered the banner as a full-bleed absolute\nbackground with heavy legibility gradients and text sitting on top of\nit (min-h-[24rem], tactical corner brackets) -- a different visual\narchitecture than 5stackgg/web''s current design: one surface with the\nbanner as a plain band on top (own aspect ratio, max-h-[18.75rem]),\nidentity/actions below it, tab row at the foot. Matched 5stack''s\npattern exactly (same tournamentBannerClasses used upstream), which\nalso fixes the \"banner looks small\" complaint -- the old container''s\nmin-height made the image area proportionally tiny next to all the\noverlaid content.\n\nAll the existing business logic (join/leave buttons, organizer menu,\nstatus badge, tabs) is untouched -- only the surrounding container/\nbanner markup changed, so every v-if/handler keeps working exactly as\nbefore, just laid out below the banner instead of on top of it.\n\nVerified: 173 relevant node:test assertions pass (5 pre-existing\nunrelated failures: 4 need the sibling api-deafcs checkout this\ncontainer doesn''t have, 1 is a CRLF-sensitive regex in an untouched\nfile); visually confirmed via local build against production data,\ndesktop and mobile, for both a finished and an upcoming tournament.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3c40d530641a8646f994269a9bc2b6922913558b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/3c40d530641a8646f994269a9bc2b6922913558b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/c43e89b7b1d0f8ed4d163e2ebf317f977fe3b2fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/c43e89b7b1d0f8ed4d163e2ebf317f977fe3b2fd","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKGM0M2U4OWI3YjFkMGY4ZWQ0ZDE2M2UyZWJmMzE3Zjk3N2ZlM2IyZmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/84175012ba83a87439bc2d79ca160fe91f566d5e","sha":"84175012ba83a87439bc2d79ca160fe91f566d5e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/84175012ba83a87439bc2d79ca160fe91f566d5e"}],"sha":"c43e89b7b1d0f8ed4d163e2ebf317f977fe3b2fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/c43e89b7b1d0f8ed4d163e2ebf317f977fe3b2fd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/84175012ba83a87439bc2d79ca160fe91f566d5e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:37:38Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:37:38Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"message":"fix(tournaments): remove MatchTypeBadge/Random leftovers from list cards\n\nA line-by-line diff (CRLF-normalized) of every tournament card\ncomponent against 5stackgg/web@7eaa139b showed these five files carry\na MatchTypeBadge + \"Random\" label (and, in two cards, a\nTournamentProgress bar) that upstream never had in these spots at\nall -- confirmed absent in all four upstream source files, not just\nrelocated. Removes them from:\n\n- TournamentAgendaRow.vue (dead import only, was never rendered)\n- TournamentNextLan.vue\n- TournamentLiveFeature.vue (also drops the stray TournamentProgress\n  bar on this live-feature card)\n- TournamentQuickLook.vue\n- WatchTournamentCard.vue (also drops its TournamentProgress bar;\n  kept tournamentRegistrationCount, the Paused-state handling and the\n  podium/live-quick-action additions -- those are real DEAFCS\n  functionality, not cosmetic drift, and nothing in 5stack''s source\n  replaces them)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"546278e5c930df6b9615fc9984252cec1775a8dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/