.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/54bcd31e111f6f666ecfdd28e5586c327431fcf2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:20:28Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:20:28Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"message":"fix(tournaments): drop the create-page banner title, shrink sidebar rows\n\nTwo more gaps from screenshot comparison against 5stack.gg:\n\n1. pages/tournaments/create.vue showed a large visible \"CREATE\n   TOURNAMENT\" TacticalPageHeader banner above the wizard; 5stack has\n   no visible page title there at all, just an sr-only <h1> for\n   accessibility. Matched that exactly (same pattern already used by\n   upstream''s create.vue).\n\n2. The step sidebar''s rows (padding, badge size, label font-size) were\n   noticeably larger than 5stack''s -- tightened padding (px-4 py-3 ->\n   px-3 py-2), badge (h-7 w-7 -> h-6 w-6), and label size (text-sm ->\n   0.8rem) to match.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0db673c97b238fd8d9935ec79dd244e0eaf60da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/e0db673c9