ub.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/3c43f9e74691f828cebaa2a723d639f096d5806e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:04:11Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T11:04:11Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"message":"feat(tournaments): match 5stack''s create-wizard step order and sidebar layout\n\nTwo concrete gaps from a side-by-side screenshot comparison against\n5stack.gg/tournaments/create:\n\n1. Step order: Registration now comes before Match Options (was the\n   reverse). Matches 5stack''s Information -> Location -> Registration\n   -> Match Options -> Prizes -> (Stages/Awards) order, and makes more\n   sense functionally -- who can register (teams/free agents/both)\n   frames which match settings even apply.\n\n2. Step indicator: rebuilt as a left-hand sidebar (sticky, vertical)\n   on desktop, matching 5stack''s layout, instead of a horizontal pill\n   row across the top. Falls back to a horizontal scroller below the\n   lg breakpoint, since a 6-item vertical list doesn''t fit a phone\n   screen. Kept DEAFCS''s own amber/tactical colour scheme throughout --\n   only the structural layout changed, not the visual identity.\n\nvalidateStep''s registration-fields branch and the step-order\nregression test (test/tournament-create-wizard.test.mjs) are updated\nto match the new indices.\n\nVerified: 59/59 tournament component tests pass, create-wizard step\ntests pass (8 pre-existing unrelated failures from a stale\nattendance_open_before field rename, tracked separately), full\nproduction Docker build succeeds.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d0af1efeda3be71266d78de181aa3cd67a91d1d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/d0af1efeda3be71266d78de181aa3cd67a91d1d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/3c43f9e74691f828cebaa2a723d639f096d5806e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/3c43f9e74691f828cebaa2a723d639f096d5806e","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKDNjNDNmOWU3NDY5MWY4MjhjZWJhYTJhNzIzZDYzOWYwOTZkNTgwNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/362a0daa3816477bf98f9e5a19dcd36a21006991","sha":"362a0daa3816477bf98f9e5a19dcd36a21006991","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/362a0daa3816477bf98f9e5a19dcd36a21006991"}],"sha":"3c43f9e74691f828cebaa2a723d639f096d5806e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/3c43f9e74691f828cebaa2a723d639f096d5806e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/362a0daa3816477bf98f9e5a19dcd36a21006991/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:46:40Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:46:40Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"message":"feat(tournaments): remove the legacy random/individual-registration toggle\n\nDeletes the \"Individual Registration\" (Random) switch from the shared\nMatchOptions form, which was the only remaining way to put a NEW\ntournament into the old random-pick mode. It was shown in both\nTournamentCreateWizard and TournamentMatchOptionsForm (edit), gated\nby canSetIndividualRegistration / lockSubstitutes -- tournament scope\nonly, never shown for regular matches or scrims.\n\nGoing forward, Team / Free Agent / Both (TournamentRegistrationForm''s\nregistration_type picker, already fully built and translated) is the\nonly way to configure who can register for a tournament.\n\nExisting tournaments are unaffected: registration_version stays 1 for\neverything created before the free-agent migration, and their stored\noptions.individual_registration_enabled value is untouched (nothing\nresets it on save -- the field just has no control to flip it\nanymore). The randomPreset compatibility branch in\nTournamentRegistrationForm.vue still renders correctly when an old\nrandom tournament is edited.\n\nVerified: 59/59 tournament component tests pass, full production\nDocker build succeeds, legacy \"5v5 Random\" tournaments still render\ncorrectly on /tournaments.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1f7fc7e92d53f7d1fca1a50935365ee106f432e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/1f7fc7e92d53f7d1fca1a50935365ee106f432e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/362a0daa3816477bf98f9e5a19dcd36a21006991","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/362a0daa3816477bf98f9e5a19dcd36a21006991","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKDM2MmEwZGFhMzgxNjQ3N2JmOThmOWU1YTE5ZGNkMzZhMjEwMDY5OTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/882e4c8deef59afed73bedc3e66a04703adab96a","sha":"882e4c8deef59afed73bedc3e66a04703adab96a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/882e4c8deef59afed73bedc3e66a04703adab96a"}],"sha":"362a0daa3816477bf98f9e5a19dcd36a21006991","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/362a0daa3816477bf98f9e5a19dcd36a21006991"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/882e4c8deef59afed73bedc3e66a04703adab96a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:20:16Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T10:20:16Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"message":"fix(notifications): stop a dismissed friend request from reappearing\n\nActionToasts aggregates several independent async sources (friends\nsubscription, draft/team/tournament invites, lobby invites, match\nactions). Its auto-clear-on-resolve watcher compared a dismissed id\nonly against the current items snapshot: if any OTHER source changed\nbefore the friends subscription had loaded, the friend request\nlooked \"gone\" from that partial snapshot and its dismissal got\ncleared (and persisted) for good, even though the request was still\npending. Once the friends data actually arrived moments later, the\ntoast reappeared -- exactly reproducible on a refresh or any\nnavigation that re-triggers the initial load ordering.\n\nOnly clear a dismissed id on an actual present-to-absent transition\n(present in the previous items snapshot, absent from the current\none), not merely because it''s missing from whichever partial\nsnapshot happened to trigger this run.\n\nAdded a regression test: dismiss a friend request, then load an\nunrelated notification source -- the friend toast must stay hidden\nuntil the friend request is genuinely resolved.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"62359eb002476cd14ed307e76e6dd5c79fd20416","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/62359eb002476cd14ed307e76e6dd5c79fd20416"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/882e4c8deef59afed73bedc3e66a04703adab96a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/use