ions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/1bba50e930a334c6b2d2830b0915432cd1f3ad72/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:53:33Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:53:33Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"message":"fix(build): raise Node heap limit for the production Docker build\n\nThe theater-mode clip bundle pushes the Vite client build past Node''s\ndefault old-space heap limit inside the alpine container, OOMing\npartway through transform. Bump max-old-space-size so the image can\nactually be built.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"05ee47f5f35603948749ffbbf47a77c60100ed0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/05ee47f5f35603948749ffbbf47a77c60100ed0c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/1bba50e930a334c6b2d2830b0915432cd1f3ad72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/1bba50e930a334c6b2d2830b0915432cd1f3ad72","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKDFiYmE1MGU5MzBhMzM0YzZiMmQyODMwYjA5MTU0MzJjZDFmM2FkNzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/284dce5ea90feac8ae163725e8b3dcae0ef5a94e","sha":"284dce5ea90feac8ae163725e8b3dcae0ef5a94e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/284dce5ea90feac8ae163725e8b3dcae0ef5a94e"}],"sha":"1bba50e930a334c6b2d2830b0915432cd1f3ad72","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/1bba50e930a334c6b2d2830b0915432cd1f3ad72"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/284dce5ea90feac8ae163725e8b3dcae0ef5a94e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:47:53Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T09:47:53Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"message":"feat(clips): port 5stack theater-mode clip detail view for 1:1 parity\n\nReplace ClipDetailModal.vue and ClipTile.vue with upstream''s\nredesigned theater-mode versions (5stackgg/web@b1b85663) so\n/watch?clip=... matches 5stack.gg/watch?clip=... exactly, per\nTheft''s request to check 5stack''s clip-detail coding for parity.\n\nAdd the new ClipKillBadge.vue component and update clipDisplay.ts\nto upstream''s current version (needed for ClipKillTier support),\nwhile keeping highlightCells() so the existing watch-page grid\n(WatchHighlights.vue) keeps working unchanged.\n\nRe-synced i18n locale files against upstream key additions via a\ndeep JSON merge (key-reordering only, no content conflicts).\n\nVerified via full Docker build (yarn build succeeds, no missing\ndependencies).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5d103e3797552759fe24c38ad5b56248fccce681","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/5d103e3797552759fe24c38ad5b56248fccce681"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/284dce5ea90feac8ae163725e8b3dcae0ef5a94e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://