riconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T19:12:17Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"feat(tournaments): adopt new tournament experience\n\nAdd unified registration, free-agent and party views, invitation management, scheduled check-in review, tournament discovery and quick-look cards. Share tournament presentation with Watch while preserving DEAFCS detail, chat, Awards, and Highlights behavior.\n\nInclude regenerated API bindings, scoped incoming invitation notifications, responsive preview fixtures, regression coverage, and the local migration/rollback safety report. Exclude .claude/launch.json.\n\nValidation: full WEB suite 792/792 before final cleanup; affected tournament/Watch checks 52/52 after cleanup; final Nuxt production build and whitespace checks passed. Responsive component previews checked at 1440, 1280, 768 and 375 pixels.","tree":{"sha":"d46e3125e198f071de54f0383e12d62eb3095433","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/d46e3125e198f071de54f0383e12d62eb3095433"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/d451aa3d676f37e81dc559d8741b5b7ab397cecf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/d451aa3d676f37e81dc559d8741b5b7ab397cecf","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKGQ0NTFhYTNkNjc2ZjM3ZTgxZGM1NTlkODc0MWI1YjdhYjM5N2NlY2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/07bf17f3d7ed744a6e2556ac396a7cbe5f1b2848","sha":"07bf17f3d7ed744a6e2556ac396a7cbe5f1b2848","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/07bf17f3d7ed744a6e2556ac396a7cbe5f1b2848"}],"sha":"d451aa3d676f37e81dc559d8741b5b7ab397cecf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/d451aa3d676f37e81dc559d8741b5b7ab397cecf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/07bf17f3d7ed744a6e2556ac396a7cbe5f1b2848/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:06:35Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T14:06:35Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"feat(tournaments): expand tournament setup and competition views\n\nTournament setup and page, using 5Stack''s 2026-10-04 tournament redesign\nas the reference (MIT; adapted to DEAFCS, not copied wholesale):\n\n- Substitutes Enabled ON/OFF in create and edit (hidden for Duel). The\n  allowance stays the global team substitute setting; edit locks it from\n  being turned off once registration has closed, like the API.\n- Overview: progress strip (stage, round, matches played, live now, next\n  start, links to Bracket/Matches) and a Match Setup card (mode badge in\n  DEAFCS colours, format, BO per stage, veto, substitutes, maps, full\n  settings). Match settings show the effective substitute count.\n- Bracket is its own tab; a Matches tab lists every tournament match as\n  DEAFCS match rows with All / Live / Upcoming / Results filters.\n- Follow team: pick a team to ring its bracket cards and draw its path.\n- generated/zeus: substitutes_enabled added in codegen''s shape; regenerate\n  from the live schema once the API is deployed.\n\nNot ported: 5Stack''s entry gate and check-in panel/review (per-player\nroster check-in and ELO entry limits; DEAFCS keeps its attendance system),\nmanage console, rewritten bracket card, and the Watch events stepper.\nDEAFCS attendance, Solo Random, mode badges and /watch are unchanged.\n\nRequires the API commit (tournaments.substitutes_enabled) to be deployed\nfirst.\n\nTests: new tournament-substitutes (9) and tournament-ux (17) specs; full\nVitest 783/783; tournament node tests 261/262 (1 pre-existing failure,\nidentical on HEAD); Nuxt build PASS.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a745d153e112d24e86db1bfce0b3864391ac0d3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/a745d153e112d24e