77576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/030bc1c8909649dd852ff8a1edd4a50e24152014/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:57:59Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:57:59Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"feat(matches): add ELO void action and improve veto ban labels\n\n- Void ELO: administrators get \"Void ELO\" in the match ... menu, between\n  Cancel and Delete, on Finished / Forfeit / Tie / Surrendered matches whose\n  ELO is not voided yet (organizers and players never see it). It opens a\n  confirmation (\"Void ELO?\" / \"Remove the ELO changes from this match? The\n  match, score, stats, highlights and demo will stay.\" / Cancel, Void ELO)\n  and only the confirm button sends voidMatchElo(match_id); success shows\n  \"ELO voided\", errors show the API message. The match page subscribes to\n  matches.elo_voided so the item hides afterwards. voidMatchElo and\n  elo_voided are newer than the generated client (any-cast like\n  map_veto_sequence); run codegen after the API release.\n- Veto: a banned map card no longer dims as a whole. Only the poster goes\n  dark and grey (the name keeps its line-through), so the BANNED . T1/T2\n  tag stays fully bright in its red tone. No layout change.\n\nRequires the API release with matches.elo_voided first: the match page\nsubscription selects it.\n\nTests: new match-actions-void-elo spec and a banned-tag regression; full\nVitest 439 passed; Nuxt production build and git diff --check pass. Node\nscript failures are the same 10 as on origin/main.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f749a46931341d4419eba4b8234fb435962ded4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/f749a46931341d4419eba4b8234fb435962ded4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/030bc1c8909649dd852ff8a1edd4a50e24152014","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.co