ss the Captain Pick Overview pool and team panels, preserving country flags, avatars, roles, ratings and same-context profile routes. Ignore stale enrichment responses when the match scope changes.\n\nKeep selectable cards as pick surfaces and add a separate profile control that stops propagation. Preserve draft authority, mutations, timers and auto-picks.\n\nValidation: 29 focused tests and 419/419 Vitest tests passed; diff checks passed.","tree":{"sha":"bb28cba343e92620151a8a89fe5a99778d68cfd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/bb28cba343e92620151a8a89fe5a99778d68cfd0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/466a3fc128ed831fde1c6396f44f96bfa907275c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/466a3fc128ed831fde1c6396f44f96bfa907275c","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKDQ2NmEzZmMxMjhlZDgzMWZkZTFjNjM5NmY0NGY5NmJmYTkwNzI3NWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/53cea70deeba5f492e30a08323a15d482bd1bb50","sha":"53cea70deeba5f492e30a08323a15d482bd1bb50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/53cea70deeba5f492e30a08323a15d482bd1bb50"}],"sha":"466a3fc128ed831fde1c6396f44f96bfa907275c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/466a3fc128ed831fde1c6396f44f96bfa907275c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/53cea70deeba5f492e30a08323a15d482bd1bb50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:04:03Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T14:04:03Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"fix(matches): gate clip render subscription for guests","tree":{"sha":"8788c413af64fac669e3b49cbbb1fe4494e721ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/8788c413af64fac669e3b49cbbb1fe4494e721ef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/53cea70deeba5f492e30a08323a15d482bd1bb50","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/53cea70deeba5f492e30a08323a15d482bd1bb50","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKDUzY2VhNzBkZWViYTVmNDkyZTMwYTA4MzIzYTE1ZDQ4MmJkMWJiNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/d6637f63c20ef8bd5bee48df3b82b6a09a9dadab","sha":"d6637f63c20ef8bd5bee48df3b82b6a09a9dadab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/d6637f63c20ef8bd5bee48df3b82b6a09a9dadab"}],"sha":"53cea70deeba5f492e30a08323a15d482bd1bb50","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/53cea70deeba5f492e30a08323a15d482bd1bb50"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/d6637f63c20ef8bd5bee48df3b82b6a09a9dadab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:23:38Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:23:38Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"fix(matches): polish live overview interactions\n\nFour issues found in live testing of the match Overview.\n\n- Player profile links stay in the same context. The Overview team panels,\n  Captain Pick pool and check-in rows opened profiles with target=\"_blank\",\n  which moved website users into the installed app (and app users out of\n  it). They now use the site''s normal PlayerDisplay/NuxtLink navigation.\n- Players check-in rows use PlayerDisplay''s existing dense layout, so the\n  name + role block is centered against the avatar. Readiness unchanged.\n- Match action popups through the existing ActionToasts, driven only by\n  the server''s flags on MatchLobbyStore.myMatches (adds can_check_in and\n  lineup is_ready to that subscription): \"Match check-in is open\" for an\n  eligible player who has not checked in while the team still needs it,\n  and region/map veto (side picks included) for the lineup whose turn it\n  is. One stable id per match and action (no repeats on subscription\n  updates; a dismissal holds for that action), hidden while on that match\n  page or draft room, single Open Match action. Spectators, organizers not\n  playing and guests get none. Phones show these match popups; invites\n  stay desktop-only. ToastCard gains optional acceptLabel/hideDecline.\n- CT/T side choice takes the measured map-grid footprint (fallback: the\n  shape a three-column grid of the pool has), with slightly smaller CT/T\n  cards; map background and name kept. Side-pick logic, confirmation,\n  mutation and timers unchanged.\n\nNo API, Hasura or schema change; the new myMatches fields were checked\nread-only against production Hasura for every signed-in role.\n\nTests: focused 119 passed; full Vitest 399 passed; Nuxt production build,\ngit diff --check and em-dash scan pass. Node script failures are the same\n10 as on origin/main.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"40cf8007a82516c017f09d541b7e6089b60906f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/40cf8007a82516c017f09d541b7e6089b60906f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/d6637f63c20ef8bd5bee48df3b82b6a09a9dadab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/d6637f63c20ef8bd5bee48df3b82b6a09a9dadab","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKGQ2NjM3ZjYzYzIwZWY4YmQ1YmVlNDhkZjNiODJiNmEwOWE5ZGFkYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/f336eb4b24ef67b6627987635f57ea703f6bff04","sha":"f336eb4b24ef67b6627987635f57ea703f6bff04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/f336eb4b24ef67b6627987635f57ea703f6bff04"}],"sha":"d6637f63c20ef8bd5bee48df3b82b6a09a9dadab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/d6637f63c20ef8bd5bee48df3b82b6a09a9dadab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/f336eb4b24ef67b6627987635f57ea703f6bff04/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:43:34Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:43:34Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"feat(matches): unify scheduled match lifecycle and negotiation\n\nMatch Overview\n- Scheduled matches open on the Overview. A new schedule stage shows the\n  committed scheduled_at in the viewer''s timezone with a \"Starts in\"\n  countdown (never the bracket''s scheduled_eta projection), pending\n  re-scheduling proposals with the existing Accept/Decline, and the\n  organizer''s existing ScheduleMatch controls. Only the server moves the\n  match on (check-in, region, veto); the page never transitions itself.\n- Post-veto server panel is the Scoreboard''s own MatchInfo/QuickMatchConnect\n  (new opt-in lifecycle mode): Server Booting from the end of the veto,\n  then Time to Connect and Copy IP / Join Server in the same place. The\n  separate \"Server ready\" bar is removed. Connect and TV details still need\n  a signed-in viewer and Hasura''s connection fields.\n- Players check-in uses a two-column grid (Team 1 left, Team 2 right) with\n  one compact row per player; Captains/Admin check-in unchanged.\n- Active veto: picked maps and the decider show \"{team} starts CT\" from\n  their match_maps sides (set by create_match_map_from_veto).\n- A remembered server-ready moment is dropped whenever the server puts the\n  match in a pre-server stage, so a restarted/reset match gets a fresh\n  30 second handoff; viewers already on the Scoreboard return to the\n  Overview on a live pre-match -> pre-server transition.\n- Overview player cards, the Captain Pick pool and the check-in grid link\n  to player profiles (new tab) and show the existing role icons, via\n  opt-in linkable/showRole props (draft room cards unchanged).\n\nNegotiated scheduling (non-league tournaments)\n- Bracket cards in a negotiated tournament get a Schedule surface before\n  and after the match exists: proposal state visible to everyone; team\n  managers (owner, captain, roster Admin) and administrators can propose,\n  accept, counter or decline through the league schedule''s existing\n  league_scheduling_proposals mutations and ProposeTimeDialog, within the\n  stage window or the next two weeks, as the triggers enforce.\n- The first accepted proposal creates the Scheduled match through the\n  existing backend; it then opens on the Overview schedule stage. Leagues\n  keep the league schedule; auto/fixed tournaments and the organizer''s\n  bracket schedule dialog are unchanged. No API, Hasura or schema change.\n\nTests: focused Overview/scheduling/negotiation 108 passed; full Vitest 388\npassed; Nuxt production build and git diff --check pass. Node script\nfailures are the same 10 as on origin/main. Proposal flow for a\nnon-league negotiated tournament verified against the real triggers on a\nmigrated test database; new subscription fields checked read-only against\nproduction Hasura for all roles.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"79c7b1052e2aecdc69667bc2efa850675d429004","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/79c7b1052e2aecdc69667bc2efa850675d429004"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/f336eb4b24ef67b6627987635f57ea703f6bff04","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"