:"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/4e0cf6bdaa1940eb8fc08f2836de127fd71b3fb5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:00:14Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T09:00:14Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"message":"fix: fetch default game-type configs from DEAFCS''s own game-server repo\n\nThe game-type-configs settings page''s \"default config\" / \"revert to\ndefaults\" fetched from 5stackgg/game-server''s upstream shared/cfg\nfiles, which have drifted from DEAFCS''s own values (e.g. 5stackgg now\nships 3x31s team timeouts, DEAFCS runs 4x30s). Point it at DEAFCS''s own\ngame-server repo instead so defaults match what''s actually deployed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a8090615e3dea62c1fd8f63d1dc178d37f50bfef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/a8090615e3dea62c1fd8f63d1dc178d37f50bfef"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/4e0cf6bdaa1940eb8fc08f2836de127fd71b3fb5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/4e0cf6bdaa1940eb8fc08f2836de127fd71b3fb5","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKDRlMGNmNmJkYWExOTQwZWI4ZmMwOGYyODM2ZGUxMjdmZDcxYjNmYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/f149bcc24cdd7a2a878b5d0bdd67eee0998e609a","sha":"f149bcc24cdd7a2a878b5d0bdd67eee0998e609a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/f149bcc24cdd7a2a878b5d0bdd67eee0998e609a"}],"sha":"4e0cf6bdaa1940eb8fc08f2836de127fd71b3fb5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/4e0cf6bdaa1940eb8fc08f2836de127fd71b3fb5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/f149bcc24cdd7a2a878b5d0bdd67eee0998e609a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T00:26:09Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T00:26:09Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"refactor(matches): refine veto dismissal and server-ready handoff\n\nVeto confirmation: drop the Cancel button. The selected map card (or\nCT/T choice) shows one centered Confirm, which takes focus. Any press\noutside the card, a click on the card outside Confirm, or Escape cancels;\npressing another map cancels the first and its click selects normally.\nDismissal never submits.\n\nScoreboard handoff: no longer counted from matches.started_at (veto\ncompletion). The Overview stays up while the server prepares, and the\nhidden 30 second handoff starts when the server is ready: the same state\nin which QuickMatchConnect offers Join Server / Copy IP (Live, server\nassigned, is_server_online). There is no server timestamp for that\nmoment, so the first time a device sees it is remembered per match in\nlocalStorage: a refresh continues the window, after it lands on the\nScoreboard. Once a map leaves Warmup everyone switches at once. No timer\nor message is shown.\n\nTabs: the Overview tab is staff-only (moderator and up, the Admin tab''s\nstaff line). Non-staff get no Scoreboard tab or tab row while the pre-game\nOverview is the lifecycle''s view; after the handoff (and on live/finished\nmatches) Scoreboard is back so they can return from Economy, Clutches etc.\nMatch organizers, captains and players are not staff for this.\n\nWEB only. Captain Pick, veto and CT/T timers and backend auto-veto are\nunchanged.\n\nTests: match-overview.spec.ts updated (dismissal, server-ready handoff,\nrefresh, play cutoff, tab rule per role; role stub aligned to AuthStore''s\norder). Full Vitest 347/347, Nuxt production build and git diff --check\npass. Node scripts: same two baseline failures (match-detail-layout-width,\nmatch-overview-drawer).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2dfd23da53625bb719435e29fbda88f038558abe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/2dfd23da53625bb719435e29fbda88f038558abe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/f149bcc24cdd7a2a878b5d0bdd67eee0998e609a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/f149bcc24cdd7a2a878b5d0bdd67eee0998e609a","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKGYxNDliY2MyNGNkZDdhMmE4NzhiNWQwYmRkNjdlZWUwOTk4ZTYwOWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/0d06ded91b8d239b5410e790655f099d76a004d6","sha":"0d06ded91b8d239b5410e790655f099d76a004d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/0d06ded91b8d239b5410e790655f099d76a004d6"}],"sha":"f149bcc24cdd7a2a878b5d0bdd67eee0998e609a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/f149bcc24cdd7a2a878b5d0bdd67eee0998e609a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/0d06ded91b8d239b5410e790655f099d76a004d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T23:53:58Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T23:53:58Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"refactor(matches): refine Overview banner and veto confirmation\n\nArrange lifecycle actions, region/progress and authoritative action timers in a three-column banner. Center veto cards and server/connect content, confirm actions inside the selected card, and keep the Scoreboard handoff silent. Preserve organizer/manual navigation and existing permissions.\n\nValidation: 89 focused tests and 345 full Vitest tests passed; Nuxt build and git diff --check passed. Relevant Node scripts: 36 passed, 2 known baseline failures unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"1a190be0657db9f9aeaedf5ed74e257047a944bd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/1a190be0657db9f9aeaedf5ed74e257047a944bd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/0d06ded91b8d239b5410e790655f099d76a00