gs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/363644082ce99c2a6556d44720658a06bb0ffb9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T20:29:04Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T20:29:04Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"feat(matches): show live Captain Pick spectator progress\n\nDisplay the public Captain Pick feed above the existing match tabs while PickingPlayers, with captains, picked rosters, current turn and available players. Reuse draft display components without pick controls or private chat.\n\nScope EventSource updates to the current match, resync on reconnect, clear stale state and restore the current match view on completion. Preserve participant workflow and existing permissions.\n\nValidation: 280 Vitest tests, final Nuxt production build and diff check pass. Five relevant node scripts pass; two pre-existing failures reproduce against origin/main.","tree":{"sha":"f6beda52c0ae0ea004952de77f4461b8ba363953","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/f6beda52c0ae0ea004952de77f4461b8ba363953"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/363644082ce99c2a6556d44720658a06bb0ffb9c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"h