om/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/754e5531ae2f9c44dffb60c76ac0e57397b8170f","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKDc1NGU1NTMxYWUyZjljNDRkZmZiNjBjNzZhYzBlNTczOTdiODE3MGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/6119ccc4c2903310d6a0deb1f5a4b61259d040eb","sha":"6119ccc4c2903310d6a0deb1f5a4b61259d040eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/6119ccc4c2903310d6a0deb1f5a4b61259d040eb"}],"sha":"754e5531ae2f9c44dffb60c76ac0e57397b8170f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/754e5531ae2f9c44dffb60c76ac0e57397b8170f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/6119ccc4c2903310d6a0deb1f5a4b61259d040eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:52:07Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:52:07Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"fix(matches): harden captain pick status detection\n\n- Track whether the API has actually answered for the match on screen\n  (resolved). While a PickingPlayers match''s answer is pending,\n  retrying or never came, manual lineup edits stay locked; only a\n  settled \"not a Captain Pick match\" unlocks them, so ordinary custom\n  PickingPlayers matches unlock normally.\n- The match shell can be visible a moment before the server records\n  which draft it belongs to, so a \"no\" is asked again: at most 3\n  requests, 1.5 s apart. A \"yes\" is final and stops asking. A pending\n  retry is canceled when the match changes, leaves PickingPlayers, or\n  the page goes away.\n- Participant Match Chat still needs the API''s positive answer for\n  this match; nothing opens while it is unresolved.\n- The match page''s inline shared room is labeled Match Chat (only this\n  match) instead of Global Chat; same match room underneath.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bf53dbc7378ef1638d22ca6b2cca3558c24c31b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/bf53dbc7378ef1638d22ca6b2cca3558c24c31b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/6119ccc4c2903310d6a0deb1f5a4b61259d040eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/6119ccc4c2903310d6a0deb1f5a4b61259d040eb","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKDYxMTljY2M0YzI5MDMzMTBkNmEwZGViMWY1YTRiNjEyNTlkMDQwZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/31d1fce7f0d5f628e3bdc929280479ff714e3858","sha":"31d1fce7f0d5f628e3bdc929280479ff714e3858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/31d1fce7f0d5f628e3bdc929280479ff714e3858"}],"sha":"6119ccc4c2903310d6a0deb1f5a4b61259d040eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/6119ccc4c2903310d6a0deb1f5a4b61259d040eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/31d1fce7f0d5f628e3bdc929280479ff714e3858/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:24:26Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:24:26Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"fix(matches): captain pick match chat and lineup lock on the match page\n\nThe match page now asks the API (matchmaking:captain-pick:match-status)\nwhether the match on screen is an active Captain Pick draft''s match and\nwhether the viewer is one of its ten players. Only while the match is\nPickingPlayers; the answer is kept for that match only.\n\n- Match Chat: the draft''s ten players opening /matches/{id} while they\n  are still being picked get the same Match Chat as on\n  /play/captain-pick (type match, lobby id = the match id), inline and\n  in the Chat Hub, which opens on it. The API still authorizes the\n  join. Spectators get no chat; admins keep their Match-Chat-only\n  access; Team Chat still follows the lineup rule.\n- Lineup lock: while it is an active Captain Pick draft''s match, the\n  lineup controls are hidden: add player, remove player, promote\n  captain, switch side, leave lineup, randomize/swap teams and coach\n  assignment. Only this match: ordinary PickingPlayers matches are\n  unaffected, components outside the match page default to unlocked,\n  and the lock ends when the match leaves PickingPlayers. The API''s\n  finalizer keeps refusing lineups it didn''t draft.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1444f0935739803d7d53129e1c22e27a975f165a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/1444f0935739803d7d53129e1c22e27a975f165a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/31d1fce7f0d5f628e3bdc929280479ff714e3858","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/31d1fce7f0d5f628e3bdc929280479ff714e3858","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKDMxZDFmY2U3ZjBkNWY2MjhlM2JkYzkyOTI4MDQ3OWZmNzE0ZTM4NTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/91a7ccbac75292985fa3adbce927479f0ee61c3c","sha":"91a7ccbac75292985fa3adbce927479f0ee61c3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/91a7ccbac75292985fa3adbce927479f0ee61c3c"}],"sha":"31d1fce7f0d5f628e3bdc929280479ff714e3858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/31d1fce7f0d5f628e3bdc929280479ff714e3858"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/91a7ccbac75292985fa3adbce927479f0ee61c3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:09:12Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T16:09:12Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"fix(matches): show captain pick matches while players are picking\n\nThe API now creates the Captain Pick match as a PickingPlayers shell at\n10/10 (same fixed id through veto and live). Show it and use it.\n\n- /watch lists PickingPlayers in the active (Live) row, and the Watch\n  badge (liveMatchesCount) counts it. Both are the existing live\n  subscriptions, so it appears and later moves on to Veto in place.\n  /matches Upcoming/Live already included PickingPlayers.\n- Captain Pick chat uses the real match''s ordinary Match chat\n  (type \"match\", lobby id = the draft''s matchId) in the inline\n  Match | Team tabs and in the Chat Hub, which opens on it once the\n  match id is known. Team Chat is unchanged (captain_pick_team).\n  After the draft the match page uses the very same room, so there is\n  no second shared room and nothing to migrate.\n- Remove the temporary captain_pick_match room added in 3b193701\n  (types, panel, pop-out, notification routing, labels).\n- Players stay on /play/captain-pick while picking: the draft''s\n  matchId is present from the start, but routing still happens only\n  on MatchCreated (tests for the draft page and the ready check).\n\nNeeds the matching API change (early match shell, Match chat access\nfor the ten players, Hasura select rule for PickingPlayers matchmaking\nmatches) deployed first.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b9eadf8b3c7f6d815db9fc656bd2bcd3e726bdb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/b9eadf8b3c7f6d815db9fc656bd2bcd3e726bdb7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/91a7ccbac75292985fa3adbce927479f0ee61c3c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/91a7ccbac75292985fa3adbce927479f0ee61c3c","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKDkxYTdjY2JhYzc1MjkyOTg1ZmEzYWRiY2U5Mjc0NzlmMGVlNjFjM2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/3b193701bb79807b91b6320edec8dda97252b8ad","sha":"3b193701bb79807b91b6320edec8dda97252b8ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/3b193701bb79807b91b6320edec8dda97252b8ad"}],"sha":"91a7ccbac75292985fa3adbce927479f0ee61c3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/91a7ccbac75292985fa3adbce927479f0ee61c3c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/3b193701bb79807b91b6320edec8dda97252b8ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:28:33Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T15:28:33Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"fix(chat): use Captain Pick match chat instead of Global chat\n\nCaptain Pick used the site-wide Global Chat as its shared conversation.\nIt now uses the draft''s own room (captain_pick_match, id = draftId),\nwhich the API only opens to the ten players in that draft (see the\nAPI change adding ChatLobbyType.CaptainPickMatch).\n\n- Inline Captain Pick chat: Match | Team instead of Global | Team.\n  Match is captain_pick_match/draftId, without attachments (it becomes\n  the match chat). Team is unchanged.\n- Chat Hub: entering Captain Pick opens and focuses Match Chat, for\n  every player, before or after they have a side. Team Chat still\n  appears silently once the server puts the player on a side. Global\n  stays a normal standing Hub channel and is no longer focused here.\n- Leaving for the match removes both temporary Captain Pick rooms; the\n  match page''s Match + own Team Chat take over as before.\n- ChatPanel: Sword icon and Match Chat subtitle, no red unread badge,\n  no attachments. Pop-out and notification click support the type.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"16d6681c51583568d3879abb53be9b010eb48553","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/16d6681c51583568d3879abb53be9b010eb48553"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/3b193701bb79807b91b6320edec8dda97252b8ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/3b193701bb79807b91b6320edec8dda97252b8ad","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKDNiMTkzNzAxYmI3OTgwN2I5MWI2MzIwZWRlYzhkZGE5NzI1MmI4YWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/84a8be6f66a6b0f9cb455cd039ba4b40d62dd798","sha":"84a8be6f66a6b0f9cb455cd039ba4b40d62dd798","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/84a8be6f66a6b0f9cb455cd039ba4b40d62dd798"}],"sha":"3b193701bb79807b91b6320edec8dda97252b8ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/3b193701bb79807b91b6320edec8dda97252b8ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/84a8be6f66a6b0f9cb455cd039ba4b40d62dd798/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T14:52:20Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T14:52:20Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"feat(chat): add contextual match team rooms to chat hub\n\nMake the right-side Chat Hub the main chat during match flows. The\nexisting inline chats (match page, Captain Pick, Draft room) stay as\nthey are for now.\n\n- New useChatHubContext: a page describes its chat context (rooms +\n  focus). The Hub opens on Chat once per newly entered context; a\n  manual close, hub switch or room switch is not undone by reactive\n  updates of the same context. Rooms the context added are removed\n  when the page leaves, unless the player is a real participant.\n- Match page (any origin, incl. tournament and draft matches): Match\n  Chat, plus Team Chat for the viewer''s own lineup only. An admin\n  watching a match they are not in gets Match Chat only, and it is\n  removed (tab, subscription, unread) when they leave the page.\n  Finished matches do not auto-open.\n- Participants: their own Team Chat now sits next to their Match Chat\n  in the Hub on every page (from myMatches is_on_lineup). The stale\n  match sweep skips rooms a page is holding.\n- Captain Pick: opens on Global Chat, or on Team Chat when the player\n  already has a side. The captain_pick_team room appears as soon as\n  the server puts the player on a side, without stealing focus, and\n  goes away when the match page takes over.\n- Draft room: Draft chat (canonical draft/room id) until the match\n  exists, then Match Chat + own Team Chat. Only auto-opens for the\n  room''s players, host and organizers.\n- ChatPanel: Shield icon and Team Chat subtitle for match_team and\n  captain_pick_team, Team Chat listed right below its Match Chat, no\n  attachments for match/match_team (API rejects them). Draft and\n  Captain Pick team rooms join Match/MatchTeam in never counting a\n  red unread badge.\n- Pop-out supports the new room types.\n- Team, Captain Pick and Draft chat notification clicks route to the\n  owning page and focus the room in the Hub there.\n- Socket: the shared room cache stores each live message once, even\n  when the inline chat and the Hub both listen to the same room.\n\nWEB only. No API, Hasura or schema change: the API already enforces\nMatch / MatchTeam / CaptainPickTeam / Draft access.\n\nTests: new chat-hub-context.spec.ts and chat-hub-rooms.spec.ts; the\ncaptain-pick page spec now mocks the Hub context. vitest.config.ts\ngets a test-only alias for Nuxt''s virtual \"#app\" module.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b2c8bae295347756824a1f33c81056ffa30390e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/3b2c8bae295347756824a1f33c81056ffa30390e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/84a8be6f66a6b0f9cb455cd039ba4b40d62dd798","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/84a8be6f66a6b0f9cb455cd039ba4b40d62dd798","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKDg0YThiZTZmNjZhNmIwZjljYjQ1NWNkMDM5YmE0YjQwZDYyZGQ3OTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/71e70e314a0823cfc8b5d538ffa30544ace5358e","sha":"71e70e314a0823cfc8b5d538ffa30544ace5358e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/71e70e314a0823cfc8b5d538ffa30544ace5358e"}],"sha":"84a8be6f66a6b0f9cb455cd039ba4b40d62dd798","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/84a8be6f66a6b0f9cb455cd039ba4b40d62dd798"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/71e70e314a0823cfc8b5d538ffa30544ace5358e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:05:09Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:05:09Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"message":"fix: verification application details overflow horizontally on mobile\n\nThe dt/dd grid used grid-cols-[max-content_1fr] unconditionally, so\nthe label column was always sized to fit the longest label (e.g. \"Do\nyou know any DEAFCS or deaf Counter-Strike players?\"), wider than a\nphone screen. That forced the whole card to scroll horizontally\ninstead of the labels wrapping.\n\nStack the grid to a single column below the sm breakpoint and only\nswitch to the two-column max-content layout at sm and up. Also add\nbreak-all to the social/Steam URL links so a long unbroken URL wraps\ninstead of stretching its row.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"329ca339ae07911767d36121a19547eee0c3363c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/329ca339ae07911767d36121a19547eee0c3363c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/71e70e314a0823cfc8b5d538ffa30544ace5358e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/theftgun","id":33658221,"login":"theftgun","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjU4MjIx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/71e70e314a0823cfc8b5d538ffa30544ace5358e","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKDcxZTcwZTMxNGEwODIzY2ZjOGI1ZDUzOGZmYTMwNTQ0YWNlNTM1OGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/ff54418b99447d79614c7f8dedef58127de177cc","sha":"ff54418b99447d79614c7f8dedef58127de177cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/ff54418b99447d79614c7f8dedef58127de177cc"}],"sha":"71e70e314a0823cfc8b5d538ffa30544ace5358e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/71e70e314a0823cfc8b5d538ffa30544ace5358e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/ff54418b99447d79614c7f8dedef58127de177cc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:10:38Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:10:38Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"fix(matchmaking): complete captain pick responsive chat\n\nPhones and tablets: the one Captain Pick chat (Global | Team) sits below\nthe Draft Log, after the clock, teams and pool. Drop the forced 440px\nminimum height so it stays compact; each room is the existing\nfixed-height ChatLobby that scrolls inside. Desktop keeps the same\nsticky right sidebar. Still a single CaptainPickChat, so the same room\nsubscriptions and the same server-side Team access rules.\n\nDraft Log: the spelled-out \"Auto-picked\" label is now opt-in\n(showAutoPickLabel). Captain Pick turns it on; Draft Games keeps its\noriginal icon-only marker.\n\nTests: vitest 188/188 (chat placement and order below xl, Team unlock\nafter a pick and for the last auto-assigned player, compact chat, Draft\nLog default vs opt-in); node .mjs tests unchanged (same 10 pre-existing\nfailures); nuxt build --standalone OK; git diff --check OK.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5f8d306f50544db3d575f3999227edd9e8a292a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/5f8d306f50544db3d575f3999227edd9e8a292a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/ff54418b99447d79614c7f8dedef58127de177cc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/ff54418b99447d79614c7f8dedef58127de177cc","node_id":"C_kwDOTjTHGtoAKGZmNTQ0MThiOTk0NDdkNzk2MTRjN2Y4ZGVkZWY1ODEyN2RlMTc3Y2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commit/b0996276f1649319d808dac7859d91aecaaef566","sha":"b0996276f1649319d808dac7859d91aecaaef566","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/b0996276f1649319d808dac7859d91aecaaef566"}],"sha":"ff54418b99447d79614c7f8dedef58127de177cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/ff54418b99447d79614c7f8dedef58127de177cc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/306877576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Triconzor","id":306877576,"login":"Triconzor","node_id":"U_kgDOEkqUiA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Triconzor","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/b0996276f1649319d808dac7859d91aecaaef566/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:00:13Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T22:00:13Z","email":"306877576+Triconzor@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Triconzor"},"message":"feat(matchmaking): align pick system with draft experience\n\nRebuild the Competitive - Pick System draft screen on the existing Draft\nGames components so both drafts look and behave the same:\n\n- Shared DraftTurnStatus (clock, \"X is picking\", pick-order chips),\n  extracted from DraftRoom with no change to Draft Games behaviour.\n- Draft team panels and player cards for both teams and the pool, with\n  the DEAFCS / CS2 / FACEIT rating selector and rank hover (display only;\n  it never changes who can be picked or the pick payload).\n- Country flags: load the draft''s public player records (playerFields,\n  one query per draft) so cards get the same country data as Draft Games\n  instead of falling back to the globe.\n- Profile links open in a new tab and never pick; the rest of the card\n  and the Draft button still pick (only for the captain on the clock).\n- Draft Log at the bottom; timed-out picks are labelled \"Auto-picked\"\n  (also shown in Draft Games). The last auto-assigned player is not\n  logged as an eighth pick.\n- Right sidebar with Global Chat and a private Team Chat tab\n  (captain_pick_team, room `${draftId}:${lineup}`). The tab opens once\n  the server has the player on a side; the API authorizes every join,\n  read and send from the draft state.\n\nRemoves the Captain Pick translation keys the old screen used.\n\nTests: vitest 182/182 (new screen, chat, helper, flag, profile-link and\nDraft Log specs); node .mjs tests unchanged (same 10 pre-existing\nfailures); nuxt build --standalone OK; git diff --check OK.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a4858d4a669c0dfecc869d31b090feb80eaa5969","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/a4858d4a669c0dfecc869d31b090feb80eaa5969"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/b0996276f1649319d808dac7859d91aecaaef566","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"commit