tgun/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/commits/37370d9ec1dbd782d185013671f63a09db44dbf4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T13:38:14Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-28T13:38:14Z","email":"blend_hamalaw@hotmail.com","name":"Blend Hamalaw"},"message":"Add GIF support via GIPHY search\n\nNew GIF picker button next to the attachment button (search box + grid,\nwith the required \"Powered by GIPHY\" attribution), searching through\napi-deafcs''s proxy endpoint so the API key stays server-side. Clicking a\nGIF sends it immediately as its own message, independent of whatever\ntext is currently being typed.\n\nSent GIFs render at the same locked/capped size as image attachments,\nwith the same click-to-enlarge overlay -- straight off GIPHY''s own CDN,\nno upload or S3 storage of our own involved.\n\nDocuments the new giphy-secrets-* Kubernetes secret in CLAUDE.md''s\nproduction envFrom list, already wired into the live api deployment.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"34e99ed1ce32df5aa068a93460cd828da430f855","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/trees/34e99ed1ce32df5aa068a93460cd828da430f855"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DEAFCS/deafcs-web/git/commits/37370d9ec1dbd782d185013671f63a09db44dbf4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/33658221?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/theftgun/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https:/