TARGET / DESIGN labels) and a\n  must-not-get-wrong numbers cheat sheet\n- Part 1: the 10 business personas from personas-and-journeys.md\n- Part 2: technical and governance personas (CISO, solution architect,\n  data engineer, AI/ML engineer, SRE, DPO, auditor, CFO, procurement,\n  QA, UX, change management)\n- Part 3: one section per rating-grid criterion (TR-DES-01 ...\n  TR-PRE-01) including a ''why not 5/5'' answer for each 4-scored item\n- Part 4: deployment and operations\n- Part 5: evolution and roadmap phases/gates\n- Part 6: curveball, trap and meta questions\n- appendices: trap defusal table, sentences to never say, persona to\n  source-document map\n\nAlso registers the document in docs/README.md and\ndocs/presentation/README.md.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCopilot-Session: 4a019273-080a-4430-ac25-fbdf32086fe5","tree":{"sha":"101dc9cbf8d7d19f0955f4f6ad188b8374b773a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/trees/101dc9cbf8d7d19f0955f4f6ad188b8374b773a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/commits/03fea71c194cadc795d2a3f9c463cb73eb25a25f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74252080?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/frkim","id":74252080,"login":"frkim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUyMDgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/starred{/