,"verified_at":"2026-08-06T13:41:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/frkim/NovaSteel3/commit/2fe7da7e5866d0ce62e6e61201dfa0396728583f","node_id":"C_kwDOTjwLXNoAKDJmZTdkYTdlNTg2NmQwY2U2MmU2ZTYxMjAxZGZhMDM5NjcyODU4M2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/frkim/NovaSteel3/commit/95ea15a17ba8245fdffd1f296fab8afdbea7c9eb","sha":"95ea15a17ba8245fdffd1f296fab8afdbea7c9eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/commits/95ea15a17ba8245fdffd1f296fab8afdbea7c9eb"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/frkim/NovaSteel3/commit/ca7c9897a26550ad921d4873d2615a4fd047ba45","sha":"ca7c9897a26550ad921d4873d2615a4fd047ba45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/commits/ca7c9897a26550ad921d4873d2615a4fd047ba45"}],"sha":"2fe7da7e5866d0ce62e6e61201dfa0396728583f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/commits/2fe7da7e5866d0ce62e6e61201dfa0396728583f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74252080?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/frkim","id":74252080,"login":"frkim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUyMDgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/commits/ca7c9897a26550ad921d4873d2615a4fd047ba45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-06T13:31:08Z","email":"frkim@live.fr","name":"François-Xavier Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-06T13:31:08Z","email":"frkim@live.fr","name":"François-Xavier Kim"},"message":"docs(demo): run the DM-5 knowledge beat on the operator capture PWA\n\nThe 10-minute runbook still described DM-5 as \"start interview or play\nfallback synthetic audio\" on a desktop tab. The operator voice-capture\nPWA shipped in #48 and #50 does that beat far better, and on the device\nthe story is actually about, so the script now runs those three rows in\nthe phone app.\n\nSix new annotated cue cards (S20-S25) cover the wizard: consent with the\nretention period and the GDPR consent checkbox, the idle and active\nrecorder, local review before upload, the transcript with speaker labels\nand per-segment confidence, and the created PROC-IV draft sitting in\nIN_REVIEW behind the human-in-the-loop notice. Sources are first-party\ncaptures of the deployed capture Container App walked end to end against\nthe real BFF, using the shipped sample interview so the transcript is\ndeterministic.\n\nNew section 4.5 carries the step-by-step, the preflight (grant the mic\nonce and rehearse so the service worker caches the bundle and the sample\nWAV), and the fallbacks. One honesty note matters: with no BFF configured\nthe app falls back to a client-side stub whose transcript is a Continuous\nCasting example that does not match the hearth-cooling audio, so the\nrunbook says never to present from that state.\n\nThe annotation generator gained a per-shot target_width because these are\nportrait phone screens that would look absurd upscaled to the 1400 px the\ndesktop cards use.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCopilot-Session: e3a020f8-4f3e-480a-9ac3-4ce68385e127","tree":{"sha":"692a0f3be12f5160b3ed34287a923e0602a64227","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/trees/692a0f3be12f5160b3ed34287a923e0602a64227"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/commits/ca7c9897a26550ad921d4873d2615a4fd047ba45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74252080?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/frkim","id":74252080,"login":"frkim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUyMDgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim","user_view_type":"public"},"ht