ovaSteel3/commits/6d0b90c2e3799cb7e9b7cf862822d32b11f3e8b1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74252080?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/frkim","id":74252080,"login":"frkim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUyMDgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/commits/3afce0bd27dc7df61fdb39cd9768e15686b272cb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T15:52:43Z","email":"frkim@live.fr","name":"François-Xavier Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T15:52:43Z","email":"frkim@live.fr","name":"François-Xavier Kim"},"message":"Make every predefined Copilot question answer from a Fabric retrieval\n\nThe panel already served curated Fabric answers for the 44 non-search screen\nchips, but it served them silently: a figure appeared, \"Microsoft Fabric\" was\ncited, and nothing showed that a query had run. The 32 persona chips were not\ncurated at all and fell through to the generic local answer.\n\nEvery dataset is now a query step. fabric_sources.py carries the workspace and\nartefact constants and gives FabricDataset an engine, a statement, a row count\nand an elapsed time; gold()/kql()/graph() build one against the SQL analytics\nendpoint, the Eventhouse or the ontology. The statements are written against the\nreal schema - the tables, materialised views and fn_* functions in\nDatabaseSchema.kql, the gold DDL, and the Asset -[:supplies]-> Asset genealogy -\nthey bind to July 2026 rather than to GETDATE(), and they use the real plant\nkeys. Where a column does not exist the answer derives the figure or says the\ndemo does not carry it.\n\n_fabric_retrieval() renders those steps as a localized block between the intro\nand the body, and appends them to the reasoning trace, so what the user reads\nand what the trace records agree.\n\nThe persona chips get the same treatment: 32 cards, 71 query steps, bodies in\nfive languages. They arrive as free text with no section, so _build_index() now\nmatches a card by its verbatim prompts as well as by section and index.\n\n76 cards, 151 query steps, 380 answers. A schema audit over every statement and\na test that parses PERSONA_QUESTIONS out of the TSX keep it honest.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCopilot-Session: dc7f097d-a243-4c8f-acca-971cab81e5f2","tree":{"sha":"46e901ce141d6f1d983fee28233fddea9c4bfec7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/trees/46e901ce141d6f1d983fee28233fddea9c4bfec7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/commits/3afce0bd27dc7df61fdb39cd9768e15686b272cb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74252080?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/frkim","id":74252080,"login":"frkim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUyMDgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/orgs","received_events_url":"https:/