ronment:demo\nexisted. GitHub issues immutable-ID subjects for this repository, so the\ntoken actually presented repo:frkim@74252080/NovaSteel3@1312557916:environment:demo.\nRegistering that second spelling made the deployment succeed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCopilot-Session: 7af88ab5-1888-4aaa-b6c2-b0d489d137d6","tree":{"sha":"5b8b4239253a1257458ddddf5ae75e762afecd75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/trees/5b8b4239253a1257458ddddf5ae75e762afecd75"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/commits/55676b872538ac54bde1a2eb614550dd5aa8aa9f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74252080?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/frkim","id":74252080,"login":"frkim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUyMDgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/frkim/NovaSteel3/commit/55676b872538ac54bde1a2eb614550dd5aa8aa9f","node_id":"C_kwDOTjwLXNoAKDU1Njc2Yjg3MjUzOGFjNTRiZGUxYTJlYjYxNDU1MGRkNWFhOGFhOWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/frkim/NovaSteel3/commit/6610c79fab318ce5b82d3044bb93242f9c4599af","sha":"6610c79fab318ce5b82d3044bb93242f9c4599af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/commits/6610c79fab318ce5b82d3044bb93242f9c4599af"}],"sha":"55676b872538ac54bde1a2eb614550dd5aa8aa9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/commits/55676b872538ac54bde1a2eb614550dd5aa8aa9f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74252080?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/frkim","id":74252080,"login":"frkim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUyMDgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/commits/6610c79fab318ce5b82d3044bb93242f9c4599af/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T10:42:48Z","email":"frkim@live.fr","name":"François-Xavier Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T10:42:48Z","email":"frkim@live.fr","name":"François-Xavier Kim"},"message":"ci: target demo, the environment that actually exists\n\nThe first version of this branch deployed to dev. There is no dev\ninfrastructure: the only NovaSteel V3 resource group in the subscription is\nrg-novasteelv3-demo-sc, holding novasteelv3-bff and novasteelv3-portal.\n\nSo the automatic promotion targets demo, and only the two services that have a\nContainer App to land on. Nothing is lost by dropping the other four: the\nbff-api image already carries optimizer-worker, scoring-worker,\nknowledge-orchestrator and the device simulator as build contexts, which is why\nthe change filter routes all of those paths to it.\n\nThe demo environment now carries a required reviewer, so a merge queues a\ndeployment and waits for one click rather than rolling straight to the demo\nthat gets presented. That is the human decision point the release gates ask\nfor, without going back to looking image digests up by hand.\n\nSupporting configuration applied outside the repository:\n\n- novasteelv3-github-oidc gained a federated credential for the subject\n  repo:frkim/NovaSteel3:environment:demo. A job that declares an environment\n  gets the environment subject rather than the branch subject, so the existing\n  ref:refs/heads/main credential could never have authenticated CD - which is\n  why the one previous CD run failed.\n- The same identity gained Container Apps Contributor on\n  rg-novasteelv3-demo-sc; it only had AcrPush, so it could publish an image but\n  not deploy one.\n- CONTAINER_RESOURCE_GROUP, BFF_CONTAINER_APP and PORTAL_CONTAINER_APP are set\n  on the demo environment. They were empty, which is where the previous run\n  stopped.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCopilot-Session: 7af88ab5-1888-4aaa-b6c2-b0d489d137d6","tree":{"sha":"ad861ff55865cf9cab035caffe733937b8398e4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/trees/ad861ff55865cf9cab035caffe733937b8398e4e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/commits/6610c79fab318ce5b82d3044bb93242f9c4599af","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74252080?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/frkim","id":74252080,"login":"frkim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUyMDgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/frkim/NovaSteel3/commit/6610c79fab318ce5b82d3044bb93242f9c4599af","node_id":"C_kwDOTjwLXNoAKDY2MTBjNzlmYWIzMThjZTViODJkMzA0NGJiOTMyNDJmOWM0NTk5YWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/frkim/NovaSteel3/commit/694b7a0b93d88c41c103b5be5fe9b537a522e8c0","sha":"694b7a0b93d88c41c103b5be5fe9b537a522e8c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/commits/694b7a0b93d88c41c103b5be5fe9b537a522e8c0"}],"sha":"6610c79fab318ce5b82d3044bb93242f9c4599af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/commits/6610c79fab318ce5b82d3044bb93242f9c4599af"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74252080?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/frkim","id":74252080,"login":"frkim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUyMDgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/commits/694b7a0b93d88c41c103b5be5fe9b537a522e8c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T10:26:35Z","email":"frkim@live.fr","name":"François-Xavier Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T10:26:35Z","email":"frkim@live.fr","name":"François-Xavier Kim"},"message":"ci: deploy to dev automatically when main moves\n\nMerging to main built and pushed the service images but stopped there, so the\ndev environment only ever matched main if somebody remembered to dispatch CD\nby hand - and to look the image digest up in ACR first, because cd-services\nrejects anything that is not a @sha256 reference.\n\nci-build-services now closes that loop: each build job exposes the digest\nbuildx just produced, and a deploy job per service calls cd-services with it.\nThe existing change filter still applies, so an unchanged service is skipped\nrather than redeployed.\n\nPromotion deliberately stops at dev. test, demo and prod stay a manual\ndispatch because the release gates in the security model want a human sign-off\non data classification, agent controls and the DPIA. cd-services enforces that\nitself - a call that did not come from workflow_dispatch is refused for any\nenvironment other than dev - so the policy cannot be undone by editing the\ncaller alone.\n\ncd-services gains a workflow_call trigger. workflow_call cannot express choice\ninputs, so the environment and service enums are re-checked in the validate\njob rather than trusting the caller.\n\nTwo tests lock the policy in place: every automatic deployment targets dev and\npasses the OIDC token down, and it deploys a digest rather than a tag.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCopilot-Session: 7af88ab5-1888-4aaa-b6c2-b0d489d137d6","tree":{"sha":"7d1902c15c61bbb9a1961f3a61c0e07014780e88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/trees/7d1902c15c61bbb9a1961f3a61c0e07014780e88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/commits/694b7a0b93d88c41c103b5be5fe9b537a522e8c0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74252080?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/frkim","id":74252080,"login":"frkim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUyMDgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/frkim/NovaSteel3/commit/694b7a0b93d88c41c103b5be5fe9b537a522e8c0","node_id":"C_kwDOTjwLXNoAKDY5NGI3YTBiOTNkODhjNDFjMTAzYjViZTVmZTliNTM3YTUyMmU4YzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/frkim/NovaSteel3/commit/763f3ec114700d8334ab7cd7da84b9114959f5c9","sha":"763f3ec114700d8334ab7cd7da84b9114959f5c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/commits/763f3ec114700d8334ab7cd7da84b9114959f5c9"}],"sha":"694b7a0b93d88c41c103b5be5fe9b537a522e8c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/commits/694b7a0b93d88c41c103b5be5fe9b537a522e8c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74252080?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/fol