_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/frkim","id":74252080,"login":"frkim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUyMDgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/commits/4be87e820e66eaa9ba126c2a259c9e87b6b135da/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T21:21:34Z","email":"frkim@live.fr","name":"François-Xavier Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T21:21:34Z","email":"frkim@live.fr","name":"François-Xavier Kim"},"message":"Add carbon, quality and orchestrator agents with deterministic routing\n\nThe operations Foundry project held two agents, one per calculation. The use\ncase has four concerns, and the interesting questions span them: a cheaper\ndispatch schedule that raises emissions, a coiling adjustment that lifts yield\nbut shortens lining life. Answering those across two agents leaves the operator\nto combine two results themselves, which is the unsourced arithmetic ADR-006\nexists to prevent.\n\nAdds two specialists backed by calculations that already existed but had no\nagent in front of them - carbon_footprint_summary over the sustainability\nsummary, quality_yield_what_if over the bounded first-pass-yield model - and\none orchestrator holding all four tools for the cross-domain case. Each\nspecialist still owns exactly one calculation; the orchestrator is the single\ndeliberate exception, and it is instructed to name a trade-off and stop rather\nthan weight cost against carbon against asset life. That weighting is the\nplanner''s decision.\n\nRouting is deterministic (agent_router.py), not a supervisor model. A model\nchoosing the agent would make the choice of calculation an inference, which is\nthe one thing kept out of the model everywhere else; it is unreviewable, since\nnothing diffs and a routing regression looks like a good day; and it is a\nprompt-injection surface, because text carried into the turn could steer which\ntools become reachable. Keyword scoring over declared domains is a pure\nfunction of the question and testable without a network.\n\nRouting grants nothing. Every tool body still re-applies the caller''s roles and\nplant scope, so a mis-route costs a worse answer, never a wider one. The\nknowledge project is untouched and still holds zero function tools.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCopilot-Session: 81dacaa0-c91e-489c-84d4-ba2b552786da","tree":{"sha":"c995dc955fdf51904c0648faf108fd69365d338c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/trees/c995dc955fdf51904c0648faf108fd69365d338c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/commits/4be87e820e66eaa9ba126c2a259c9e87b6b135da","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74252080?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/frkim","id":74252080,"login":"frkim","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc0MjUyMDgw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/