\"Simulated\" badge from the topbar Fabric\ncapacity pill; the capacity panel keeps its detailed wording.\n\nRetire the Isabelle Moreau (Executive) and Nils Andersen (Platform Ops)\npersonas. Their screens stay reachable: the shell nav items move to the plant\nmanager, who already sees the full menu, and the MFE route table re-attributes\nthem to remaining personas.\n\nCarry the persona selected in the shell top menu across the analytics bridge as\nprimaryPersona, so the Copilot suggestion combo can lead with and highlight the\nselected role''s questions. The plant manager is excluded on purpose: he is the\ndefault cross-domain role, so highlighting him would highlight the default.\n\nStop the Copilot dead-ending on \"I can''t determine that from the provided\ngrounding\". The BFF now attaches steel-corpus grounding with screen context on\nas well as off, the system prompts require an expert answer with the mechanism\nand typical ranges when a figure is absent, and the Foundry adapter replaces a\nshort refusal with the deterministic grounded answer.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCopilot-Session: 99f13968-6514-4faa-9e44-ce4f89667503","tree":{"sha":"2e1223bb6b9e03acd37abb35a075bc5512b38deb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/trees/2e1223bb6b9e03acd37abb35a075bc5512b38deb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/commits/182f0620f86e18a53454662680d2e3f68371ad72","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74252080?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/frkim","id":74252080,"logi