.github.com/users/frkim/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/commits/4195b53bacecc01cd9c13e35524b7d2b3e97af4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-30T13:00:09Z","email":"frkim@live.fr","name":"François-Xavier Kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-30T13:00:09Z","email":"frkim@live.fr","name":"François-Xavier Kim"},"message":"Install the agent SDK in the runtime images\n\nThe tool-calling Foundry agents run inside the BFF process, but neither the\nbff-api nor the knowledge-orchestrator image installed azure-ai-projects or\nopenai. The agent code paths would have raised ImportError on the first\nrequest in a deployed environment; this went unnoticed because the agent\nruntime has never been deployed.\n\nPin azure-ai-projects 2.2.0 (the version whose create_version/get_openai_client\nsurface the code targets - the 1.x surface is incompatible) and openai 2.44.0,\nresolved from the protected feed, matching the versions the test suite was\nvalidated against.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot App <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\nCopilot-Session: 19c453da-57c8-48ea-b6e5-9c5f118ffc30","tree":{"sha":"2b1bbd759bed73d9bdf80934aa8c9654e2577978","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/trees/2b1bbd759bed73d9bdf80934aa8c9654e2577978"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/frkim/NovaSteel3/git/commits/4195b53bacecc01cd9c13e35524b7d2b3e97af4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/74252080?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/frkim/following{/other_user}","gists_url"