pi.github.com/repos/zvitaly7/loregraph/commits/f4e37f74626f61e4e1f924e314bc5935c8db53ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T05:21:49Z","email":"zheltkovitaly@gmail.com","name":"vzheltko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T05:21:49Z","email":"zheltkovitaly@gmail.com","name":"vzheltko"},"message":"ci: run the suite on every push and prove the rebuild is byte-identical\n\nThe only workflow so far ran tests when publishing a tag, so nothing was\nverified between releases and the Node/OS support the package claims was\nnever exercised. A second job rebuilds the graph twice and compares all\ntwelve node/edge files — the determinism the tool rests on, checked rather\nthan asserted. Both caches are written outside the working tree: one\nwritten inside it gets inventoried by the next build, which fails the\ncomparison for a reason that has nothing to do with determinism.\n\nAdds a CHANGELOG, starting at the changes since 0.2.1.","tree":{"sha":"b21978047fff2b35ce78e28a2ac6547126961155","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvitaly7/loregraph/git/trees/b21978047fff2b35ce78e28a2ac6547126961155"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvitaly7/loregraph/git/commits/f4e37f74626f61e4e1f924e314bc5935c8db53ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51998458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zvitaly7","id":51998458,"login":"zvitaly7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTk4NDU4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.g