:21:49Z","email":"zheltkovitaly@gmail.com","name":"vzheltko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T05:21:49Z","email":"zheltkovitaly@gmail.com","name":"vzheltko"},"message":"fix(imports): resolve .mts/.cts and follow a build entry back to its source\n\nTwo reasons a dependency on the repo''s own package went missing. The\nresolver''s extension list omitted .mts and .cts — ordinary TypeScript\nmodule files that the inventory has always classified and the\ntype-checking layers read — so nothing could land on one. And a manifest\nentry naming a built file was tried only as written, though the file it\nwas built from usually sits at the same relative place under the source\nroot; dist/export/index.mjs is now also tried as src/export/index.\n\nOn the reference monorepo this reached one of the two packages nothing\ncould reach before, 82 imports, with no mapping configured at all.\n\nThe domains layer now also says when its overlay learned nothing: no\nconfigured source root exists here, or no domain depends on another while\ninternal imports do. A flat overlay reads like a clean result otherwise.","tree":{"sha":"f372f408f9d218d681090ecb2dfe403f0bb21056","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvitaly7/loregraph/git/trees/f372f408f9d218d681090ecb2dfe403f0bb21056"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvitaly7/loregraph/git/commits/e40fbf74e1db68722dc83e752ca6a263bbf9b4e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51998458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zvitaly7","id":51998458,"login":"zvitaly7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTk4NDU4","organiza