ers/zvitaly7/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvitaly7/loregraph/commits/ac12554874f727de1c6186617e84f9eb51731e20/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T13:51:13Z","email":"zheltkovitaly@gmail.com","name":"vzheltko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T13:51:13Z","email":"zheltkovitaly@gmail.com","name":"vzheltko"},"message":"fix(config): merge paths per pattern instead of all-or-nothing\n\nThe first cut let a tsconfig that declared any paths suppress the config\ntable entirely. A per-package tsconfig maps that package''s own internal\naliases and says nothing about its siblings, so the rule silenced the\nconfig table exactly where it was needed. Precedence is now per alias\npattern: the tsconfig keeps every pattern it declares, the config table\nsupplies the rest, and entries are rebased when the two bases differ.","tree":{"sha":"992503e65313ae51da68f531d507729f06187cb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvitaly7/loregraph/git/trees/992503e65313ae51da68f531d507729f06187cb9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zvitaly7/loregraph/git/commits/ac12554874f727de1c6186617e84f9eb51731e20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/51998458?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/zvitaly7","id":51998458,"login":"zvitaly7","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxOTk4NDU4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zvitaly7/received_events","repos_url":"https://ap