","email":"nevin.madhukar.k@gmail.com","name":"Nevin M K"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T15:16:07Z","email":"nevin.madhukar.k@gmail.com","name":"Nevin M K"},"message":"fix(03-ssr-hybrid): show full HH:MM:SS.mmm for render/hydration timestamps\n\ntoLocaleTimeString''s fractionalSecondDigits depends on the engine''s ICU\ndata; on a small-icu Node build it silently drops hh:mm:ss and prints\nonly milliseconds. formatTime.ts now builds the string manually from\nDate''s own getters so it''s deterministic regardless of ICU support.","tree":{"sha":"8a851811cbf9dfc8b846e57d2557dc7aa6fc2b91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nevinmk/Frontend-architecture-patterns/git/trees/8a851811cbf9dfc8b846e57d2557dc7aa6fc2b91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nevinmk/Frontend-architecture-patterns/git/commits/291ca74043194cfa2e15cff06bfcff1de8f99cd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5534190?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevinmk/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevinmk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevinmk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevinmk/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/nevinmk","id":5534190,"login":"nevinmk","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1MzQxOTA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevinmk/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevinmk/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevinmk/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevinmk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevinmk/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nevinmk","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nevinmk/Frontend-architecture-patterns/commit/291ca74043194cfa2e