ttps://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shankar-v27","id":188288378,"login":"Shankar-v27","node_id":"U_kgDOCzkNeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commits/b11be0e08733d4ac4d4a61c8e8e18aa621e0560b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T15:39:52Z","email":"188288378+Shankar-v27@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shankar-v27"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T15:39:52Z","email":"188288378+Shankar-v27@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shankar-v27"},"message":"fix(phase8): broken authz EL in analytics/productivity; dev health probe\n\n- AnalyticsController and ProductivityController used\n  @PreAuthorize(\"@securityUtils.isCompanyAdmin(#companyId)\") — a bean\n  method that does not exist, so every request 500''d at EL evaluation;\n  they also trusted a caller-controlled {companyId} path variable.\n  Both now follow the platform pattern: hasRole(''COMPANY'') + company id\n  from the JWT principal, mounted under /api/v1/company/...\n  (old paths were unusable — nothing could have consumed them)\n- Dev profile disables the mail health indicator: with no local SMTP it\n  dragged /actuator/health to DOWN despite db/disk/ping all UP\n\nPort 8080: verified live — backend boots and serves on 8080 (health,\nauth, company/candidate/interview flows all exercised); no duplicate\nbinding or config conflict exists in the codebase. The reported\nconflict was a stale prior process, not a config bug; port unchanged\nper the engagement constraints.","tree":{"sha":"71443390d289568b85c19b6505fb4ee2f0548a2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/trees/71443390d289568b85c19b6505fb4ee2f0548a2c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/commits/b11be0e08733d4ac4d4a61c8e8e18aa621e0560b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188288378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shankar-v27","id":188288378,"login":"Shankar-v27","node_id":"U_kgDOCzkNeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commit/b11be0e08733d4ac4d4a61c8e8e18aa621e0560b","node_id":"C_kwDOTkAr-toAKGIxMWJlMGUwODczM2Q0YWM0ZDRhNjFjOGU4ZTE4YWE2MjFlMDU2MGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commit/d55c137f8082a809288cdd26a52fe03d079bdc32","sha":"d55c137f8082a809288cdd26a52fe03d079bdc32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commits/d55c137f8082a809288cdd26a52fe03d079bdc32"}],"sha":"b11be0e08733d4ac4d4a61c8e8e18aa621e0560b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commits/b11be0e08733d4ac4d4a61c8e8e18aa621e0560b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188288378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shankar-v27","id":188288378,"login":"Shankar-v27","node_id":"U_kgDOCzkNeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commits/d55c137f8082a809288cdd26a52fe03d079bdc32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T15:31:57Z","email":"188288378+Shankar-v27@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shankar-v27"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T15:31:57Z","email":"188288378+Shankar-v27@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shankar-v27"},"message":"feat(phase7): voice interview layer, full candidate report, reporting authz fix\n\nSpeech system (spec §10):\n- Continuous STT with live interim subtitles; finalized speech lands in\n  the editable draft so the candidate reviews the transcript before\n  sending; typing remains the always-available fallback with an explicit\n  unsupported-browser notice\n- TTS speaks the AI''s opener and every question with a mute toggle and\n  a speaking indicator (verbal + subtitles, per §8)\n\nReporting (spec §10):\n- New GET /api/v1/company/reports/assignments/{id}: resume summary +\n  skills, per-round scores with weightage and the stored AI evaluation\n  (dimension scores, strengths/weaknesses, recommendation, transcript\n  summary), weighted total, proctoring event log, fraud status, decision\n- Fixed broken authorization: @PreAuthorize referenced a nonexistent\n  securityUtils.isCompanyAdmin bean method (every request would 500) and\n  trusted a caller-controlled {companyId} path variable. Reporting now\n  uses hasRole(''COMPANY'') + the JWT company id like every other company\n  controller; scorecard CSV moved to /api/v1/company/reports/...\n\nResume pipeline note: conversational agents already consume the single\nparsed resume profile via candidateContext (wired in phase 3) - every\nAI agent reads the same stored profile, nothing re-parses.\n\nValidation: mvn compile + test exit 0; tsc + vite build clean","tree":{"sha":"fe2fcb82e5456c10da09759f94a47d89585d66f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/trees/fe2fcb82e5456c10da09759f94a47d89585d66f9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/commits/d55c137f8082a809288cdd26a52fe03d079bdc32","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188288378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shankar-v27","id":188288378,"login":"Shankar-v27","node_id":"U_kgDOCzkNeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commit/d55c137f8082a809288cdd26a52fe03d079bdc32","node_id":"C_kwDOTkAr-toAKGQ1NWMxMzdmODA4MmE4MDkyODhjZGQyNmE1MmZlMDNkMDc5YmRjMzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commit/09c52498fac924fa42e03e91c67407f0917220ec","sha":"09c52498fac924fa42e03e91c67407f0917220ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commits/09c52498fac924fa42e03e91c67407f0917220ec"}],"sha":"d55c137f8082a809288cdd26a52fe03d079bdc32","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commits/d55c137f8082a809288cdd26a52fe03d079bdc32"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188288378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shankar-v27","id":188288378,"login":"Shankar-v27","node_id":"U_kgDOCzkNeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commits/09c52498fac924fa42e03e91c67407f0917220ec/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T15:29:02Z","email":"188288378+Shankar-v27@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shankar-v27"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T15:29:02Z","email":"188288378+Shankar-v27@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shankar-v27"},"message":"feat(phase6): proctoring detector expansion; 4th warning forfeits current round only\n\nBackend (spec §10 policy change):\n- Max 3 warnings; the 4th terminates ONLY the round in progress\n  (RoundSession -> INVALIDATED). The session survives, completed rounds\n  keep their scores, and the warning budget resets for the next round.\n  Previously 3 strikes killed the entire session.\n- Session flagged for recruiter review from the 2nd warning; every\n  threshold crossing raises an auditable fraud event\n\nFrontend detectors added to the proctoring hook:\n- devtools-open heuristic (persistent outer/inner viewport gap)\n- camera/microphone disabled mid-round (devicechange + enumeration)\n- no-face and multiple-faces via the native FaceDetector API where the\n  browser supports it, with confidence attached; capability absence is\n  reported once as INFO so recruiters know coverage\n- fullscreen exit upgraded to WARNING; tab-switch/blur/copy/paste/\n  network-drop retained\n\nValidation: mvn compile + test exit 0; tsc + vite build clean","tree":{"sha":"a2549e6dcae0ab76b6503a9e0d48de38716a4d69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/trees/a2549e6dcae0ab76b6503a9e0d48de38716a4d69"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/commits/09c52498fac924fa42e03e91c67407f0917220ec","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188288378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/us