ps://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commits/6867d92679a81fb8c383f53fcfdedaf10cf4a3a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T15:26:25Z","email":"188288378+Shankar-v27@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shankar-v27"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T15:26:25Z","email":"188288378+Shankar-v27@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shankar-v27"},"message":"feat(phase5): weightage enforcement, weighted scoring, immediate candidate login, session re-verification\n\n- Interview cannot go ACTIVE unless every enabled round has a weightage\n  and they sum to exactly 100%; the validation error names each round\n  and the current total (spec §10)\n- Final score is now the weighted composite sum(percentage x weightage/100),\n  never a flat sum; legacy interviews without weightages keep the old\n  raw-sum behavior for backward compatibility\n- Candidates provisioned with a password (form or bulk import) are\n  ACTIVE immediately - login works right away, no activation step;\n  recruiter-chosen passwords are never echoed by email; recruiter form\n  gains password + confirm-password with policy validation\n- Per-session identity re-verification (V13, additive): every new\n  session or browser/device change nulls identity_checked_at; round\n  start returns 422 VERIFICATION_REQUIRED until the candidate passes a\n  live face capture matched against their approved ID document via\n  POST /candidate/sessions/{id}/reverify; candidate lobby shows a\n  webcam re-verification dialog and retries the round automatically\n\nValidation: mvn compile + mvn test exit 0; tsc + vite build clean","tree":{"sha":"d5bd87bf97020c6a2895f335658eb9b14fb6c933","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/trees/d5bd87bf97020c6a2895f335658eb9b14fb6c933"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/commits/6867d92679a81fb8c383f53fcfdedaf10cf4a3a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188288378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shankar-v27","id":188288378,"login":"Shankar-v27","node_id":"U_kgDOCzkNeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commit/6867d92679a81fb8c383f53fcfdedaf10cf4a3a2","node_id":"C_kwDOTkAr-toAKDY4NjdkOTI2NzlhODFmYjhjMzgzZjUzZmNmZGVkYWYxMGNmNGEzYTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commit/cb35370a5bd4c5cef50eee9027a2c5aad836cda6","sha":"cb35370a5bd4c5cef50eee9027a2c5aad836cda6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commits/cb35370a5bd4c5cef50eee9027a2c5aad836cda6"}],"sha":"6867d92679a81fb8c383f53fcfdedaf10cf4a3a2","url":"https://api.github.co