 into the IDE as a Custom\n  input tab with stdout/stderr/compile output and timing\n- Coding generation prompt now mandates original DSA stdin/stdout\n  problems (never MCQ) with input/output spec, constraints, examples,\n  and starter code for java/python/cpp/javascript\n\nValidated live: java 21->42 and -3->-6 pass (45ms), cpp 21->42 passes,\nbroken cpp surfaces compiler diagnostics as COMPILE_ERROR; mvn compile\nexit 0; tsc + vite build clean","tree":{"sha":"b8790e731f88ffe4c8e86d7e8c70e8d9a712e7fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/trees/b8790e731f88ffe4c8e86d7e8c70e8d9a712e7fe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/commits/cb35370a5bd4c5cef50eee9027a2c5aad836cda6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188288378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shankar-v27","id":188288378,"login":"Shankar-v27","node_id":"U_kgDOCzkNeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commit/cb35370a5bd4c5cef50eee9027a2c5aad836cda6","node_id":"C_kwDOTkAr-toAKGNiMzUzNzBhNWJkNGM1Y2VmNTBlZWU5MDI3YTJjNWFhZDgzNmNkYTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commit/aec306d1eada322697ec127988e450e4cb35d71d","sha":"aec306d1eada322697ec127988e450e4cb35d71d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commits/aec306d1eada322697ec127988e450e4cb35d71d"}],"sha":"cb35370a5bd4c5cef50eee9027a2c5aad836cda6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commits/cb35370a5bd4c5cef50eee9027a2c5aad836cda6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188288378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shankar-v27","id":188288378,"login":"Shankar-v27","node_id":"U_kgDOCzkNeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commits/aec306d1eada322697ec127988e450e4cb35d71d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T14:46:43Z","email":"188288378+Shankar-v27@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shankar-v27"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T14:46:43Z","email":"188288378+Shankar-v27@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shankar-v27"},"message":"feat(phase3): staged, resume-aware, non-repeating conversational interviews\n\nTechnical HR and General HR agents now follow the spec §8 flow:\nintroduction -> resume discussion -> projects -> skills/experience ->\ndomain questions (HR variant: leadership/conflict/communication/culture/\ncareer goals) -> follow-ups -> wrap-up. Both agents now actually receive\nthe candidate''s parsed resume profile and round config (previously\ncandidate_context was dropped on the floor), and carry an explicit\nnever-repeat-a-question constraint against the full conversation memory.\n\nCompany-approval gate after successful AI verification (spec §8 removal):\nverified already-compliant - VerificationService auto-approves clean,\nhigh-confidence verifications with no recruiter gate; manual review only\nengages when AI verification does not succeed. No change required.","tree":{"sha":"cbe3eb0bf65ff2f542f5b60db5378f53ecaec876","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/trees/cbe3eb0bf65ff2f542f5b60db5378f53ecaec876"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/commits/aec306d1eada322697ec127988e450e4cb35d71d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188288378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shankar-v27","id":188288378,"login":"Shankar-v27","node_id":"U_kgDOCzkNeg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.gith