sers.noreply.github.com","name":"Shankar-v27"},"message":"feat(phase2): round-scoped questions with approval workflow; remove global bank\n\nQuestions now belong exclusively to a round of an interview (spec §7):\n- V12 migration (additive): questions.round_id, interview_rounds.weightage\n- New round-scoped endpoints: list/create/generate questions per round,\n  approve/reject singly or in bulk; coding generate-and-pin per round\n- Round-scoped AI generation always lands PENDING_APPROVAL; approval\n  state machine: Pending -> (Edit) -> Approved (ACTIVE) / Rejected (DISABLED)\n- QuestionSelector serves approved round-owned questions; shared-pool\n  draw retired (legacy pinned questionIds kept for pre-V12 rounds)\n- Conversational round types (Tech HR/HR/GD/Live) reject pre-generation\n  with 422 - they interview dynamically\n- Frontend: Question Bank + Coding Problems pages removed; per-round\n  Questions panel in the round builder (generate/approve/reject/edit,\n  AI button hidden for conversational types); weightage field on rounds\n\nValidation: mvn compile exit 0, tsc + vite build clean","tree":{"sha":"27ffe79cbeef583e3c33392c74b25a2404a9e548","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/trees/27ffe79cbeef583e3c33392c74b25a2404a9e548"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/commits/0b28357e3b7cf68b4caf5eac617a0a6f65a8e003","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/188288378?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shankar-v27","id":188288378,"login":"Shankar-v27","node_id":"U_kgDOCzkNeg","or