"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commits/4ae1f110920d938a71ab7f390de3cf91609c2489/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T13:35:10Z","email":"188288378+Shankar-v27@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shankar-v27"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T13:35:10Z","email":"188288378+Shankar-v27@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shankar-v27"},"message":"docs: phase 1 executive summary — what is done vs not done\n\nDONE (validated with live requests, one concern per commit):\n- Fixed HTTP 500 on all conversational AI endpoints (camelCase attr\n  access on snake_case pydantic models)\n- Mounted the missing code-execution router (404 -> real sandbox runs)\n- Removed every silent stub fallback in question/coding generation,\n  OCR, and resume parsing (503 unconfigured / 502 real provider error)\n- Removed canned defaults that masked agent output (fraud always\n  APPROVE, scores always 0, interviews never finishing)\n- Added interview_summarizer and answer_evaluator agents; fixed\n  round-type -> agent routing for real backend enum names\n- Provider hardening: 503/422 handlers, per-call logging, transient-only\n  retries; backend now surfaces the AI service''s real error detail\n- anthropic SDK pinned; mvn compile/test + pytest all green\n\nNOT DONE (blocked or deferred):\n- Real-key E2E validation of every AI endpoint (awaiting ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)\n- Full React -> Spring -> FastAPI -> Claude trace + live-stack\n  regression checklist (needs key + running Postgres/backend)\n- Face-match remains a dev stub pending product decision (not an LLM task)\n- Duplicate Claude gateway + duplicated schema block deferred to a\n  later phase (smallest-safe-change discipline)\n- Phases 2-8 of the remediation protocol not yet started","tree":{"sha":"41bdcab2613653589d942571a009f9644e712a35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/trees/41bdcab