scriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shankar-v27","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/commits/33783a2f6e6d3d09b3308e3427cbd1642becd5e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-26T16:10:34Z","email":"188288378+Shankar-v27@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shankar-v27"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-26T16:10:34Z","email":"188288378+Shankar-v27@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shankar-v27"},"message":"HireMind AI backend: Spring Boot orchestration + Python AI service\n\nEnterprise multi-agent recruitment platform backend.\n\n- Spring Boot (Java 21) orchestration layer: layered architecture, JWT auth\n  with refresh rotation, RBAC, Redis rate limiting, standardized responses,\n  correlation IDs, immutable audit trail.\n- Full domain: admin/company/candidate onboarding with bulk import, interview\n  workflow engine (composable rounds, 5 progression modes), question & coding\n  banks with approval-gated AI generation, assessment engine (auto-save,\n  deterministic scoring, sandboxed execution, AI interviews), two-gate\n  candidate flow (identity verification + resume), fraud/proctoring,\n  schedulers, dashboards.\n- PostgreSQL schema via Flyway (V1-V11); Redis caching.\n- Python FastAPI AI microservice: question/coding generation, OCR, resume\n  parsing, evaluation, conversational interview agent, fraud analysis, dev\n  code sandbox. Claude-backed with deterministic stub fallback.\n- Docker Compose, Dockerfiles, README, architecture docs. 15/15 unit tests.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"74808faed1e20e36df37340bbeae381301af778c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/trees/74808faed1e20e36df37340bbeae381301af778c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Knowhere-06/Hiremind-AI/git/commits/33783a2f6e6d3d09b3308e3427cbd1642becd5e6","verificatio