ttps://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commits/36d484eebec4b0f984ec093d28e09d1d565f28a3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T12:45:15Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T12:45:15Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(milestones): stop counting a timeline that has not loaded (#35)\n\nitems.length is zero while the query is pending and while it has failed, so\nthe subtitle read \"0 momentos especiais registrados\" — a sentence about the\nfamily, not about the request. On failure it sat above \"Não foi possível\ncarregar os marcos.\", asserting a count and then admitting nothing was read.\n\nMeasured against the running stack, by delaying and by failing the request:\n\n  before  loading  \"0 momentos especiais registrados\"\n          error    \"0 momentos especiais registrados\"  above the error\n  after   loading  \"Carregando os marcos…\"\n          error    no subtitle, error alone\n          data     \"4 momentos especiais registrados\"   (unchanged)\n\nFourth and last screen with this shape. A source sweep of all six\nauthenticated routes found the pattern in the dashboard, /vaccines,\n/appointments and here; /notifications, /profile and the vaccination card\nderive nothing from a possibly-empty list.\n\nThe locale files are written with LF, which is what main stores. Writing them\nwith CRLF rewrites all 681 lines in the diff and conflicts with every other\nbranch that touches a locale — measured on an earlier branch that did exactly\nthat and carried +2179/-2060 for three added keys.","tree":{"sha":"4a87d20e1b18ca00fdad085788fa80f277d18e85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/git/trees/4a87d20e1b18ca00fdad085788fa80f277d18e85"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/git/commits/36d484eebec4b0f984ec093d28e09d1d565f28a3","verification":{"payload":"tree 4a87d20e1b18ca00fdad085788fa80f277d18e85\nparent 942c11cba5571f99b378b32b9e8cc32c57294642\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1787748315 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787748315 -0300\n\nfix(milestones): stop counting a timeline that has not loaded (#35)\n\nitems.length is zero while the query is pending and while it has failed, so\nthe subtitle read \"0 momentos especiais registrados\" — a sentence about the\nfamily, not about the request. On failure it sat above \"Não foi possível\ncarregar os marcos.\", asserting a count and then admitting nothing was read.\n\nMeasured against the running stack, by delaying and by failing the request:\n\n  before  loading  \"0 momentos especiais registrados\"\n          error    \"0 momentos especiais registrados\"  above the error\n  after   loading  \"Carregando os marcos…\"\n          error    no subtitle, error alone\n          data     \"4 momentos especiais registrados\"   (unchanged)\n\nFourth and last screen with this shape. A source sweep of all six\nauthenticated routes found the pattern in the dashboard, /vaccines,\n/appointments and here; /notifications, /profile and the vaccination card\nderive nothing from a possibly-empty list.\n\nThe locale files are written with LF, which is what main stores. Writing them\nwith CRLF rewrites all 681 lines in the diff and conflicts with every other\nbranch that touches a locale — measured on an earlier branch that did exactly\nthat and carried +2179/-2060 for three added keys.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjt/bCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAi9QQAGqe1XNszBXXMP67nNvv/PMl\nrdPcioejCjfpMlwuhEBSPzAK/wOBLTneoTXClvHZsqdGredak43nbFtiCGQ12WP/\n6IAPdeP9b6bcw3i2eAqzJ3WQwdYmV3hw40EDGHlgMvj5JlbmJYig9gMhiZxdZoku\n9Fqga/oX7yAgLlpUjFyXWhAQBgMnxDZLNQ5UkFtVQEDcrpAFabFPEjnyXv442bPE\nnRlpQqRKktAp2UNK5VsZKuEAgp2tF6N0tsPnTyzDEQUQUD30Fj3oFxtEYxpfR3Ey\nOVj2bR0Km/EYdMiU/6BWSCg92PGQUYuGqjvZCjHbCL2E1Pmh+Y7ChFiQ3nwv7HWb\n52KeOoSSNBFXyPbSkDq6ScSLrXUEP6k630g5b7mSOoI7FbU2OxTAUpZW9XFBvxmz\nd+QsCU52qIMIt92Cmxnfn7KOIcTp54mZ907cu6rP45ZF7ykl7JVcEvDqXnbMW1Ih\nckJQq35r8dVX6ux+kFq+8kOM/QrXf6u38eOw9dNOQ6sYnEZIFnWbZte97jWwYS1n\naTYBgIS8P3hx1jdG2TiC0dZMoL24IsOHFCk067a6Va0yKIU433ecWOmy1tv9oi8t\n3rGEn/+AT+lXDymZQ+isTkj/OPb7zg0Qp/1FxBgVVKT1oMytI4xYboGg4mr4/h2W\nf0rlprgkiSUD9Urns6iO\n=ftB4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T12:45:16Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commit/36d484eebec4b0f984ec093d28e09d1d565f28a3","node_id":"C_kwDOTkG-FdoAKDM2ZDQ4NGVlYmVjNGIwZjk4NGVjMDkzZDI4ZTA5ZDFkNTY1ZjI4YTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commit/942c11cba5571f99b378b32b9e8cc32c57294642","sha":"942c11cba5571f99b378b32b9e8cc32c57294642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commits/942c11cba5571f99b378b32b9e8cc32c57294642"}],"sha":"36d484eebec4b0f984ec093d28e09d1d565f28a3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commits/36d484eebec4b0f984ec093d28e09d1d565f28a3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commits/942c11cba5571f99b378b32b9e8cc32c57294642/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T12:45:11Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T12:45:11Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(appointments): stop counting a list that has not loaded (#34)\n\nBoth counts are derived from `items`, which is an empty array while the\nquery is pending and while it has failed. The summary rendered\nunconditionally, so the page printed \"0 realizadas · 0 agendadas\" for the\nwhole load, and on failure printed it directly above \"Não foi possível\ncarregar as consultas.\" — asserting a count and then admitting, one line\ndown, that it had read nothing.\n\nMeasured against the running stack, by delaying and by failing the\nappointments request:\n\n  before  loading  \"Consultas  0 realizadas · 0 agendadas\"\n          error    \"0 realizadas · 0 agendadas  /  Não foi possível carregar…\"\n  after   loading  \"Consultas  Carregando as consultas…\"\n          error    \"Consultas  /  Não foi possível carregar as consultas.\"\n          data     \"Consultas  2 realizadas · 2 agendadas\"   (unchanged)\n\nNothing on error: the message below already says the list did not load, and\nrepeating it in a subtitle only competes with it for attention.\n\nSame defect and same treatment as the vaccine summary, deliberately — a\ncount derived from an empty list is indistinguishable from a count of zero,\nand this is the third screen where that mattered.","tree":{"sha":"f2e6358f12bcaedec9adea7f14dfedba2712586a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/git/trees/f2e6358f12bcaedec9adea7f14dfedba2712586a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/git/commits/942c11cba5571f99b378b32b9e8cc32c57294642","verification":{"payload":"tree f2e6358f12bcaedec9adea7f14dfedba2712586a\nparent dd12486ee9a8d77ec5ddfd466697c351e334882b\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1787748311 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787748311 -0300\n\nfix(appointments): stop counting a list that has not loaded (#34)\n\nBoth counts are derived from `items`, which is an empty array while the\nquery is pending and while it has failed. The summary rendered\nunconditionally, so the page printed \"0 realizadas · 0 agendadas\" for the\nwhole load, and on failure printed it directly above \"Não foi possível\ncarregar as consultas.\" — asserting a count and then admitting, one line\ndown, that it had read nothing.\n\nMeasured against the running stack, by delaying and by failing the\nappointments request:\n\n  before  loading  \"Consultas  0 realizadas · 0 agendadas\"\n          error    \"0 realizadas · 0 agendadas  /  Não foi possível carregar…\"\n  after   loading  \"Consultas  Carregando as consultas…\"\n          error    \"Consultas  /  Não foi possível carregar as consultas.\"\n          data     \"Consultas  2 realizadas · 2 agendadas\"   (unchanged)\n\nNothing on error: the message below already says the list did not load, and\nrepeating it in a subtitle only competes with it for attention.\n\nSame defect and same treatment as the vaccine summary, deliberately — a\ncount derived from an empty list is indistinguishable from a count of zero,\nand this is the third screen where that mattered.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjt/XCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAMBoQAFWzCppc6x+aOsRQVQ5ifRjl\nlKBOtnSlbe1GvfgFfhoqHNV/sTdD7ND+tI1dorL0BByPcay98jyVucbjob9bhaZM\nFCXhNq0OZg+T4EyLDCxi2Sc5w28kj6XExfsAAhbcw2cZA0WUoo0VWFebqu4942sr\nWgAFOa1SXzD2enFDFLi92G396kS+czp5kZpo3q69CdC4Hf1JZeM6FjoYuDE5I2wA\n/4ZD1QPRVxIRYET0vl+dkhX0gyTn8pBgporNLN+oH2IgnuSOARGE8mmC2nHL4Kyl\nf0FyhR6f83VvjEOrOSrNY+3AS9OotUQJ6orIwcHdZttVrUT5Jws41OYe0C3ra2+B\nMUCIMclIunHfGCNXduDW9Zdc1PT8t5/Ku8TsxMRaWrCsQcSqu0cHmbMikp++8ewB\n+hWWZfQ4fpJybfJV9sbd+1t7E5s45hjpUu0B2mMBorGxhylkXzbD9vPR35A8nO/Q\nDAHvQPc5Yww8K8rVzRfTxwjmAmzsBMbYVfPO5frZh/bUuqhmPPsTKJwv9wZ5X1Pb\n/KDxMkf2ELjYThV2n3frbv20c0WVOzXSuF9kwwS97sOBRwci+6gydfNNvH3fC9Qp\nhblHO5Es2+YsWMR/nwU5FaA6Rlk4Ci0iyX3lDHpxP/ndYLaEFAYpTqzAHAKBAoHE\neDvuL1BVZ82ckVEI5kDl\n=F32e\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T12:45:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commit/942c11cba5571f99b378b32b9e8cc32c57294642","node_id":"C_kwDOTkG-FdoAKDk0MmMxMWNiYTU1NzFmOTliMzc4YjMyYjllOGNjMzJjNTcyOTQ2NDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commit/dd12486ee9a8d77ec5ddfd466697c351e334882b","sha":"dd12486ee9a8d77ec5ddfd466697c351e334882b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commits/dd12486ee9a8d77ec5ddfd466697c351e334882b"}],"sha":"942c11cba5571f99b378b32b9e8cc32c57294642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commits/942c11cba5571f99b378b32b9e8cc32c57294642"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commits/dd12486ee9a8d77ec5ddfd466697c351e334882b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T12:45:01Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T12:45:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(vaccines): do not offer to print a card that has no rows (#33)\n\nThe print button called window.print() unconditionally. With the calendar\nquery failing it sent \"Não foi possível carregar a carteira de vacinação.\"\nto paper under the heading \"Carteira de Vacinação\", and during the 3.1s the\nqueries spend retrying it printed \"Carregando…\".\n\nA vaccination card is a document people hand to a clinic. An error message\nwearing that title is worse than no page at all.\n\nPrinting is now offered only when there are rows: not pending, not errored,\nand rows.length > 0.\n\nVerified on the rebuilt container, both directions, because a control that\nis always disabled is its own bug:\n\n  against the real API   disabled  (the error state)\n  with a stubbed 200     enabled   (rows render, card is printable)\n\nThe stub also answers a question the broken contract was hiding: the card UI\nitself is correct end to end. Given a response matching vaccineCalendarSchema\nit renders the header, the four columns and the rows. What is missing is the\nAPI''s side of the contract, not this screen.","tree":{"sha":"2b3dd6a911ed8c497d65a9af6e7ee881e24af7dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/git/trees/2b3dd6a911ed8c497d65a9af6e7ee881e24af7dd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/git/commits/dd12486ee9a8d77ec5ddfd466697c351e334882b","verification":{"payload":"tree 2b3dd6a911ed8c497d65a9af6e7ee881e24af7dd\nparent 079d52cf87ad219ec47d4a5fbd49cf5f89e8ff44\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1787748301 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787748301 -0300\n\nfix(vaccines): do not offer to print a card that has no rows (#33)\n\nThe print button called window.print() unconditionally. With the calendar\nquery failing it sent \"Não foi possível carregar a carteira de vacinação.\"\nto paper under the heading \"Carteira de Vacinação\", and during the 3.1s the\nqueries spend retrying it printed \"Carregando…\".\n\nA vaccination card is a document people hand to a clinic. An error message\nwearing that title is worse than no page at all.\n\nPrinting is now offered only when there are rows: not pending, not errored,\nand rows.length > 0.\n\nVerified on the rebuilt container, both directions, because a control that\nis always disabled is its own bug:\n\n  against the real API   disabled  (the error state)\n  with a stubbed 200     enabled   (rows render, card is printable)\n\nThe stub also answers a question the broken contract was hiding: the card UI\nitself is correct end to end. Given a response matching vaccineCalendarSchema\nit renders the header, the four columns and the rows. What is missing is the\nAPI''s side of the contract, not this screen.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjt/NCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaU4QAJCIDK/ZnlB0bN78b5VlwMtl\nmBCHHpOBI4uMaqLe4yNroWDnb7k8TYpfoDddjsq6eEoaHVWTyBGEMS2EsRnvOKoO\nZ5O/r4SFrMxZeSKaHL2vfYag