hub.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commits/079d52cf87ad219ec47d4a5fbd49cf5f89e8ff44"}],"sha":"dd12486ee9a8d77ec5ddfd466697c351e334882b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commits/dd12486ee9a8d77ec5ddfd466697c351e334882b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commits/079d52cf87ad219ec47d4a5fbd49cf5f89e8ff44/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T12:44:56Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T12:44:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(a11y): give the mobile header three equal 44px targets (#32)\n\n\"Adicionar Filho\" and \"Ver meu perfil\" were 32x32 — p-1.5 around a 20px icon\n— while ThemeToggle sitting between them was 36x36. Three controls in one\nrow, three sizes, and the two smallest were the smallest targets in the app\nafter the invite CTA.\n\nThey clear WCAG 2.5.8 (24px, AA) and axe''s target-size passes them. What they\nmiss is 2.5.5 (44px, AAA), and more immediately they are inconsistent with\neach other in a header the thumb reaches for on every page.\n\nAll three are now 44x44. Nothing moves visually: the fills are transparent\nand the icons stay centred at their own size, so the growth is hit area only.\nThemeToggle takes the size through className rather than gaining a variant,\nbecause 44px is right here and not at its other call sites.\n\nMeasured on the rebuilt container at 390px, signed in as a seeded family:\n44x44 / 44x44 / 44x44, and the header still does not scroll horizontally —\nthree 44px controls plus two 4px gaps is 140px of the 350px content width.\n\nScope note: a sweep of the six authenticated pages at 390px found 22 targets\nunder 44px. Most are not this defect — inline text links (\"Ver tudo\" at 16px\ntall) are exempt from 2.5.8 by the inline exception, and the h-8 form submits\nare a separate question about primary-action scale. This commit fixes the one\nset that is inconsistent within a single row.","tree":{"sha":"e1e97f1bec42ddaf14878471c06533e53c6a78b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/git/trees/e1e97f1bec42ddaf14878471c06533e53c6a78b5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/git/commits/079d52cf87ad219ec47d4a5fbd49cf5f89e8ff44","verification":{"payload":"tree e1e97f1bec42ddaf14878471c06533e53c6a78b5\nparent 33ab887ed3aef3c389a0728926ac2095d46419d3\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1787748296 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787748296 -0300\n\nfix(a11y): give the mobile header three equal 44px targets (#32)\n\n\"Adicionar Filho\" and \"Ver meu perfil\" were 32x32 — p-1.5 around a 20px icon\n— while ThemeToggle sitting between them was 36x36. Three controls in one\nrow, three sizes, and the two smallest were the smallest targets in the app\nafter the invite CTA.\n\nThey clear WCAG 2.5.8 (24px, AA) and axe''s target-size passes them. What they\nmiss is 2.5.5 (44px, AAA), and more immediately they are inconsistent with\neach other in a header the thumb reaches for on every page.\n\nAll three are now 44x44. Nothing moves visually: the fills are transparent\nand the icons stay centred at their own size, so the growth is hit area only.\nThemeToggle takes the size through className rather than gaining a variant,\nbecause 44px is right here and not at its other call sites.\n\nMeasured on the rebuilt container at 390px, signed in as a seeded family:\n44x44 / 44x44 / 44x44, and the header still does not scroll horizontally —\nthree 44px controls plus two 4px gaps is 140px of the 350px content width.\n\nScope note: a sweep of the six authenticated pages at 390px found 22 targets\nunder 44px. Most are not this defect — inline text links (\"Ver tudo\" at 16px\ntall) are exempt from 2.5.8 by the inline exception, and the h-8 form submits\nare a separate question about primary-action scale. This commit fixes the one\nset that is inconsistent within a single row.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjt/ICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAyIQAB45y2kRp6QtADq464U7+EjI\n3SBDFEEym41NyXW/UgsSpBrWN7tasPgR/zrKyUhz1bGW2SxOVbDbbcSBy3aOuGEw\n+4Q0o/4eTBcWZpTjDLpnVfYZmrZka5hY1OdCVh/cH66VD1rm4K/0jjBTORH35TlB\nnOE6TVnq1gzjg2Pwf1zDg8G8CHXFUX+Xt7TUTofuxFg3h9VGvAZIjYEOnk4fh6K1\nOyTFnd/4gy2VyGUE1GHc3nbNCdc6ZZphehiNkZ9lImibP5lHtZjeNlB21Yhdre9g\nsQg6w8iwd/WS8a4OV5zRp8ysWubB0/Zvdvtx3PdScJ0/f5oFGuhg0+j2s872z4MM\ndlurpS+fUQ7fp1fam5FyF46nxHiWSsrC9oncF3/DlTUMa6JgQjuf9wD4vHTEOnUQ\nhnaO9mT4RDWNkSQRfH+iHSOJTEMsYsQsX6XiKtaB5bFQy2oU1Ww8FFtGXeBXSpXp\nce5vAyj//TGGlo33NuswjpnIx1WzSeZR3mGVfxQhQmYQF37P+zuglG4oigWh1pb2\nt5D2ZAWs7BYdyiLZjrMQoBdDgwox1tQj5AhNx6NSpgoPvcKuLHoeXFvTYU90HOuY\nWk8+x7nfX5b+EGfBlumHB9bArOC1GwZijFiwv8Oebs6Rjf8EXOehsjiHqp4icsqp\nfLmfLG0HySOfqonpwLvj\n=axex\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T12:44:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commit/079d52cf87ad219ec47d4a5fbd49cf5f89e8ff44","node_id":"C_kwDOTkG-FdoAKDA3OWQ1MmNmODdhZDIxOWVjNDdkNGE1ZmJkNDljZjVmODllOGZmNDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commit/33ab887ed3aef3c389a0728926ac2095d46419d3","sha":"33ab887ed3aef3c389a0728926ac2095d46419d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commits/33ab887ed3aef3c389a0728926ac2095d46419d3"}],"sha":"079d52cf87ad219ec47d4a5fbd49cf5f89e8ff44","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commits/079d52cf87ad219ec47d4a5fbd49cf5f89e8ff44"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commits/33ab887ed3aef3c389a0728926ac2095d46419d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T12:44:52Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T12:44:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(invites): size the accept button like a primary action (#31)\n\n\"Aceitar convite\" rendered at 117x32 — the raw Button default. It is the\nonly control on the screen, and the screen exists for that one tap, yet it\nwas the smallest primary action in the app: AuthSubmitButton is 48px and the\ndashboard hero CTA is ~52px.\n\nNot a WCAG failure — axe passes it, and 32px clears the 24px AA target floor.\nIt is the scale inconsistency: a page whose entire purpose is one decision\nwas presenting that decision more quietly than any form submit in the app.\n\nNow h-12 and full width, matching AuthSubmitButton. Measured on the rebuilt\ncontainer against a pending invite:\n\n  mobile 390    117x32 -> 326x48\n  tablet 768    117x32 -> 448x48\n  desktop 1440  117x32 -> 448x48\n\nNo horizontal scroll at any of the three, and 48px clears the 44px AAA\ntarget size as well.\n\nThe fill stays --primary. Which colour a primary action should take is a\nquestion this repo has not settled — the app currently varies it per screen —\nand scale is fixable without settling it.\n\naxe (wcag2a, wcag2aa, wcag22aa) clean on the screen in both themes.","tree":{"sha":"afae8351fe9b07e275adbea3224341bc525149f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/git/trees/afae8351fe9b07e275adbea3224341bc525149f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/git/commits/33ab887ed3aef3c389a0728926ac2095d46419d3","verification":{"payload":"tree afae8351fe9b07e275adbea3224341bc525149f4\nparent 61690e3bcbd56292479a87500e6df95a9812581c\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1787748292 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787748292 -0300\n\nfix(invites): size the accept button like a primary action (#31)\n\n\"Aceitar convite\" rendered at 117x32 — the raw Button default. It is the\nonly control on the screen, and the screen exists for that one tap, yet it\nwas the smallest primary action in the app: AuthSubmitButton is 48px and the\ndashboard hero CTA is ~52px.\n\nNot a WCAG failure — axe passes it, and 32px clears the 24px AA target floor.\nIt is the scale inconsistency: a page whose entire purpose is one decision\nwas presenting that decision more quietly than any form submit in the app.\n\nNow h-12 and full width, matching AuthSubmitButton. Measured on the rebuilt\ncontainer against a pending invite:\n\n  mobile 390    117x32 -> 326x48\n  tablet 768    117x32 -> 448x48\n  desktop 1440  117x32 -> 448x48\n\nNo horizontal scroll at any of the three, and 48px clears the 44px AAA\ntarget size as well.\n\nThe fill stays --primary. Which colour a primary action should take is a\nquestion this repo has not settled — the app currently varies it per screen —\nand scale is fixable without settling it.\n\naxe (wcag2a, wcag2aa, wcag22aa) clean on the screen in both themes.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjt/ECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACsYQAH5l8mErvh8XCQipKwiDeSoJ\nRw3PkbDdl0PYfm9AM4It9psBkJr93XMT0B05DQ/L2zTTQYKpIFdvFKZnWQ5vLEOi\nDjU/nFOW3LbCZRjvM9DeAy4E4Ib/NpRvLqNafgLBHlZJqWSZulbuZj6cNNNp9fkS\n8GW8mlgCDPUzl7OIECPYaDhnjxAjqKgzaof6FgJuNpG2+2oH9+cHuUW0wG4aCk+O\n9kLw2yKuRdkaNWzb