elcsantana/cygnus/commits/4290c0a06ae817ae7eeda5358ac70e05f22b7ee6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30626822?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/samuelcsantana","id":30626822,"login":"samuelcsantana","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwNjI2ODIy","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samuelcsantana","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/commits/44be587f15eb00e16ed446670cba56f3ef6eb04a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T12:42:14Z","email":"samuel.ssa89@gmail.com","name":"Samuel Santana"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T12:42:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"test(e2e): bring the specs up to the current app (#27)\n\nFive of the seven specs failed on every run, and the queue entry called it \"an\nold dashboard selector\". It was not: they described an architecture two\nrebuilds ago.\n\n    link \"Começar Agora: Adicionar Criança\"  ->  button \"Cadastrar Primeiro Filho\"\n    navegação para /add-baby                 ->  um diálogo, sem navegação\n    navegação para /appointments/new         ->  idem\n    heading \"Painel da Família\"              ->  a saudação do dashboard\n    formulário de uma tela                   ->  assistente de 2 e de 3 passos\n\nThe wizards are what actually cost the time: `addBaby` clicked \"Criar Perfil\"\nstraight after filling the name and waited thirty seconds for a button that\nlives one step away, behind \"Continuar\". Same shape in the appointment dialog,\nwhich has three steps and drops the \"whose child?\" one when there is only one.\n\nAssertions were rewritten to check what the screens now show, and to check\nsomething that can only be true if the record exists: the child''s name **and**\nits \"Editar perfil de X\" action, rather than a heading that no longer renders.\n\n`log-vaccine` is marked `fixme`, not fixed. It is blocked rather than stale —\nthe vaccine calendar has not loaded since 13/08 (the frontend requires\n`guidance`, `recommendationKind` and a `{ metadata, groups }` envelope the API\ndoes not send, so Zod rejects a 200), and with no vaccine row on screen there is\nnothing to mark as applied. Whether its selectors still work cannot be known\nuntil the data comes back. A suite with one permanent failure teaches everyone\nto ignore the suite; removing the `fixme` is the first test that the contract\nwas fixed.\n\nResult: 6 passed, 1 skipped, 0 failed. It was 5 failed before.","tree":{"sha":"b577ba43a785f3eb776f0e3a88566a2559799d5b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/git/trees/b577ba43a785f3eb776f0e3a88566a2559799d5b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/samuelcsantana/cygnus/git/commits/44be587f15eb00e16ed446670cba56f3ef6eb04a","verification":{"payload":"tree b577ba43a785f3eb776f0e3a88566a2559799d5b\nparent c92a6df6e3e2b240ee214295762d0160aa15edb6\nauthor Samuel Santana <samuel.ssa89@gmail.com> 1787748134 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787748134 -0300\n\ntest(e2e): bring the specs up to the current app (#27)\n\nFive of the seven specs failed on every run, and the queue entry called it \"an\nold dashboard selector\". It was not: they described an architecture two\nrebuilds ago.\n\n    link \"Começar Agora: Adicionar Criança\"  ->  button \"Cadastrar Primeiro Filho\"\n    navegação para /add-baby                 ->  um diálogo, sem navegação\n    navegação para /appointments/new         ->  idem\n    heading \"Painel da Família\"              ->  a saudação do dashboard\n    formulário de uma tela                   ->  assistente de 2 e de 3 passos\n\nThe wizards are what actually cost the time: `addBaby` clicked \"Criar Perfil\"\nstraight after filling the name and waited thirty seconds for a button that\nlives one step away, behind \"Continuar\". Same shape in the appointment dialog,\nwhich has three steps and drops the \"whose child?\" one when there is only one.\n\nAssertions were rewritten to check what the screens now show, and to check\nsomething that can only be true if the record exists: the child''s name **and**\nits \"Editar perfil de X\" action, rather than a heading that no longer renders.\n\n`log-vaccine` is marked `fixme`, not fixed. It is blocked rather than stale —\nthe vaccine calendar has not loaded since 13/08 (the frontend requires\n`guidance`, `recommendationKind` and a `{ metadata, groups }` envelope the API\ndoes not send, so Zod rejects a 200), and with no vaccine row on screen there is\nnothing to mark as applied. Whether its selectors still work cannot be known\nuntil the data comes back. A suite with one permanent failure teaches everyone\nto ignore the suite; removing the `fixme` is the first test that the contract\nwas fixed.\n\nResult: 6 passed, 1 skipped, 0 failed. It was 5 failed before.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjt8mCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYMMQAKWNjHc4hKNMctAbXMj+IxlE\n9Haiv+5ySsTTrWKH9ODq7rBStFIudIVnw7iSKsd8I6zHH3xV7neTGNfKoALZiYHg\nv4hr506nxSbQqE/X405SNzhChvF2C9D47utzKkOAoO84l99NgpgePcIGeDBEiq2o\nCJ7Fo1P9GnsYi0MXjN7QQzdb+XLIceffjWL9p3L9Tt/ZJVj1si/H07PyT48rJ4N5\nfNTX1rYdRtmPBqh+CPo4fOfvnJRT8Q8qaNkCCuXeXqfq4fyuGMW4atRU2WP1Gj5C\nOkcm1Pyy064O8UQ6xG7V9R7UMAejufZDov2/bHLEnXeU