ed the missing i18n strings it\nand the dashboards needed\n- Consolidated admin/cms staff session+auth into one shared module\n(`@repo/shared/staff-auth`) — the two apps had 5 byte-for-byte-identical\nfiles each (differing only by cookie name), and cms''s copy had zero test\ncoverage. Wired cms''s `StaffAuthGuard`/`StaffAuthRuntimeProvider` into\nits middleware and `(protected)` layout, which previously only handled\nlocale routing.\n\n## Test plan\n\n<!-- How this was verified: commands run, checks passed, manual steps.\n-->\n\n- `pnpm --filter admin --filter cms run lint` — pass\n- `pnpm --filter admin --filter cms run typecheck` — pass\n- `turbo run lint / typecheck / build` (pre-push hook, full workspace) —\npass\n- `turbo run test` (full workspace, incl. new `@repo/shared` staff-auth\nsuite) — pass, 289+ tests\n- Manually verified `/vi` (admin) no longer 500s after the client/server\nboundary fix for the new `core/session` module\n\n## Related\n\n<!-- Refs #<issue-number>, or \"None\". -->\n\nRefs #24\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant co-author attribution in this PR''s commit messages\nor description (see CONTRIBUTING.md).","tree":{"sha":"2fde80d9f886a342f3ce2b7227c8e9b060e678d4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/2fde80d9f886a342f3ce2b7227c8e9b060e678d4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/dd04524e02435dd495a41c380ea8891f594418a8","verification":{"payload":"tree 2fde80d9f886a342f3ce2b7227c8e9b060e678d4\nparent 051a3a1f32d2196061273d9822e12462042b8c62\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1787816481 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787816481 +0700\n\nfeat(admin,cms): redesign dashboard, tables, and login page (#73)\n\n## Summary\n\n<!-- What changed, in 1-3 bullet points. -->\n\n- Rebuilt the admin dashboard (real-data stat tiles for\nproducts/orders/low-stock/staff + an order-status breakdown chart) and\nthe cms dashboard (products/categories stat tiles)\n- Added shared shell components (`DataTable`, `PageHeader`, `StatCard`,\n`TableSkeleton`) and reworked categories/inventory/orders/products/staff\nadmin pages onto `DataTable`\n- Redesigned the admin login page and added the missing i18n strings it\nand the dashboards needed\n- Consolidated admin/cms staff session+auth into one shared module\n(`@repo/shared/staff-auth`) — the two apps had 5 byte-for-byte-identical\nfiles each (differing only by cookie name), and cms''s copy had zero test\ncoverage. Wired cms''s `StaffAuthGuard`/`StaffAuthRuntimeProvider` into\nits middleware and `(protected)` layout, which previously only handled\nlocale routing.\n\n## Test plan\n\n<!-- How this was verified: commands run, checks passed, manual steps.\n-->\n\n- `pnpm --filter admin --filter cms run lint` — pass\n- `pnpm --filter admin --filter cms run typecheck` — pass\n- `turbo run lint / typecheck / build` (pre-push hook, full workspace) —\npass\n- `turbo run test` (full workspace, incl. new `@repo/shared` staff-auth\nsuite) — pass, 289+ tests\n- Manually verified `/vi` (admin) no longer 500s after the client/server\nboundary fix for the new `core/session` module\n\n## Related\n\n<!-- Refs #<issue-number>, or \"None\". -->\n\nRefs #24\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant co-author attribution in this PR''s commit messages\nor description (see CONTRIBUTING.md).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqj+oiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHDIQAKlf00nXbcdnrHD8KWlAW+k1\nxdZCV2aY6ynQkCVZFfrmOpH/BgXEhWwoUp0Z/99z4rtu1vN/DbbB29u6njcnEe2r\n4c32s0FP7B48rNyQ+YYkuv9Ncm25fYl/c84VL8b4V72M16Nxt8XxmHzu93/VngkU\nhWNb6AiZkNPBMaEAqto+ohtDng/yiIJwb/TScRdjJCPDtQ/R8LmmK2FpscX7O2PK\naLHSISuD0YgwfVwmvpYI+X/bZpMkS1QSG9G6tQ3tx6IRxT9awPB7ziMiM3Y+WtBw\nWjg8YdFB6YIsZykUpTbf0BpzMzzPaj1t4OTsax4eU4Vxtc00rwWYO/pMYtwweCsK\nLuE2sZ8OisMlGN+ieox/3ig3YSOFcPWBgHdWUezMXklLgzX/NWEMydN/tZUrOn+O\n65QNzrx0f7AvlOLVUYvxaTItzl32IQamQAt8IoZxvk5RQYlc+dgogvf8AjzvcHDA\