or the\nlocale-aware `@/i18n/navigation` everywhere in both apps.\n- Admin''s `middleware.ts` also gains an auth-guard (redirect-to-login /\nredirect-away-from-login) mirroring storefront''s pattern, backed by a\nnew `admin_access_token` cookie set alongside the existing in-memory\ntoken store.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `pnpm test` (all workspaces via turbo) — passing, including 2 existing\ntest files updated to wrap `NextIntlClientProvider`/mock\n`@/i18n/navigation` after the migration.\n- `pnpm typecheck` and `pnpm lint` (all workspaces) — clean.\n- `pnpm build` for `admin`, `cms`, and `storefront` — all succeed;\n`admin`/`cms` route trees confirmed under `/[locale]/*`.\n- Manually inspected for leftover hardcoded strings in the migrated\nadmin files (none found).\n\n## Related\n\nRefs #71\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant co-author attribution in this PR''s commit messages\nor description (see CONTRIBUTING.md).","tree":{"sha":"7d33d6b66ff66369534b86d78687b942c40e8078","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/7d33d6b66ff66369534b86d78687b942c40e8078"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/051a3a1f32d2196061273d9822e12462042b8c62","verification":{"payload":"tree 7d33d6b66ff66369534b86d78687b942c40e8078\nparent d5f95497c7927782fe27610f8b7e73801dc6f1f0\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1787761494 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787761494 +0700\n\nfeat(admin,cms,i18n): add next-intl config to admin and cms (#72)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Add a shared `@repo/i18n` package (locale list, `next-intl`\nrequest-config factory, locale-only middleware factory) so `admin` and\n`cms` no longer lack the translate config `storefront` already has.\n- Wire `next-intl` into both apps: `[locale]` routing, per-app\n`middleware.ts`, `src/i18n/request.ts`, and `src/lang/{vi,en}/*.json`\nmessage files (admin:\ncommon/auth/staff/product/category/inventory/order; cms: common/auth).\n- Migrate every hardcoded Vietnamese string in `admin`''s UI to\n`next-intl` messages, and swap `next/navigation`/`next/link` for the\nlocale-aware `@/i18n/navigation` everywhere in both apps.\n- Admin''s `middleware.ts` also gains an auth-guard (redirect-to-login /\nredirect-away-from-login) mirroring storefront''s pattern, backed by a\nnew `admin_access_token` cookie set alongside the existing in-memory\ntoken store.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `pnpm test` (all workspaces via turbo) — passing, including 2 existing\ntest files updated to wrap `NextIntlClientProvider`/mock\n`@/i18n/navigation` after the migration.\n- `pnpm typecheck` and `pnpm lint` (all workspaces) — clean.\n- `pnpm build` for `admin`, `cms`, and `storefront` — all succeed;\n`admin`/`cms` route trees confirmed under `/[locale]/*`.\n- Manually inspected for leftover hardcoded strings in the migrated\nadmin files (none found).\n\n## Related\n\nRefs #71\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant co-author attribution in this PR''s commit messages\nor description (see CONTRIBUTING.md).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjxNWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABAUQAEjMJVrjPmE8wzBqJsEy+uFY\n3TuHw113wpuDkC44lBbnmUrSWctXY+aTO9zwSDoNW0jLiMDvuMi/o97JI3SSGF9I\nFe3GbAu/yaxlt7AZWxfY48ALQXc5bqimfH+2xIkgeRGXmmwAmohqPM5mADP3I345\nMFkhKs6imja8MJa0I1tee2mBf2HO4GAfJ5mibzZK1fevAcjOt9HbZHY1R1T+rN09\npxX+rETAPNNJsr9C9QrC06upVy60mVc8PJGTDQ9ZNrHGuMAeUgSe3KVvMRB58FxX\nPzdunwqWMPu2W7JNWJ0S3s4UrtiSwQtXViWqVotqbFHsyIz6tx3EUWq4d23gWVtr\nGdL2JA2LDGF0RJ605MZA2lTq2NIqtBupmKi2FiACCtKSwLb0l/8GCokgFvBHvRvE\nQULc2o2ZeTvgj1SZbG52AAnDi+d07MLlUQT0wiMmEauSVoiedQB6Hw2UTmkSylO+\nc9GXnZuk2DIiERw6zq1/q8MDETZgaIxqxUpmYiZ3vuL8R+bhRWCX8yry1D7I/2Cu\nHLZO2Gc6aIbJrnvmEJAiuA00GspO7EYodQKOTjubwku7yydsVMq0yhm+UzP904vl\nGj9DsBi/iLE1N8RKlNUqAT8Jdu/kjKdca9mVQnQEXxSiJM5esMpx0ZG5Fa/Jvuji\n9/Gr/uJMg2hwYkCkTirl\n=sonc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T16:24:54Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/051a3a1f32d2196061273d9822e12462042b8c62","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKDA1MWEzYTFmMzJkMjE5NjA2MTI3M2Q5ODIyZTEyNDYyMDQyYjhjNjI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/d5f95497c7927782fe27610f8b7e73801dc6f1f0","sha":"d5f95497c7927782fe27610f8b7e73801dc6f1f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/d5f95497c7927782fe27610f8b7e73801dc6f1f0"}],"sha":"051a3a1f32d2196061273d9822e12462042b8c62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/051a3a1f32d2196061273d9822e12462042b8c62"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/d5f95497c7927782fe27610f8b7e73801dc6f1f0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T09:51:26Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T09:51:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(admin,api-sdk,schemas): staff and role management (issue #23) (#69)\n\n## Summary\n- Implements issue #23 — Admin Staff & Role management (SUPER_ADMIN CRUD\n+ Role assignment, rbac-matrix.md, Decision #78-79). This closes out the\nAdmin issue set (#18-#23).\n- TDD''d at the mock API layer seam (per `/tdd`), same pattern as\n#18-#22.\n\n## Changes\n- `packages/schemas`: `StaffListResponseSchema`,\n`StaffCreateInputSchema` (a new Staff needs at least one Role up front),\n`StaffUpdateInputSchema` (profile fields only — `name`/`isActive`),\n`StaffAssignRolesInputSchema` (its own shape, gated on the separate\n`staff:assign-role` permission per Decision #78-79).\n- `packages/api-sdk/staff-fixtures.ts`: `listStaff`/`createStaff` (409\non duplicate email)/`updateStaffInfo`/`deleteStaff`, and\n`assignStaffRoles` which wraps the already-existing `setStaffRoles` —\nthat function already revoked the target Staff''s refresh session on a\nRole change (Decision #79), so reassignment gets that for free.\n`nextStaffId` is now a real mutable counter (was `const`, never used\nsince nothing created Staff before).\n- `packages/api-sdk`: `admin-staff.ts` endpoints, `/api/admin/staff*`\nMSW handlers gated on a valid Staff session.\n- `apps/admin`: Staff page — list showing each Staff''s Roles *and*\neffective permissions (the union of every assigned Role, via the\nexisting `resolvePermissions`, not just the Role badges) per the\nacceptance criteria; create dialog with Role as a checkbox group\n(multi-Role assignment is a first-class case, not an edge case); a\ndedicated \"Gán Role\" dialog for reassignment; `isActive` toggle; guarded\ndelete. Nav item gated on `staff:read`. No SUPER_ADMIN bypass-all branch\nanywhere in FE logic — `ROLE_PERMISSIONS` (unchanged from #18) lists it\nwith every permission like any other Role.\n\n## Tests\n- 12 new tests in `admin-staff.test.ts`: create (incl. multi-Role,\nduplicate-email 409), update, delete, role reassignment, and the\nDecision #79 check — reassigning a Staff''s Roles invalidates their\nexisting refresh token (`refreshStaffSession` on it now rejects 401).\n- Full regression: `packages/api-sdk` 144/144, `packages/schemas` 25/25,\n`apps/admin` 11/11, `apps/storefront` 289/289, typecheck/lint clean,\n`next build` succeeds for `apps/admin`.\n\nCloses #23.","tree":{"sha":"8d025a29de3b9ee0b11e217d371fab622b0c59e7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/8d025a29de3b9ee0b11e217d371fab622b0c59e7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/d5f95497c7927782fe27610f8b7e73801dc6f1f0","verification":{"payload":"tree 8d025a29de3b9ee0b11e217d371fab622b0c59e7\nparent 8a43f64bfdb0e42315aa50be71c5c01df577c793\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1787737886 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787737886 +0700\n\nfeat(admin,api-sdk,schemas): staff and role management (issue #23) (#69)\n\n## Summary\n- Implements issue #23 — Admin Staff & Role management (SUPER_ADMIN CRUD\n+ Role assignment, rbac-matrix.md, Decision #78-79). This closes out the\nAdmin issue set (#18-#23).\n- TDD''d at the mock API layer seam (per `/tdd`), same pattern as\n#18-#22.\n\n## Changes\n- `packages/schemas`: `StaffListResponseSchema`,\n`StaffCreateInputSchema` (a new Staff needs at least one Role up front),\n`StaffUpdateInputSchema` (profile fields only — `name`/`isActive`),\n`StaffAssignRolesInputSchema` (its own shape, gated on the separate\n`staff:assign-role` permission per Decision #78-79).\n- `packages/api-sdk/staff-fixtures.ts`: `listStaff`/`createStaff` (409\non duplicate email)/`updateStaffInfo`/`deleteStaff`, and\n`assignStaffRoles` which wraps the already-existing `setStaffRoles` —\nthat function already revoked the target Staff''s refresh session on a\nRole change (Decision #79), so reassignment gets that for free.\n`nextStaffId` is now a real mutable counter (was `const`, never used\nsince nothing created Staff before).\n- `packages/api-sdk`: `admin-staff.ts` endpoints, `/api/admin/staff*`\nMSW handlers gated on a valid Staff session.\n- `apps/admin`: Staff page — list showing each Staff''s Roles *and*\neffective permissions (the union of every assigned Role, via the\nexisting `resolvePermissions`, not just the Role badges) per the\nacceptance criteria; create dialog with Role as a checkbox group\n(multi-Role assignment is a first-class case, not an edge case); a\ndedicated \"Gán Role\" dialog for reassignment; `isActive` toggle; guarded\ndelete. Nav item gated on `staff:read`. No SUPER_ADMIN bypass-all branch\nanywhere in FE logic — `ROLE_PERMISSIONS` (unchanged from #18) lists it\nwith every permission like any other Role.\n\n## Tests\n- 12 new tests in `admin-staff.test.ts`: create (incl. multi-Role,\nduplicate-email 409), update, delete, role reassignment, and the\nDecision #79 check — reassigning a Staff''s Roles invalidates their\nexisting refresh token (`refreshStaffSession` on it now rejects 401).\n- Full regression: `packages/api-sdk` 144/144, `packages/schemas` 25/25,\n`apps/admin` 11/11, `apps/storefront` 289/289, typecheck/lint clean,\n`next build` succeeds for `apps/admin`.\n\nCloses #23.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjrceCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA2noQAAv0QHA2INGasOzI/BJbJ4tV\nG+1foszt1MZIp1dWAk4KLchOJVluXGGm2Eh7rwulbYfBCNbXnMadHibAKHMvxlVW\ng5KU8qXn3CLC+1hDEKpv1A6TAdJ73Vbuqc4dLYdjBxAc4wyiRPl6kd05ZOrNfFAQ\nloKYUVigs60FTTFZOrhgTTppqgreMzs7BfiYHZ0eZKeQEyhM1j/0cCjRvuvdxPcH\nTe3feYOiG1kwU6zzEQRNxAuCirfDMI/4myR0bCPFveWJkN4+Pbmv24KJGlrR6oQc\nkGL6+Eu+FCW53kXfnmO86T8yefXgxQbQvdEEY1t39aBrgLl+H9bEBjzyn+rEGVZx\nsXfQ9dEPSijI1o2d1QTbS6btlvdUkC/d/7NAv7oJws7krNYju8VYHpSqg9vf1YBR\ngiQbW4EmUZpZsn5i6arQaiBKZ/g8U/j3juOkSWSot9R13X+AZHI8jtLTUoOse4vm\nh04cq66R+1nROvT6o/2l2vac2+IY+9sII3rAHzNHSLqAHQIkZNwwxlaWsrhzxQdp\nEjnxzU5RTrs33fLs/u4h7k6RteiZMex5AQwqjuXuvZRdvYFrfOIPxYAQNsaihap5\n9nLHJPQzrkFv1Z7pei7wUe0QG/LnzhV3TViqnd5KrwNMx5Aqk+iLyM78r+nP5qvb\nisRsStz75c9iUlNiuTmK\n=DPK8\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T09:51:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/d5f95497c7927782fe27610f8b7e73801dc6f1f0","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKGQ1Zjk1NDk3Yzc5Mjc3ODJmZTI3NjEwZjhiN2U3MzgwMWRjNmYxZjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/8a43f64bfdb0e42315aa50be71c5c01df577c793","sha":"8a43f64bfdb0e42315aa50be71c5c01df577c793","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/8a43f64bfdb0e42315aa50be71c5c01df577c793"}],"sha":"d5f95497c7927782fe27610f8b7e73801dc6f1f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/d5f95497c7927782fe27610f8b7e73801dc6f1f0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/8a43f64bfdb0e42315aa50be71c5c01df577c793/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T09:36:21Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T09:36:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(admin,api-sdk): order status update + return approval (issue #22) (#68)\n\n## Summary\n- Implements issue #22 — Admin Order status update + return approval\n(AD-04).\n- TDD''d at the mock API layer seam (per `/tdd`), same pattern as\n#18–#21.\n\n## Changes\n- `packages/api-sdk/order-transitions.ts`:\n`canAdminTransition`/`adminTransitionsFrom` — one valid forward step at\na time (`PENDING→PROCESSING→PACKED→SHIPPED→DELIVERED`) plus the\n`CANCELLED` branch only from `PENDING`/`PROCESSING`. Shared by the mock\nserver and the Admin UI''s button gating, same single-source-of-truth\npattern as the existing `canCancelOrder`/`canRequestReturn`.\n- `packages/api-sdk/catalog-fixtures.ts`: `releaseSkuStock` — the\ninverse of `commitSkuStock`.\n- `packages/api-sdk/order-fixtures.ts`: `getAllOrders`/`getOrderById`\n(Admin-only, unscoped by Customer), `updateAdminOrderStatus` (validated\nvia `canAdminTransition`, 400 on an invalid transition, 404 on an\nunknown order), `approveOrderReturn` (`RETURN_REQUESTED → RETURNED`,\nreleases every line''s SKU stock back to `available`) and\n`rejectOrderReturn` (`RETURN_REQUESTED → DELIVERED`, stock untouched).\n- `packages/api-sdk`: `admin-orders.ts` endpoints, `/api/admin/orders*`\nMSW handlers gated on a valid Staff session.\n- `apps/admin`: Orders list + detail page. Status-transition buttons\nonly ever render the transitions `canAdminTransition` allows from the\norder''s current status — an invalid transition can''t be attempted from\nthe UI, not just rejected server-side. Return approve/reject shown only\nwhile `RETURN_REQUESTED`, cancel/reject wrapped in a confirm dialog. All\nlogic lives in hooks (`useAdminOrders`/`useOrderMutations`) — UI only\nrenders.\n\n## Tests\n- 14 new tests in `admin-orders.test.ts`: every valid step transition,\nan invalid skip (`PENDING→SHIPPED`), `CANCELLED` refused once past\n`PACKED`, both return branches (stock release verified against\n`getAdminInventory`, stock untouched on reject), 401/404 guards.\n- Full regression: `packages/api-sdk` 132/132, `apps/admin` 11/11,\n`apps/storefront` 289/289, typecheck/lint clean, `next build` succeeds\nfor `apps/admin`.\n\nCloses #22.","tree":{"sha":"e14d078f0d7e43e37eae0d37fa6c4ecb71907315","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/e14d078f0d7e43e37eae0d37fa6c4ecb71907315"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/8a43f64bfdb0e42315aa50be71c5c01df577c793","verification":{"payload":"tree e14d078f0d7e43e37eae0d37fa6c4ecb71907315\nparent 3de1a48d02f7bb5a6f5ba2cf0553ad105b21d809\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1787736981 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787736981 +0700\n\nfeat(admin,api-sdk): order status update + return approval (issue #22) (#68)\n\n## Summary\n- Implements issue #22 — Admin Order status update + return approval\n(AD-04).\n- TDD''d at the mock API layer seam (per `/tdd`), same pattern as\n#18–#21.\n\n## Changes\n- `packages/api-sdk/order-transitions.ts`:\n`canAdminTransition`/`adminTransitionsFrom` — one valid forward step at\na time (`PENDING→PROCESSING→PACKED→SHIPPED→DELIVERED`) plus the\n`CANCELLED` branch only from `PENDING`/`PROCESSING`. Shared by the mock\nserver and the Admin UI''s button gating, same single-source-of-truth\npattern as the existing `canCancelOrder`/`canRequestReturn`.\n- `packages/api-sdk/catalog-fixtures.ts`: `releaseSkuStock` — the\ninverse of `commitSkuStock`.\n- `packages/api-sdk/order-fixtures.ts`: `getAllOrders`/`getOrderById`\n(Admin-only, unscoped by Customer), `updateAdminOrderStatus` (validated\nvia `canAdminTransition`, 400 on an invalid transition, 404 on an\nunknown order), `approveOrderReturn` (`RETURN_REQUESTED → RETURNED`,\nreleases every line''s SKU stock back to `available`) and\n`rejectOrderReturn` (`RETURN_REQUESTED → DELIVERED`, stock untouched).\n- `packages/api-sdk`: `admin-orders.ts` endpoints, `/api/admin/orders*`\nMSW handlers gated on a valid Staff session.\n- `apps/admin`: Orders list + detail page. Status-transition buttons\nonly ever render the transitions `canAdminTransition` allows from the\norder''s current status — an invalid transition can''t be attempted from\nthe UI, not just rejected server-side. Return approve/reject shown only\nwhile `RETURN_REQUESTED`, cancel/reject wrapped in a confirm dialog. All\nlogic lives in hooks (`useAdminOrders`/`useOrderMutations`) — UI only\nrenders.\n\n## Tests\n- 14 new tests in `admin-orders.test.ts`: every valid step transition,\nan invalid skip (`PENDING→SHIPPED`), `CANCELLED` refused once past\n`PACKED`, both return branches (stock release verified against\n`getAdminInventory`, stock untouched on reject), 401/404 guards.\n- Full regression: `packages/api-sdk` 132/132, `apps/admin` 11/11,\n`apps/storefront` 289/289, typecheck/lint clean, `next build` succeeds\nfor `apps/admin`.\n\nCloses #22.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjrOVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEUEQAFcTk51TwWrc7Lw6jO9kyXIx\nmdJh39frqfkj20MYu/1Pg6dRk7QBfagf3X2AD8hu4uYtNsQY90LsIyuIbmqsyQH8\nVWQ8KP0abkCiM2fvG+T9XOIKsIchhSabMGm5F6vXpmgk/4ZhceHCIK1cFSPAD2CY\nK9+pRGmJZ8Q4vdria/rDpjjULrqxKrK1CPem+f4JzjXM5/+4OrqDTEKEVdeoPHSa\n01M6xbJi/hFFDkArVCBu1NFImUv0QGjBpKRSFmKFr0MTiw2XBFHTRLlC2w0MVTw4\nVs4IhNoq56dYTpgYuPRJ0z6pmoSQU8U6e3DY2UmoU443EAOThwF8EZNM6RpJXejs\ngz5/ENRQsiflxBIxWe70b7Rs8XtfESlcKA4S8O6XUs7R0pnbVEViPKQvf69z3G6g\n5tkT5veB9H5Scqv3JQVzCaWCvwJtBv4dGXSoeCZMAesJquKzRpfHnbeyLBhYleZI\nmKHN2gggLGKeIKF4kHUF8q7Jh0fOMLQOIroRdgPQf8o2lBbDB/Yr0VpVgal/qbMn\n4TFYaNvSpnvZodlMGomxM00Hqr4BoHOGRmDRWwF6Ke/GDdcDTRqqgh4SllyPvjSq\nj4+cqfPGhfteMIi9r9mEYjmn4EQlKdsHUQxMgrqSxv4XaIxfA6c5mkTbJ+KQJb5U\np35gPgPHVFC1mW3Vtc2s\n=/O8K\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T09:36:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/8a43f64bfdb0e42315aa50be71c5c01df577c793","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKDhhNDNmNjRiZmRiMGU0MjMxNWFhNTBiZTcxYzVjMDFkZjU3N2M3OTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/3de1a48d02f7bb5a6f5ba2cf0553ad105b21d809","sha":"3de1a48d02f7bb5a6f5ba2cf0553ad105b21d809","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/3de1a48d02f7bb5a6f5ba2cf0553ad105b21d809"}],"sha":"8a43f64bfdb0e42315aa50be71c5c01df577c793","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/8a43f64bfdb0e42315aa50be71c5c01df577c793"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/3de1a48d02f7bb5a6f5ba2cf0553ad105b21d809/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T09:19:47Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T09:19:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(admin,api-sdk,schemas): admin inventory view/update (issue #21) (#67)\n\n## Summary\n- Implements issue #21 — Admin Inventory view/update (AD-03).\n- TDD''d at the mock API layer seam (per `/tdd`), same pattern as\n#18/#19/#20.\n\n## Changes\n- `packages/schemas`: new `inventory` module — `InventoryItem` splits\nstock into `onHand`/`reserved`/`available`, matching the Phase 4 BE\nroadmap''s inventory model so this shape survives a real-backend swap\nunchanged. `InventoryUpdateInput` (only `onHand` is writable),\n`InventoryAuditEntry` (actor + before/after + timestamp).\n- `packages/api-sdk`:\n- `inventory-fixtures.ts`: `listInventory` derives\n`reserved`/`available` from in-flight Reservations (issue #16) rather\nthan storing them; `updateInventoryOnHand` writes the SKU''s `stock` in\nplace and appends an audit-log entry; `getInventoryAuditLog` (optionally\nfiltered by `skuId`).\n- `admin-inventory.ts`:\n`getAdminInventory`/`updateAdminInventoryOnHand`/`getAdminInventoryAuditLog`.\n- `handlers.ts`: `/api/admin/inventory*` MSW routes, gated on a valid\nStaff session (401 otherwise; unknown SKU on update → 404), mirroring\nthe product/category routes.\n- `apps/admin`: Inventory page — table with inline `on_hand` edit per\nSKU (reserved/available shown read-only) + an audit log panel below, nav\nitem gated on `inventory:read`. All logic lives in hooks\n(`useAdminInventory`/`useInventoryMutations`) — UI only renders.\n\n## Tests\n- 7 new tests in `admin-inventory.test.ts`, covering the on_hand update,\nthe 404 guard, the reserved/available derivation against an active\nReservation, and the audit-log entry (actor + before/after).\n- Full regression: `packages/api-sdk` 118/118, `packages/schemas` 25/25,\n`apps/admin` 11/11, `apps/storefront` 289/289, typecheck/lint clean,\n`next build` succeeds for `apps/admin`.\n\nCloses #21.","tree":{"sha":"e763e1dbf1b0b93b5a8e0cd303cec3477d69662f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/e763e1dbf1b0b93b5a8e0cd303cec3477d69662f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/3de1a48d02f7bb5a6f5ba2cf0553ad105b21d809","verification":{"payload":"tree e763e1dbf1b0b93b5a8e0cd303cec3477d69662f\nparent 637650349609728c03f73b4682166588ed233a6f\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1787735987 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787735987 +0700\n\nfeat(admin,api-sdk,schemas): admin inventory view/update (issue #21) (#67)\n\n## Summary\n- Implements issue #21 — Admin Inventory view/update (AD-03).\n- TDD''d at the mock API layer seam (per `/tdd`), same pattern as\n#18/#19/#20.\n\n## Changes\n- `packages/schemas`: new `inventory` module — `InventoryItem` splits\nstock into `onHand`/`reserved`/`available`, matching the Phase 4 BE\nroadmap''s inventory model so this shape survives a real-backend swap\nunchanged. `InventoryUpdateInput` (only `onHand` is writable),\n`InventoryAuditEntry` (actor + before/after + timestamp).\n- `packages/api-sdk`:\n- `inventory-fixtures.ts`: `listInventory` derives\n`reserved`/`available` from in-flight Reservations (issue #16) rather\nthan storing them; `updateInventoryOnHand` writes the SKU''s `stock` in\nplace and appends an audit-log entry; `getInventoryAuditLog` (optionally\nfiltered by `skuId`).\n- `admin-inventory.ts`:\n`getAdminInventory`/`updateAdminInventoryOnHand`/`getAdminInventoryAuditLog`.\n- `handlers.ts`: `/api/admin/inventory*` MSW routes, gated on a valid\nStaff session (401 otherwise; unknown SKU on update → 404), mirroring\nthe product/category routes.\n- `apps/admin`: Inventory page — table with inline `on_hand` edit per\nSKU (reserved/available shown read-only) + an audit log panel below, nav\nitem gated on `inventory:read`. All logic lives in hooks\n(`useAdminInventory`/`useInventoryMutations`) — UI only renders.\n\n## Tests\n- 7 new tests in `admin-inventory.test.ts`, covering the on_hand update,\nthe 404 guard, the reserved/available derivation against an active\nReservation, and the audit-log entry (actor + before/after).\n- Full regression: `packages/api-sdk` 118/118, `packages/schemas` 25/25,\n`apps/admin` 11/11, `apps/storefront` 289/289, typecheck/lint clean,\n`next build` succeeds for `apps/admin`.\n\nCloses #21.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjq+zCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAiCoQAAZ/YMlevudflDlFgz1lCccW\nC+sWT5HFJZ8JmA8FkTLNQ7yYaNxsmmn0fH7qcud8+W8WHz3xo8m+Ov/ohUn1RbZ/\n20kbuPzMOVB00a41Ec7sdbPrtugCKh+8uxhNNtkro69cZXlhgY28tmKxhwXz0+8g\nACDZYsSRTzn4fKQfOT+8SXM9vDEjQhZEbc2YBStQTo7zYvonopxTFJdf4sgkuBQW\n68hu7kEek4OHhkFXFT2O5O2nDBHzHkHyjihse4lCmCijOIBte71Hwg2BH30IC/BO\nVeFmW10cnyh6rXJIzuSAFBjv8Tm7pWoEIuuSQm1c4o5Hh/K+MdzeU51Zf4L9UrTk\nFov/XowAb1NZxqtFBfcAUI5mMxtwbSEf5DEVGxbOwjnNiGP/ivKl7zSDa0ah1nev\nZ931aDL7rw+C3rLfxqcWMyTLoqRxwMZ2Z1kW+g4lFrPPabcy7M60BCnITc1zzF9/\nqpw9mVyef3d+8