17?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/637650349609728c03f73b4682166588ed233a6f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T09:00:05Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T09:00:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(admin,api-sdk,schemas): admin category management (issue #20) (#66)\n\n## Summary\n- Implements issue #20 — Admin Category management\n(create/read/update/delete on the same `Category` tree the public PLP\nfilter panel reads).\n- TDD''d at the mock API layer seam (per `/tdd`), same pattern as\n#18/#19.\n\n## Changes\n- `packages/schemas`: `CategoryInputSchema`/`CategoryInput` for the\ncreate/update payload.\n- `packages/api-sdk`:\n- `catalog-fixtures.ts`:\n`createCategory`/`updateCategory`/`deleteCategory`/`findCategoryById`/`resetMockCategoriesForTesting`.\n    - Create/update reject an unknown `parentId` (400).\n- Update refuses a `parentId` that would make a category its own parent\nor a descendant of itself — cycle prevention (400).\n- Delete refuses a category that still has child categories (409) or\nproducts assigned to it (409).\n- `admin-catalog.ts`:\n`getAdminCategories`/`createAdminCategory`/`updateAdminCategory`/`deleteAdminCategory`.\n- `handlers.ts`: `/api/admin/categories*` MSW routes, gated on a valid\nStaff session (401 otherwise), mirroring the product routes.\n- `apps/admin`: category tree page (indented by depth) with create/edit\nform and guarded delete (confirm dialog surfaces the 409 message), all\nlogic in hooks (`useAdminCategories`/`useCategoryMutations`) — UI only\nrenders.\n\n## Tests\n- 19 new/updated tests in `admin-catalog.test.ts` covering the guards\nabove — all passing.\n- Full regression: `packages/api-sdk` 111/111, `apps/admin` 11/11,\n`apps/storefront` 289/289, typecheck/lint clean, `next build` succeeds\nfor `apps/admin`.\n\nCloses #20.","tree":{"sha":"1d0eed084ffba145faf2797794c40a96a37a601a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/1d0eed084ffba145faf2797794c40a96a37a601a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/637650349609728c03f73b4682166588ed233a6f","verification":{"payload":"tree 1d0eed084ffba145faf2797794c40a96a37a601a\nparent 3ea3bab8a0870a18a4b851141501a57439be7e2c\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1787734805 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787734805 +0700\n\nfeat(admin,api-sdk,schemas): admin category management (issue #20) (#66)\n\n## Summary\n- Implements issue #20 — Admin Category management\n(create/read/update/delete on the same `Category` tree the public PLP\nfilter panel reads).\n- TDD''d at the mock API layer seam (per `/tdd`), same pattern as\n#18/#19.\n\n## Changes\n- `packages/schemas`: `CategoryInputSchema`/`CategoryInput` for the\ncreate/update payload.\n- `packages/api-sdk`:\n- `catalog-fixtures.ts`:\n`createCategory`/`updateCategory`/`deleteCategory`/`findCategoryById`/`resetMockCategoriesForTesting`.\n    - Create/update reject an unknown `parentId` (400).\n- Update refuses a `parentId` that would make a category its own parent\nor a descendant of itself — cycle prevention (400).\n- Delete refuses a category that still has child categories (409) or\nproducts assigned to it (409).\n- `admin-catalog.ts`:\n`getAdminCategories`/`createAdminCategory`/`updateAdminCategory`/`deleteAdminCategory`.\n- `handlers.ts`: `/api/admin/categories*` MSW routes, gated on a valid\nStaff session (401 otherwise), mirroring the product routes.\n- `apps/admin`: category tree page (indented by depth) with create/edit\nform and guarded delete (confirm dialog surfaces the 409 message), all\nlogic in hooks (`useAdminCategories`/`useCategoryMutations`) — UI only\nrenders.\n\n## Tests\n- 19 new/updated tests in `admin-catalog.test.ts` covering the guards\nabove — all passing.\n- Full regression: `packages/api-sdk` 111/111, `apps/admin` 11/11,\n`apps/storefront` 289/289, typecheck/lint clean, `next build` succeeds\nfor `apps/admin`.\n\nCloses #20.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjqsVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAo74QACmvRmqmXAREKOZeCUaO+5SJ\nSd3Ji7qcZaJDGZJFiJxLGniv3oEQye138sP/v+mmpQE3uL3QAGPhip/hseM10sg1\nR1W/XH8YUDT7vMzEudUL9MQgzlENV481xD2X/fkiEOGLCNI+JprrdHyNFmeuEN0h\nbwvZwRHUixn/SiNA7F7YtEQL+Xt/MEaWRN2OMNsBNHCbPQrLJ26O9ipHWqtlqdco\ntYG13ZkowtRy3cylx5UCUUT/iNA4jA2kaVVoBYNK3fu0dQdVzig9IO7tw5kf1BC0\n/3bWOpUgEYlJtUuwcaEnuKuMigVeuhLYRNE6RNFPGfuz+Q6T5mCcxAQENMqzNuuZ\nxXv6sRP8WByIDwd12x8i6J/bVUQL/stlWqUTJn8FePoXv+d3r7HGhu4joMXSBtiV\ntgmrpUPy4ompptjxZQOxn7P9uHSs84IUmcaRSKN8sUVDGZ2SpcmQJwEHdskEnvuV\nT8D5WDMZUIgF2O1pJ/4IVd+X06Yg102s5bdjW8dsn12fuGM45sWTh5KnxmGDfl1w\n50FdhDHtvKuupDxEQX+M3PoemtyhadWil0fuIaXL6H+uZxfVsRwt7dh1956AYzR8\nSf8PDrzMBQMCACfOmWMu8nMVYKPDVpi0ZpvEliiDpP7zrFffIpjbOKE9H+SUQ2El\nPcW3gm3A7xV0HZKgqr3e\n=z6kZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T09:00:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/637650349609728c03f73b4682166588ed233a6f","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKDYzNzY1MDM0OTYwOTcyOGMwM2Y3M2I0NjgyMTY2NTg4ZWQyMzNhNmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/3ea3bab8a0870a18a4b851141501a57439be7e2c","sha":"3ea3bab8a0870a18a4b851141501a57439be7e2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/3ea3bab8a0870a18a4b851141501a57439be7e2c"}],"sha":"637650349609728c03f73b4682166588ed233a6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/637650349609728c03f73b4682166588ed233a6f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/3ea3bab8a0870a18a4b851141501a57439be7e2c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T08:22:37Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T08:22:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(admin,api-sdk,schemas): Admin Product/Variant/SKU CRUD (issue #19) (#65)\n\nCloses #19. Stacked on #63 (issue #18) — this branch''s diff will shrink\nto just the #19 commits once #63 merges.\n\n## What this is\n\nProduct list (search/paginate) + create/update with dynamic Variant/SKU\nrows + a hard-delete guard, built TDD against the confirmed seam (mock\nAPI layer). List/form/table UI layers on top, untested directly — same\npattern as #18''s login page.\n\n## Notable design decision: OrderItem now carries `skuId`\n\n`packages/schemas/order`''s `OrderItem` never tracked which SKU it came\nfrom — `order-fixtures.ts`''s own comment on issue #17 flagged this as a\nknown, deliberately-deferred gap (\"releasing committed stock back to\navailable on CANCELLED would need OrderItem to retain a skuId ... left\nas a known gap\"). Issue #19''s delete-guard is exactly the moment this\ngap needed closing, and `skuId` was already in scope at Place Order time\n— this just keeps it.\n\n`skuId` is **optional**, not required: orders placed before this field\nexisted (the seed data included) can''t retroactively have it, same as a\nreal backend''s own pre-migration history would.\n\n## What''s here\n\n- **`packages/schemas`**: `OrderItemSchema.skuId` (optional).\n`ProductInputSchema`/`SkuInputSchema` for create/update payloads — an\ninput SKU''s `id` present = kept/edited, absent = a new Variant/SKU being\nadded.\n- **`packages/api-sdk/mocks`**: `catalog-fixtures.ts` gains\n`listProducts` (the filter/sort/paginate logic that used to live inline\nin the public PLP handler, now shared with Admin''s own listing instead\nof duplicated) + `createProduct`/`updateProduct`/`deleteProduct`.\n`order-fixtures.ts` gains `isSkuReferencedInAnyOrder` — the check behind\nthe guard. `updateProduct`/`deleteProduct` reject with 409 when\nremoving/deleting a SKU that''s referenced.\n- **`packages/api-sdk/endpoints`**: `admin-catalog.ts`\n(get/list/create/update/delete), all Staff-session-gated. `handlers.ts`\nregisters them under `/api/admin/products*`, reusing the same\n`listProducts` the public `/api/catalog/products` handler now also calls\nthrough (no more duplicated pagination logic).\n- **`apps/admin`**: product list table (search, paginate, per-row\nedit/delete with a `ConfirmDialog` — admin''s own copy of the\nstorefront''s, since admin has no `@repo/shared` dependency to reuse it\nfrom) + create/edit pages sharing one `ProductForm` (dynamic add/remove\nVariant/SKU rows).\n\n## Also (unrelated to #19, fixed while investigating a local dev\nquestion)\n\n`apps/admin/next.config.ts` now redirects bare `/` to `/admin`\n(`basePath: false`) — opening the admin dev server on its own port\n(bypassing the storefront''s microfrontends proxy) used to 404 outright,\nsince every real route lives under `/admin/*` once `basePath` is set.\n\n## Testing\n\n10 new mock-API tests (7 CRUD/delete-guard + 2 get-by-id + 1 auth-gated\nlist). Full storefront (289) + admin (11) + schemas (25) suites pass\nunchanged. typecheck/lint/build clean across every touched package.","tree":{"sha":"5fca15fd46b850b593b1edaa16c88b37495cad65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/5fca15fd46b850b593b1edaa16c88b37495cad65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/3ea3bab8a0870a18a4b851141501a57439be7e2c","verification":{"payload":"tree 5fca15fd46b850b593b1edaa16c88b37495cad65\nparent 2a569f3faddc034da9e6d1e008bd6921a9ef73c0\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1787732557 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787732557 +0700\n\nfeat(admin,api-sdk,schemas): Admin Product/Variant/SKU CRUD (issue #19) (#65)\n\nCloses #19. Stacked on #63 (issue #18) — this branch''s diff will shrink\nto just the #19 commits once #63 merges.\n\n## What this is\n\nProduct list (search/paginate) + create/update with dynamic Variant/SKU\nrows + a hard-delete guard, built TDD against the confirmed seam (mock\nAPI layer). List/form/table UI layers on top, untested directly — same\npattern as #18''s login page.\n\n## Notable design decision: OrderItem now carries `skuId`\n\n`packages/schemas/order`''s `OrderItem` never tracked which SKU it came\nfrom — `order-fixtures.ts`''s own comment on issue #17 flagged this as a\nknown, deliberately-deferred gap (\"releasing committed stock back to\navailable on CANCELLED would need OrderItem to retain a skuId ... left\nas a known gap\"). Issue #19''s delete-guard is exactly the moment this\ngap needed closing, and `skuId` was already in scope at Place Order time\n— this just keeps it.\n\n`skuId` is **optional**, not required: orders placed before this field\nexisted (the seed data included) can''t retroactively have it, same as a\nreal backend''s own pre-migration history would.\n\n## What''s here\n\n- **`packages/schemas`**: `OrderItemSchema.skuId` (optional).\n`ProductInputSchema`/`SkuInputSchema` for create/update payloads — an\ninput SKU''s `id` present = kept/edited, absent = a new Variant/SKU being\nadded.\n- **`packages/api-sdk/mocks`**: `catalog-fixtures.ts` gains\n`listProducts` (the filter/sort/paginate logic that used to live inline\nin the public PLP handler, now shared with Admin''s own listing instead\nof duplicated) + `createProduct`/`updateProduct`/`deleteProduct`.\n`order-fixtures.ts` gains `isSkuReferencedInAnyOrder` — the check behind\nthe guard. `updateProduct`/`deleteProduct` reject with 409 when\nremoving/deleting a SKU that''s referenced.\n- **`packages/api-sdk/endpoints`**: `admin-catalog.ts`\n(get/list/create/update/delete), all Staff-session-gated. `handlers.ts`\nregisters them under `/api/admin/products*`, reusing the same\n`listProducts` the public `/api/catalog/products` handler now also calls\nthrough (no more duplicated pagination logic).\n- **`apps/admin`**: product list table (search, paginate, per-row\nedit/delete with a `ConfirmDialog` — admin''s own copy of the\nstorefront''s, since admin has no `@repo/shared` dependency to reuse it\nfrom) + create/edit pages sharing one `ProductForm` (dynamic add/remove\nVariant/SKU rows).\n\n## Also (unrelated to #19, fixed while investigating a local dev\nquestion)\n\n`apps/admin/next.config.ts` now redirects bare `/` to `/admin`\n(`basePath: false`) — opening the admin dev server on its own port\n(bypassing the storefront''s microfrontends proxy) used to 404 outright,\nsince every real route lives under `/admin/*` once `basePath` is set.\n\n## Testing\n\n10 new mock-API tests (7 CRUD/delete-guard + 2 get-by-id + 1 auth-gated\nlist). Full storefront (289) + admin (11) + schemas (25) suites pass\nunchanged. typecheck/lint/build clean across every touched package.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjqJNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALZUQAA46T7W6Xjbd7i3C+mdj+0V8\nppmKhZDjPJDYaoAjljIiArjNhbWKd0LB4zo