08bd6921a9ef73c0","sha":"2a569f3faddc034da9e6d1e008bd6921a9ef73c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/2a569f3faddc034da9e6d1e008bd6921a9ef73c0"}],"sha":"3ea3bab8a0870a18a4b851141501a57439be7e2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/3ea3bab8a0870a18a4b851141501a57439be7e2c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/2a569f3faddc034da9e6d1e008bd6921a9ef73c0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T08:16:38Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T08:16:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(admin,api-sdk,schemas): Admin Auth/RBAC shell (issue #18) (#63)\n\nCloses #18.\n\n## What this is\n\nStaff login, permission-based route guard, and permission-based menu\nvisibility for `apps/admin`. Built TDD against 4 confirmed seams: mock\nAPI layer, guard component, menu visibility, session store.\n\n## A note on missing source docs\n\nIssue #18 references `rbac-matrix.md`, `security-baseline.md`,\n`ARC-007`, and `Decision #66` — **none of these exist anywhere in this\nrepo.** The permission matrix in `packages/schemas/src/staff/staff.ts`\nis inferred from the acceptance criteria of issues #18–#29 (each\npermission is used to gate a specific screen described in one of those\nissues) and documented in that file as the current source of truth.\nWorth reconciling with the real doc if/when it''s written — flagging this\nnow so it isn''t silently treated as settled.\n\n## What''s here\n\n- **`packages/schemas/staff`** — `StaffRoleSchema`\n(`SUPER_ADMIN`/`ADMIN_STAFF`/`CMS_EDITOR`), the permission list, and\n`ROLE_PERMISSIONS`/`resolvePermissions` (union of a Staff''s assigned\nRoles — `SUPER_ADMIN` is listed with every permission, not a bypass-all\ncode path, per issue #23''s explicit acceptance criteria).\n- **`packages/api-sdk`** — `staff-fixtures.ts` (a separate mock backing\nstore from Customer `auth-fixtures.ts`, reusing its pure\n`encode`/`decodeAccessToken`) + `staff.ts` endpoints\n(login/refresh/logout/me) + handlers under `/api/staff/*`. TTLs mirror\nthe issue''s stated profile (access 5 phút / refresh idle 8 giờ /\nabsolute 24 giờ), scaled to ms for test speed — same convention\n`auth-fixtures.ts` already uses.\n- **`apps/admin`** — `staff-store.ts` (zustand session store) +\n`staff-auth.ts`/`useStaffAuth.ts` (login/logout/bootstrap glue, mirrors\nstorefront''s `auth-store.ts`/`useAuth.ts`) + `StaffAuthGuard` (wraps\n`(protected)/*`, redirects to `/login`) + `StaffAuthRuntimeProvider`\n(registers the api-sdk auth runtime adapter) + a login page +\npermission-gated `NAV_ITEMS` in `AppShell` (`CMS_EDITOR` doesn''t see the\ncatalog/order/category menu).\n\n## Testing\n\n28 new tests (9+7 staff API/fixtures in api-sdk, 4 permission-matrix in\nschemas, 11 store/guard/menu in admin). Full storefront (289 tests) +\ncms suites pass unchanged. typecheck/lint/build clean across every\ntouched package.","tree":{"sha":"16d3f902eec3f7a445e6465b045bcf4b688e6483","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/16d3f902eec3f7a445e6465b045bcf4b688e6483"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/2a569f3faddc034da9e6d1e008bd6921a9ef73c0","verification":{"payload":"tree 16d3f902eec3f7a445e6465b045bcf4b688e6483\nparent a69fa3fda85f72be2a3533ab7277f711fb6395e8\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1787732198 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787732198 +0700\n\nfeat(admin,api-sdk,schemas): Admin Auth/RBAC shell (issue #18) (#63)\n\nCloses #18.\n\n## What this is\n\nStaff login, permission-based route guard, and permission-based menu\nvisibility for `apps/admin`. Built TDD against 4 confirmed seams: mock\nAPI layer, guard component, menu visibility, session store.\n\n## A note on missing source docs\n\nIssue #18 references `rbac-matrix.md`, `security-baseline.md`,\n`ARC-007`, and `Decision #66` — **none of these exist anywhere in this\nrepo.** The permission matrix in `packages/schemas/src/staff/staff.ts`\nis inferred from the acceptance criteria of issues #18–#29 (each\npermission is used to gate a specific screen described in one of those\nissues) and documented in that file as the current source of truth.\nWorth reconciling with the real doc if/when it''s written — flagging this\nnow so it isn''t silently treated as settled.\n\n## What''s here\n\n- **`packages/schemas/staff`** — `StaffRoleSchema`\n(`SUPER_ADMIN`/`ADMIN_STAFF`/`CMS_EDITOR`), the permission list, and\n`ROLE_PERMISSIONS`/`resolvePermissions` (union of a Staff''s assigned\nRoles — `SUPER_ADMIN` is listed with every permission, not a bypass-all\ncode path, per issue #23''s explicit acceptance criteria).\n- **`packages/api-sdk`** — `staff-fixtures.ts` (a separate mock backing\nstore from Customer `auth-fixtures.ts`, reusing its pure\n`encode`/`decodeAccessToken`) + `staff.ts` endpoints\n(login/refresh/logout/me) + handlers under `/api/staff/*`. TTLs mirror\nthe issue''s stated profile (access 5 phút / refresh idle 8 giờ /\nabsolute 24 giờ), scaled to ms for test speed — same convention\n`auth-fixtures.ts` already uses.\n- **`apps/admin`** — `staff-store.ts` (zustand session store) +\n`staff-auth.ts`/`useStaffAuth.ts` (login/logout/bootstrap glue, mirrors\nstorefront''s `auth-store.ts`/`useAuth.ts`) + `StaffAuthGuard` (wraps\n`(protected)/*`, redirects to `/login`) + `StaffAuthRuntimeProvider`\n(registers the api-sdk auth runtime adapter) + a login page +\npermission-gated `NAV_ITEMS` in `AppShell` (`CMS_EDITOR` doesn''t see the\ncatalog/order/category menu).\n\n## Testing\n\n28 new tests (9+7 staff API/fixtures in api-sdk, 4 permission-matrix in\nschemas, 11 store/guard/menu in admin). Full storefront (289 tests) +\ncms suites pass unchanged. typecheck/lint/build clean across every\ntouched package.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjqDmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOREQAEonxOxoLvk67UbeQd3VYfcc\nyNLltc81HfQazWlR1g6T2sIiB9GlfmchQjcCRn8HRrmfIIWH6fYy+O/HMadvc+Lv\nwEXH8wQ2gPo8p5xmp2L9EHWqa4y2WtQ2J195810qZ20GMOggnQAn+WYLnMwwutjD\nLxOoflWWcoDY9lJWTp6BggWd0yeGW3/GnwEZk8xrnWmKhdimCQ+IyvQMWi3Mz+ud\niz79Ji1W/B2elXeBwhgzNm4GiX/jXamy03BtTSuFzDRxMyR75Y2Hu1fSqdUMTOTP\nnwqpx36EtCqNp+T+wImke1X3NlxI5FNRJKjtmqoWqT5KmEjGt7tcQ1eIxW9e62kW\nNP7LDW6rZchHHYn6RaBdsPhbh6QyAyLQwG9/7quauT4IFl6ussN8zw63FTAI3Y2x\nZFom/RFdXhXSzNFPqvaRo2Y5LwKzO4TBzL8zAUM3THc6ON4eK9sN4aG1c5zYPKbI\nLeXFM5mVN3Cdcf6TIHhMRetR+ndN5khT8L2bB9gq7Vcw9w3evzRSl9QMDBCZSXYJ\nEt6yudZQKR1bg9sWxPBi+sVTHv8/AyjszDvdwaDalcCwR7otJwjeQIdwuzVAenYZ\nUiuDzlyXuuk30HyfXVLDWUhRH6l7tav+jqiuqCiZ4+hae42VkbmhheHoPiyDXirb\n549Yu1+J5OYYr9YW1ojk\n=6iBc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T08:16:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/2a569f3faddc034da9e6d1e008bd6921a9ef73c0","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKDJhNTY5ZjNmYWRkYzAzNGRhOWU2ZDFlMDA4YmQ2OTIxYTllZjczYzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/a69fa3fda85f72be2a3533ab7277f711fb6395e8","sha":"a69fa3fda85f72be2a3533ab7277f711fb6395e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/a69fa3fda85f72be2a3533ab7277f711fb6395e8"}],"sha":"2a569f3faddc034da9e6d1e008bd6921a9ef73c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/2a569f3faddc034da9e6d1e008bd6921a9ef73c0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/a69fa3fda85f72be2a3533ab7277f711fb6395e8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T05:42:43Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T05:42:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(storefront,api-sdk,schemas): deepen shallow modules, move UI logic into hooks, unify DTO/domain types (#62)\n\n## Summary\n\nFollows up on an architecture review (7 candidates, report attached to\nthe conversation) plus a broader UI-logic and DTO/domain-typing pass.\n\n### 1. Deepen 7 shallow modules\n- **order-transitions**:\n`canCancelOrder`/`canRequestReturn`/`isWithinReturnWindow` now live once\nin `@repo/api-sdk/endpoints/order-transitions`, used by both the mock\nserver (authority) and the storefront UI (button gating) instead of\nbeing hand-typed twice.\n- **useApiMutation**: one factory drives every mutation''s success/error\ntoast. Removes `query-client.ts`''s global `mutations.onError` default,\nwhich used to fire *in addition to* each hook''s own `onError` — a real\ndouble-toast bug on every mutation failure (react-query v5 runs both).\n- **createPersistedListStore**: the versioned-localStorage-envelope +\nhydrate-once-on-mount pattern `useCart.ts`/`useWishlist.ts` each\nhand-rolled independently is now one factory, tested once.\n- **useReservation**: replaced a hand-rolled `useRef` state machine with\n`useQuery` — gains the same test seam as every other data fetch; added\ncoverage (it had none).\n- **isMockContentEnabled**: one named seam for the placeholder-content\ngate (deliberately its own module, not `env.ts`, since `env.ts` parses\nthe full `process.env` and isn''t safe to import from a `''use client''`\ncomponent).\n- **AddressesClient / ProfileClient / CheckoutClient**: all three now\nuse `@repo/ui/form`''s `FormField`/`FormItem` instead of hand-rolling\n`aria-invalid`/`aria-describedby`/error-`<p>` per field.\nCheckoutClient''s conversion also fixes a live bug — its old error\nrendering (`t(\\`errors.${msg}\\`)`) translated the raw zod message as an\ni18n key, but the schema''s messages never matched the 3 keys\n`checkout.json` defines, so every validation error hit next-intl''s\nmissing-message path.\n- **useApiErrorMessage**: `reportApiError` sets the inline alert and\ntoasts in one call instead of every auth form re-deriving the same\n`ApiError` branch twice; removed the now-fully-unused `useToast`\npassthrough hook.\n\n### 2. UI logic → hooks\nAudited every component under `(shop)/_lib/components/**` and\n`(auth)/_lib/components/**` for business logic (mutation orchestration,\nnetwork/router/storage side effects, URL-state derivation) living in\ncomponents instead of hooks. ~13 violations fixed, each now behind a\ndedicated hook (`useAddressForm`, `useMoveToCart`,\n`useCart().removeCartItemWithUndo`, `useCatalogFilterControls`,\n`useCatalogListing`/`useProductSearchListing`,\n`useMergeGuestDataOnLogin`, `useHeaderSearch`, `useNewsletterForm`,\n`useRedirectIfCartEmpty`, `useCheckoutForm`, `useProfileForm`). Two\nServer Components (checkout/success, reset-password/[token]) can''t use\nhooks — their inline logic moved to named functions instead\n(`getOrderOrNull`, `isValidResetPasswordRequest`).\n\n### 3. DTO ↔ domain type unification\n`orders.ts`/`address.ts`/`profile.ts`/`auth.ts` in api-sdk used plain\ntype assertions (`apiClient.get<T>(...)`, no runtime check) while the\nstorefront separately hand-declared its own zod schema for the same\nshape — two independent declarations, neither actually validating the\nother. Order/Address/Profile/AuthSession schemas now live once in\n`@repo/schemas` (matching the convention `catalog.ts` already used),\napi-sdk endpoints validate every response against them via `{ schema }`,\nand storefront''s `shared/types/order.ts`/`user.ts` re-export the same\ntype instead of re-declaring it. Deleted `toStorefrontUser()` in\n`auth.ts` — it mapped `AuthUser` to `User` field-by-field; they''re now\nthe same type, so the mapper was a no-op.\n\n## Testing\n- 289 storefront tests + 76 api-sdk tests pass unchanged, plus new tests\nfor `useApiMutation`, `createPersistedListStore`, `useReservation`,\n`order-transitions`.\n- typecheck / lint / build clean across every package.","tree":{"sha":"6c537f53f45c4b486502cc504b7bcb631013dc00","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/6c537f53f45c4b486502cc504b7bcb631013dc00"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/a69fa3fda85f72be2a3533ab7277f711fb6395e8","verification":{"payload":"tree 6c537f53f45c4b486502cc504b7bcb631013dc00\nparent d52b7729171e8bab18e489adeaf0dbc80d223e66\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1787722963 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787722963 +0700\n\nrefactor(storefront,api-sdk,schemas): deepen shallow modules, move UI logic into hooks, unify DTO/domain types (#62)\n\n## Summary\n\nFollows up on an architecture review (7 candidates, report attached to\nthe conversation) plus a broader UI-logic and DTO/domain-typing pass.\n\n### 1. Deepen 7 shallow modules\n- **order-transitions**:\n`canCancelOrder`/`canRequestReturn`/`isWithinReturnWindow` now live once\nin `@repo/api-sdk/endpoints/order-transitions`, used by both the mock\nserver (authority) and the storefront UI (button gating) instead of\nbeing hand-typed twice.\n- **useApiMutation**: one factory drives every mutation''s success/error\ntoast. Removes `query-client.ts`''s global `mutations.onError` default,\nwhich used to fire *in addition to* each hook''s own `onError` — a real\ndouble-toast bug on every mutation failure (react-query v5 runs both).\n- **createPersistedListStore**: the versioned-localStorage-envelope +\nhydrate-once-on-mount pattern `useCart.ts`/`useWishlist.ts` each\nhand-rolled independently is now one factory, tested once.\n- **useReservation**: replaced a hand-rolled `useRef` state machine with\n`useQuery` — gains the same test seam as every other data fetch; added\ncoverage (it had none).\n- **isMockContentEnabled**: one named seam for the placeholder-content\ngate (deliberately its own module, not `env.ts`, since `env.ts` parses\nthe full `process.env` and isn''t safe to import from a `''use client''`\ncomponent).\n- **AddressesClient / ProfileClient / CheckoutClient**: all three now\nuse `@repo/ui/form`''s `FormField`/`FormItem` instead of hand-rolling\n`aria-invalid`/`aria-describedby`/error-`<p>` per field.\nCheckoutClient''s conversion also fixes a live bug — its old error\nrendering (`t(\\`errors.${msg}\\`)`) translated the raw zod message as an\ni18n key, but the schema''s messages never matched the 3 keys\n`checkout.json` defines, so every validation error hit next-intl''s\nmissing-message path.\n- **useApiErrorMessage**: `reportApiError` sets the inline alert and\ntoasts in one call instead of every auth form re-deriving the same\n`ApiError` branch twice; removed the now-fully-unused `useToast`\npassthrough hook.\n\n### 2. UI logic → hooks\nAudited every component under `(shop)/_lib/components/**` and\n`(auth)/_lib/components/**` for business logic (mutation orchestration,\nnetwork/router/storage side effects, URL-state derivation) living in\ncomponents instead of hooks. ~13 violations fixed, each now behind a\ndedicated hook (`useAddressForm`, `useMoveToCart`,\n`useCart().removeCartItemWithUndo`, `useCatalogFilterControls`,\n`useCatalogListing`/`useProductSearchListing`,\n`useMergeGuestDataOnLogin`, `useHeaderSearch`, `useNewsletterForm`,\n`useRedirectIfCartEmpty`, `useCheckoutForm`, `useProfileForm`). Two\nServer Components (checkout/success, reset-password/[token]) can''t use\nhooks — their inline logic moved to named functions instead\n(`getOrderOrNull`, `isValidResetPasswordRequest`).\n\n### 3. DTO ↔ domain type unification\n`orders.ts`/`address.ts`/`profile.ts`/`auth.ts` in api-sdk used plain\ntype assertions (`apiClient.get<T>(...)`, no runtime check) while the\nstorefront separately hand-declared its own zod schema for the same\nshape — two independent declarations, neither actually validating the\nother. Order/Address/Profile/AuthSession schemas now live once in\n`@repo/schemas` (matching the convention `catalog.ts` already used),\napi-sdk endpoints validate every response against them via `{ schema }`,\nand storefront''s `shared/types/order.ts`/`user.ts` re-export the same\ntype instead of re-declaring it. Deleted `toStorefrontUser()` in\n`auth.ts` — it mapped `AuthUser` to `User` field-by-field; they''re now\nthe same type, so the mapper was a no-op.\n\n## Testing\n- 289 storefront tests + 76 api-sdk tests pass unchanged, plus new tests\nfor `useApiMutation`, `createPersistedListStore`, `useReservation`,\n`order-transitions`.\n- typecheck / lint / build clean across every package.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjnzTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtBQQAD7rIvWbPmAG0ZoUxKUdLAWj\nU0qICppZnDswo9hBGRpG/2w65NlCKt3EHoJObJlMvbI3cFxnb6aJnYB2Gh7LRK6A\nCQ7NVOtoUBnGMp1vlYJnQlbAkzmvYW9F+k60tyGZeKUSNcTeq9Tx7Ub/X3ojsVwU\nXbufz7A46U78PUG6XjIu/ifPlnjGbfLH4PH3fJPWXTcOY8N0QjLJ1ts3PbL72zcx\nhLn2HVNpXGwxQKIRkMnk5OHLdun6tA2pcRAUVOwAN+obTWGt7smEAt3wiN4zvCfm\nyc3YdDN+L8El0OLPQeGqq3HvUBlcq75BYTevX4DvWrvq0jVOMePifeeJXiSuLJOi\n9PGdvsg1ues/gIILeV7188JHWU8itrbB+rkfDIsEjmV3w6T9vdm8F4FDL31baaQ+\n90Ad//HXcugHW2ccAG86GFRayglKBHlw+DV5SBg2219akaXrbNPeEvv7quoIigus\nUBhWFA7lBlh7CKrKe0K2leEMFYakmgQ5tZXOr+dQHjMhxqvwFAuxyoiV7ncp6EaO\n3hyfR5nbs1AMVkDWfADWf0JTbV/95Cu6cjWTD0U+K9ZFZJZUWmvt6i9rXTVWgEPX\nhl7OdEBJx27xGxC39VgLr04M9PKYOo37qJKOkw+AvoEJ5NQBAxS8m34BJbtnZz7v\nxHZdxh9/IelG3CkNFyij\n=r/Vj\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T05:42:43Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/a69fa3fda85f72be2a3533ab7277f711fb6395e8","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKGE2OWZhM2ZkYTg1ZjcyYmUyYTM1MzNhYjcyNzdmNzExZmI2Mzk1ZTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/d52b7729171e8bab18e489adeaf0dbc80d223e66","sha":"d52b7729171e8bab18e489adeaf0dbc80d223e66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/d52b7729171e8bab18e489adeaf0dbc80d223e66"}],"sha":"a69fa3fda85f72be2a3533ab7277f711fb6395e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/a69fa3fda85f72be2a3533ab7277f711fb6395e8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/d52b7729171e8bab18e489adeaf0dbc80d223e66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T03:45:06Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T03:45:06Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(storefront): repair dead footer auth links and gate fabricated PDP content (#61)\n\n## What\n\nTwo navigation/content bugs found while auditing the storefront page\ninventory.\n\n### 1. Footer linked to routes that never existed\n\n`/auth/login` and `/auth/register` both landed on `not-found`. `(auth)`\nis a route group, so it never appears in the URL — the real paths are\n`/login` and `/register`.\n\n### 2. The PDP shipped fabricated content to production\n\n`ProductDetailTabs` rendered invented content unconditionally, while\n`home/page.tsx` already gates its equivalent (`showTestimonials =\nenv.NODE_ENV !== ''production''`). Same class of content, two different\ntreatments.\n\nNow gated behind `NODE_ENV !== ''production''`:\n\n| Content | Why |\n|---|---|\n| 3 reviews (`Nguyễn Văn A`, `Trần Thị B`, `Lê Minh C`) with specific\ndates | fabricated social proof shown to real shoppers |\n| Rating-distribution bars | widths are hardcoded `60/30/5%` and read\nexactly like real statistics |\n| Specs table | claims `Cotton 100%` and `Xuất xứ Việt Nam` for\n**every** product — shoes and bags included |\n\n`rating` and `reviewCount` come from the product API and **stay\nvisible** in production. Those are real; dropping them would lose\ncorrect information.\n\n### 3. Test alignment (cherry-picked)\n\n`6d9902f` is also on the `#60` branch. Without it these two tests are\nred on `dev`, which would keep this PR red:\n- `OrdersClient` overrides QueryState''s error copy, so `ErrorState`\nrenders title and description as two elements, not one string\n- `notify.info` passes no options, and `toSonnerOptions` returns\n`undefined` rather than `{ description: undefined }`\n\nWhichever of this PR / #60 merges first, the other''s copy becomes a\nno-op.\n\n## Production effect\n\nThe `Thông số` tab disappears and the reviews tab shows only the real\naverage and count. The PDP reads emptier in production — that is\nintentional, and preferable to telling a shopper a running shoe is made\nof 100% cotton.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `typecheck` clean · `lint` clean · `test` 274/274 passed\n- **e2e not verified locally.** `pdp.spec.ts` / `catalog.spec.ts` fail\n7/7 on this machine *with no changes at all* (verified against a clean\nstash): `page.goto` hangs waiting for `load` because the image fixtures\npoint at `https://placehold.co`. Leaving the verdict to CI; tracked as a\nseparate issue.\n\n## Deliberately not addressed\n\n`sale` is a real Category (`{ id: ''cat-sale'', slug: ''sale'', parentId:\nnull }`, sibling of `tops`/`shoes`), yet eight call sites navigate via\n`/products?category=<slug>` — `Footer`, `HeroBanner`, `FlashSaleBanner`,\n`HeroCarousel` (×3), `SectionFeaturedCategories` (×2). One product set,\ntwo URLs, with different breadcrumbs and headings\n(`/products?category=sale` renders `\"Sản phẩm: sale\"` from the raw\nslug).\n\nConverging on `/categories/[slug]` is a navigation change that touches\nthe home page, not a fix — it needs its own PR and its own decision.","tree":{"sha":"b781cd359c8960f650b5f81d13133866248bef49","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/b781cd359c8960f650b5f81d13133866248bef49"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/d52b7729171e8bab18e489adeaf0dbc80d223e66","verification":{"payload":"tree b781cd359c8960f650b5f81d13133866248bef49\nparent 4dbb79e8a22be68e8f8e95db7727ff4b14640f36\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1787715906 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787715906 +0700\n\nfix(storefront): repair dead footer auth links and gate fabricated PDP content (#61)\n\n## What\n\nTwo navigation/content bugs found while auditing the storefront page\ninventory.\n\n### 1. Footer linked to routes that never existed\n\n`/auth/login` and `/auth/register` both landed on `not-found`. `(auth)`\nis a route group, so it never appears in the URL — the real paths are\n`/login` and `/register`.\n\n### 2. The PDP shipped fabricated content to production\n\n`ProductDetailTabs` rendered invented content unconditionally, while\n`home/page.tsx` already gates its equivalent (`showTestimonials =\nenv.NODE_ENV !== ''production''`). Same class of content, two different\ntreatments.\n\nNow gated behind `NODE_ENV !== ''production''`:\n\n| Content | Why |\n|---|---|\n| 3 reviews (`Nguyễn Văn A`, `Trần Thị B`, `Lê Minh C`) with specific\ndates | fabricated social proof shown to real shoppers |\n| Rating-distribution bars | widths are hardcoded `60/30/5%` and read\nexactly like real statistics |\n| Specs table | claims `Cotton 100%` and `Xuất xứ Việt Nam` for\n**every** product — shoes and bags included |\n\n`rating` and `reviewCount` come from the product API and **stay\nvisible** in production. Those are real; dropping them would lose\ncorrect information.\n\n### 3. Test alignment (cherry-picked)\n\n`6d9902f` is also on the `#60` branch. Without it these two tests are\nred on `dev`, which would keep this PR red:\n- `OrdersClient` overrides QueryState''s error copy, so `ErrorState`\nrenders title and description as two elements, not one string\n- `notify.info` passes no options, and `toSonnerOptions` returns\n`undefined` rather than `{ description: undefined }`\n\nWhichever of this PR / #60 merges first, the other''s copy becomes a\nno-op.\n\n## Production effect\n\nThe `Thông số` tab disappears and the reviews tab shows only the real\naverage and count. The PDP reads emptier in production — that is\nintentional, and preferable to telling a shopper a running shoe is made\nof 100% cotton.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `typecheck` clean · `lint` clean · `test` 274/274 passed\n- **e2e not verified locally.** `pdp.spec.ts` / `catalog.spec.ts` fail\n7/7 on this machine *with no changes at all* (verified against a clean\nstash): `page.goto` hangs waiting for `load` because the image fixtures\npoint at `https://placehold.co`. Leaving the verdict to CI; tracked as a\nseparate issue.\n\n## Deliberately not addressed\n\n`sale` is a real Category (`{ id: ''cat-sale'', slug: ''sale'', parentId:\nnull }`, sibling of `tops`/`shoes`), yet eight call sites navigate via\n`/products?category=<slug>` — `Footer`, `HeroBanner`, `FlashSaleBanner`,\n`HeroCarousel` (×3), `SectionFeaturedCategories` (×2). One product set,\ntwo URLs, with different breadcrumbs and headings\n(`/products?category=sale` renders `\"Sản phẩm: sale\"` from the raw\nslug).\n\nConverging on `/categories/[slug]` is a navigation change that touches\nthe home page, not a fix — it needs its own PR and its own decision.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjmFCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAACbMQABREvE5VaulMKtbJJ72OvC6b\nL0zt9cqMathRb/A8L56+Fd48CjGGq9IdIhw5bfywlSZQDG2mZlpEyDV5DbWfFsr4\nTfkJkjI1Q+E/q0ryN5vFktsKejgq1GCIQjfQWYooxLdSBVDVejSwYm/bOhVFImjS\nxmR2gEkn9oIuICuqVwhcPw/m/3qknke4SyLCxo/gAE+NnrQGcrydsT59ZL9DvUuJ\n0XtrvSqKq7CN9GwmrEpVqaHDwez2j+uBexJmHp1WjWjISG6zj7Q8PtJHEit8hiGV\nK8IdcyFOoVkIaSnG+cTolYX01b8ndc84ePLSv4DTMEIG9Rb/2rAIIFAtJyTiiIYc\njvNQnVdwJJ46mcIyx6SqU1XsmrftY3w9tw8ByqAlG7Zu3lJ8DP2S6FS+8zivTqcP\n13kZVpPzusGiQ4PRyXaLawW7+3mqaM5CZOm/xgz5yhGUCVDp6Ru0RmCbBbVEqmxs\nXBykmYVFrsHG3ZxsQ4oFaJ1AOI9QRbOdlmFC07iiqWfVBunmF6DkErR+GLAzae8i\nW8UvIMY5fJDB4YIGhHraK6YZTO3TCdGrs4oK0NvGz+I2Nw1fipwAtP6NIPLm5oQN\nBfXRyr0dDcP1jcFKCumjuY4BOemd/1SFGYrzYra6oibXwnqdWq3btrZ5JOq8kK1r\npLNL1xEGT2mltaTbVOcW\n=JhrT\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T03:45:07Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/d52b7729171e8bab18e489adeaf0dbc80d223e66","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKGQ1MmI3NzI5MTcxZThiYWIxOGU0ODlhZGVhZjBkYmM4MGQyMjNlNjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/4dbb79e8a22be68e8f8e95db7727ff4b14640f36","sha":"4dbb79e8a22be68e8f8e95db7727ff4b14640f36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/4dbb79e8a22be68e8f8e95db7727ff4b14640f36"}],"sha":"d52b7729171e8bab18e489adeaf0dbc80d223e66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/d52b7729171e8bab18e489adeaf0dbc80d223e66"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/4dbb79e8a22be68e8f8e95db7727ff4b14640f36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T03:38:26Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T03:38:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"style(storefront): polish shop pages with hallmark design system + apple fluid motion (#60)\n\n## Tóm tắt\n\nRedesign các trang chức năng của storefront (Categories & Products, Cart\n& Checkout, Account & Auth) theo hệ thống thiết kế đã khoá trong\n`design.md`, cộng thêm một đợt tinh chỉnh motion theo nguyên tắc Apple\nFluid Interfaces.\n\n### Hallmark redesign (theo design.md — Be Vietnam Pro, warm-neutral,\nbrand-red chỉ dùng cho giá/sale, trust-blue cho hành động phụ)\n- **Categories & Products**: grid rhythm nhất quán, focus-visible ring,\nfilter sidebar dạng card, breadcrumb icon.\n- **Cart & Checkout**: cart table rõ ràng hơn, brand-red chỉ áp cho giá,\nnút phụ chuyển sang trust-blue, trang success dùng token `success`.\n- **Account & Auth**: header/section nhất quán, form card hoá, link phụ\nchuyển trust-blue, thay màu cứng (`red-500`/`green-500`) bằng design\ntoken.\n\n### Apple fluid-interface motion pass (an toàn — không thêm gesture/thư\nviện mới)\n- Spring critically-damped cho tương tác do người dùng khởi tạo (drawer,\ngallery, mega menu, add-to-cart) thay cho tween cố định.\n- Phản hồi tức thì khi bấm (`whileTap`/`active:scale`) trên các nút\ntrước đây chỉ có hover.\n- Backdrop-filter cho overlay/drawer để có cảm giác vật liệu thật.\n- Sửa lệch đường vào/ra (enter/exit path) ở Cart Drawer/Table cho khớp\ntrục.\n- Toàn bộ animation framer-motion đã được bọc bởi `MotionConfig\nreducedMotion=\"user\"` toàn cục — tự động tôn trọng\n`prefers-reduced-motion`.\n\n## Phạm vi & ràng buộc\n- Chỉ thay đổi visual/layout/motion — không đụng data fetching, hooks,\nAPI, validation, routing.\n- `tsc --noEmit`, `eslint`, và `next build` (pre-push hook) đều pass\nsạch.\n- Không xoá file nào, không đổi route/component ownership.\n\n## Còn tồn đọng (đợt sau)\n- Animation trượt gốc của `SheetContent` (`@repo/ui/sheet`) chưa được\nxác minh có spring/mirror/reduced-motion hay không — nằm ngoài phạm vi 2\nfile Cart Drawer/Table lần này.","tree":{"sha":"f079ac85bcdf1dd4f6c79ce59d45f750c7bf7952","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/f079ac85bcdf1dd4f6c79ce59d45f750c7bf7952"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/4dbb79e8a22be68e8f8e95db7727ff4b14640f36","verification":{"payload":"tree f079ac85bcdf1dd4f6c79ce59d45f750c7bf7952\nparent 74d08b67fbf9b97d713d6ca5f5563d706ad75cd2\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1787715506 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787715506 +0700\n\nstyle(storefront): polish shop pages with hallmark design system + apple fluid motion (#60)\n\n## Tóm tắt\n\nRedesign các trang chức năng của storefront (Categories & Products, Cart\n& Checkout, Account & Auth) theo hệ thống thiết kế đã khoá trong\n`design.md`, cộng thêm một đợt tinh chỉnh motion theo nguyên tắc Apple\nFluid Interfaces.\n\n### Hallmark redesign (theo design.md — Be Vietnam Pro, warm-neutral,\nbrand-red chỉ dùng cho giá/sale, trust-blue cho hành động phụ)\n- **Categories & Products**: grid rhythm nhất quán, focus-visible ring,\nfilter sidebar dạng card, breadcrumb icon.\n- **Cart & Checkout**: cart table rõ ràng hơn, brand-red chỉ áp cho giá,\nnút phụ chuyển sang trust-blue, trang success dùng token `success`.\n- **Account & Auth**: header/section nhất quán, form card hoá, link phụ\nchuyển trust-blue, thay màu cứng (`red-500`/`green-500`) bằng design\ntoken.\n\n### Apple fluid-interface motion pass (an toàn — không thêm gesture/thư\nviện mới)\n- Spring critically-damped cho tương tác do người dùng khởi tạo (drawer,\ngallery, mega menu, add-to-cart) thay cho tween cố định.\n- Phản hồi tức thì khi bấm (`whileTap`/`active:scale`) trên các nút\ntrước đây chỉ có hover.\n- Backdrop-filter cho overlay/drawer để có cảm giác vật liệu thật.\n- Sửa lệch đường vào/ra (enter/exit path) ở Cart Drawer/Table cho khớp\ntrục.\n- Toàn bộ animation framer-motion đã được bọc bởi `MotionConfig\nreducedMotion=\"user\"` toàn cục — tự động tôn trọng\n`prefers-reduced-motion`.\n\n## Phạm vi & ràng buộc\n- Chỉ thay đổi visual/layout/motion — không đụng data fetching, hooks,\nAPI, validation, routing.\n- `tsc --noEmit`, `eslint`, và `next build` (pre-push hook) đều pass\nsạch.\n- Không xoá file nào, không đổi route/component ownership.\n\n## Còn tồn đọng (đợt sau)\n- Animation trượt gốc của `SheetContent` (`@repo/ui/sheet`) chưa được\nxác minh có spring/mirror/reduced-motion hay không — nằm ngoài phạm vi 2\nfile Cart Drawer/Table lần này.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjl+yCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKnoQABGz+tWZT9KIxVnx1zuX6kAs\n0yJXrExCbmyHPpOl5U4ruSJAgm8AtLDwBWVzUIqrrE8Ldg8xlXfnyGBsDNa4pUjt\nnm3T6Ft5yoXWASHqJEDRzpnZrfyyG6QZRwBYBPQMQF4uhTMYcNinDguqNB6PrqCu\nIyVkQkd+3e1EQgPmgWhNQlamouaMheGCxpNigRarexTUoS6UAiFquNUw0qIXi4vz\n0OZ14EF4ph003exthHGAETi7Y5NX+lRovBhAATUBeM8Ws8/g6n0uKRo8e7SyWGdB\nqvXH4NJ0Ae5znBgPYZk7o69In2dhwEfoj30OtrBsNPO5rl/2bpfyWntNBoGAlTIV\nQbupWFllwsmDpV63CjvLpp/fWo+ZmUcKHYWF1h+na1JOJPdxUu5GxE24XPOt7RJ+\nw4VyNMfeiOv+RxES5NUh0f9/j3saY7FjPXqlEBLoTb76GhysC0G2RpcCuZrdtNKK\nLM6VPlTxSxoPeFC9+EHynUn1SfrX1CRcgcIgzGGg587eqR8rEU55TETjKLSwbNes\nDeXQLnzJa/LbhcgZeT3v+zsOxIOaAoBOL66hs6aA9O3XMRxXhWVzfQFzO2v+FHDw\nH2upN3ePS1TKE58JjDa0pg7yxl6Y6iIASnNScgep4a64ywXXFuAXQ2pH84paqwzj\n3npjJqBYpjmYOGdGQSea\n=Y9Rh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-26T03:38:26Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5