riptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/74d08b67fbf9b97d713d6ca5f5563d706ad75cd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-26T03:37:59Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-26T03:37:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(storefront): reveal home sections on scroll and sync hero carousel entrance (#59)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Add shared `Reveal` primitive; fade+translateY on scroll-into-view for\nthe six static home sections (categories, best sellers, flash sale, new\narrivals, testimonials, why-choose-us).\n- Crossfade `NewsletterForm` between form and success state instead of\nan instant swap.\n- Sync `HeroCarousel`''s entrance with the Hero text stagger, consolidate\nhand-typed easing/duration literals into `home/motion.ts`, and use full\ntransform strings instead of the `y` shorthand.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `pnpm --filter storefront typecheck` — pass\n- `pnpm --filter storefront lint` — pass\n- `pnpm --filter storefront exec vitest run home` — 20/20 pass\n(NewsletterForm + CountdownTimer)\n- `pnpm typecheck` + `pnpm build` (pre-push hook, full monorepo) — pass\n- Manual: reduced-motion toggle respected on all new/changed animations\n\n## Related\n\nRefs #\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant co-author attribution in this PR''s commit messages\nor description (see CONTRIBUTING.md).","tree":{"sha":"73d978b5d0ffc7a1ac1bbed81cabb3053d8392be","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/73d978b5d0ffc7a1ac1bbed81cabb3053d8392be"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/74d08b67fbf9b97d713d6ca5f5563d706ad75cd2","verification":{"payload":"tree 73d978b5d0ff