anh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/69cae9dcdfd6d513e39c269f526cdab8200426ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-10T15:04:13Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-10T15:04:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(tailwind-config): drop unused @repo/design-tokens\n\nZero real importers anywhere in the repo - only tailwind-config''s own\npackage.json declared it as a dependency, never imported in theme.css/\npreset.css. Every token value (colors, typography scale, shadows,\nmotion, z-index) already lived as a literal in theme.css/preset.css,\nhand-kept in sync with design-tokens by code comments alone, with no\nbuild step or codegen connecting the two. That sync already drifted once\nin practice (3e7676f had to manually re-fix a second hardcoded color\ncopy in preset.css) - the seam was drawn but never cut.\n\nDelete packages/design-tokens, drop the dependency from\ntailwind-config/package.json, and fix the theme.css comment that claimed\nto \"wire\" typography.ts in (it never did - values were always\nhand-copied). Update FE-ARCHITECTURE.md''s package table and breakpoint-\nsource row to stop pointing at a package that no longer exists.\n\nNo visual change - confirmed via build + a Playwright screenshot of the\nstorefront home page.\n\n## Summary\n\n<!-- What changed, in 1-3 bullet points. -->\n\n-\n\n## Test plan\n\n<!-- How this was verified: commands run, checks passed, manual steps.\n-->\n\n-\n\n## Related\n\n<!-- Refs #<issue-number>, or \"None\". -->\n\nRefs #\n\n---\n\n- [ ] No AI/assistant co-author attribution in this PR''s commit messages\nor description (see CONTRIBUTING.md).","tree":{"sha":"795ed5497302b547bcb13dac086039d8f5c6fcda","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/795ed5497302b547bcb13dac086039d8f5c6fcda"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/69cae9dcdfd6d513e39c269f526cdab8200426ea","verification":{"payload":"tree 795ed5497302b547bcb13dac086039d8f5c6fcda\nparent 1764b7f95064526f825da19bb598b416376380fa\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1786374253 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786374253 +0700\n\nfix(tailwind-config): drop unused @repo/design-tokens\n\nZero real importers anywhere in the repo - only tailwind-config''s own\npackage.json declared it as a dependency, never imported in theme.css/\npreset.css. Every token value (colors, typography scale, shadows,\nmotion, z-index) already lived as a literal in theme.css/preset.css,\nhand-kept in sync with design-tokens by code comments alone, with no\nbuild step or codegen connecting the two. That sync already drifted once\nin practice (3e7676f had to manually re-fix a second hardcoded color\ncopy in preset.css) - the seam was drawn but never cut.\n\nDelete packages/design-tokens, drop the dependency from\ntailwind-config/package.json, and fix the theme.css comment that claimed\nto \"wire\" typography.ts in (it never did - values were always\nhand-copied). Update FE-ARCHITECTURE.md''s package table and breakpoint-\nsource row to stop pointing at a package that no longer exists.\n\nNo visual change - confirmed via build + a Playwright screenshot of the\nstorefront home page.\n\n## Summary\n\n<!-- What changed, in 1-3 bullet points. -->\n\n-\n\n## Test plan\n\n<!-- How this was verified: commands run, checks passed, manual steps.\n-->\n\n-\n\n## Related\n\n<!-- Refs #<issue-number>, or \"None\". -->\n\nRefs #\n\n---\n\n- [ ] No AI/assistant co-author attribution in this PR''s commit messages\nor description (see CONTRIBUTING.md).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqeehtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAux0QAKGjo7OFY5ksxdN9BQyK80PR\nboyMYIwFwfTcbqJVe8yEDeBG/oOmRJrdRr4AXJAiiMTLygjjPi0BwdUlWq+Wct6y\nKx+ImOJ8TCLpHql1D3wvFRDOLuQd0+PxraDo4EKVd/j28tPQmWIkis5NmFTCJ+BP\nC9jS3rsLk84gZDZm7p9Zk0UxnWTE1mptE7O00pFgRAlsn6uujtOW4sqJiX6MjH1z\nBWjW68j15rAXuWVds5QpSu5YUl3SxMF8mt/oDP+Zk11eJExcEJfxKyPLoNw1B521\n7pFtN3CRUb3oda4j1lyHEEopef/3rZhAMi+wJLMoCaG1bUtGORlFSvJC/aYnKOfv\nLuATnQQ90H7PS/5Oz+Teu+tkahmyPe3VWCPHHUEaaZj9Ke8eN601Ja9IP0c3Ftat\nUPATpRHLwW5yBHUjjgntZ3J0hX7pmn8hEAEhJURtah8IrLIlI9y8BaO1I1EEBYVO\ne+xQ18WMbk4RaELs+wYY3fb3DtzagoYJwQoR8nCGing03ZCO3XdhgIRIv25kxwaF\nC3KhBnWXnnHiBEpDjcC/E6jXbpn/Au6h7pcOmL5hFNH0OQDKUp/zZCRuyoafptlP\nGy4xA7YN7eU7TM9g/2PNRJyONPKN/yGF1G9lgIxSRbdwY022yHIbnqVp0tYURmSk\nkn5Ivt41dcy4uxXyoMpY\n=4jBZ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-12T22:22:55Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events