b.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/3e7676fb906f0cad2271fb95276aa7d75b47f609/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T18:29:10Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T18:29:10Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"message":"fix(storefront): ship homepage improvement plan + header redesign & category sync\n\nHomepage improvement plan (see docs/homepage-improvement-plan.md, 18/19 items):\n- Remove fake flash-sale countdown; distinct placeholder images per product/category/hero\n- Consolidate discount calculation into resolveDiscount(), shared by ProductCard/PriceDisplay\n- Header evolved to a floating inset bar, Footer to a brand-statement close (functional\n  contracts unchanged); DesktopMegaMenu spacing fixed to match; WhyChooseUs icon-inline layout\n- Wire the documented type scale into real Tailwind utilities; add --color-surface-inverse\n  token consumed by Hero/Newsletter/Footer; nudge near-zero-chroma neutral steps (also fixes\n  preset.css''s shadcn color mapping, which independently hardcoded the same values) - shared\n  token file, affects admin/cms too, flagged for a follow-up visual smoke-test\n  Header input/button height mismatch and hero vh->dvh swap; newsletter gains a styled,\n  accessible inline error state; named section-padding tokens; distinct demo product names\n- Remove the storefront''s internal (admin) route scaffold now that apps/admin exists\n\nHeader redesign + category taxonomy sync (this session):\n- Header: full-width sticky bar (replacing the floating inset bar per explicit request),\n  scroll-elevated depth, pointer-tilt 3D logo badge, hover-lift icon buttons, English copy\n- nav-categories.ts translated to English (names + slugs) and made the single source of\n  truth; home.ts''s homeCategoriesData now derives from it instead of a hand-duplicated\n  Vietnamese copy that had already drifted\n- Category page/nav/products chrome (headings, aria-labels, breadcrumbs, empty/error states)\n  translated to English\n\nVerified: eslint clean, tsc --noEmit clean (pre-existing admin-route .next type cache aside),\n274/274 vitest tests passing.\n\nKnown follow-up (not in this push): header/homepage category links still don''t resolve\nagainst the real category-page data, which is sourced from packages/api-sdk''s shared English\nfixtures with a different taxonomy shape entirely - reconciling that touches fixtures shared\nby several e2e/unit test suites.","tree":{"sha":"829f22653d43cff45dc26f8ea5123cfad98ddcc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/829f22653d43cff45dc26f8ea5123cfad98ddcc1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/3e7676fb906f0cad2271fb95276aa7d75b47f609","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizatio