/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/eb93540d5bf761a879f8eee9fbf1935034060069/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T12:37:42Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T12:37:42Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"message":"fix(storefront,admin,cms): extend @source to packages/shared, closing the same Tailwind gap\n\npackages/shared/src also ships React components with Tailwind classes\n(EmptyState, ErrorState, LoadingSpinner, PageLoader) but was outside the\n@source scan added for packages/ui. Confirmed the same class-dropping bug\nhits it live: ErrorState (rendered by apps/storefront''s [locale]/error.tsx —\nthe real error boundary) uses bg-error-50, dark:bg-error-700/20, and\nmin-w-30 that don''t appear anywhere else in storefront''s own source, so\nthey were compiled out. Verified via the built CSS output before/after —\n.bg-error-50, .min-w-30, and dark:bg-error-700/20 are now present.\n\nGrepped every workspace package for className= usage: only packages/ui and\npackages/shared contain visual components, and both are now covered — no\nother package needs this.","tree":{"sha":"e3d9994b0dc4400eeef62089911b8605ee42b0ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/e3d9994b0dc4400eeef62089911b8605ee42b0ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/eb93540d5bf761a879f8eee9fbf1935034060069","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/eve