ngThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/a1679b0be76a63c7fe5a943fd4d1eba9c77f2d9e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-09T12:23:29Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-09T12:23:29Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"message":"fix(storefront,admin,cms): resolve remaining shadscan advisories + critical Tailwind @source bug\n\nshadscan verify-disposition findings:\n- FilterSidebar: wrap ungrouped SelectItem in SelectGroup (items-belong-to-groups)\n- CartDrawer/CartTable: add an undo action to the \"remove from cart\" toast\n  (destructive-actions-confirmed) instead of a blocking confirm dialog\n- verified color-contrast-passes (AdminNavbar text-muted-foreground) computes\n  4.60:1 light / 6.20:1 dark against its background — both pass WCAG AA\n- verified pointer-target-size-passes (CheckoutClient shipping radio) is a\n  false positive: the 16px radio sits inside a full-row clickable <label>\n- verified mobile-overflow-absent (SectionBestSellers) is a false positive:\n  the carousel track has overflow-x-auto, so it''s a contained, intentional\n  scroll area, not page-level overflow\n\nFound via live browser verification (Playwright against a real prod build),\nnot from a shadscan finding:\n- Header.tsx: the wordmark + action icons don''t fit at 375px viewport width,\n  causing real page-level horizontal overflow on every route. Hide the\n  \".STORE\" suffix below `sm` so \"ANTIGRAVITY\" still reads as the brand.\n- apps/storefront/admin/cms globals.css were missing `@source` for\n  packages/ui/src. Tailwind v4 auto-detection never scanned the shared UI\n  package, so utility classes used only there (e.g. Sheet''s `inset-y-0\n  right-0`) were silently absent from the compiled CSS. In production this\n  put every Sheet''s `top`/`right` at `auto`, and the browser''s fallback\n  static-position calculation placed the panel at `top: document.body.\n  scrollHeight` — off-screen on every page. Confirmed against a real\n  production build (not dev-only), root-caused via computed-style +\n  matched-CSSRule inspection, and confirmed fixed on /vi/home, /vi/products,\n  /vi/wishlist. Applied the same fix to admin and cms since they share the\n  identical globals.css shape and would hit the same bug once they render\n  any @repo/ui component whose classes aren''t independently used in their\n  own source.","tree":{"sha":"99506dfb7be35d987e1e7f90a20f943c508527c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/99506dfb7be35d987e1e7f90a20f943c508527c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/a1679b0be76a63c7fe5a943fd4d1eba9c77f2d9e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/a1679b0be76a63c7fe5a943fd4d1eba9c77f2d9e","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKGExNjc5YjBiZTc2YTYzYzdmZTVhOTQzZmQ0ZDFlYmE5Yzc3ZjJkOWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/af33cfdac686d066f448543bbbc414dd8bcefec9","sha":"af33cfdac686d066f448543bbbc414dd8bcefec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/af33cfdac686d066f448543bbbc414dd8bcefec9"}],"sha":"a1679b0be76a63c7fe5a943fd4d1eba9c77f2d9e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/a1679b0be76a63c7fe5a943fd4d1eba9c77f2d9e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/af33cfdac686d066f448543bbbc414dd8bcefec9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T18:23:16Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T18:23:16Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"message":"fix(storefront): resolve shadscan P2 findings\n\n- Header: restore aria-label on the icon Button (kept alongside the Link''s\n  aria-label) so both links-have-accessible-names and icon-buttons-have-labels\n  static checks pass without relying on the custom Button''s asChild cloning\n- FilterSidebar: wrap catalog filter navigation in useTransition; disable\n  triggers and surface pending text + an aria-live status span while applying\n- CheckoutClient: mark the reservation error as role=\"alert\"; add an\n  aria-live status span announcing order submission in progress\n- OrderDetailClient: add aria-live status spans for cancel/return-request\n  pending state\n- ProductsClient: mark the loading state role=\"status\" and the error state\n  role=\"alert\"\n\nSkipped by product decision: FoundationCheck empty state (unlinked debug\npage), AdminSidebar mobile nav trigger (\"decide\" disposition), and further\nstatus-messages-announced instances beyond this batch (widespread pattern\nacross many components — stopped here rather than chasing every occurrence).\n\nNot actionable (shadscan false positives, verified): validation-wired-to-form\non CheckoutClient — the resolver/schema is wired one level up in\ncheckout/page.tsx via FormProvider, which the static check doesn''t trace\ninto; async-action-pending-state on NewsletterForm — the form is fully\nsynchronous today (no onSubmit wired at its call site), so there is no\npending state to expose.\n\nshadscan score: 50 -> 54/100, accessibility 64% -> 84%","tree":{"sha":"40b9b9f6b726b380b2d1267dc63069ee1827235f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/40b9b9f6b726b380b2d1267dc63069ee1827235f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/af33cfdac686d066f448543bbbc414dd8bcefec9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/af33cfdac686d066f448543bbbc414dd8bcefec9","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKGFmMzNjZmRhYzY4NmQwNjZmNDQ4NTQzYmJiYzQxNGRkOGJjZWZlYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/810b8b0d74a3a5e6eacb2bd77cba9bf3b976416c","sha":"810b8b0d74a3a5e6eacb2bd77cba9bf3b976416c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/810b8b0d74a3a5e6eacb2bd77cba9bf3b976416c"}],"sha":"af33cfdac686d066f448543bbbc414dd8bcefec9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/af33cfdac686d066f448543bbbc414dd8bcefec9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/810b8b0d74a3a5e6eacb2bd77cba9bf3b976416c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T17:33:00Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T17:33:00Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"message":"fix(storefront): resolve shadscan P1 findings\n\n- add app/not-found.tsx (foundation: not-found route)\n- add app/opengraph-image.tsx via next/og (production-polish: social preview)\n- login page: give the LoginForm Suspense boundary a visible loading fallback\n- add data-icon=\"inline-start\"/\"inline-end\" to icon+text Button usages in\n  AdminNavbar, AddressesClient, CartSummary, WishlistClient\n- declare autocomplete purposes on personal-data inputs across\n  AddressesClient, CheckoutClient, ProfileClient, NewsletterForm\n\nSkipped by product decision: dark-mode keyboard shortcut, command menu\n(Cmd/Ctrl+K) — both are \"decide\" dispositions, not gaps.\nNot actionable (shadscan false positives, verified already implemented):\ntheme-provider-mounted-in-shell and toast-provider-present/mounted are both\nalready wired via app/providers.tsx, which the static check doesn''t trace\ninto; ProductViewer3D''s Suspense fallback={null} is the correct\nreact-three-fiber pattern inside a <Canvas> and can''t render a DOM fallback.\n\nshadscan score: 41 -> 50/100, production-polish 56% -> 100%","tree":{"sha":"cee076518ffe4ec02da4b3d1de4bc09690d8e9b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/cee076518ffe4ec02da4b3d1de4bc09690d8e9b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/810b8b0d74a3a5e6eacb2bd77cba9bf3b976416c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCon