267dbedd825922ce826c3fd3a51a9b359b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T17:09:37Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T17:09:37Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"message":"fix(storefront): resolve shadscan P0 accessibility findings\n\n- add @shadscan/cli as devDependency in apps/storefront\n- FilterSidebar/Header: add aria-label to unlabeled inputs (price range, search)\n- PasswordInput: fallback aria-label for standalone (non-FormControl) usage\n- Header: move icon-link aria-label from Button onto the rendered Link so\n  it''s statically verifiable (account/login/wishlist buttons)\n- CartDrawer/ProductCard: remove nested interactive controls (button inside\n  Link) by using Button asChild composition / moving wishlist toggle out of\n  the product Link\n- AddressesClient: wire aria-invalid/aria-describedby/role=alert so field\n  errors are programmatically associated with their inputs\n\nshadscan score: 38 -> 41/100, accessibility category 50% -> 64%","tree":{"sha":"f53548b4ea23b22ec5fe69848bad33d410de6018","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/f53548b4ea23b22ec5fe69848bad33d410de6018"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/acc27267dbedd825922ce826c3fd3a51a9b359b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/acc27267dbedd825922ce826c3fd3a51a9b359b7","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKGFjYzI3MjY3ZGJlZGQ4MjU5MjJjZTgyNmMzZmQzYTUxYTliMzU5Yjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/98cf955ce4c03a92ae04e02532971e22da265846","sha":"98cf955ce4c03a92ae04e02532971e22da265846","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/98cf955ce4c03a92ae04e02532971e22da265846"}],"sha":"acc27267dbedd825922ce826c3fd3a51a9b359b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/acc27267dbedd825922ce826c3fd3a51a9b359b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/98cf955ce4c03a92ae04e02532971e22da265846/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T16:20:09Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T16:20:09Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"message":"fix(storefront,ui): resolve ui-review blocking findings (batch 1+2)\n\nSystemic (design-contract drift, packages/ui + apps/storefront):\n- ProductCard/ProductGallery: aspect-square -> aspect-[4/5] (locked product/PDP image ratio)\n- Header/DesktopMegaMenu: broken z-index custom properties (--z-header/--z-dropdown never\n  existed) -> correct --z-index-sticky/--z-index-dropdown tokens\n- Sheet/Dialog (packages/ui): hardcoded z-50 -> --z-index-overlay/--z-index-drawer/--z-index-modal\n- Header cart/wishlist count badges + ProductCard wishlist heart: brand hue (price/sale/promo\n  only) misused as a generic action color -> primary/accent\n- SectionFlashSale: brand hue used for section bg/heading (not just the promo badge) -> neutral\n\nReal bugs:\n- PasswordInput was built but never wired into Login/Register/Reset forms — no show/hide\n  toggle existed anywhere; now used in all three, plus aria-pressed on the toggle\n- AddressesClient: deleting an address had zero confirmation — now goes through ConfirmDialog;\n  also fixed unresponsive 3-col address grid on mobile and sub-40px action button targets\n- OrderStatusBadge: PROCESSING/PACKED/SHIPPED all rendered identical (bg-primary) badges,\n  indistinguishable at a glance — added a `success` Badge variant and gave all 8 statuses\n  distinct treatments\n- app/layout.tsx: <html lang=\"vi\"> was hardcoded regardless of active locale — now reads the\n  request locale via next-intl''s getLocale(); metadata/OG/PWA title still said \"E-Commerce\n  Shop\" instead of the locked brand name ANTIGRAVITY.STORE\n- CheckoutClient: city/district/ward had no error message when left blank (silent submit\n  failure); Input never used its own error state (no aria-invalid/aria-describedby wiring);\n  submit button was a raw <button> that lost the shared focus-visible ring — now uses Button\n\nVerification: storefront typecheck/lint/format clean, 266/266 tests passing (added a\nconfirm+cancel test pair for the address delete dialog, updated the one test whose flow\nchanged). packages/ui typecheck clean.\n\nKnown follow-up (not fixed here, flagged only): CheckoutClient resolves field error text via\nt(''errors.'' + zodMessage), but the zod schema''s messages are literal Vietnamese strings, not\ni18n keys — pre-existing mismatch, now also inherited by city/district/ward for consistency\nwith the sibling fields.","tree":{"sha":"e64c375672673eed58cbc49c5d04bfe5d6091aec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/e64c375672673eed58cbc49c5d04bfe5d6091aec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/98cf955ce4c03a92ae04e02532971e22da265846","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/98cf955ce4c03a92ae04e02532971e22da265846","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKDk4Y2Y5NTVjZTRjMDNhOTJhZTA0ZTAyNTMyOTcxZTIyZGEyNjU4NDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/7197999396db9452d63b0a5b2af9fee3c56275bb","sha":"7197999396db9452d63b0a5b2af9fee3c56275bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/7197999396db9452d63b0a5b2af9fee3c56275bb"}],"sha":"98cf955ce4c03a92ae04e02532971e22da265846","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/98cf955ce4c03a92ae04e02532971e22da265846"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/7197999396db9452d63b0a5b2af9fee3c56275bb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T15:43:44Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T15:43:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(storefront,api-sdk): storefront order lifecycle cancel+return-request (#17) (#52)\n\n## What\n\nOrder lifecycle từ phía khách hàng: huỷ đơn và yêu cầu trả hàng, theo\nđúng state machine COD (SF-\\?, glossary.md — Cart & Order / Return &\nRefund).\n\nCloses #17\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [x] Huỷ đơn (CANCELLED) chỉ khả dụng khi Order đang\nPENDING/PROCESSING; từ PACKED trở đi, nút huỷ không hiển thị/không cho\nphép.\n- [x] Return request (RETURN_REQUESTED) chỉ tạo được khi Order DELIVERED\nvà trong vòng 7 ngày kể từ delivered_at; quá hạn bị từ chối ngay ở\nvalidate (cả client — nút ẩn + thông báo quá hạn, lẫn server — 409).\n- [x] Order detail hiển thị đúng trạng thái hiện tại và hành động khả\ndụng tương ứng theo state machine.\n- [x] FE-INT test cho từng nhánh state transition hợp lệ/không hợp lệ từ\ngóc nhìn Customer.\n\n## Notes\n\n- `canCancelOrder`/`canRequestReturn` are shared pure functions\n(`shared/types/order.ts`) — the UI gate (show/hide button) and the\nmock''s server-side validation both key off the exact same rule, not two\ncopies that can drift apart.\n- Another 2 real mock gaps closed: `POST /api/orders/:id/cancel/` (the\nCancel button has existed since before #15 but had no MSW handler at all\n— clicking it always silently failed) and `POST\n/api/orders/:id/return-request/` (new).\n- Stock is **not** released back to `available` on CANCELLED in this\npass — doing that would need `OrderItem` to retain a `skuId`, which the\ncustomer-facing snapshot deliberately doesn''t keep (glossary.md —\nOrderItem is a name/price/image snapshot, not a live reference). Flagged\nas a known gap in the code rather than widening that shape for this\nissue; not called out in #17''s acceptance criteria.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `pnpm --filter storefront typecheck` / `pnpm --filter @repo/api-sdk\ntypecheck` — clean\n- `pnpm --filter storefront test` — 265/265 passed (27 new)\n- `pnpm --filter @repo/api-sdk test` — 65/65 passed\n- `pnpm --filter storefront lint` / `format:check` — clean\n- `pnpm --filter storefront build` — succeeds","tree":{"sha":"022a0ff33992bcc81644ec22142857446379683b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/022a0ff33992bcc81644ec22142857446379683b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/7197999396db9452d63b0a5b2af9fee3c56275bb","verification":{"payload":"tree 022a0ff33992bcc81644ec22142857446379683b\nparent 0cac9e30840f1443850d1c7ec507216ec0a8345d\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1786203824 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786203824 +0700\n\nfeat(storefront,api-sdk): storefront order lifecycle cancel+return-request (#17) (#52)\n\n## What\n\nOrder lifecycle từ phía khách hàng: huỷ đơn và yêu cầu trả hàng, theo\nđúng state machine COD (SF-\\?, glossary.md — Cart & Order / Return &\nRefund).\n\nCloses #17\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [x] Huỷ đơn (CANCELLED) chỉ khả dụng khi Order đang\nPENDING/PROCESSING; từ PACKED trở đi, nút huỷ không hiển thị/không cho\nphép.\n- [x] Return request (RETURN_REQUESTED) chỉ tạo được khi Order DELIVERED\nvà trong vòng 7 ngày kể từ delivered_at; quá hạn bị từ chối ngay ở\nvalidate (cả client — nút ẩn + thông báo quá hạn, lẫn server — 409).\n- [x] Order detail hiển thị đúng trạng thái hiện tại và hành động khả\ndụng tương ứng theo state machine.\n- [x] FE-INT test cho từng nhánh state transition hợp lệ/không hợp lệ từ\ngóc nhìn Customer.\n\n## Notes\n\n- `canCancelOrder`/`canRequestReturn` are shared pure functions\n(`shared/types/order.ts`) — the UI gate (show/hide button) and the\nmock''s server-side validation both key off the exact same rule, not two\ncopies that can drift apart.\n- Another 2 real mock gaps closed: `POST /api/orders/:id/cancel/` (the\nCancel button has existed since before #15 but had no MSW handler at all\n— clicking it always silently failed) and `POST\n/api/orders/:id/return-request/` (new).\n- Stock is **not** released back to `available` on CANCELLED in this\npass — doing that would need `OrderItem` to retain a `skuId`, which the\ncustomer-facing snapshot deliberately doesn''t keep (glossary.md —\nOrderItem is a name/price/image snapshot, not a live reference). Flagged\nas a known gap in the code rather than widening that shape for this\nissue; not called out in #17''s acceptance criteria.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `pnpm --filter storefront typecheck` / `pnpm --filter @repo/api-sdk\ntypecheck` — clean\n- `pnpm --filter storefront test` — 265/265 passed (27 new)\n- `pnpm --filter @repo/api-sdk test` — 65/65 passed\n- `pnpm --filter storefront lint` / `format:check` — clean\n- `pnpm --filter storefront build` — succeeds","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqd06wCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGjoQAKwUeRuPmaFrgJIm/3HbNXXw\neMHjMVHUWymWRJCx2zNrUMBrazn8N6iwK4i51eHSTOx2LBxrf2yeqLj7Po8fg1mv\nMUi7EnWUSqBFBn7/LVVdDMIx4PO/g8zyJy7ON8dnpo+BJYtS+JaPABtzzAuJayG2\nS9JLNVi7pkJnjn4RP6ffyKxGpXUUsgX4+wjhx1TX0hrIYXxGrXfG4ZKNyXtbFG8P\nEpdBZtJq0Np3Xz/yvOA3lG/vcjcsEvK3VlxSGaNhnkpcgsznXccrJaNC7/4rJNmV\nVDsQHQIIqfjdrNQOV4mopaIvNhqENFa2frrCuM5xdV2acjr5iv1PR6nqa60ZrjKI\na0YgmpWugot6c/gjNg/V8rPb/5T5/G3s8urBTZMayLiGnVQ36C2vxqSLLKmsUx68\n00huOXw8DQT3aBOhunOkvELYDyRtkNmcI8HAGmPGZWF7DUAeHHkLxeeOvuXih5XG\nR9CHsWlXD2HVPck2X6OvxuRNyc8x/7s3G/WLyOg+TdzgdGP1LKXkwP8WgnmcuCog\n5eLmphH/fmMxc1pi9y5WMpQcs+Slsnn2llZIKBlje4IFckdMHaJvKVwoeiHQplhX\nrLTNw/H73kH1C4tMaHMdbes6Z6mOLfXAVqsqz5yv9YkanVo/0ftV9fdUuOuVP+Oe\naIOYIOaYMYlpkYcJ3F9B\n=V0PB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-08T15:43:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/7197999396db9452d63b0a5b2af9fee3c56275bb","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKDcxOTc5OTkzOTZkYjk0NTJkNjNiMGE1YjJhZjlmZWUzYzU2Mjc1YmI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/0cac9e30840f1443850d1c7ec507216ec0a8345d","sha":"0cac9e30840f1443850d1c7ec507216ec0a8345d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/0cac9e30840f1443850d1c7ec507216ec0a8345d"}],"sha":"7197999396db9452d63b0a5b2af9fee3c56275bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/7197999396db9452d63b0a5b2af9fee3c56275bb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/0cac9e30840f1443850d1c7ec507216ec0a8345d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T06:58:00Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T06:58:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(storefront,api-sdk): storefront checkout COD reservation+idempotent place order (#16)\n\n## What\n\nCheckout COD-only: reservation khi bắt đầu checkout, place order\nidempotent, order success, OrderItem snapshot (SF-07).\n\nCloses #16\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [x] Checkout chỉ có COD, không có bước payment gateway (Decision #7) —\ndropped bankTransfer/vnpay/momo/zalopay from the storefront''s own\ncheckout schema + endpoint type; the payment-method UI is now a fixed\nCOD notice, nothing to select.\n- [x] Reservation (mock) chỉ ''tạo'' khi bắt đầu Checkout — created on\nCheckout mount, holds `available` stock (base - reserved), expires on\nits own (TTL) if the customer abandons Checkout, no explicit release\ncall needed.\n- [x] Place order chặn duplicate (idempotency) — `requestKey` generated\nonce client-side, reused across retries; the mock replays the original\norder instead of creating a duplicate.\n- [x] Order success hiển thị đầy đủ; OrderItem snapshot — items snapshot\nproduct_name/variant_name/price/image at the moment Place Order commits\nthe Reservation (Decision #38), not a live SKU reference.\n- [x] FE-E2E-001: browse → PDP → cart → checkout COD → order success.\n\n## Real gaps filled along the way\n\n- `POST /api/orders/` (place order) and `POST\n/api/checkout/reservations` had **no MSW handler at all** before this\nPR.\n- `OrdersClient` fetched via a server-fetched prop — closes a gap from\n#15 where the mock''s in-memory-only auth token can never reach a\nserver-side fetch (Decision #90), so order history was always empty even\nafter placing a real order. Now fetches client-side via `useOrders()`.\n- **Found and fixed a real pre-existing race in `CheckoutClient`**,\nsurfaced by e2e (not caught by any existing test): the empty-cart\nredirect checked the async live-resolved `items` (always empty on a\nfresh mount, since it depends on a SKU-resolve query) instead of the\nalready-hydrated persisted cart — bouncing the user back to `/cart`\nbefore the query ever finished. Fixed by adding a reactive `isHydrated`\nflag to the cart store.\n- `/checkout` is now actually gated by `AuthGuard` (middleware.ts\nalready listed it as protected, but nothing enforced it client-side,\nsame gap #15 closed for `/account/*`).\n\n## Verification\n\n- `pnpm --filter storefront typecheck` / `pnpm --filter @repo/api-sdk\ntypecheck` — clean\n- `pnpm --filter storefront test` — 238/238 passed (9 new)\n- `pnpm --filter @repo/api-sdk test` — 65/65 passed\n- `pnpm --filter storefront lint` / `format:check` — clean\n- `pnpm --filter storefront build` — succeeds\n- `playwright test` — all 18 e2e specs pass (sequential; this sandbox''s\ndev server gets resource-contended under heavy parallel e2e load —\npre-existing environment behavior, not gated by CI, unrelated to this\nPR''s logic)","tree":{"sha":"4ecf2c335aaed51e440d236cb6e07d2d29495437","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/4ecf2c335aaed51e440d236cb6e07d2d29495437"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/0cac9e30840f1443850d1c7ec507216ec0a8345d","verification":{"payload":"tree 4ecf2c335aaed51e440d236cb6e07d2d29495437\nparent 492fea651cbb7e103b30c6cc142c16c4d1e93a30\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1786172280 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786172280 +0700\n\nfeat(storefront,api-sdk): storefront checkout COD reservation+idempotent place order (#16)\n\n## What\n\nCheckout COD-only: reservation khi bắt đầu checkout, place order\nidempotent, order success, OrderItem snapshot (SF-07).\n\nCloses #16\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [x] Checkout chỉ có COD, không có bước payment gateway (Decision #7) —\ndropped bankTransfer/vnpay/momo/zalopay from the storefront''s own\ncheckout schema + endpoint type; the payment-method UI is now a fixed\nCOD notice, nothing to select.\n- [x] Reservation (mock) chỉ ''tạo'' khi bắt đầu Checkout — created on\nCheckout mount, holds `available` stock (base - reserved), expires on\nits own (TTL) if the customer abandons Checkout, no explicit release\ncall needed.\n- [x] Place order chặn duplicate (idempotency) — `requestKey` generated\nonce client-side, reused across retries; the mock replays the original\norder instead of creating a duplicate.\n- [x] Order success hiển thị đầy đủ; OrderItem snapshot — items snapshot\nproduct_name/variant_name/price/image at the moment Place Order commits\nthe Reservation (Decision #38), not a live SKU reference.\n- [x] FE-E2E-001: browse → PDP → cart → checkout COD → order success.\n\n## Real gaps filled along the way\n\n- `POST /api/orders/` (place order) and `POST\n/api/checkout/reservations` had **no MSW handler at all** before this\nPR.\n- `OrdersClient` fetched via a server-fetched prop — closes a gap from\n#15 where the mock''s in-memory-only auth token can never reach a\nserver-side fetch (Decision #90), so order history was always empty even\nafter placing a real order. Now fetches client-side via `useOrders()`.\n- **Found and fixed a real pre-existing race in `CheckoutClient`**,\nsurfaced by e2e (not caught by any existing test): the empty-cart\nredirect checked the async live-resolved `items` (always empty on a\nfresh mount, since it depends on a SKU-resolve query) instead of the\nalready-hydrated persisted cart — bouncing the user back to `/cart`\nbefore the query ever finished. Fixed by adding a reactive `isHydrated`\nflag to the cart store.\n- `/checkout` is now actually gated by `AuthGuard` (middleware.ts\nalready listed it as protected, but nothing enforced it client-side,\nsame gap #15 closed for `/account/*`).\n\n## Verification\n\n- `pnpm --filter storefront typecheck` / `pnpm --filter @repo/api-sdk\ntypecheck` — clean\n- `pnpm --filter storefront test` — 238/238 passed (9 new)\n- `pnpm --filter @repo/api-sdk test` — 65/65 passed\n- `pnpm --filter storefront lint` / `format:check` — clean\n- `pnpm --filter storefront build` — succeeds\n- `playwright test` — all 18 e2e specs pass (sequential; this sandbox''s\ndev server gets resource-contended under heavy parallel e2e load —\npre-existing environment behavior, not gated by CI, unrelated to this\nPR''s logic)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdtN4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgOgQACaeyGGEo5n9J+ptVZK3cymS\nzLoG3QRrsc+stEje5KQTzBiFmb3AE2Z30ngY9aGeSC5CzFQj0g3+JINAEpuSFtVv\nRQH7fo8phujXz+yGrMphNiI+D2ozzPu6iUv3VfA0vNiJpfxEZkeFUbdIczX52UV2\nkJAhPf5ctZovd7JaEq4T9mhsZ68Q85RVDUWbjj9elJnZdHcEYkHksEwPmC4LLXYK\n6m3tXV9qyvsghHUqzjrPAP4Z8GEKK7lRikrz1wYYTOnAAlhIEudBcMN8KLzQ4Syl\nv9brDsoaBbmvvWk3fz7p0OZUEBIQdcv2TFFGUW6KzQW3Ae7rU45+4zbBqMaa/ZS4\n2gk2cb19Af4xm4bTR2vZi/UX5orIm/Gg0DZzuteKGvnVvVNjgyT8V4Jl30O0F4wm\nQO//5tT8XWQ85J7o+OYJRyKgpIo2oNbexdlr9yJb6FeqAUiaeJQB0wcX8ntDrY+f\nWzzN7RckEMnkiHQCYN+FbY9KTCmIdLjDZJV8Ehf/Y6h5ejEof6Nb9K4+NlDrxf8P\nDumzz0nOI+lwgXny8tZJ8Tp/vdTXX2nGFjVA4OwyO74M75xLALXAkhvdjpj7E/t1\nqryylCp0S8Dk8vFu2IXwc4uW+24utA924hYuH/7Cs+BKqh/36LlunAb2cUvjriju\nq1OqLLnmoxckUFtl94XI\n=GH/c\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-08T06:58:06Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/0cac9e30840f1443850d1c7ec507216ec0a8345d","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKDBjYWM5ZTMwODQwZjE0NDM4NTBkMWM3ZWM1MDcyMTZlYzBhODM0NWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/492fea651cbb7e103b30c6cc142c16c4d1e93a30","sha":"492fea651cbb7e103b30c6cc142c16c4d1e93a30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/492fea651cbb7e103b30c6cc142c16c4d1e93a30"}],"sha":"0cac9e30840f1443850d1c7ec507216ec0a8345d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/0cac9e30840f1443850d1c7ec507216ec0a8345d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/492fea651cbb7e103b30c6cc142c16c4d1e93a30/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T06:12:41Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T06:12:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(storefront,api-sdk): storefront account profile/addresses/orders (#15)\n\n## What\n\nStorefront Account: profile, saved-address book, order history (SF-09).\n\nCloses #15\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [x] Route `account/profile`, `account/addresses`, `account/orders` +\n`account/orders/[id]` render — moved profile/orders under `/account` to\nmatch `ROUTES.ACCOUNT` (was a pre-existing path mismatch), added\n`account/addresses`, gated all three behind a shared\n`account/layout.tsx` `AuthGuard` (previously wired nowhere despite\nexisting).\n- [x] Customer chỉ xem được Order của chính mình — `order-fixtures.ts`\nscopes every lookup by `userId`; there is no code path to another\nCustomer''s order, not a permission check layered on top. Covered by an\nFE-INT test asserting a non-owned/nonexistent id 404s the same way (no\nexistence leak) and a signed-out request is rejected.\n- [x] CRUD địa chỉ (thêm/sửa/xoá, đặt mặc định) hoạt động qua mock — new\n`api-sdk/endpoints/address.ts` + `address-fixtures.ts` +\n`AddressesClient`.\n- [x] FE-INT test cho profile update, address CRUD.\n\n## Notable side-quest: OrderStatus didn''t match glossary.md\n\nFound while wiring Order history: the existing `shared/types/order.ts`\n`OrderStatus`\n(`pending/confirmed/processing/shipped/delivered/cancelled`) didn''t\nmatch the state machine already decided in `docs/00-core/glossary.md`\n(`PENDING/PROCESSING/PACKED/SHIPPED/DELIVERED/CANCELLED/RETURN_REQUESTED/RETURNED`,\nCANCELLED only valid from PENDING/PROCESSING). Realigned it now (+\n`delivered_at` for the future 7-day return window) rather than let\n#16/#17 build Reservation/return-request on top of the wrong enum.\n`OrderStatusBadge` and the existing PENDING-only cancel gate in\n`OrderDetailClient` are updated to match; the full cancel/return-request\nstate-machine + mutation handlers stay #17''s scope.\n\n## Two real mock gaps filled along the way\n\nNeither had an MSW handler at all before this PR (both existing UI,\nsilently no-op/empty until now):\n- `PATCH /api/auth/me/update/` (profile update)\n- `GET /api/orders/` + `GET /api/orders/:id/` (order history) —\nread-side only; place-order/cancel/return stay #16/#17.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `pnpm --filter storefront typecheck` / `pnpm --filter @repo/api-sdk\ntypecheck` — clean\n- `pnpm --filter storefront test` — 229/229 passed (11 new)\n- `pnpm --filter @repo/api-sdk test` — 65/65 passed\n- `pnpm --filter storefront lint` / `format:check` — clean\n- `pnpm --filter storefront build` — succeeds, all 4 `/account/*` routes\ngenerated","tree":{"sha":"18835ec68585f61617e81ff90dab8d84662e4520","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/18835ec68585f61617e81ff90dab8d84662e4520"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/492fea651cbb7e103b30c6cc142c16c4d1e93a30","verification":{"payload":"tree 18835ec68585f61617e81ff90dab8d84662e4520\nparent 9f0b22112703d539cef6093142e06c62fcbfb230\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1786169561 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786169561 +0700\n\nfeat(storefront,api-sdk): storefront account profile/addresses/orders (#15)\n\n## What\n\nStorefront Account: profile, saved-address book, order history (SF-09).\n\nCloses #15\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [x] Route `account/profile`, `account/addresses`, `account/orders` +\n`account/orders/[id]` render — moved profile/orders under `/account` to\nmatch `ROUTES.ACCOUNT` (was a pre-existing path mismatch), added\n`account/addresses`, gated all three behind a shared\n`account/layout.tsx` `AuthGuard` (previously wired nowhere despite\nexisting).\n- [x] Customer chỉ xem được Order của chính mình — `order-fixtures.ts`\nscopes every lookup by `userId`; there is no code path to another\nCustomer''s order, not a permission check layered on top. Covered by an\nFE-INT test asserting a non-owned/nonexistent id 404s the same way (no\nexistence leak) and a signed-out request is rejected.\n- [x] CRUD địa chỉ (thêm/sửa/xoá, đặt mặc định) hoạt động qua mock — new\n`api-sdk/endpoints/address.ts` + `address-fixtures.ts` +\n`AddressesClient`.\n- [x] FE-INT test cho profile update, address CRUD.\n\n## Notable side-quest: OrderStatus didn''t match glossary.md\n\nFound while wiring Order history: the existing `shared/types/order.ts`\n`OrderStatus`\n(`pending/confirmed/processing/shipped/delivered/cancelled`) didn''t\nmatch the state machine already decided in `docs/00-core/glossary.md`\n(`PENDING/PROCESSING/PACKED/SHIPPED/DELIVERED/CANCELLED/RETURN_REQUESTED/RETURNED`,\nCANCELLED only valid from PENDING/PROCESSING). Realigned it now (+\n`delivered_at` for the future 7-day return window) rather than let\n#16/#17 build Reservation/return-request on top of the wrong enum.\n`OrderStatusBadge` and the existing PENDING-only cancel gate in\n`OrderDetailClient` are updated to match; the full cancel/return-request\nstate-machine + mutation handlers stay #17''s scope.\n\n## Two real mock gaps filled along the way\n\nNeither had an MSW handler at all before this PR (both existing UI,\nsilently no-op/empty until now):\n- `PATCH /api/auth/me/update/` (profile update)\n- `GET /api/orders/` + `GET /api/orders/:id/` (order history) —\nread-side only; place-order/cancel/return stay #16/#17.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `pnpm --filter storefront typecheck` / `pnpm --filter @repo/api-sdk\ntypecheck` — clean\n- `pnpm --filter storefront test` — 229/229 passed (11 new)\n- `pnpm --filter @repo/api-sdk test` — 65/65 passed\n- `pnpm --filter storefront lint` / `format:check` — clean\n- `pnpm --filter storefront build` — succeeds, all 4 `/account/*` routes\ngenerated","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdsjZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAOkYQAJSIpQXVxtx0f4Id4tElqZYb\neixc5u8onaQg8BZAk6N42V+ed5pdOghR9wAnG6ET9khJVuFkpsRx78qZ7ReWv8wQ\nVTa8vt2JOedrFWIg+J/6XxNUgm7wlGGqLG93VeRvAmf9b4XtzYmb3HLjXdS5CYWT\nfdEX4L2doL9k5vw4Axbp6QeRzPfq5ySeY0s8jMlSIz4/VH5Dqn3AbQUXaTBh7Bmv\nd2/9iizB/C96iW5G9aVHSer9UFDA1hytod2w37e+uGeSjXbtjKJikcgmhBQMBbXd\nelGZ7UQ4LA9vXztx2QAQpj6Lm1zo4boLqAnRYHH2jOB4HbzVvytY9OhJbHMVjyO0\nDnN6NjViGqnUDcMY6UVLW48Tt7Z/mnsji8h9L/TaNBlfDrL5piFhl3wr5FKo2cU1\noxN1AWRmUP9TQZTLl72suwbrlyQqei08a1dnQxcKFesaNlctlilNPLsInVnVbuK2\nGLqdoqHaUEDwwZ6QqubGMaQJqN6Qd5y2+oZ3/6QT4UP06GnZhD2oKLpWY9Trwxf8\nHEvKxavOcm7uN9yJEdXN639kUtbHhcqCu43HYa60leLiK1bo3mnPV0XHtUHVktjV\nVanDc0GsJCRQqa+vvXC588uOPkrd265T6+evA4uOjxOM3ZjfZPiLxWykO7rcvFPP\nrUhHMYAP0H1kRHtkA+/d\n=nT4w\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"202