s.ts`).\n- `useIsWishlisted` is a separate, lightweight selector (no react-query\nresolve) so each `ProductCard` on a grid doesn''t trigger its own network\nresolve — only the full Wishlist page uses the heavier `useWishlist()`.\n- New route `/wishlist` + Header icon/badge, wired into the same\npost-login effect as cart merge.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `pnpm --filter storefront typecheck` / `pnpm --filter @repo/api-sdk\ntypecheck` — clean\n- `pnpm --filter storefront test` — 218/218 passed (23 new)\n- `pnpm --filter @repo/api-sdk test` — 65/65 passed\n- `pnpm --filter storefront lint` / `format:check` — clean\n- `pnpm --filter storefront build` — succeeds, `/vi/wishlist`\n`/en/wishlist` generated","tree":{"sha":"c94121e7126c768d76173ad4345330d652bcf749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/c94121e7126c768d76173ad4345330d652bcf749"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/9f0b22112703d539cef6093142e06c62fcbfb230","verification":{"payload":"tree c94121e7126c768d76173ad4345330d652bcf749\nparent 0d58d9ecb490f49d06d2f53c2595aae4c09a8499\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1786168115 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786168115 +0700\n\nfeat(storefront,api-sdk): storefront wishlist guest+merge+move-to-cart (#14)\n\n## What\n\nStorefront Wishlist: guest + authenticated, merge sau đăng nhập,\nmove-to-cart (SF-06).\n\nCloses #14\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n- [x] `WishlistItem` tham chiếu Product (không SKU/Variant cụ thể —\nglossary.md); toggle ngay trên `ProductCard` ở PLP.\n- [x] Merge sau đăng nhập: hợp nhất (union) theo Product, khử trùng,\nkhông có khái niệm xung đột số lượng (Decision #41).\n- [x] Move-to-cart: Product có Variant → điều hướng PDP để tự chọn\nColor/Size; Product không Variant → add thẳng vào giỏ.\n- [x] FE-INT test cho toggle/merge/move-to-cart cả 2 nhánh (có/không\nVariant).\n\n## Notes\n\n- `useWishlist`/`useIsWishlisted` follow the same store+hook shape as\n`useCart`/`useAuth` (raw zustand store + plain function wrappers), guest\nstate in `localStorage`, account merge mocked via MSW + `sessionStorage`\nfixtures (mirrors `cart-fixtures.ts`).\n- `useIsWishlisted` is a separate, lightweight selector (no react-query\nresolve) so each `ProductCard` on a grid doesn''t trigger its own network\nresolve — only the full Wishlist page uses the heavier `useWishlist()`.\n- New route `/wishlist` + Header icon/badge, wired into the same\npost-login effect as cart merge.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `pnpm --filter storefront typecheck` / `pnpm --filter @repo/api-sdk\ntypecheck` — clean\n- `pnpm --filter storefront test` — 218/218 passed (23 new)\n- `pnpm --filter @repo/api-sdk test` — 65/65 passed\n- `pnpm --filter storefront lint` / `format:check` — clean\n- `pnpm --filter storefront build` — succeeds, `/vi/wishlist`\n`/en/wishlist` generated","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdsMzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAUpwQAB4tHyvUE8AlKV6SAMzYTi8O\nG/Tgmxh1koxwH0h01bWhfAVcsaQdyaCmLgDzgMMTzQ14H8zW6WxbXyVMMkAPpFqY\nQtBF7hlG646hs0LT2nEmTq74CoHth5KcePhlYQhLWQtX0WVRgRNNMLGEbDvYPpzF\n1eZAwEELY/1WSfXSrtKkNrJSTw9iNGVJbpJv2f04LShrjTbwuJqrtdC5RJ5eoZzz\n6xuOupZ3+OV3LNqQiPCfH4hLv6OnXmmDYiwHkikBTOZpfQEQ0DGlrOD1PSOtcziS\nTEzPtaHqX38riw0LZZuE2vXY/JXcT3ejIpVV0A1g5Jh/85kuF/CiBbdBbQMYOpJ7\nh0BTbK5vUipI8RH08vt8MBHKHwxslMzFYsEzqdjU9ThUg18r6ygUPWB980qkotWK\nbS0tUHgrcEu2lvPPKF9TnKR0WBzFdQyJQFEnf1zCnTNQ4Vynbg1J2E7mNNiYrZrx\nhhQNOuii2gezIue3FMZqypRjOprPoMQv0dGmGg0rU8OpC/72guy3AgzD5vdhvRDp\neky7i+CQlq02z5+p9fxj6ANkq5m1+AKoY+H3GTfCwkDq7QRbv0uwWY1U8Ucxpm06\nostQbrbXZWsGmjAeuIURqI15OMpR/oHyl53+2VtoDJijauuIRLrsBig4SjakiqaQ\nsAIIVoiW/Smffpf/3KQF\n=U+DL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-08T05:48:44Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/9f0b22112703d539cef6093142e06c62fcbfb230","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKDlmMGIyMjExMjcwM2Q1MzljZWY2MDkzMTQyZTA2YzYyZmNiZmIyMzA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/0d58d9ecb490f49d06d2f53c2595aae4c09a8499","sha":"0d58d9ecb490f49d06d2f53c2595aae4c09a8499","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/0d58d9ecb490f49d06d2f53c2595aae4c09a8499"}],"sha":"9f0b22112703d539cef6093142e06c62fcbfb230","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/9f0b22112703d539cef6093142e06c62fcbfb230"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/0d58d9ecb490f49d06d2f53c2595aae4c09a8499/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T02:41:49Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T02:41:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(storefront,api-sdk): storefront cart guest+merge+rollback (#13)\n\n## Summary\n\n- `CartItem` changed to `{skuId, quantity}` per glossary.md — drops the\nold denormalized shape\n(`variantId`/`productId`/`name`/`image`/`price`/`variantName`) entirely.\n- Price/stock are never cached client-side: `useCart()` resolves every\nline against the live SKU through a new `GET /api/catalog/skus` mock\nendpoint on every render.\n- Adding a SKU already at its cart+stock limit is refused outright\n(rollback); a partial add clamps to the remaining room and reports it.\n- Added `POST /api/cart/merge` (Bearer-gated) for merge-after-login\n(Decision #36): sums quantity per colliding SKU with the account''s\nstored cart, clamps to current stock. Seeded the demo account with an\nexisting cart so the merge test proves summing, not a trivial merge into\nempty.\n- Merge is triggered from `Header.tsx` watching `authStatus` transition\nto `authenticated`, not from the login/register actions directly — those\nlive in the `(auth)` route group, which `boundaries/dependencies`\n(Decision #83) forbids from importing `(shop)`''s private `_lib`\n(confirmed via a real lint error).\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm test` (turbo, all packages) -\ngreen\n- `pnpm build` (turbo, all 3 apps) - green\n- Playwright e2e (chromium): `cart.spec.ts` (2: guest CRUD,\nmerge-after-login summing) + existing specs (15) - all passing\n- New tests: cart endpoint integration tests through the real MSW\nhandler; `useCart` FE-INT tests (add/update/delete + rollback +\npartial-clamp, localStorage persistence)\n\nNote: given a context budget constraint this session, this PR skipped\nthe usual two-axis (standards+spec) automated review pass done for\n#11/#12.\n\n## Related\n\nRefs #13\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant co-author attribution in this PR''s commit messages\nor description (see CONTRIBUTING.md).","tree":{"sha":"3b5ef8e8da3f83e83cc87b3e0d4a6629cbeb7958","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/3b5ef8e8da3f83e83cc87b3e0d4a6629cbeb7958"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/0d58d9ecb490f49d06d2f53c2595aae4c09a8499","verification":{"payload":"tree 3b5ef8e8da3f83e83cc87b3e0d4a6629cbeb7958\nparent b4180fd0f918987762d27cb522bf48739daf37fc\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1786156909 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786156909 +0700\n\nfeat(storefront,api-sdk): storefront cart guest+merge+rollback (#13)\n\n## Summary\n\n- `CartItem` changed to `{skuId, quantity}` per glossary.md — drops the\nold denormalized shape\n(`variantId`/`productId`/`name`/`image`/`price`/`variantName`) entirely.\n- Price/stock are never cached client-side: `useCart()` resolves every\nline against the live SKU through a new `GET /api/catalog/skus` mock\nendpoint on every render.\n- Adding a SKU already at its cart+stock limit is refused outright\n(rollback); a partial add clamps to the remaining room and reports it.\n- Added `POST /api/cart/merge` (Bearer-gated) for merge-after-login\n(Decision #36): sums quantity per colliding SKU with the account''s\nstored cart, clamps to current stock. Seeded the demo account with an\nexisting cart so the merge test proves summing, not a trivial merge into\nempty.\n- Merge is triggered from `Header.tsx` watching `authStatus` transition\nto `authenticated`, not from the login/register actions directly — those\nlive in the `(auth)` route group, which `boundaries/dependencies`\n(Decision #83) forbids from importing `(shop)`''s private `_lib`\n(confirmed via a real lint error).\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm test` (turbo, all packages) -\ngreen\n- `pnpm build` (turbo, all 3 apps) - green\n- Playwright e2e (chromium): `cart.spec.ts` (2: guest CRUD,\nmerge-after-login summing) + existing specs (15) - all passing\n- New tests: cart endpoint integration tests through the real MSW\nhandler; `useCart` FE-INT tests (add/update/delete + rollback +\npartial-clamp, localStorage persistence)\n\nNote: given a context budget constraint this session, this PR skipped\nthe usual two-axis (standards+spec) automated review pass done for\n#11/#12.\n\n## Related\n\nRefs #13\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant co-author attribution in this PR''s commit messages\nor description (see CONTRIBUTING.md).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdpdtCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9PcQAEScGMcjFlf023kVhKUOMRdW\nuy30LqxzQVJEHOTFnCQaUnMgp7roHPOcTaQLd5gsoBsw5ZqUoPGWDQvNwst6KiEt\n5GCoVHC67fkP1dPgEKh3Zv32ueRPPWoBNpNyn9dScU0C3jw1onG79hJbQRp3jpBY\ngVSj8OtpHBXNt3C4gN2RrPKVG/NKai++RTjaNCdwjE8dtXLqtce23fn+K0FM/Q2J\nitw/exWCSk55IH/a2nTp4rtflJmLWAT/Zl+XBMVT8bZdAKyeeBTrVYsTwoy14LKU\nexmzyMdcVD/8iABXt/xC1H/qW37vNp56Ibg1b6gv0U7VxbbZ8Jnkf4wfHc/nLzP1\nOGNIveU9gKCB03kxxNxuNz827QWnkJvRHnOXDuZZcAx1Rx2Fnc9H0JE1kY+J+QwS\nhtC8qFTqg9ES7sAbAeAUaP+IPSKTz+73lTYsLbQfE1s7PNikcIScXgFG2yvlAPyx\nsIkNXVyfuGBe8TBMXy4nCi1xyrq5jSXES4fcAxip5Kiwwi3KvJkpHdygEfQJRwMj\noQcqfTRqbqIHenRn00j+pa3frSz6oEk7ia6AimgapJFO1cF5MN8I