s://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/b4180fd0f918987762d27cb522bf48739daf37fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-08T02:06:28Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-08T02:06:28Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(storefront,api-sdk): storefront auth register/login/forgot-reset (#12)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Built the `/api/auth/*` MSW mock from scratch\n(register/login/refresh/logout/password-reset+confirm/me) — previously\nno auth mock handler existed at all, so every real login/register call\n404''d.\n- Refresh-token rotation + reuse detection per ADR-0010, with mock TTLs\nscaled down (5s/20s/40s) while keeping Decision #66''s relative ordering\n(10min/7d/30d) — the issue''s acceptance criteria explicitly allows this.\n- Refresh token stays in-memory alongside the access token instead of an\nhttpOnly cookie: a spike (since removed) proved MSW''s browser Service\nWorker can''t forward `Set-Cookie`/`Cookie` in either direction. Still\nnever touches `localStorage`/`sessionStorage`.\n- Fixed logout to actually call the revoke endpoint (it only cleared\nclient state before) and a pre-existing bug where it redirected to a\nlocale-less `/login`. Fixed a single-flight gap in the fetcher''s\n401→refresh handling that let concurrent requests false-trigger reuse\ndetection and force-log-out a legitimate user.\n- Added a minimal login/logout entry point to the storefront Header —\nthere was previously no way for a customer to log out from the\nstorefront UI at all.\n- Deliberately left out-of-scope, pre-existing gaps undisturbed and\ndocumented instead (middleware''s non-functional cookie route-guard, two\nincompatible `ApiError` classes, stale `packages/schemas/src/auth`,\nunused `PasswordInput`) — see decision-log.md Decision #90.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm test` (turbo, all packages) -\ngreen\n- `pnpm build` (turbo, all 3 apps) - green\n- Playwright e2e (chromium): `auth.spec.ts` (register → login → forgot →\nreset → re-login) + existing\n`catalog.spec.ts`/`pdp.spec.ts`/`home.spec.ts` (10) - all passing\n- New unit/integration tests: `auth-fixtures.test.ts`\n(rotation/reuse/expiry/reset-token), `auth.test.ts` (endpoints, through\nthe real MSW handler — including a single-flight-refresh regression test\nverified to fail without the fix),\n`useAuth.test.ts`/`auth-store.test.ts` updates\n\n## Related\n\nRefs #12\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant co-author attribution in this PR''s commit messages\nor description (see CONTRIBUTING.md).","tree":{"sha":"5dd828ae43adc8b927973c290c2f3d2e490e7ab8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/5dd828ae43adc8b927973c290c2f3d2e490e7ab8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/b4180fd0f918987762d27cb522bf48739daf37fc","verification":{"payload":"tree 5dd828ae43adc8b927973c290c2f3d2e490e7ab8\nparent bbf325fcc0e1cdcb44e9a54ee23215ae4b09ee92\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1786154788 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786154788 +0700\n\nfeat(storefront,api-sdk): storefront auth register/login/forgot-reset (#12)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Built the `/api/auth/*` MSW mock from scratch\n(register/login/refresh/logout/password-reset+confirm/me) — previously\nno auth mock handler existed at all, so every real login/register call\n404''d.\n- Refresh-token rotation + reuse detection per ADR-0010, with mock TTLs\nscaled down (5s/20s/40s) while keeping Decision #66''s relative ordering\n(10min/7d/30d) — the issue''s acceptance criteria explicitly allows this.\n- Refresh token stays in-memory alongside the access token instead of an\nhttpOnly cookie: a spike (since removed) proved MSW''s browser Service\nWorker can''t forward `Set-Cookie`/`Cookie` in either direction. Still\nnever touches `localStorage`/`sessionStorage`.\n- Fixed logout to actually call the revoke endpoint (it only cleared\nclient state before) and a pre-existing bug where it redirected to a\nlocale-less `/login`. Fixed a single-flight gap in the fetcher''s\n401→refresh handling that let concurrent requests false-trigger reuse\ndetection and force-log-out a legitimate user.\n- Added a minimal login/logout entry point to the storefront Header —\nthere was previously no way for a customer to log out from the\nstorefront UI at all.\n- Deliberately left out-of-scope, pre-existing gaps undisturbed and\ndocumented instead (middleware''s non-functional cookie route-guard, two\nincompatible `ApiError` classes, stale `packages/schemas/src/auth`,\nunused `PasswordInput`) — see decision-log.md Decision #90.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm test` (turbo, all packages) -\ngreen\n- `pnpm build` (turbo, all 3 apps) - green\n- Playwright e2e (chromium): `auth.spec.ts` (register → login → forgot →\nreset → re-login) + existing\n`catalog.spec.ts`/`pdp.spec.ts`/`home.spec.ts` (10) - all passing\n- New unit/integration tests: `auth-fixtures.test.ts`\n(rotation/reuse/expiry/reset-token), `auth.test.ts` (endpoints, through\nthe real MSW handler — including a single-flight-refresh regression test\nverified to fail without the fix),\n`useAuth.test.ts`/`auth-store.test.ts` updates\n\n## Related\n\nRefs #12\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant co-author attribution in this PR''s commit messages\nor description (see CONTRIBUTING.md).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdo8kCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAsWgQAE6FozXqc/ZzJgmuKIIwVhs+\nPo9VPc0/jXhHvVEFW/MwGeWNPKb15qOJbHoc4MePU1KdTffUi5QI6tJN4KzC1ZTt\nDYMA8k3oLjQ7dLatQ8+6DFjnm1mfhSTyDLlIZuFmkVJeTdDCSmLpQROuKr4ebeXw\ntHEDnOx4wDksNqOSzz5iX2P2V+tKQ9eCQujF1gBxB7GO/ROViRQjtDcqp6vkMqsH\n3MjioJKvDP7owVfHC2pDXNRMil46/p4ksOXx5IxQyOUNjYp15NA28UZtgtD539FN\noDSl9J9flvPi+WlaJr/nk4eehgS7kuInEJVxLxi7k/6Xrsh3fqgxH6IxaoSEjQ+O\nt+7Hj8GZnMt4BHCIbvbdyH0/SN1T3LMXWYTgas2Wh3AEcgblgrVk3aEnJ823dvDw\nkKL8P5CeDJ43tV2owuNN2xqfNB1LW3YsNeVpeHfKN1skAwpTCiuiASgbGeP57OwH\nAnvI9VhACSqwbpIIvSackfoP7Dzp3IjJPcB1NdjSC16Qvm6Vh6xqU3OF+hJBYncu\nKznyFgLPugUT6fLY55Le8oOmlIySvMKKOOPOcqXx3r3A/GZp8F7z6Sx7pf1ExuLa\nzczvjIrWrlPsVKAZKqeGeYMtu5RSvXZKr5uHM56KTouEb0SSj35Mwm3PhQm85nzH\n7GqCBBjYlco22gnGRILf\n=3ccF\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-08T02:06:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/b4180fd0f918987762d27cb522bf48739daf37fc","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKGI0MTgwZmQwZjkxODk4Nzc2MmQyN2NiNTIyYmY0ODczOWRhZjM3ZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/bbf325fcc0e1cdcb44e9a54ee23215ae4b09ee92","sha":"bbf325fcc0e1cdcb44e9a54ee23215ae4b09ee92","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/bbf325fcc0e1cdcb44e9a54ee23215ae4b09ee92"}],"sha":"b4180fd0f918987762d27cb522bf48739daf37fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/b4180fd0f918987762d27cb522bf48739daf37fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/bbf325fcc0e1cdcb44e9a54ee23215ae4b09ee92/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T16:30:30Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T16:30:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(storefront,api-sdk): storefront search co ban (#11) (#46)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Storefront search (SF-04) now reads from the canonical catalog\npipeline PLP uses (`useProductSearch` → `packages/api-sdk`\n`getProducts({ search })`) instead of a parallel legacy pipeline, with\nits own `q`/`page` URL-state kept fully separate from the PLP/Category\nfilter''s `catalogUrlState.ts`.\n- MSW catalog handler simulates accent-insensitive +\nslight-misspelling-tolerant matching against name+description\n(`packages/api-sdk/src/mocks/search-match.ts`, NFD diacritic-stripping +\nper-token Levenshtein fallback) — mock-only stand-in for the real\nPostgreSQL FTS/`unaccent`/`pg_trgm` (Decision #75 stays Backend-only,\nBE-INT-008).\n- Removed the legacy chain this change fully orphaned\n(`useLegacyProductSearch.ts`, `ProductGrid.tsx`,\n`_lib/data/products.ts`, `_lib/types/product.ts`) after confirming zero\nremaining importers, and fixed a whitespace-only `?q=` query rendering\nan error state instead of the empty-query prompt.\n- Documented the approach as Decision #89 in `decision-log.md`.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm test` (turbo, all packages) -\ngreen\n- `pnpm build` (turbo, all 3 apps) - green\n- Playwright e2e (chromium): `search.spec.ts` (4: results,\naccent-insensitive match, empty state, filter-state independence) +\nexisting `catalog.spec.ts`/`pdp.spec.ts`/`home.spec.ts` (10) - all\npassing\n- New unit/integration tests: `search-match.test.ts` (accent/fuzzy\nmatching), `catalog.test.ts` (search through the real MSW handler),\n`SearchClient.test.tsx` (FE-INT: results/accent-insensitive/empty/error\nstate)\n\n## Related\n\nRefs #11\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant co-author attribution in this PR''s commit messages\nor description (see CONTRIBUTING.md).","tree":{"sha":"e309919cec073c2eb7e76bf616e6460a2a7b5d3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/e309919cec073c2eb7e76bf616e6460a2a7b5d3f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/bbf325fcc0e1cdcb44e9a54ee23215ae4b09ee92","verification":{"payload":"tree e309919cec073c2eb7e76bf616e6460a2a7b5d3f\nparent b326d7658cbc73fc888f8c78876b40938207b815\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1786120230 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1786120230 +0700\n\nfeat(storefront,api-sdk): storefront search co ban (#11) (#46)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Storefront search (SF-04) now reads from the canonical catalog\npipeline PLP uses (`useProductSearch` → `packages/api-sdk`\n`getProducts({ search })`) instead of a parallel legacy pipeline, with\nits own `q`/`page` URL-state kept fully separate from the PLP/Category\nfilter''s `catalogUrlState.ts`.\n- MSW catalog handler simulates accent-insensitive +\nslight-misspelling-tolerant matching against name+description\n(`packages/api-sdk/src/mocks/search-match.ts`, NFD diacritic-stripping +\nper-token Levenshtein fallback) — mock-only stand-in for the real\nPostgreSQL FTS/`unaccent`/`pg_trgm` (Decision #75 stays Backend-only,\nBE-INT-008).\n- Removed the legacy chain this change fully orphaned\n(`useLegacyProductSearch.ts`, `ProductGrid.tsx`,\n`_lib/data/products.ts`, `_lib/types/product.ts`) after confirming zero\nremaining importers, and fixed a whitespace-only `?q=` query rendering\nan error state instead of the empty-query prompt.\n- Documented the approach as Decision #89 in `decision-log.md`.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm test` (turbo, all packages) -\ngreen\n- `pnpm build` (turbo, all 3 apps) - green\n- Playwright e2e (chromium): `search.spec.ts` (4: results,\naccent-insensitive match, empty state, filter-state independence) +\nexisting `catalog.spec.ts`/`pdp.spec.ts`/`home.spec.ts` (10) - all\npassing\n- New unit/integration tests: `search-match.test.ts` (accent/fuzzy\nmatching), `catalog.test.ts` (search through the real MSW handler),\n`SearchClient.test.tsx` (FE-INT: results/accent-insensitive/empty/error\nstate)\n\n## Related\n\nRefs #11\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant co-author attribution in this PR''s commit messages\nor description (see CONTRIBUTING.md).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqdggmCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgqcQAEj4V7CgcgVXRr15HMFnkJRQ\n9n867GZrcKp67NyZg37X9giDzBUJduXd092idT3iy86E6J2MdTrkFkvFvdS4iBe3\nJew44s12ZaDxN+TEYV/F1sqe4hZ7Rd1YEGVPXbox9I1fd/9OTmOwVoUnRgnfH0yu\noRHzrJSBufCSj+YPxy+ScgtWWCNvWJu7K1w17O2AhCfhq86kvIfZtNgWCc4lUtyn\noRgQ6wTcymC4YFSMv9Ssi/d0IFN0t5RR18Kz3LRWpcETE71tFsTaqWQvfbnlM9XP\nQFFXCuodjZoGrW5rDc7kGthR38LUaIkfNC25gv+2UC1cJlBLsafXy2HCxjcaVMFC\nteUiNPur1qHlirDcVr2PW1EPaoLliK88jmvRuhQUyvDaTyFouKQpHrXwwNh2IJHh\nEsds5HCfcL9iNfJLHZpI2A8ICRnnZ7O7zmSt53q/1JDzQrnpsfiNrYFCsF2FRRbs\n7Gv5T4y6XUZjMgU2EGVwWJWFBMgJzbVbAAP5/9t/8Ll2d3/O5tjTlR5xugAONkLK\ntQUFRcHpzqGNaGlmbAVSdZVK84CqrnPrul8Dfvob+fei1GHtUAz4opm8yv0w87d6\nZD38It9C/fIg8/U9SHTA7wivVEJ//+fbVlEsG60UwG3cPhBkCIOiQbvwx0qPP5x3\nxGc3GPOqWXMbw3WhuCdi\n=LePI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-07T16:30:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","recei