"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/b326d7658cbc73fc888f8c78876b40938207b815/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T19:46:23Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T19:46:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(storefront,api-sdk,schemas): storefront catalog browse + PDP variant-to-SKU/3D viewer (#9, #10) (#45)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Storefront catalog browse (PLP + Category + Gender filter) on a real\nMSW-backed pipeline: canonical Product/Category/Gender/SKU schema,\nDecision #50 mock catalog (24 products, 3x2 categories), URL-state\nfilter/sort/pagination, \"price from\" display.\n- PDP Variant-to-SKU resolution + 3D viewer: pure resolveSku logic for\n0/1/2 Variant axes, price/stock always read from the resolved SKU, a\nlazy-loaded three.js viewer synced to the selected Color,\nbundle-isolated from the PLP route.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm test` (turbo, all packages) -\ngreen\n- `pnpm build` (turbo, all 3 apps) - green\n- Playwright e2e (chromium): catalog.spec.ts (3), pdp.spec.ts (4),\nhome.spec.ts (3) - all passing\n- Verified 3D viewer/three.js absent from the PLP route''s build manifest\n(bundle isolation)\n- Manual smoke: gender/sort/pagination URL-state + reload, category tree\nnav, variant selection gating add-to-cart, out-of-stock combo disabling\nadd-to-cart, no-variant product skipping selection\n\n## Related\n\nRefs #9, Refs #10\n\nKnown gaps (documented in decision-log.md Decisions #84/#85/#87/#88,\ndeferred to later issues): PDP/header-nav/homepage still partially on\nlegacy catalog data for non-PLP/PDP surfaces; Category/PDP pages are\nclient-rendered (not SSR) due to a Next.js App Router + MSW\nfetch-caching incompatibility, trading away a true HTTP 404 for unknown\nslugs; Cart stays on its pre-existing shape until the real backend\ncontract exists.\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant attribution (see CONTRIBUTING.md) in this PR''s\ncommit messages or description.","tree":{"sha":"16200d50cb41f9fcb782335ce8015729e8a7a832","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/16200d50cb41f9fcb782335ce8015729e8a7a832"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/b326d7658cbc73fc888f8c78876b40938207b815","verification":{"payload":"tree 16200d50cb41f9fcb782335ce8015729e8a7a832\nparent 6210b793f9f35f0671851c82df4df02102fcacdb\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1785959183 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785959183 +0700\n\nfeat(storefront,api-sdk,schemas): storefront catalog browse + PDP variant-to-SKU/3D viewer (#9, #10) (#45)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Storefront catalog browse (PLP + Category + Gender filter) on a real\nMSW-backed pipeline: canonical Product/Category/Gender/SKU schema,\nDecision #50 mock catalog (24 products, 3x2 categories), URL-state\nfilter/sort/pagination, \"price from\" display.\n- PDP Variant-to-SKU resolution + 3D viewer: pure resolveSku logic for\n0/1/2 Variant axes, price/stock always read from the resolved SKU, a\nlazy-loaded three.js viewer synced to the selected Color,\nbundle-isolated from the PLP route.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `pnpm typecheck`, `pnpm lint`, `pnpm test` (turbo, all packages) -\ngreen\n- `pnpm build` (turbo, all 3 apps) - green\n- Playwright e2e (chromium): catalog.spec.ts (3), pdp.spec.ts (4),\nhome.spec.ts (3) - all passing\n- Verified 3D viewer/three.js absent from the PLP route''s build manifest\n(bundle isolation)\n- Manual smoke: gender/sort/pagination URL-state + reload, category tree\nnav, variant selection gating add-to-cart, out-of-stock combo disabling\nadd-to-cart, no-variant product skipping selection\n\n## Related\n\nRefs #9, Refs #10\n\nKnown gaps (documented in decision-log.md Decisions #84/#85/#87/#88,\ndeferred to later issues): PDP/header-nav/homepage still partially on\nlegacy catalog data for non-PLP/PDP surfaces; Category/PDP pages are\nclient-rendered (not SSR) due to a Next.js App Router + MSW\nfetch-caching incompatibility, trading away a true HTTP 404 for unknown\nslugs; Cart stays on its pre-existing shape until the real backend\ncontract exists.\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant attribution (see CONTRIBUTING.md) in this PR''s\ncommit messages or description.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqc5MPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQFkQAJtIguWoFcy+5dDFqE0XynJH\nKoVflxVv95X1uZBcki6RnoqueeQVJUel3NGSloQXuRdjYNIHeh+fLdJWzkSrd6T2\ncFktd3MdiM8bT4u3DhbhkhzxWccugl1XBfCOh7X3w0KVnIexQMEFgWeTPyBewQET\nOnVi+8i4aDFOPhJ/LRG8KaXFykaCxRPkDcek6CX2b96hHLMPEN7nHHY9+Dd2Qed6\nlXVBQwSBeUSZ+9DR6qV/MiKuthlIOdBMahwKpIH0rK8bK8dZMoAg9TnKY8tbqTeF\nLYuhv06/nw3HO2Wx8mykRKil+I7YPujVJGmNu10QsIBf59mwPETLeJglnQaVguse\nT0ls40bSrexi562GTpxx7OlCT1h7DWry5fxPfR1D2DN0t4v+U1lXhGFy4ROLbM0w\nEukLUuuWMKzJzpdIuGr4vB4LSkZ4AqpbQQQOn1Sg+n3AQ6K7pYqmSh6eJ6uYKYz/\nItFHD0xH+ju3YV2Srky6VMgxia0yXRSz9Cc9qbYbVU8ofOYFHsJGJIBFyVsqJQFZ\n7Vb5B1JYNsYo4YHLdtMeKE+S0byeLKE9wZ9qr1n5UuoMawKoDJLw/pJnLr+VpLel\nuFlD94oaEngLwhkjwz5YjK3gfSwp3qBHTWLdkffCYYAqhW942W7ZeXQFpdjGgSnm\nLSz3M2wcut451wuPmoNp\n=/sHW\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-05T19:46:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","recei