comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-05T09:43:14Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-05T09:43:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs: add project onboarding README (#44)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Adds a project onboarding README plus the storefront''s UI design\ncontract and improvement plan (`design.md`,\n`docs/FE/FE-UI-DESIGN-CONTRACT.md`, `docs/FE/FE-UI-IMPROVEMENT-PLAN.md`)\nso future UI work reads from one source of truth.\n- Polishes the storefront home page (hero, featured categories, new\narrivals, why-choose-us, trust badges, footer) and adds a Nike-style\n`ProductCarousel` (native scroll-snap, no new dependency) to Best\nSellers.\n- Adds a shared `AppShell` + nav-items (lucide-react icons) for\n`admin`/`cms`, wired into their protected layouts.\n- Fixes `/orders` build hanging during static generation — the route is\nper-user and needs live session data, so it''s now marked dynamic instead\nof being statically prerendered.\n- Installs the `hallmark` design skill for future design work.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm typecheck` — clean across all 11 workspace packages\n- [x] `pnpm lint` — clean across admin/cms/storefront\n- [x] `pnpm test` — 26 test files / 173 tests passing (storefront)\n- [x] `pnpm build` — all 3 apps build; confirms `/orders` no longer\nhangs during static generation (requires `apps/storefront/.env.local`\nper `.env.example`)\n- [x] `pnpm test:e2e` — Playwright home page smoke spec (3 tests)\npassing on chromium; firefox/webkit not run in this environment (browser\nbinaries not installed)\n\n## Related\n\nRefs #7 (admin/cms shared app shell)\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant attribution (e.g. `Co-Authored-By: Claude ...`) in\nthis PR''s commit messages or description.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Thanh Luong <thanh.luongcong@smartdev.com>","tree":{"sha":"a32196a8844cbc4d614aa48ed4f472c6e55196c5","url":"https: