-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/48d6cd51d8c9fe6080c44ed16449b1b5b5383435","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKDQ4ZDZjZDUxZDhjOWZlNjA4MGM0NGVkMTY0NDliMWI1YjUzODM0MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/c234a58af9de7a2e476ac703b8029929e3ba38cf","sha":"c234a58af9de7a2e476ac703b8029929e3ba38cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/c234a58af9de7a2e476ac703b8029929e3ba38cf"}],"sha":"48d6cd51d8c9fe6080c44ed16449b1b5b5383435","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/48d6cd51d8c9fe6080c44ed16449b1b5b5383435"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/c234a58af9de7a2e476ac703b8029929e3ba38cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T04:25:12Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T04:25:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(admin,cms,storefront): FE app shells boot (#43)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Scaffolds `apps/admin` and `apps/cms` from scratch:\n`app/(protected)/layout.tsx` (khung only, RBAC is a separate slice —\nissues #18/#24), the `QueryClientProvider` baseline from FE-EXECUTION.md\n§2.9, and a first real feature (`ProductsSummary`) proving each app can\nrender a `@repo/ui` primitive, use a `@repo/schemas` type, and call a\nmock endpoint through `@repo/api-sdk`.\n- Wires `apps/storefront` (which already boots — locale\nrouting/providers predate this monorepo per Decision #80/#81) to the\nsame three packages via a new isolated route,\n`/[locale]/foundation-check` — not linked from any nav, with its own\nlocal MSW-boot gate, so it can''t touch the app''s real shipped UI or\nexisting tests.\n- `instrumentation.ts` boots the MSW server adapter in all 3 apps (no-op\nunless `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_MOCKING` is set), matching the client-side gate\nalready in each app''s providers.\n- Ran `/review` (standards + spec axes) and fixed the two confirmed\nstandards gaps: `../` parent imports in admin/cms''s test files (should\nbe `@/` alias, Decision #57) and a `mockingReady` boolean missing its\n`is` prefix (Decision #55).\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm typecheck` — clean across all 10 workspace packages\n- [x] `pnpm lint` — clean across admin/cms/storefront (only these 3 +\nstorefront have lint scripts wired so far)\n- [x] `pnpm test` — 178 storefront + 1 admin + 1 cms tests passing,\nincluding an MSW-backed render test per app proving the\nui+schemas+api-sdk wiring\n- [x] `pnpm build` — all 3 apps compile; `/vi/foundation-check` and\n`/en/foundation-check` render as static routes in storefront''s build\noutput\n- [x] Ran `/review` (standards + spec axes) and fixed the confirmed\nfindings\n\n## Related\n\nRefs #7\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant attribution (e.g. `Co-Authored-By: Claude ...`) in\nthis PR''s commit messages or description.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Thanh Luong <thanh.luongcong@smartdev.com>","tree":{"sha":"64efa9f0893a2173015a0dceaf8810536fd038a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/64efa9f0893a2173015a0dceaf8810536fd038a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/c234a58af9de7a2e476ac703b8029929e3ba38cf","verification":{"payload":"tree 64efa9f0893a2173015a0dceaf8810536fd038a8\nparent 50e26d9ff59a8fd4ed9318765e26993cfa968942\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1785817512 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785817512 +0700\n\nfeat(admin,cms,storefront): FE app shells boot (#43)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Scaffolds `apps/admin` and `apps/cms` from scratch:\n`app/(protected)/layout.tsx` (khung only, RBAC is a separate slice —\nissues #18/#24), the `QueryClientProvider` baseline from FE-EXECUTION.md\n§2.9, and a first real feature (`ProductsSummary`) proving each app can\nrender a `@repo/ui` primitive, use a `@repo/schemas` type, and call a\nmock endpoint through `@repo/api-sdk`.\n- Wires `apps/storefront` (which already boots — locale\nrouting/providers predate this monorepo per Decision #80/#81) to the\nsame three packages via a new isolated route,\n`/[locale]/foundation-check` — not linked from any nav, with its own\nlocal MSW-boot gate, so it can''t touch the app''s real shipped UI or\nexisting tests.\n- `instrumentation.ts` boots the MSW server adapter in all 3 apps (no-op\nunless `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_MOCKING` is set), matching the client-side gate\nalready in each app''s providers.\n- Ran `/review` (standards + spec axes) and fixed the two confirmed\nstandards gaps: `../` parent imports in admin/cms''s test files (should\nbe `@/` alias, Decision #57) and a `mockingReady` boolean missing its\n`is` prefix (Decision #55).\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm typecheck` — clean across all 10 workspace packages\n- [x] `pnpm lint` — clean across admin/cms/storefront (only these 3 +\nstorefront have lint scripts wired so far)\n- [x] `pnpm test` — 178 storefront + 1 admin + 1 cms tests passing,\nincluding an MSW-backed render test per app proving the\nui+schemas+api-sdk wiring\n- [x] `pnpm build` — all 3 apps compile; `/vi/foundation-check` and\n`/en/foundation-check` render as static routes in storefront''s build\noutput\n- [x] Ran `/review` (standards + spec axes) and fixed the confirmed\nfindings\n\n## Related\n\nRefs #7\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant attribution (e.g. `Co-Authored-By: Claude ...`) in\nthis PR''s commit messages or description.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Thanh Luong <thanh.luongcong@smartdev.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcWmoCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA264QAAzjGIc/FZTvXc1r2hxJdURF\n3xIc82X5rYv6UiuHqVgisuzXWSp8wHV6wnjcf0JlKZXzNsT1HYOlUblUa5zDwinr\nzWZZKq76pePcO7bDuXBANikAHyJrUTg1+qQ8R/lB+ehPe59ZmnTt4OcL1SjGmAYp\nIs+MlwICluywdFb8BHZGgxa/o3Zc1NGNVsw8OmLjzvDgznEKy5PD6SM35UainQ2M\nk4SuBg+uXSBGlD58NdBzVDB2JXxRKj9KPmHudXYOMy4v5W53ZID1g+z0aJfqkx1j\nc7Fsm4XLvenSeouO0d2PJQiY031A5wWIU+r1bPySHuINzY36gB5yKHh78Q0BPAe/\nk2ZEchODYoE9ZhNmaGaxirVmq6QkyKxJomvZ2oDBGIDLLsGWUCUfPLx5Wcop51mn\nwtWYzXUs1atre2Wj/Vno9I6p11o+Lb/LAPWXdXFZdn2P2fjIl9r3iUbH0xkXrgA3\nYL+TqHtgh5Vt3LTt1rtu8lfRAXBwM+08QPjqZd0s9zU/UsUtpNw88XMx5GpIY8fh\nMi8LLI0mh3Rf5EpM9r4RKPP6nNPpHFLGEzR5HLhk8C/WEKiz8FJQ+6Yh1ex3U1tU\nPRQwFDvSUepqK6+TYuUWnmk6fOBX6GSPz6GSpCOWCToT+hUMe4vDZUQ2cWASxr2I\nskXkFDQZxvzB0YGVxdms\n=NuX6\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-04T05:01:13Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/c234a58af9de7a2e476ac703b8029929e3ba38cf","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKGMyMzRhNThhZjlkZTdhMmU0NzZhYzcwM2I4MDI5OTI5ZTNiYTM4Y2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/50e26d9ff59a8fd4ed9318765e26993cfa968942","sha":"50e26d9ff59a8fd4ed9318765e26993cfa968942","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/50e26d9ff59a8fd4ed9318765e26993cfa968942"}],"sha":"c234a58af9de7a2e476ac703b8029929e3ba38cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/c234a58af9de7a2e476ac703b8029929e3ba38cf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/50e26d9ff59a8fd4ed9318765e26993cfa968942/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:36:30Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T14:36:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(api-sdk): FE contract & API foundation (schemas + api-sdk + MSW) (#42)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Adds `packages/schemas`: request/response/error schema skeletons for\nall 10 domains (common, errors, auth, catalog, cart, wishlist, account,\ncheckout, admin, cms), each exported via a `package.json` subpath, no\n`index.ts` barrel. Every domain re-exports the shared\n`ErrorEnvelopeSchema` under a domain-scoped name so it''s reusable both\nstandalone and cross-package.\n- Adds `packages/api-sdk`: `client/fetcher.ts` (credentials:\"include\",\nthrows a typed `ApiError` parsed against the shared error envelope),\n`env/config.ts` (`IS_API_MOCKING`/`API_BASE_URL`),\n`endpoints/catalog.ts` (first typed endpoint, `getProducts`),\n`mocks/handlers.ts` (MSW handlers), and\n`adapters/browser.ts`/`adapters/server.ts` (the mock/real switch, gated\non `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_MOCKING`) which dynamically import\n`testing/msw-browser`/`testing/msw-server` so `msw/browser`/`msw/node`\nnever land in a production bundle that only imports\n`client`/`endpoints`.\n- Ran `/review` (standards + spec axes) and fixed the one confirmed gap\nit surfaced: each domain in `packages/schemas` initially only had\nrequest/response schemas, not the \"request/response/error\" trio issue #6\nasked for — fixed by re-exporting the shared error envelope per domain.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm typecheck` — clean across all 8 workspace packages\n- [x] `pnpm lint` — clean (only `storefront` has a lint script wired so\nfar; no other package has eslint wired yet, matching existing precedent\nfor `packages/ui`/`packages/design-tokens`)\n- [x] `pnpm test` — 177 storefront + 12 `@repo/schemas` + 9\n`@repo/api-sdk` tests passing, including an MSW-node-server round trip\nthrough `getProducts()` and an env-gated mock/real switch test\n- [x] Ran `/review` (standards + spec axes) and fixed the confirmed\nfinding\n\n## Related\n\nRefs #6\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant attribution (e.g. `Co-Authored-By: Claude ...`) in\nthis PR''s commit messages or description.","tree":{"sha":"10c82b05c0c8be1b504acc799813615fc9af2ec6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/10c82b05c0c8be1b504acc799813615fc9af2ec6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/50e26d9ff59a8fd4ed9318765e26993cfa968942","verification":{"payload":"tree 10c82b05c0c8be1b504acc799813615fc9af2ec6\nparent 191ec40b29da8b0ceb199b856a39394649f98c29\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1785767790 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785767790 +0700\n\nfeat(api-sdk): FE contract & API foundation (schemas + api-sdk + MSW) (#42)\n\n## Summary\n\n- Adds `packages/schemas`: request/response/error schema skeletons for\nall 10 domains (common, errors, auth, catalog, cart, wishlist, account,\ncheckout, admin, cms), each exported via a `package.json` subpath, no\n`index.ts` barrel. Every domain re-exports the shared\n`ErrorEnvelopeSchema` under a domain-scoped name so it''s reusable both\nstandalone and cross-package.\n- Adds `packages/api-sdk`: `client/fetcher.ts` (credentials:\"include\",\nthrows a typed `ApiError` parsed against the shared error envelope),\n`env/config.ts` (`IS_API_MOCKING`/`API_BASE_URL`),\n`endpoints/catalog.ts` (first typed endpoint, `getProducts`),\n`mocks/handlers.ts` (MSW handlers), and\n`adapters/browser.ts`/`adapters/server.ts` (the mock/real switch, gated\non `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_MOCKING`) which dynamically import\n`testing/msw-browser`/`testing/msw-server` so `msw/browser`/`msw/node`\nnever land in a production bundle that only imports\n`client`/`endpoints`.\n- Ran `/review` (standards + spec axes) and fixed the one confirmed gap\nit surfaced: each domain in `packages/schemas` initially only had\nrequest/response schemas, not the \"request/response/error\" trio issue #6\nasked for — fixed by re-exporting the shared error envelope per domain.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm typecheck` — clean across all 8 workspace packages\n- [x] `pnpm lint` — clean (only `storefront` has a lint script wired so\nfar; no other package has eslint wired yet, matching existing precedent\nfor `packages/ui`/`packages/design-tokens`)\n- [x] `pnpm test` — 177 storefront + 12 `@repo/schemas` + 9\n`@repo/api-sdk` tests passing, including an MSW-node-server round trip\nthrough `getProducts()` and an env-gated mock/real switch test\n- [x] Ran `/review` (standards + spec axes) and fixed the confirmed\nfinding\n\n## Related\n\nRefs #6\n\n---\n\n- [x] No AI/assistant attribution (e.g. `Co-Authored-By: Claude ...`) in\nthis PR''s commit messages or description.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqcKduCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAEqUQAHsoyY1KTm+HgSMClWar4WBC\naE0dI5CRTvMDDqa3QV7VLUyhdiwVIbEn1lDsfawYXlef0EDvJRgVFbiDZcRXJLEM\nBtkNmyAOI5XwC0JUnyb0z4xJ/5Oq8t2fUDQaJtNkiPGHPU0dceTFYRqOqLZXLgdk\nvGylyS48KnFeEnbKH1qoqjBW7ECHEFire3vBFaMUrVW2fOvXkl1PLMAJY2PzxBzQ\nv05Q13+xg0NbbOfs8zCKj7pyE04+FCW7TInA8SZH9gWR2O2+ApJD4T7yaubyO0nP\n7g99VwJDyA0Q0Vue8O4Plta2tCYEJidfvx93EYECP3iOkRO6eYfAeDEKtwawEPl7\nc/sot3eGKnLeNsHs6wMJ2YYyB7rijQLC+YUiy4sitFeBDxNi3HO3Bd3n3wLm6X+T\nj1CCcmZPXjs20QKvjive1icheqkLr9eZLqAkGQKrMCsB7S3giVCyWsoiSSnZbRip\nsNDp3ZSFNgdAiaWeRtKrOdW9TnrBig7azBtJ7T6HGWrLiX71dvW4LySe/k5Uo