 publishable packages, not an app; enabling it surfaced a\nreal `TS2742` portability error, fixed by this override.\n- `eslint.config.mjs` intentionally left standalone — merging with\n`@repo/eslint-config/next.js` would double-register the\n`@typescript-eslint` plugin (storefront via\n`@typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin` directly, shared config via the\n`typescript-eslint` meta-package), risking the same \"Cannot redefine\nplugin\" crash already hit once with `eslint-plugin-import`. Storefront''s\nexisting rules already meet/exceed the shared baseline.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm --filter storefront typecheck`\n- [x] `pnpm --filter storefront build`\n- [x] `pnpm --filter storefront lint`\n- [x] `pnpm --filter storefront test` — 177 tests pass","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqb311CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAd70QAJ1GCi2cVskWDYqS1ECv9NYJ\nkR5kjWe2HSbQ7/lcLQ30URPdSJBBH02beGS6ZmJC2ZY6phdn2C8OykF4ucexGmY+\n87+QFA3dDCu8+f/z1izZ6XIkKH9KCLXpidL/vB0bEJSY+h0TugrGKtY8knzPZK37\nkh7ebZ8hF3hk2ZHw/zt4oSfLoASC94NrNQpGGUpcyQ5anpWHYQPpOo8YoJmguh51\nw3td+N5N6wPiNBS4xAxhxRne8B5vYCCVMSGjvCsLCrlKhrj1KCEBD8ZA1TIYtAMK\nAwrAdngX8XYW7JDmyPSh1xxLS8Qvu1MW9hqmXwLwsAPAIlxMVGT91rsqn5BqS4OW\n4cbT3rAGwqhYkxHXZSCPrCf1GNddues/cPRX/20B2Zj3T3eZi73zCz8Fn9ydNNlK\nHJFZaDb0lLolohlRqtmJXfG8z8c9Nzh6+/s8qw7D2CCB6jRzRZ3sKqAaPcPifSBK\nW0b973SOO7lOu510gEb7CQdFEroXTBHU4NPkepFIHncrIyfMM3E1AcCALaIt8zHQ\nmwoztK2beBtvqLGleaHwCwPzoKc0lgnoAa4CWqBWBAEA/SfiyMIC9LHa0dRdJiq6\nLJ27YmaVH4HDmXevL4G5Nbj6wIlewayOXNDhkY8vGyLVlEMQHL5gmWv9e1s92CpC\nNYlwHUQHSNqXSDIwTHkp\n=EzOh\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-02T17:25:09Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/we