m/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/fc3442aab403e4ef4244b2e520b2cef6fbfb35eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-02T10:46:56Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-02T10:46:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(design-system): design tokens, tailwind preset, ui primitives (#39)\n\n## Summary\n\n- `packages/design-tokens`:\ncolors/semantic/spacing/typography/radius/shadow/motion/breakpoints/z-index,\nsubpath exports only.\n- `packages/tailwind-config`: single shared `preset.css` (`@theme` +\nbase layer + locked container-width utility per FE-ARCHITECTURE.md\n§16.4.3).\n- `packages/ui`: Button/Input/Label/Modal/Tabs/Tooltip (cva + Radix +\nlucide-react) + Container/Section/Stack/Grid layout primitives.\n- Migrated `apps/storefront` off its own inline `@theme` — `globals.css`\nnow just imports the shared preset. Switched body font Inter -> Be\nVietnam Pro (single-family rule, §16.3). Container max-widths now match\nthe locked baseline.\n- Kept `sm`/`2xl` Tailwind breakpoints at defaults (640/1536) instead of\nthe docs'' original 480/1440 — would have shifted layout on 32 existing\n`sm:` usages across 23 files. Updated `decision-log.md` #82 and\n`FE-ARCHITECTURE.md` §16.2.1 to match reality instead.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm install` — 7 workspace packages resolved\n- [x] `pnpm build` — storefront builds clean with the new shared preset\n- [x] `pnpm lint` — 0 errors\n- [x] `pnpm typecheck` — clean across all 4 new/touched packages\n- [x] `pnpm test` — 177 tests pass\n\nRefs #5","tree":{"sha":"26ef30c087d074504f31330f13b504a2413b3ecf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/26ef30c087d074504f31330f13b504a2413b3ecf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/fc3442aab403e4ef4244b2e520b2cef6fbfb35eb","verification":{"payload":"tree 26ef30c087d074504f31330f13b504a2413b3ecf\nparent d61f04d95a5395b3d1f9e60e8c3792687da85a79\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1785667616 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785667616 +0700\n\nfeat(design-system): design tokens, tailwind preset, ui primitives (#39)\n\n## Summary\n\n- `packages/design-tokens`:\ncolors/semantic/spacing/typography/radius/shadow/motion/breakpoints/z-index,\nsubpath exports only.\n- `packages/tailwind-config`: single shared `preset.css` (`@theme` +\nbase layer + locked container-width utility per FE-ARCHITECTURE.md\n§16.4.3).\n- `packages/ui`: Button/Input/Label/Modal/Tabs/Tooltip (cva + Radix +\nlucide-react) + Container/Section/Stack/Grid layout primitives.\n- Migrated `apps/storefront` off its own inline `@theme` — `globals.css`\nnow just imports the shared preset. Switched body font Inter -> Be\nVietnam Pro (single-family rule, §16.3). Container max-widths now match\nthe locked baseline.\n- Kept `sm`/`2xl` Tailwind breakpoints at defaults (640/1536) instead of\nthe docs'' original 480/1440 — would have shifted layout on 32 existing\n`sm:` usages across 23 files. Updated `decision-log.md` #82 and\n`FE-ARCHITECTURE.md` §16.2.1 to match reality instead.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm install` — 7 workspace packages resolved\n- [x] `pnpm build` — storefront builds clean with the new shared preset\n- [x] `pnpm lint` — 0 errors\n- [x] `pnpm typecheck` — clean across all 4 new/touched packages\n- [x] `pnpm test` — 177 tests pass\n\nRefs #5","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbyAgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA6DcQAFMOfscqGuC