ommerce-nike-style/commit/d61f04d95a5395b3d1f9e60e8c3792687da85a79","sha":"d61f04d95a5395b3d1f9e60e8c3792687da85a79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/d61f04d95a5395b3d1f9e60e8c3792687da85a79"}],"sha":"fc3442aab403e4ef4244b2e520b2cef6fbfb35eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/fc3442aab403e4ef4244b2e520b2cef6fbfb35eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/d61f04d95a5395b3d1f9e60e8c3792687da85a79/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-01T19:51:48Z","email":"66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-01T19:51:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(monorepo): merge storefront into Turborepo monorepo (apps/storefront) (#38)\n\n## Summary\n\nImplements the current architecture (Decision #4/#5, reaffirmed by #81\nafter briefly trying multi-repo in #80): this repo becomes the FE\nTurborepo monorepo root. Brings the storefront app in from the separate\n`LuongCongThanh/E-commerce-platforms-FE` repo (36+ merged PRs) as\n`apps/storefront` — **that repo is untouched**, only its current file\ntree (branch `feat/4-fe-monorepo-foundation`) was copied here.\n\n- Root: `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, `turbo.json`, `.npmrc`, `.husky`\n(`pre-commit` → `lint-staged` format-only, `commit-msg` → `commitlint`,\n`pre-push` → `pnpm typecheck`), CI workflows, root `package.json`\n(turbo-driven `dev/build/lint/typecheck/test/test:e2e/clean`,\ntooling-only devDependencies).\n- `packages/ts-config`, `packages/eslint-config`: shared config\npackages.\n- `apps/storefront`: full app content. `package.json` scripts restored\nto direct commands (no more `legacy:*` split); root-only devDependencies\n(turbo/husky/lint-staged/commitlint) and `packageManager`/`prepare`\nfields removed; `eslint.config.mjs` dropped a now-irrelevant\n`packages/**` ignore.\n\nTwo real bugs found and fixed while wiring this up (not pre-existing —\nintroduced by this restructure):\n- `lint-staged.config.mjs` originally ran `eslint --fix` across the\nwhole tree from root, but root has no `eslint` of its own (each\nworkspace member owns its config) — scoped to format-only (Prettier);\nreal linting runs via `pnpm lint`/CI, correctly scoped per package by\nturbo.\n- `.husky/pre-push` ran bare `tsc --noEmit`, which relied on a root\n`tsconfig.json` that no longer exists (it moved into `apps/storefront/`)\n— switched to `pnpm typecheck` (turbo-delegated).\n\nCommit history is split into several small commits (root tooling → app\nconfigs → static assets → `src/` in a few chunks) instead of one —\nstaging the full ~300-file move in a single commit hit Windows''\ncommand-line length limit inside the `lint-staged` pre-commit hook.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm install` — resolves all 4 workspace packages (root,\n`storefront`, `@repo/ts-config`, `@repo/eslint-config`)\n- [x] `pnpm build` — turbo runs `next build --webpack` for `storefront`,\nsucceeds\n- [x] `pnpm lint` — turbo runs `eslint .` for `storefront`, 0 errors\n- [x] `pnpm typecheck` — turbo runs `tsc --noEmit` for `storefront`, 0\nerrors\n- [x] `pnpm test` — 26 test files / 177 tests pass\n- [x] Pre-commit (`lint-staged` + `prettier`) and pre-push (`pnpm\ntypecheck`) hooks verified working during the migration commits\nthemselves\n\n## Related\n\n- `00-core/decision-log.md` Decision #4/#5 (original monorepo choice),\n#80 (brief multi-repo detour), #81 (revert back to monorepo)\n- Issue #4 (FE monorepo & shared tooling foundation) — this PR is where\nthat foundation actually lands with a real app in it","tree":{"sha":"0a3a77168cb20f8145efc442e82c78e76e485a7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/0a3a77168cb20f8145efc442e82c78e76e485a7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/d61f04d95a5395b3d1f9e60e8c3792687da85a79","verification":{"payload":"tree 0a3a77168cb20f8145efc442e82c78e76e485a7c\nparent cf222d47a063d846038f4982f1c3d576e7aee83d\nauthor Luong Cong Thanh <66105517+LuongCongThanh@users.noreply.github.com> 1785613908 +0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785613908 +0700\n\nfeat(monorepo): merge storefront into Turborepo monorepo (apps/storefront) (#38)\n\n## Summary\n\nImplements the current architecture (Decision #4/#5, reaffirmed by #81\nafter briefly trying multi-repo in #80): this repo becomes the FE\nTurborepo monorepo root. Brings the storefront app in from the separate\n`LuongCongThanh/E-commerce-platforms-FE` repo (36+ merged PRs) as\n`apps/storefront` — **that repo is untouched**, only its current file\ntree (branch `feat/4-fe-monorepo-foundation`) was copied here.\n\n- Root: `pnpm-workspace.yaml`, `turbo.json`, `.npmrc`, `.husky`\n(`pre-commit` → `lint-staged` format-only, `commit-msg` → `commitlint`,\n`pre-push` → `pnpm typecheck`), CI workflows, root `package.json`\n(turbo-driven `dev/build/lint/typecheck/test/test:e2e/clean`,\ntooling-only devDependencies).\n- `packages/ts-config`, `packages/eslint-config`: shared config\npackages.\n- `apps/storefront`: full app content. `package.json` scripts restored\nto direct commands (no more `legacy:*` split); root-only devDependencies\n(turbo/husky/lint-staged/commitlint) and `packageManager`/`prepare`\nfields removed; `eslint.config.mjs` dropped a now-irrelevant\n`packages/**` ignore.\n\nTwo real bugs found and fixed while wiring this up (not pre-existing —\nintroduced by this restructure):\n- `lint-staged.config.mjs` originally ran `eslint --fix` across the\nwhole tree from root, but root has no `eslint` of its own (each\nworkspace member owns its config) — scoped to format-only (Prettier);\nreal linting runs via `pnpm lint`/CI, correctly scoped per package by\nturbo.\n- `.husky/pre-push` ran bare `tsc --noEmit`, which relied on a root\n`tsconfig.json` that no longer exists (it moved into `apps/storefront/`)\n— switched to `pnpm typecheck` (turbo-delegated).\n\nCommit history is split into several small commits (root tooling → app\nconfigs → static assets → `src/` in a few chunks) instead of one —\nstaging the full ~300-file move in a single commit hit Windows''\ncommand-line length limit inside the `lint-staged` pre-commit hook.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] `pnpm install` — resolves all 4 workspace packages (root,\n`storefront`, `@repo/ts-config`, `@repo/eslint-config`)\n- [x] `pnpm build` — turbo runs `next build --webpack` for `storefront`,\nsucceeds\n- [x] `pnpm lint` — turbo runs `eslint .` for `storefront`, 0 errors\n- [x] `pnpm typecheck` — turbo runs `tsc --noEmit` for `storefront`, 0\nerrors\n- [x] `pnpm test` — 26 test files / 177 tests pass\n- [x] Pre-commit (`lint-staged` + `prettier`) and pre-push (`pnpm\ntypecheck`) hooks verified working during the migration commits\nthemselves\n\n## Related\n\n- `00-core/decision-log.md` Decision #4/#5 (original monorepo choice),\n#80 (brief multi-repo detour), #81 (revert back to monorepo)\n- Issue #4 (FE monorepo & shared tooling foundation) — this PR is where\nthat foundation actually lands with a real app in it","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqbk5UCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANhsQAHKquCvDdC2BrdSp6x1JNdo5\nrB+vqMHUkJ/G5EMxcmnCVXVDBLYZJ4g10oaGnI8rpK6cB4MExK2z3NO1NRU/GqOe\nfNKXgUI3eTOQhDyOhSc+RN5AIy80vK8BLdEKHo1PeP+GtKVCgvYYZaQAsEo5o2e9\ncEtU4B8xHRURZRFISdN56iYIoaUZhQFS8PSVcLsiipSYe/HWb28DmpKSx64YWrZw\nyc5/TJiA4N+pKv4INLGKe9nMN3xV55+saDNbG+rsS35ZtWvWp43sepJDDZefU2kd\nSYIOD/+nHosaY0j83dQ4JIK/Ko7RaT/VUeBNwDiHHNfWK0UglTEhoSRRpd4yE8KY\nz7dnBu4yqiiz91xne2K/A3BnpjVUWX9/twiyaeb1i0a3n2l3j+slbWSiO3uxCMIi\nmlAaX/qA6kfwgYNGmD677rboW8DaeenYqNFOzyMLXxmAMWXc1cDgljmUxEwn4bvf\n23mvHX8N35XFyiAic0sHNU/oXBEl6Z56kYBzvY71dvH+D63C1C4QS6KAwCeKze9Q\n+4Fz8zRncg+yzFIP12EjHWH0kR791miiMkkI5h0xk8vX80m2blgY5pL1X8NJqEsd\nMrAwNyEYNPENPQlj1Y7QNMJvOI1mSzTioGMyF2+qzBc3ImKpfF4HovAjVZysVtHJ\nYZf9m/1B2lIfMMfAvjL6\n=SyEq\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-01T19:51:49Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","ur