r":{"date":"2026-07-31T17:55:01Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"message":"Remove redundant generated 01-delivery/specification/ docs\n\nimplementation-plan.md, master-spec.vi.md, prd.md, srs.md,\ntechnical-design.md, and traceability-matrix.md were a one-shot\ngenerated snapshot (\"Generated on July 29, 2026\") duplicating content\nalready living in 00-core/, FE/, product/, security/, and\ntraceability/ — master-spec.vi.md was literally a synthesis of the\nother 5 files in the same folder. reading-paths.md, the canonical\n\"what to read\" guide, never referenced this folder in any of its 5\npaths or even its \"skip this\" list, confirming it was orphaned.\n\nAlso fixes the dead links this removal created in the top-level\ncondensed docs (BE.md, DEVOPS.md, SRS.md, TEST.md, FE/FE.md,\nSUPPORTING-DOCS.md) that cited specification/ files as sources.","tree":{"sha":"e01f2d9a35d24fd0827e08aac729799910f7bf3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/e01f2d9a35d24fd0827e08aac729799910f7bf3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/2a8351747294d836e3cbe52b9ea4a88bffb106d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/2a8351747294d836e3cbe52b9ea4a88bffb106d0","node_id":"C_kwDOTkNxUNoAKDJhODM1MTc0NzI5NGQ4MzZlM2NiZTUyYjllYTRhODhiZmZiMTA2ZDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commit/8a5896d3cee5283edf470387ab665d4870dd7c2a","sha":"8a5896d3cee5283edf470387ab665d4870dd7c2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/8a5896d3cee5283edf470387ab665d4870dd7c2a"}],"sha":"2a8351747294d836e3cbe52b9ea4a88bffb106d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/2a8351747294d836e3cbe52b9ea4a88bffb106d0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66105517?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/LuongCongThanh","id":66105517,"login":"LuongCongThanh","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MTA1NTE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LuongCongThanh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/commits/8a5896d3cee5283edf470387ab665d4870dd7c2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T17:54:41Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T17:54:41Z","email":"thanhluong.it.0909@gmail.com","name":"Luong Cong Thanh"},"message":"Add Decision #78-79: permission-based RBAC for admin/cms\n\n- ADR 0013: Staff/Role/Permission model. Staff (separate entity from\n  Customer) gets many-to-many Role assignment; Role maps to a fixed,\n  code-defined Permission set (resource:action). Controllers declare\n  RequirePermissions(...); a global PermissionsGuard enforces it,\n  fail-closed when the decorator is missing. No CASL/OPA/Keycloak/\n  DB-backed permission builder yet.\n- rbac-matrix.md: MVP baseline of 3 roles (SUPER_ADMIN, ADMIN_STAFF,\n  CMS_EDITOR) derived from actual AD-*/CMS-* scope, trimmed from the\n  unconfirmed 6-role list in implementation-plan.md.\n- ADR 0010: add role change to the refresh-token-family revoke triggers.\n- glossary.md: new Identity & Access terms (Customer, Staff, Role,\n  Permission, PermissionsGuard).\n- Fix architecture/backend, which was a flat file (data lost in a prior\n  restructure, commit e483180) instead of a directory, blocking\n  rbac-matrix.md from being created; recovered as backend/roadmap.md.\n- Update functional-requirements.md, open-decisions.md, and\n  FE-ARCHITECTURE.md to point at the new baseline instead of the dead\n  rbac-matrix.md link.","tree":{"sha":"77865e27277ed8b727750ded9db4a48bfc91d3f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/trees/77865e27277ed8b727750ded9db4a48bfc91d3f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/LuongCongThanh/fe-ecommerce-nike-style/git/commits/8a5896d3cee5283edf470387ab665d4870dd7c2a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":