ons","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valthon/zigapagos/commits/4eb7e8868be17cbc523d9c6a9fc716013c4a5ffe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:30:09Z","email":"valthon@gmail.com","name":"valthon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T10:30:09Z","email":"valthon@gmail.com","name":"valthon"},"message":"Make Rails converter gaps answerable\n\nUnbound locals, unresolved or cyclic partial renders, and known route\nhelpers with unusable literal arguments previously fell through to\nid-less markers. A route containing only one of those gaps could never be\nsettled by a decisions file.\n\nDerive each failure with render-site context, keep successful\nsubstitutions and resolutions unchanged, and emit named regions for the\nfailing cases. Retain the unmapped marker only as a defensive signal when\nderivation and conversion disagree.\n\nCover exact boundaries, allocator failures, combined conversion output,\nand scaffold decisions. Update the migration reference and release note.","tree":{"sha":"fca509cc15c92ae40df5874358d6cb94ffd3273e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valthon/zigapagos/git/trees/fca509cc15c92ae40df5874358d6cb94ffd3273e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valthon/zigapagos/git/commits/4eb7e8868be17cbc523d9c6a9fc716013c4a5ffe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5040?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/valthon","id":5040,"login":"valthon","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.co