om/users/valthon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/valthon","id":5040,"login":"valthon","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valthon/zigapagos/commits/f510a6ebc75b01c6d6d363793c0bf2105088884e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-01T02:57:49Z","email":"valthon@gmail.com","name":"valthon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-01T02:57:49Z","email":"valthon@gmail.com","name":"valthon"},"message":"Make dynamic Rails titles answerable\n\nA top-level content_for :title block with a non-literal body was swallowed during conversion but represented only by an id-less marker. A route containing only that gap could never be settled by a decisions file.\n\nDerive RAILS_CONTENT_FOR_DYNAMIC at the exact view-level conversion boundary, emit its finding, and skip the captured block so title markup cannot leak into the page body. Keep literal titles, nested blocks, layouts, and partials unchanged, and cover both open and blocked outcomes.\n\nUpdate the migration guide and release note to remove this case from the remaining converter gaps.","tree":{"sha":"645f22ae76dfa40e79e0c04372393dbdb59de95f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valthon/zigapagos/git/trees/645f22ae76dfa40e79e0c04372393dbdb59de95f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valthon/zigapagos/git/commits/f510a6ebc75b01c6d6d363793c0bf2105088884e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verifie