on@gmail.com","name":"valthon"},"message":"Complete Rails migration parity\n\nA migrated target needs replayable evidence.\n\nGenerated route-specific test logic cannot serve as the contract.\n\nEmit typed parity rows from written artifacts and applied endpoints.\n\nPosition literal facts so replaced ERB regions cannot leak evidence.\n\nShip fixed Bun and Playwright runners that consume the handoff.\n\nKeep GET and HEAD replays free of rejected request bodies.\n\nPin navigation, asset, authentication, mutation, and validation facts.\n\nReplay them against stock ZigBase with deterministic fixture data.\n\nDocument the support boundary and the final handoff workflow.\n\nPart of #167\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016ceqUz8nDB4ouT3zjGBDR4","tree":{"sha":"e5273323fbf27af9d98c5dba04a8f735a1b2426c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valthon/zigapagos/git/trees/e5273323fbf27af9d98c5dba04a8f735a1b2426c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/valthon/zigapagos/git/commits/b4742ed038814c466a0c9b96f5792e8e4b583d92","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5040?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/valthon","id":5040,"login":"valthon","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valthon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.gi