Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T22:17:01Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"chore: add automated release workflow\n\nAdds .github/workflows/release.yml so pushing a vX.Y.Z tag triggers a\nverified build + `npm publish --provenance --access public` and creates\na GitHub Release whose body is extracted from the matching CHANGELOG\nsection.\n\n- Guards against tag/package-version drift before publishing.\n- Runs the same lint/format/type-check/coverage/build gates as CI.\n- Uses `id-token: write` + `--provenance` for supply-chain provenance.\n- Documents the required `NPM_TOKEN` repo secret in CONTRIBUTING.md.\n- Updates CONTRIBUTING release process to reflect the tag-driven flow\n  and adds a `npm pack --dry-run` local verification step.\n- Notes the workflow in the 1.0.0 CHANGELOG entry.\n\nCloses #8\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b4581c5c412f0d14c91342ddcf16ed4041c6b17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/hooks-js/git/trees/1b4581c5c412f0d14c91342ddcf16ed4041c6b17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/hooks-js/git/commits/1020aa3d4a0130ac4e9ad61428a01d88aecd317c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_e