","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/hooks-js/commits/222956bcebbcee865517c9a6a111e958713d463e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T21:14:31Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T21:14:31Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"docs: publish full documentation surface for 1.0\n\nAdds the developer-facing docs surface for the 1.0 release:\n\n- README rewritten with install, quickstart, full API reference (mirroring\n  the PHP twin), React adapter section, Module Federation section\n  (singleton config + globalThis.ApHooks escape hatch + bootModule),\n  DevTools debug mode, hook naming convention (verbatim from the PHP\n  README), and a migration summary from @wordpress/hooks.\n- /docs tree with YAML frontmatter and GitLab-wiki-style cross-links\n  matching the convention used across ArtisanPack UI packages. Includes\n  home.md, getting-started, actions, filters, priorities, deprecations,\n  module-federation, devtools-debug, migration-from-wordpress-hooks,\n  testing, faq, security, contributing, changelog.\n- /docs/react subdirectory with a companion docs/react.md \"home\" file per\n  the ArtisanPack UI subdirectory convention. Pages cover useFilter,\n  useAction, useHookedChildren, HookSlot, and SSR.\n- CONTRIBUTING.md with dev setup, script matrix, code style, testing\n  and docs conventions, PR conventions, and release process.\n- CHANGELOG seeded with a 1.0.0 entry that captures the shipped API\n  surface and this documentation drop.\n\nCloses #7\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"98351a5bcddf801c2e87dcedbaa64cbb85acc002","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/hooks-js/git/trees/98351a5bcddf801c2e87dcedbaa64cbb85acc002"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/hooks-js/git/commits/222956bcebbcee865517c9a6a111e958713d463e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8247489?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_typ