{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ViewFromTheBox","id":8247489,"login":"ViewFromTheBox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyNDc0ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ViewFromTheBox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/hooks-js/commits/d8bccb4a427dcce1f686ccd52f61e8ad390e187c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T20:59:19Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T20:59:19Z","email":"me@jacobmartella.com","name":"Jacob Martella"},"message":"feat: Module Federation singleton, DevTools debug, and test parity\n\nAdds a cross-realm hook state singleton keyed by a Symbol.for slot on\nglobalThis so duplicate copies of the package (Module Federation without\n`shared: singleton`) share one registry. Exposes the public API on\n`globalThis.ApHooks` for plugins loaded outside the bundler graph, and\nopt-in DevTools logging via `window.__AP_HOOKS_DEBUG__ = true`.\n\nExpands the vitest suite to parity with the PHP Pest tests — priority-\nscoped removeAll, add-during-dispatch deferral, seed-value passthrough,\ncross-alias dedup for bound methods, React adapter sibling-unmount\nisolation, StrictMode single-registration — and wires @vitest/coverage-v8\nwith per-glob thresholds (95%+ core, 90%+ React adapter) into CI.\n\nCloses #5\nCloses #6\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a019c9e34a3366f73b4414954a03c35c70746f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtisanPack-UI/hooks-js/git/trees/3a019c9e34