dour100/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commits/9c3e6e186088f3904f58d811adbeba0eb2c16644/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-07T00:56:50Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-07T00:56:50Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"message":"feat: add Module model, admin CRUD API, and admin dashboard UI\n\nBackend:\n- New Module model (top-level theme, e.g. week7_deep_learning)\n- QuestionGroup now has ModuleID for module grouping\n- CRUD endpoints: /api/v1/modules, /api/v1/question-groups, /api/v1/questions\n- Question groups and questions support ?module_id= and ?group_id= filtering\n- Admin DTOs include is_correct and analysis (not exposed in exam flow)\n\nFrontend:\n- Simple password-based admin auth (/admin/login, hardcoded admin123)\n- Protected route wrapper with localStorage guard\n- Admin layout with nav tabs (Modules, Data Entry) and logout\n- Modules page: list and create modules\n- Data Entry page: select module -> create question group -> add questions\n  with dynamic options (min 2, exactly 1 correct)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"102498eb9a7b02b695a206e3f92a263da7a0c5b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/git/trees/102498eb9a7b02b695a206e3f92a263da7a0c5b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/git/commits/9c3e6e186088f3904f58d811adbeba0eb2c16644","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77058791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/following{/other_user}",