 padding on small screens (py-6 → sm:py-8)\n\nQuestionCard:\n- Larger radio buttons on mobile (h-5 w-5, min-h-[48px] per option)\n- active:bg-gray-50 feedback for touch devices\n- Responsive padding + font sizing (p-4 sm:p-6, text-base sm:text-lg)\n\nPagination:\n- 44px minimum touch targets for Previous/Next buttons\n- Compact page indicator (1/5) on mobile\n- active:bg-gray-100 touch feedback\n\nHomePage:\n- Responsive title: text-2xl → sm:text-4xl\n- Responsive padding: py-8 → sm:py-16, p-4 → sm:p-6\n- Larger touch targets for question-count buttons (min-h-[44px])\n- Larger Start Exam button on mobile (py-3.5)\n- Footer link with 44px min-height for accessibility\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55fa8db5e240de2d9a4c3762a43380567cfeec6e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/git/trees/55fa8db5e240de2d9a4c3762a43380567cfeec6e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/git/commits/8b0edef045d95449f56c66df956af72e8bd527be","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77058791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ardour100","id":77058791,"login":"ardour100","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MDU4Nzkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/subscriptions","type"