}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commits/862de1075b28009fcae0e7bb35d63245f27658ba/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-04T09:08:31Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-04T09:08:31Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"message":"feat: implement exam page with pagination and auto-save\n\nPagination & navigation:\n- Display 10 questions per page with Previous/Next buttons\n- Keyboard shortcuts: ← → for page navigation, A/B/C/D to select\n  options on the current page (targets first unanswered question)\n\nAuto-save:\n- Saves answers on every page flip via PATCH /api/v1/exams/:id/answers\n- Periodic auto-save every 30 seconds for dirty answers on current page\n- Best-effort save on beforeunload via fetch with keepalive\n- Save-status indicator: Saving... / Unsaved changes / Saved at HH:MM\n\nExam timer:\n- Countdown based on question count (2 min per question)\n- Visual urgency pulse when under 5 minutes remaining\n- Auto-submit when timer reaches zero\n\nProgress tracking:\n- Progress bar reflects answered questions (not just pages visited)\n- Shows answered count and percentage\n\nSubmit flow:\n- Submit button appears on last page\n- Confirmation dialog warns about unanswered questions\n- Handles submission errors gracefully with timer restart\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc73b6711536f72deb0450352f7f067ee9f57b7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/git/trees/fc73b6711536f72deb0450352f7f067ee9f57b7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/git/commits/862de1075b28009fcae0e7bb35d63245f27658ba","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at"