254dd"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commit/8c3c103d93ec40f1ec5b2e78b8c81fb7b89e1b9c","sha":"8c3c103d93ec40f1ec5b2e78b8c81fb7b89e1b9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commits/8c3c103d93ec40f1ec5b2e78b8c81fb7b89e1b9c"}],"sha":"f8bf8ec59849bfacc0630bb74000ca9d59bfeef2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commits/f8bf8ec59849bfacc0630bb74000ca9d59bfeef2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77058791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ardour100","id":77058791,"login":"ardour100","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MDU4Nzkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commits/8c3c103d93ec40f1ec5b2e78b8c81fb7b89e1b9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:29:00Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:29:00Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"message":"feat: build React frontend with routing, API client, and all pages\n\nAPI client (src/api/client.ts):\n- Typed fetch wrapper with ApiError for consistent error handling\n- createExam, saveAnswers, submitExam, listNotes, getNote, saveNote,\n  deleteNote — mirrors every backend endpoint\n\nType definitions (src/types/index.ts):\n- Exam/ExamQuestion/ExamOption — exam mode (no is_correct)\n- ExamResult/QuestionResult/OptionResult — result mode (with answers)\n- Note, AnswerInput, request body types\n\nPages:\n- HomePage: question count selector (10/20/30/40/50), creates exam\n  via POST /api/v1/exams, navigates to /exam/:id with state\n- ExamPage: paginated (10 per page), auto-saves on page flip via\n  PATCH /api/v1/exams/:id/answers, submit triggers POST .../submit\n  and redirects to /result/:id\n- ResultPage: score display (color-coded), per-question review with\n  correct/incorrect markers, expandable analysis, option highlighting\n- NotesPage: full CRUD with inline editing, list all notes\n\nComponents:\n- QuestionCard: radio-button options with A/B/C/D labels\n- Pagination: Previous/Next with page counter\n\nRouting: / → /exam/:id → /result/:id + /notes\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b59a9d06746dcc33e935f229f286ab09fd7b6cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/git/trees/4b59a9d06746dcc33e935f229f286ab09fd7b6cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/git/commits/8c3c103d93ec40f1ec5b2e78b8c81fb7b89e1b9c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77058791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ardour100","id":77058791,"login":"ardour100","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MDU4Nzkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commit/8c3c103d93ec40f1ec5b2e78b8c81fb7b89e1b9c","node_id":"C_kwDOTkdeaNoAKDhjM2MxMDNkOTNlYzQwZjFlYzViMmU3OGI4YzgxZmI3Yjg5ZTFiOWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commit/d47586d28aeaa7f85fb864e603ff87faa2f8696a","sha":"d47586d28aeaa7f85fb864e603ff87faa2f8696a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commits/d47586d28aeaa7f85fb864e603ff87faa2f8696a"}],"sha":"8c3c103d93ec40f1ec5b2e78b8c81fb7b89e1b9c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commits/8c3c103d93ec40f1ec5b2e78b8c81fb7b89e1b9c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77058791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ardour100","id":77058791,"login":"ardour100","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MDU4Nzkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commits/d47586d28aeaa7f85fb864e603ff87faa2f8696a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:25:48Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:25:48Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"message":"feat: add user notes CRUD API keyed by question group\n\nNotes are attached to question_group (not question version), so they\nsurvive content updates — the user''s personal notes persist across\nquestion revisions.\n\nRepository (internal/repository/note.go):\n- GetNoteByGroupID / UpsertNote (ON CONFLICT) / DeleteNoteByGroupID /\n  ListAllNotes — standard CRUD with group_id as the natural key\n\nService (internal/service/note.go):\n- GetNote: returns nil (not error) when no note exists yet\n- SaveNote: upsert via group_id — frontend always uses PUT\n- DeleteNote / ListNotes: straightforward delegation\n- NoteResponse DTO with id, group_id, content, timestamps\n\nHandler (internal/handler/note.go):\n- GET    /api/v1/notes             — list all notes\n- GET    /api/v1/notes/:group_id   — get one\n- PUT    /api/v1/notes/:group_id   — create or update (upsert)\n- DELETE /api/v1/notes/:group_id   — delete\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8df62cc90639af0e978e0d0de4ffd2ba972c9afe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/git/trees/8df62cc90639af0e978e0d0de4ffd2ba972c9afe"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/git/commits/d47586d28aeaa7f85fb864e603ff87faa2f8696a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77058791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ardour100","id":77058791,"login":"ardour100","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MDU4Nzkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commit/d47586d28aeaa7f85fb864e603ff87faa2f8696a","node_id":"C_kwDOTkdeaNoAKGQ0NzU4NmQyOGFlYWE3Zjg1ZmI4NjRlNjAzZmY4N2ZhYTJmODY5NmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commit/0f526acfac53ca61354bf66b6d3b374060e5cbbe","sha":"0f526acfac53ca61354bf66b6d3b374060e5cbbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commits/0f526acfac53ca61354bf66b6d3b374060e5cbbe"}],"sha":"d47586d28aeaa7f85fb864e603ff87faa2f8696a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commits/d47586d28aeaa7f85fb864e603ff87faa2f8696a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77058791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ardour100","id":77058791,"login":"ardour100","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MDU4Nzkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commits/0f526acfac53ca61354bf66b6d3b374060e5cbbe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:23:49Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:23:49Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"message":"feat: add progress auto-save and exam submission with grading\n\nRepository (internal/repository/exam.go):\n- UpsertUserAnswers: batch upsert via ON CONFLICT on exam_question_id,\n  so the frontend can safely call save on every page flip\n- GetExamByID: fetch exam for ownership / lifecycle checks\n- GetExamQuestionsForGrading: eager-load question, options, and user\n  answer for computing the score\n- SubmitExam: update exam status to submitted with score and timestamp\n\nService (internal/service/exam.go):\n- SaveProgress: validates exam is in_progress, then upserts answers\n- SubmitExam: grades each question by comparing selected_option_id\n  against the correct option, calculates score as a percentage,\n  persists the result, and returns a full snapshot\n- ExamResultResponse / QuestionResultResponse / OptionResultResponse\n  DTOs INCLUDE is_correct and analysis (exam is over, user reviews)\n- Nil-safe grading: unanswered questions count as wrong, no panic\n\nHandler (internal/handler/exam.go):\n- PATCH /api/v1/exams/:id/answers — incremental progress save\n- POST /api/v1/exams/:id/submit — submit & grade\n- Sentinel error mapping: ErrExamNotFound → 404,\n  ErrExamAlreadySubmitted → 409\n\nRouter updated with the new sub-routes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c3d06856e9bcd7301e55a1d397be8ddc4a9dd0d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/git/trees/c3d06856e9bcd7301e55a1d397be8ddc4a9dd0d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/git/commits/0f526acfac53ca61354bf66b6d3b374060e5cbbe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77058791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ardour100","id":77058791,"login":"ardour100","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MDU4Nzkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commit/0f526acfac53ca61354bf66b6d3b374060e5cbbe","node_id":"C_kwDOTkdeaNoAKDBmNTI2YWNmYWM1M2NhNjEzNTRiZjY2YjZkM2IzNzQwNjBlNWNiYmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commit/149b9ac22e9c2560943b1a2c940414cf49260b71","sha":"149b9ac22e9c2560943b1a2c940414cf49260b71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commits/149b9ac22e9c2560943b1a2c940414cf49260b71"}],"sha":"0f526acfac53ca61354bf66b6d3b374060e5cbbe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commits/0f526acfac53ca61354bf66b6d3b374060e5cbbe"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77058791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ardour100","id":77058791,"login":"ardour100","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MDU4Nzkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commits/149b9ac22e9c2560943b1a2c940414cf49260b71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:20:16Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:20:16Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"message":"feat: add exam generation with anti-cheat option shuffle\n\nImplement the core exam creation flow across all three layers:\n\nRepository (internal/repository/exam.go):\n- GetRandomQuestions: fetch N random questions with eager-loaded\n  options via PostgreSQL RANDOM()\n- CreateExamWithQuestions: transactional insert of Exam +\n  ExamQuestion snapshots\n\nService (internal/service/exam.go):\n- GenerateExam: picks random questions, shuffles option IDs with\n  Fisher-Yates, persists shuffled order as JSONB in exam_questions,\n  and returns a frontend-safe DTO\n- Anti-cheat: ExamResponse/QuestionResponse/OptionResponse DTOs\n  deliberately omit is_correct and analysis fields — the service\n  layer is the single choke point that enforces this, so no\n  frontend bug can accidentally leak answers\n- ErrNoQuestions sentinel for clear error handling\n\nHandler (internal/handler/exam.go):\n- POST /api/v1/exams — validates question_count (10/20/30/40/50),\n  delegates to service, returns 201 with safe response\n\nUtility (pkg/shuffle/shuffle.go):\n- Fisher-Yates shuffle with package-level seeded rand source\n- ResetSeed for deterministic testing\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0351eff924173dfcbfac24d338e047e0724b5f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/git/trees/e0351eff924173dfcbfac24d338e047e0724b5f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/git/commits/149b9ac22e9c2560943b1a2c940414cf49260b71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77058791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ardour100","id":77058791,"login":"ardour100","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MDU4Nzkx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commit/149b9ac22e9c2560943b1a2c940414cf49260b71","node_id":"C_kwDOTkdeaNoAKDE0OWI5YWMyMmU5YzI1NjA5NDNiMWEyYzk0MDQxNGNmNDkyNjBiNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commit/49f4c5d2646a79d