dour100/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ardour100","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/commits/e902eaa20e7750930c0f4bebae343c0a2bece439/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T00:12:22Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T03:48:34Z","email":"imzhuting@gmail.com","name":"Ting Zhu"},"message":"feat: add database models and auto-seeding with English seed data\n\nDefine 7 GORM models: QuestionGroup, Question, Option, Exam,\nExamQuestion, UserAnswer, and UserNote.\n\nKey design decisions:\n- Questions are versioned — updates insert new rows so historical\n  exam snapshots remain intact\n- exam_questions stores shuffled option_order as JSONB for anti-cheat\n- user_notes bind to question_group (not question version) so notes\n  survive content updates\n- AutoMigrate runs on startup to create/update all tables\n- Idempotent seeding via backend/data/seed_data.json with 10 CV\n  questions covering: image filtering, Canny edge detection, SIFT,\n  Harris corner detection, camera calibration, CNN pooling,\n  optical flow, Hough transform, semantic/instance segmentation,\n  and object detection (IoU)\n- Seed runs inside a transaction — partial failure rolls back cleanly\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c60a4d07cab2b09a584afd2a3e826f8cc0e374a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/git/trees/c60a4d07cab2b09a584afd2a3e826f8cc0e374a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhu-ting/Computer-Vision-Go/git/commits/e902eaa20e7750930c0f4bebae343c0a2bece439","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/77058791?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/user